window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4701,"title":"Chapter 4701 The Broken Stone Bead","paragraphs":["4701 The Broken Stone Bead","The air seemed to freeze for a moment. The tall and thin old man thought for a while and said, “Did you separate the sword body and the sword hilt?”","The awe-inspiring old man also appeared from the Boyang Body and said in a bad mood, “Idiot, can’t you tell that this is a broken sword? Don’t tell me you store ur sword with the hilt and blade separate?”","“But with such a broken sword, it’ll definitely be difficult to break through this evil creature’s life source.” The tall and thin old man frowned.","The old man who appeared after him gave a flying kick and kicked the tall and thin old man who was holding the sword down. “Stop talking nonsense. You can leave now.”","In the crater-like wound, the tall and thin old man was holding the broken Tarot Divine Sword. His muddled attitude had disappeared, and in its place was a reserved, calm, and majestic aura.","Although it was broken, it could not hide the Emperor’s appearance. The Emperor’s clothes fluttered in the wind, and a mighty force spread out, repairing the broken body of the Tarot Divine Sword, and stabbed down with a thousand feet of brilliance.","It directly broke through the head of the giant Sea Sky Octopus and went straight for its origin.","At the same time, the other two Emperors also made their moves. Two long rays of light carrying Emperor’s might merged into one and fell together.","The terrifying power turned into a pillar of light and exploded in the giant Sea Sky Octopus’s head.","Jian Wushuang felt his body relax and he was blown away by the layers of shock waves.","He hurriedly stretched out his hand and clenched it. The rippling force ribbon directly clung firmly to the giant Sea Sky Octopus’s head.","As the tragic explosion shook its head, even such an ultimate giant creature finally wailed and fell into the sea without a sound.","The three Dao unification Emperor’s True Shadow struck out and the extremely huge head began to break apart. All sorts of unknown fragments flew out and a unique force was released but it only lasted for an instant before it disappeared.","Jian Wushuang leaped over and held the Invisible Sword high, then he entered the wound.","He seemed to have entered a primordial space. In the center of the huge Sea Sky Octopus’s head, there was a ball of golden life source that was like a huge sun.","As the sword broke through, billions of rays of auspicious light burst out. The three Emperors all covered their eyes subconsciously.","The auspicious light only appeared for a moment before it dimmed.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang looked forward and saw a stone bead that was more than half broken. It was still spinning.","“What is this thing?” The tall and thin old man looked up and asked in confusion, “The auspicious light just now was emitted by this thing?”","“No matter what it is, it must be a treasure to be in this guy’s head.” The awe-inspiring old man took a step forward and observed carefully.","The old man with polycoria pouted. “Look at your ignorant faces. This small stone bead must have been formed by that big guy’s accumulation of energy from heaven and earth. Although it can’t be considered a treasure, it’s extremely beneficial for nourishing the meridians.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak. For some reason, he felt that the broken stone bead was not the life source that the vast Sea Sky Octopus had condensed.","After saying that, he raised his hand and pushed the stone bead to Jian Wushuang, “Although this thing is useless to us, it is still good for you. Take it and warm your meridians.”","Jian Wushuang did not refuse. The stone bead was in his hand, and there was nothing strange about it except that it was a little wet and cold.","The cracks on the stone bead seemed to have been chiseled by some kind of hard object, making it look slightly ugly.","After putting the stone bead back into the Boyang Bottle, Jian Wushuang and the Emperors wandered around the huge Sea Sky Octopus’s head for a while to make sure it was dead before they left.","After this disaster, the entire fleet suffered heavy losses, and only four of the giant ships full of black mountain crystals were left.","Almost all of the Yan Immortals had died, and the survivors were all gathered on the first ship.","As soon as his feet landed on the ground, Jian Wushuang returned to the deck. Everyone subconsciously took half a step back and fear flashed in their eyes.","Chun Qiu rushed over and said in a trembling voice, “Brother Jian, it’s great that you’re fine.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, “I was lucky.”","He turned to look at the less than 50 people on the deck and said in a low voice, “The danger has been eliminated. Please return to your respective ships.”","Hearing this, everyone looked at each other, but no one dared to move.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He jumped to the bow of the ship and began to nurse his meridians.","He was almost forced to the extreme in this battle. The two Ancestral Skills were used at the same time, and more than half of his Yan Li was consumed in an instant. If he did not regulate his breathing quickly, it would be difficult to deal with the next sudden situation.","He turned around and looked at the giant Sea Sky Octopus, which was half-floating and half-sinking on the surface of the sea, and doubts flashed through his heart.","The real fighting power of the giant Sea Sky Octopus was not on the same level as the aura he revealed. He could only defend himself against the attacks of Jian Wushuang and the others.","If it was not for its massive size, any one of the three Emperors would have been able to severely injure it.","Furthermore, there were countless immortal pavilions and jade buildings on top of the giant Sea Sky Octopus’s head. It was very likely that some almighty had used it as a foundation to create a Secret Realm.","Not being able to find a treasure among them had become a great regret in Jian Wushuang’s heart.","After overcoming this disaster, the vast sea that had connected countless worlds returned to its previous deathly silence.","Dozens of days later, the thin man in a purple robe that had been split in half by the giant Sea Sky Octopus slowly woke up. Its waist and abdomen were already intact.","To a Yan Immortal, as long as a part of the Great Dao life source was left, even if his divine body was reduced to dust, he could still be completely restored.","However, this time, the skinny purple-robed man’s origin and true shadow were almost destroyed.","The face under the hood coughed slightly. He got up with the help of the people around him and looked at Jian Wushuang’s back.","Then, he walked in Jian Wushuang’s direction.","When Chun Qiu noticed this, he immediately became alert. Just as he was hesitating whether to wake Jian Wushuang up, a slightly low voice was heard.","“This old man thanks you for what you did that day, and will definitely repay you in the future.”","After he finished speaking, the skinny purple-robed man turned around and left. He was extremely cold.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and shook his head helplessly. Then, he closed his eyes and continued to meditate.","Sailing in the huge sea was an extremely dull and boring thing. Apart from the stars in the sky, there were no living things to speak of.","Of course, if another living creature appeared, it would be extremely bad.","After an unknown period of time, Jian Wushuang, who had already entered the state of comprehension, faintly heard the voice of Chun Qiu.","“Brother Jian, look over there, doesn’t that look like a person?”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and looked at the sea area not far away.","He could see a white robe floating on the water’s surface, and because of the speed of the water, it began to approach the giant ship."]},{"number":4702,"title":"Chapter 4702 Zheng Ying","paragraphs":["4702 Zheng Ying","As he got closer, Jian Wushuang finally saw clearly that the faint white robe was indeed a person. However, it seemed that he was seriously injured, as his waist and abdomen were dyed red with divine blood.","Other than the weak Yan power protecting him, there was nothing else.","Without the help of external forces, it was impossible for this person to survive. After all, this huge sea that connected countless worlds was simply too vast.","After hesitating for a while, Jian Wushuang, who had the duty of repairing, used Yan power to scoop up the body and placed it on the deck.","After getting out of the water, the power disappeared on its own. Divine blood began to flow out from her back, staining the deck.","Jian Wushuang jumped down from the bow of the ship and waved his hand to release Yan power, which wrapped around this person.","With the intervention of an even more majestic and vast Yan power, the figure in the white robe quickly became silent.","Her waist-length hair fell down slowly, revealing a pale but beautiful face.","However, even if she was extremely beautiful, it could not cause a ripple in Jian Wushuang’s heart. After all, after reaching the Supreme realm, one could reconstruct their divine body and change any kind of beautiful face.","On the contrary, almost no cultivators changed their original appearance. At most, they only modified the details slightly.","Jian Wushuang was puzzled. How could someone travel alone in this boundless sea? Even a Yan Immortal could be killed in this sea area if he was not careful.","This woman seemed to have also encountered danger, but she was still alive.","After careful observation, Jian Wushuang did not find anything strange, so he sat down at the bow again to meditate.","On the other hand, Chun Qiu’s eyes brightened, and he began to work around this lady in plain clothes, urging Yan power to protect her carefully.","Time quickly passed, and after the boundless sea had crossed thousands of cold and dead worlds, the aura of living beings began to appear on both sides of the sea.","Fortunately, after experiencing the giant Sea Sky Octopus, no more terrifying existences appeared under the giant sea, allowing the remaining four giant ships to sail out of the most dangerous area.","During this time, the woman in plain clothes who had been rescued to the deck had also slowly woken up.","The first thing she did when she woke up was to look around in confusion. Then, she jumped out of the deck without any hesitation.","The consequence of doing so was to directly fall into the sea.","Even Jian Wushuang, who had enough self-control, could not help but laugh. He waved his hand and lifted the figure that was struggling in the sea.","“I say, Miss, your injuries have not improved at all. If you leave like this, it’s no different from sending yourself to your death.” Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry.","The woman in plain clothes looked at him coldly and coughed a few times. Then, she leaned against the fence and closed her eyes.","Chun Qiu hesitated for a moment, then prepared to take off his long robe and give it to the woman in plain clothes.","However, the skinny purple-robed man who had been silent as a dead man stood up and threw a thick cloak to her.","The woman in plain clothes opened her eyes and glanced at him. She reached out and covered her body with the thick cloak, then fell asleep again.","Everything returned to a dead silence.","The galaxy of stars swirled in the sky.","When Jian Wushuang turned over at the bow of the ship and subconsciously opened his eyes, he saw the woman in a plain dress standing less than an arm’s length away from him and looking at him calmly.","No longer sleepy, Jian Wushuang sat up straight and asked, “What’s the matter?”","She retracted her gaze and looked at the end of the sea. Her voice was as cold as her entire being. “Why did you save me?”","Jian Wushuang was speechless for a moment, but then he said, “Of course, I can’t bear to just see you die”.","A ripple flashed in the eyes of the woman in plain clothes. “That’s it?”","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang was helpless and then lay back on the fence.","After a long while, the lady in plain clothes said coldly, “My name is Zheng Ying. I will definitely repay you in the future.”","“There’s no need to repay me, it’s just a small matter.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and then fell asleep again.","The woman in plain clothes, Zheng Ying, looked at Jian Wushuang again before returning to her original place to sit down.","After the third year, there was finally a strong Yan power fluctuation in the surrounding area of the sea.","This world was like a hidden sect.","Furthermore, from the occasional conversation he had with the skinny purple-robed man, he could tell that these hidden great sects were inextricably linked to them.","This made Jian Wushuang give up the idea of escaping. If what the skinny purple-robed man said was true, he was sure that once he escaped, he would be hunted down in the Divine Power Universe again.","Following the principle of ‘the less trouble, the better’, Jian Wushuang continued to escort the giant ship to the destination in boredom.","The further they went, the more they could see Yan Immortal, a rogue cultivator, traveling in the air.","This meant that they had already left the most dangerous area, but some of the stronger Yan Immortals could not be ignored.","After killing a few Ancestor-level wandering cultivators with a wave of his hand, no other wandering cultivators dared to hijack the ship.","However, this situation did not last long. When hundreds of strong auras surged in the small world, Jian Wushuang realized that danger was coming.","The dozen men in the lead revealed their Yan Immortal state, while the rest of the hundreds of figures were Ancestor realm existences.","Jian Wushuang felt a little emotional. These experts, who were as considered a top existence in every universe, were actually willing to be bandits in the Great Yan Domain.","However, there was one thing that Jian Wushuang was sure of. The Ancestor realm experts in the great Yan Domain and the Ancestor realm experts in the Divine Power Universe were basically two different existences.","The most important thing about the Ancestor realm in the Divine Power Universe was to control the fate energy and Great Dao of the entire vast universe. As for the Ancestor realm in the Great Yan Domain, they could only control a part of the world.","The fate energy of the Great Dao was the most fundamental.","This group of bandits led by more than ten Yan Immortals was obviously a powerful existence.","Looking at the ship that was like a lamb waiting to be slaughtered, the man in the lead’s eyes were already shining.","“All of you, disembark quickly and accept the inspection.” A sharp and soft voice resounded in the world.","However, the people on the ship did not move. Some of them were even looking at the bandits with mocking expressions.","In their eyes, the fate of these people was already destined.","The notorious bandit Luo Ming whom he had met in the Void Universe flashed through his mind. Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. It seemed that no matter where he was, even if the rules of the Great Dao changed, there would always be a group of people who liked to make quick money.","Jian Wushuang did not hate this kind of people who liked to make quick money, but it did not mean that he would be soft-hearted."]},{"number":4703,"title":"Chapter 4703 Whirling Heaven","paragraphs":["4703 Whirling Heaven","A fine-looking Yan Immortal took a step forward and said arrogantly, “All of you, get off the ship! After entering my territory, the Whirling Heaven, everything is under our control. If you’re sensible, I can still let you live, but otherwise, you’ll all die without a burial place!”","No one would believe the words of these desperados. Jian Wushuang was sure that even if they gave away the ships, it was impossible for these desperados to let them go.","Everyone had a mocking look on their faces, and Chun Qiu even drew the long blade at his waist.","With the existence that could destroy the mighty spiritual monster on his own, it inexplicably made people feel at ease.","“Get lost,” he said. The word that came out of Jian Wushuang’s mouth reverberated through the entire world.","All the bandits were stunned, then they looked at each other and laughed.","A total of 10 Yan Immortals and nearly 100 Quasi Yan Immortals were extremely terrifying existences in any part of the world.","And there were at most 5 Yan Immortals on these ships, yet they dared to talk big, how could they not be stunned and laugh?","A bandit laughed and immediately aimed at Jian Wushuang and blasted a huge fire Wave.","However, in the next moment, before Jian Wushuang could make a move, the woman in plain clothes, Zheng Ying, made a move. An even more vigorous Yan power soared into the sky and instantly destroyed the fire Wave.","Yan power’s momentum did not slow down and he went straight for the fine-looking bandit.","“Bang!”","The fine-looking bandit flew backward for thousands of feet before he managed to stop himself. His face looked like it was covered in dye, and divine blood was flowing out of its seven orifices.","Jian Wushuang looked at the cold woman in plain clothes beside him, smiled, and jumped to the bow of the ship.","He reached out and pulled out the broken Tarot Divine Sword from his waist, and the thousands of Sword Intents merged into one.","“Alright, since you’re not willing to get off the ship, then you can all stay in Whirling Heaven.” The leader of the group, a muscular man, laughed. A great divine technique surged in his palm.","Six bright Eight Trigrams that did not match his figure rose from under his feet, and a terrifying force rose from it.","He punched out with both fists, and a total of 100 Eight Trigrams covered the sky like a dense net.","Jian Wushuang, who had been relaxed, was shocked when he saw the Eight Trigrams.","It was impossible for these guys to be some random itinerant bandits. It was very likely that they were from some kind of organized hidden sect that could teach such a move.","With one sword move, the original Star Sundering was no longer the same as before. It turned into heaven-revealing Sword Intent and completely broke apart the net-like Eight Trigrams.","Then, Jian Wushuang stepped on the bow of the ship, stepped on the void, and rose up. He then thrust his sword forward.","A violent sonic boom resounded, causing ripples to appear on the entire ocean.","The brawny man’s eyes narrowed. His left hand formed a series of hand seals, and an even more magnificent Tai Chi Formations appeared in front of him.","The mighty sword move that had always been successful only pierced through a dozen layers of the Tai Chi Formations before dissipating.","The sturdy man smiled complacently and moved his body to smash Jian Wushuang again.","As the two of them fought in the void, the remaining hundred or so bandits charged toward the giant ship with grim smiles.","In their eyes, they had already treated him as a lamb waiting to be slaughtered, and they rushed forward to fight with each other.","A pure beam of light rose into the sky, and the aura of the peak of the Yan Immortal realm gushed out like a great river.","The skinny purple-robed man suddenly flicked his sleeve, and a wave of Yan power, which was as gentle as a breeze but could not be resisted, rose up, directly forcing the first ten or so bandits to retreat.","At the same time, Zheng Ying moved as well. Her cloak landed on the ground, and her entire figure was like a cloud of smoke as she stood on the outermost side of the ship.","Chun Qiu opened his mouth but swallowed his words. He then stood side by side with Zheng Ying and waited for him.","The remaining 30 purple-robed men also leaped into the air and began to fight with all their might.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes grew grimmer as he cut off the Eight Trigrams images that were coming from all directions. Today, none of the bandits could survive. Otherwise, if any one of them escaped, they would most likely be retaliated.","After forcing the burly man to retreat ten thousand feet with another sword attack, Jian Wushuang clenched his left hand in the air with full killing intent.","The burly man felt the void around him shatter and a supreme power bound him firmly. He could not control his body and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","A sense of fear from the moment of life and death surged into his heart. He did not dare to hesitate any longer. His hands formed a series of hand seals, and thousands of Eight Trigrams appeared around him to cut off the invisible restraint.","However, Jian Wushuang had expected this. He had released his Primordial Universe a long time ago and weakened him without him knowing.","The sturdy man was greatly shocked, but it was impossible for him to escape.","Jian Wushuang raised his sword and slashed forward, landing on his head without any mistake.","Anguished wails rang out, but the scene of the life source shattering and the divine body being destroyed did not appear.","The Tarot Divine Sword had actually deviated by an inch, cutting off his ear.","The burly man finally broke free from the restraints. He held his head that was spewing divine blood and said in shock and anger, “You actually dare to hurt me? Do you know that if you hurt me, you will become the enemy of the entire Whirling Heaven!”","Jian Wushuang sneered and flicked away the divine blood on the Tarot Divine Sword. “Even if there were ten of you in front of me, I’d still kill you all, let alone the entire Whirling Heaven!”","“Good, good, then I’ll let you all be completely buried in this Whirling Heaven!” The burly man’s hatred was overflowing. However, in the next moment, he fled hundreds of millions of miles away like a shooting star.","Seeing this, the rest of the criminals also ran away without a care.","Jian Wushuang executed his divine power and killed another 20 Ancestors realm cultivators before he stopped.","Even so, more than 30 bandits still managed to escape.","Zheng Ying floated forward, clearly intending to cut the weeds and eliminate the roots.","Jian Wushuang reached out to pull her and then shook his head. “Don’t chase after a cornered enemy. It will be very troublesome if we are attacked on the sea.”","An unnatural look flashed across Zheng Ying’s face. She shook off Jian Wushuang’s hand and returned to the boat.","Jian Wushuang had not expected to let so many bandits go. If it was really as he had guessed, that the so-called hidden sect of the Whirling Heaven was behind these bandits, it was very likely that they would fight back in the following journey.","“Brother Jian, what are we going to do next?” Chun Qiu asked.","Looking at the remaining dozen people on the deck, Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, “Go full speed ahead. Don’t stop.”","The ship broke through the water surface and traveled millions of miles in an instant. Even with such a speed, Jian Wushuang could still feel strong auras emerging from the end of the small world when they were about to leave the Whirling Heaven.","The undercurrent surged, and everyone’s hearts sank. They had not expected that this revenge would come so quickly."]},{"number":4704,"title":"Chapter 4704 Whirling Patriarch","paragraphs":["4704 Whirling Patriarch","In the sky where there was no sunlight, streaks of red light appeared and connected with each other, like a dense net that wanted to trap everyone.","“Go ashore!” Jian Wushuang immediately made a decision and took the lead to step into the ground of the Whirling Heaven.","Chun Qiu followed closely behind. A hint of hesitation flashed through Zheng Ying’s eyes, but she also followed.","The rest of the people followed the skinny purple-robed man and jumped onto the shore.","The Whirling Heaven was no different from any other Small Heaven. The only difference was that it was filled with blooming lotus flowers. Looking at it, one would feel extremely relaxed and happy.","As Jian Wushuang and the others went ashore, the bandits who had escaped earlier all fell from the clouds.","“I’ve said that I’ll kill you all in this Whirling Heaven. You will never take a step out of this place!” The brawny man, whose ear had been cut off by Jian Wushuang, still had the divine blood on his face. He looked ferocious and a little comical.","“You’re trying to rob the Dao like others?” Jian Wushuang took a step forward slowly and his vast Yan power surged, “This time, it’s not just your ears that will fall.”","The sturdy man smiled cruelly and took half a step back.","A moment later, tens of thousands of seven-colored rainbow shadows appeared in the dusky sky. A lotus platform then broke through the clouds and slowly emerged.","On this lotus platform, there was a fat bald Arhat sitting quietly.","There were thousands of seven-colored rainbow shadows behind him, and the Immortal Qi was vast.","As his aura was so strong, even Jian Wushuang could not help but take a second look.","“Patriarch, it’s them. They dared to defile you. As Patriarch’s confidant, I’ve asked you to deal with them because I was angry!” The burly man held his head and pretended to be on the verge of death. “I beg you to seek justice, Patriarch.”","However, the bald Arhat sitting on the lotus platform did not seem to hear what the strong man said at all. He looked at Jian Wushuang and the others with a bright light in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang felt a little disgusted. How could he not know the meaning of that look? obviously, the bald Arhat was not a good person either. He had entered the Dao with evil.","“Patriarch, Patriarch?” The sturdy man called out a few times tentatively. A trace of disgust flashed in the bald Arhat’s eyes. He directly flicked his sleeve and gave the man a slap. “Get lost!”","The burly man covered his head, where divine blood had been drawn out again, but he did not dare to say anything.","“I’m the Whirling Patriarch of the Whirling Heaven. Why aren’t you kneeling before me, Juniors?” the bald Arhat said in a deep voice that resounded through the entire Whirling Heaven.","A supreme might was revealed, and it was rather divine.","The face of the bald Arhat who called himself ‘Whirling Patriarch’ stiffened. An unbearable humiliation surged into his heart.","“Foul-mouthed Junior, you actually just called me a Wild Fox Koan?!”","Being repeated again, Chun Qiu and the others could not help but laugh out loud. Even the cold Zheng Ying raised her eyebrows.","Wild Fox Koan was a general term for those who claimed to be the founders of a sect and had entered the evil world after Enlightenment. It was a great insult to those who had achieved Dao.","Jian Wushuang had hit the nail on the head and directly tore apart the bald Arhat’s false mask.","Jian Wushuang continued to sneer, “You are a Wild Fox Koan, and you went astray with just a few moves. You even set up a sect and misled your disciples. If you are not a Wild Fox Koan, then why did I cut off one of your disciple’s ears?”","As soon as he said that, Chun Qiu and the others burst into laughter.","The bald Arhat was both embarrassed and irritated. He immediately jumped up and gave the sturdy man another heavy slap. “Trash!”","How could the sturdy man withstand this slap? He immediately saw stars and fell straight into the clouds, not knowing what the world was.","After teaching his disciple a lesson, the bald Arhat glared at Jian Wushuang fiercely. “Foul-mouthed Junior, I’ll take your life and pull out your fangs one by one!”","With that, he suddenly waved his arm and a sharp octagonal Eight Trigrams forms cut through the void and slashed at Jian Wushuang with unstoppable force.","He focused his gaze and used the broken Tarot Divine Sword to block in front of him.","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of crisis. He looked forward and saw the octagonal Eight Trigrams suddenly split into two. They easily avoided the Tarot Divine Sword and cut his arm.","The divine blood gushed out. If Jian Wushuang had not escaped in time, his two arms would have been cut off on the spot.","The bald Arhat laughed and hung his head in the clouds. “Now, you will commit suicide in front of me. I will let you die a more comfortable death.”","Yan power surged and the bone-deep wounds on his left and right arms healed instantly. Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath of turbid air.","After becoming a Yan Immortal, the Chaos Overlord Body had also been completely transformed into the Undying Immortal Body. Even if his life source was broken, as long as there was an aura in any part of the universe, he could be completely resurrected.","“Even if you show off your fancy moves, you still can’t get rid of your Wild Fox Koan title.” Jian Wushuang laughed disdainfully.","The next moment, a grand Heavenly Gate quietly appeared above his head, and billions of rays of light shone out from the Heavenly Gate.","Seeing this, the bald Arhat was stunned at first, then his eyes suddenly opened wide and a bright light burst out.","“You have such a pure aura. If I swallow you, my cultivation realm will be perfect!” The bald Arhat’s voice trembled, and his fat body stood up from the lotus platform.","“This is the will of the heavens!” He let out a strange shriek and waved his Kasaya-clad arms. All of a sudden, all of the Yan power in the entire Whirling Heaven gathered towards him.","The wind and clouds changed drastically, and even the ground was lifted up by the strange hurricane.","An eight-armed treasure form with angry eyes appeared behind him, almost occupying the entire Whirling Heaven.","This eight-armed treasure form had two heads, one dark and one bright, one black and one white.","Four pairs of sun-like eyes looked at Jian Wushuang in unison, and a supreme sense of oppression surged.","Everyone felt that the Yan power in their bodies seemed to be suppressed by something, and the flow was slow.","“All of you will become nourishment for my Whirling Heaven. I will remember every single one of you,” the bald Arhat said in a drunken manner.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his eyebrows. The Transcendence Heavenly Gate had finally suppressed him.","However, a sudden change occurred. When the giant finger that could poke a hole in the head of the giant Ocean Sky octopus touched the bald Arhat, the eight-armed image form behind him opened its mouth and swallowed all the energy, turning it into nourishment.","“Come, attack me as much as you want. Exhaust all your strength and submit to me.” The bald Arhat laughed hideously. As his body moved, the earth-shaking eight-armed iimage form with angry eyes took a heavy step forward, stirring the wind and clouds.","The two black-golden palms descended, and everyone’s faces were filled with shock. They all released thick Yan power, ready to resist with all their might."]},{"number":4705,"title":"Chapter 4705 Eight-Armed Buddha Image","paragraphs":["4705 Eight-Armed Buddha Image","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate any longer. He raised his palm and the great supreme Yan power was unleashed.","The terrifying power that could even destroy a Yan Immortal turned into a pillar of light that shot up into the sky and struck the black-gold palm.","However, an unbelievable scene appeared.","The two collided, and the thousands of streams of light from the explosion scattered. However, the giant black-golden palm only trembled. Not only was it not damaged in the slightest, but it also became more solid.","“Retreat!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and he quickly retreated. Chun Qiu and the others also moved in an instant to escape the range of the black-golden palm.","Five of the weaker cultivators were hit and died on the spot. Their vast Yan power was completely absorbed.","The ground sank thousands of feet, and a chasm was torn open.","The bald Arhat standing on the lotus platform laughed. As his figure moved, the eight-armed Buddha image with angry eyes behind him also moved the clouds and came over. It was inexplicably eerie and strange as it loomed in the dense clouds.","The black and white heads then shot down four beams of light from their eye sockets.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to cast an enchantment to cover everyone. Then, he held an Invisible Sword and flew up. He stepped on the light pillar and went straight to the Lotus platform in the sky.","The bald Arhat’s gaze focused and he waved his palm to bring down layers of Eight Trigrams. The eight-armed Buddha behind him also opened its huge mouths at the same time and sucked in all the energy that was escaping.","Even Jian Wushuang felt that the Yan power that was spreading around his body was being devoured.","“Foul-mouthed Junior, obediently accept your fate.” The bald Arhat laughed weirdly. His arms danced wildly, blasting out countless Eight Trigrams.","Jian Wushuang stepped on the light pillar and guided the invisible sword forward with one hand.","It was another Extinctive Sword Strike!","100,000 swords combined into one. There was no gaudy radiance overflowing, but no one dared to look at it directly.","The sky was torn apart by this attack.","The sword of Extinctive Sword Strike seemed to have entered a no man’s land, instantly breaking through the layers of Eight Trigrams, and then stabbed towards the bald Arhat without losing any momentum.","Everything happened too quickly, so fast that the bald Arhat did not even have time to react before the Extinctive Sword Strike hit the left side of his face.","Divine blood gushed out, and a complete left ear fell on the lotus platform.","This was a huge humiliation!","The bald Arhat came back to his senses from his disbelief. The humiliation he had suffered again and again had driven him crazy.","A total of eight boundless forces that blotted out the sky covered the entire Whirling Heaven.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn. From the several confrontations, the bald Arhat who called himself Whirling Patriarch was still at the peak of the Yan Immortal realm, but the Yan power he displayed showed signs of a breakthrough, especially the eight-armed monster behind him, which made him surpass it in one fell swoop and reach an unknown realm.","The terrifying power descended with an earth-shattering force. Chun Qiu and the others had already activated the Yan power barrier to deal with this disaster.","As for Jian Wushuang, he wanted to open the Boyang Bottle to let the three Emperors participate in the battle, but there were more than 20 Young Emperor’s spies around him. If he rashly released the three Emperors, he was afraid that he would not be able to explain himself.","After quickly dispelling this thought, Jian Wushuang used Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate.","The giant palm formed by the essence of thousands of divine weapons surged like the sun and collided with the eight black-gold palms.","Layers of explosion ripples swept up from the center, instantly sweeping away the clouds that shrouded the entire Whirling Heaven. At the same time, huge waves were stirred up on the surface of the giant sea.","Even Yan Immortal could not escape unscathed from this unimaginable explosion. Even Chun Qiu and the others, who were far away from the battle, felt their hearts palpitate.","Jian Wushuang took half a step back and the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate finally dissipated. However, although the eight black-gold palms were extremely dim, they still existed and continued to attack him with great power!","At the critical moment, an ethereal but extremely tough Yan power turned into layers of enchantment and blocked Jian Wushuang’s head, preventing the eight black-gold palms from advancing any further.","At the same time, a thin purple-robed figure appeared behind him and said, “Go.”","Jian Wushuang understood tacitly. He immediately jumped up and turned into the sharpest arrow, shooting at the bald Arhat.","Thousands of rays of brilliance gathered in Jian Wushuang’s palm. Almost as soon as the bald Arhat reacted, they covered the sky and surrounded him.","A hint of panic flashed across the bald Arhat’s face. He hurriedly waved his hands and abandoned the lotus platform, sitting on the palm of the eight-armed Buddha image form behind him.","Jian Wushuang rushed over and crushed the lotus platform with one foot. He looked at the bald Arhat with a calm gaze.","The ear that had been cut off by the sword had already grown back, but he was still filled with hatred after being humiliated so many times.","Even though the bald Arhat now understood that he had kicked a hard obstacle, he could no longer turn back under the command of his mind!","As long as he could completely devour it, he would definitely be able to take that step and ascent to the next cultivation realm!","At the thought of this, the bald Arhat’s eyes gleamed. He looked at Jian Wushuang with a cold smile and said, “Foul-mouthed Junior, if you’re willing to kneel down and kowtow to me three times today, I’ll let bygones be bygones and let you leave the Whirling Heaven safely. How about it?”","Jian Wushuang was extremely calm and sneered. “You think you are worthy of making me kneel down with your mediocre cultivation method? If you kowtow to me three hundred times, I can consider leaving your corpse intact.”","“Arrogant fool, I’ll sit here today and see what you can do to me,” the bald Arhat stood up on the palm of the eight-armed Buddha image and shouted loudly.","Without a doubt, Jian Wushuang swept forward with his sword, and the vast Sword Intent slashed forward. However, the bald Arhat did not dodge, but took it with his body.","The Sword Intent swept out and directly cut off one of the bald Arhat’s arms.","Then, he hugged his arms and cried out in pain. His figure subconsciously retreated, obviously trying to escape!","Jian Wushuang did not want to miss such a good opportunity. He stepped into the air and grabbed him, ready to kill him directly.","With the skinny purple-robed man, Zheng Ying, and the others dealing with the eight-armed Buddha image form, Jian Wushuang could pursue the bald Arhat with all his might.","He, who had lost an arm, seemed to be scared out of his wits. He moved forward in a panic, and his speed was a little slow.","In just a few breaths, Jian Wushuang had already arrived behind him and directly slashed down with his sword.","Suddenly, an arm grew out of the bald Arhat’s back and grabbed the sword.","“Hehehe...”","There was a strange sound. On the back of the bald Arhat’s head, which only had a few strands of hair left, an ugly face appeared. Its huge, pancake-like lips moved toward Jian Wushuang without saying anything.","Jian Wushuang felt a chill in his heart. He immediately raised his sword and stabbed it into the mouth of the strange face."]},{"number":4706,"title":"Chapter 4706 Help From the Emperors","paragraphs":["4706 Help From the Emperors","The surging Sword Intent did not achieve the desired effect. After it all smashed into his mouth, it was like a clay ox entering the sea, without the slightest ripple.","At the same time, a terrifying suction force rose and enveloped Jian Wushuang.","He felt Yan power flowing out of his body uncontrollably. At the same time, his skin was aging quickly.","The Arhat was devouring Jian Wushuang’s power!","However, it was too late. Jian Wushuang could not escape.","The bald Arhat laughed madly. His stomach was as big as a bucket, and he directly swallowed the whole whale into his stomach.","When the last wisp of light completely disappeared, the whole process only took a few dozen breaths. He could not suppress the excitement on his face.","As long as he devoured them, even Yan Immortals would not be able to escape.","The bald Arhat was already in ecstasy. He could already imagine the scene when he took that step and Ascend.","At the thought of this, the bald Arhat did not stay any longer and directly flew towards the eight-armed Budda image form.","He sat back on top of the eight-armed Buddha image form and glanced coldly at the few people who were struggling to resist on the ground. Then, he closed his eyes and began to digest.","His top priority now was to take that step!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang, who was dressed in a black robe, entered a strange space.","As far as the eye could see, it was all chaotic haze, and the ground under his feet was slightly wet.","If he did not guess wrong, the space he was in right now was the stomach of the bald Arhat.","In the chaotic and strange haze, the Yan power in his body was slowly being stripped away. However, Jian Wushuang did not look worried at all.","Even earlier, when the bald Arhat had the thought of devouring, Jian Wushuang had already understood it and played along with it.","If the three emperors were not around, Jian Wushuang would not have dared to be involved. But now, things were different.","Before the three emperors left, they would be his greatest trump card.","Breaking through from the inside would be a pretty good method to directly destroy this rather sinister Whirling Patriarch to the greatest extent.","Taking the Boyang Bottle from his waist, Jian Wushuang directly pulled out the stopper.","Immediately after, three figures scrambled out of the Boyang Bottle.","“It’s all your fault, you old man. You can just sleep if you have nothing to do. Why did you blindly pour in Yan power? you almost caused my beard to fall!”","Jian Wushuang felt a headache when he saw the three Emperor Lords cursing at each other. It seemed to have become a fixed way for the three of them to appear.","“All of you shut up, don’t lose your demeanor in front of this Little Friend.” The dual-pupiled old man coughed, then took a step forward and said with a smile, “Little Friend, you called the three of us out. Have you met with any trouble?”","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He cupped his hands and told the three Emperors everything that had happened.","After saying this, the three Emperors turned around and looked around.","“In other words, we’re now in that guy’s stomach?”","“This fellow’s cultivation level is not bad. He’s about to reach the perfect level,” the dual-pupiled old man said as he stroked his beard.","The majestic old man snorted disdainfully. “He’s using crooked ways, something that can’t be shown in public. With such a state of mind, even if he continues to cultivate, it’s impossible for him to become an Emperor.”","“Nonsense, how many people can be as outstanding as us, able to obtain the great destiny, Ascend to the throne, create the Heavenly Court, and recruit talents?” the tall and thin old man said arrogantly.","Surprisingly, this time, the other two Emperors did not refute him. They both agreed.","“...”","“Three Seniors, do you have any way to deal a heavy blow to this guy?” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said.","When the three Emperor heard this, they straightened his faces and looked around again. Then, the tall and thin old man smiled smugly. “What’s so difficult about it? This old man’s strength has already reached the peak, but he has not taken that step. This means that there is a crack in his mind. As long as we find it, everything will be solved without any attack.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then walked forward.","Three old men in tattered Emperor’s clothing were all lying on his body, acting as guides.","As he walked in the darkness, with the three Emperor Lords’ fate energy on his body, the Yan power in his body did not dissipate, and it began to show signs of recovery.","After pushing away the layers of mist, countless unconscious cultivator True Souls floated in this strange space.","“What a foul-smelling person. I’m sure that this old man’s evil cultivation technique is definitely from Zhen Wuyang.” The tall and thin old man waved his hand in disgust. At the same time, he wrapped Jian Wushuang with a ray of Emperor light. “Don’t be affected by the karma.”","The other two Emperors nodded affirmatively and waved their hands to disperse the True Souls that were approaching.","After dispersing all the True Souls, Jian Wushuang counted more than 90,000 steps in his heart and arrived at the place where the wind was howling.","There was a violent squall wreaking havoc, but it was not a big deal to him.","The Emperors jumped down from Jian Wushuang’s back and stood at the front.","“This should be the old man’s weakest point. Su He, you’ll have to help this time,” the tall and thin old man said without looking sideways.","“You’re making it seem as if I’ve never done anything.” The dual-pupiled old man curled his lips. As he spoke, he swept his palm forward.","An extremely complex palm pattern, carrying the Emperor’s light, smashed toward the weakest point.","This strange world suddenly trembled, and a shrill roar came from nowhere and resounded in all directions.","Golden cracks began to appear.","The tall and thin old man and the awe-inspiring old man also moved at the same time. They raised their palms and waved. Two grand and full of Emperor’s light patterns pressed forward.","With the combined power of the three Emperors, the mighty Emperor’s light surged and easily broke through this strange world.","Although he had expected it, Jian Wushuang was still surprised by how easily the three Emperor Lords waved their Emperor marks. The unrivaled aura had appeared the moment the three Emperor Lords waved their Emperor marks.","At the same time, he heaved a sigh of relief. If he had killed one of the Emperor’s True Shadows at the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, he would not have been able to leave the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes alive.","That kind of unrivaled dominance, even if it was only the True Shadow of an Emperor, was enough to make people tremble.","At the same time, the bald Arhat who was sitting on the eight-armed image form’s shoulder suddenly opened his eyes and looked at his belly.","With his belly button as the center, golden lines began to spread out, almost instantly covering his entire stomach.","The next moment, it exploded!","A radiance that carried billions of wisps of light gushed out, illuminating the entire Whirling Heaven.","“No!” the bald Arhat said with difficulty. He wanted to escape at all costs, but his entire divine body had been shattered. Only his ugly head was left."]},{"number":4707,"title":"Chapter 4707 Breaking the Eight Arms Buddha","paragraphs":["4707 Breaking the Eight Arms Buddha","Jian Wushuang appeared out of nowhere and stood in the void. There was a glow that seeped out from the gaps between his fingers and scattered across the entire Whirling Heaven, like golden sand.","The people who were bitterly resisting felt the pressure on their bodies relax. The earth-shaking eight-armed image form actually stopped at this moment. Then, the eight arms retracted and the four eyes closed.","“What, what’s going on?”","Chun Qiu was confused at first. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the void, surrounded by golden sand-like brilliance, and he understood.","Jian Wushuang had already given him an invisible image of a strong person who could turn the tide and take everything to heart.","The only person who could calm him down was his Imperial Father, Fenghua.","As eight arms image form stopped, the entire Whirling Heaven was on the verge of collapse.","The bald Arhat, whose divine body had been blown to pieces, looked at Jian Wushuang in despair with his eyes wide open.","Although in the realm of the Yan Immortal, as long as the aura was not exhausted, it was close to Immortality, but he was frightened. He felt that everything in his body was dissipating rapidly, as if it was being stripped away by some mighty energy.","Slowly exhaling, Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and grabbed the bald Arhat’s head.","The great terror of life and death made his teeth tremble, and he could not even speak properly.","“Lord... Lord Yan Immortal, please let me go...”","Obviously, Jian Wushuang was too lazy to talk nonsense. If the bald Arhat had stayed in the cave and not come out to rob them, this series of events would not have happened.","Now that things had come to this, it was time to cut the weeds and eliminate the roots.","He stretched out his index and middle fingers and touched the center of the bald Arhat’s face. An unrivaled tyrannical energy directly crushed his life force.","“No...”","The ugly head was shattered and Whirling Patriarch, who occupied the entire Whirling Heaven, eventually died in the hands of Jian Wushuang.","In order to prevent him from being completely dead, Jian Wushuang used his great divine power to completely clear the hundreds of millions of miles of heaven and earth in the Whirling Heaven and destroyed any aura that could be reignited.","At this point, more than half of the Whirling Heaven had become a dead zone without harming any other living beings.","As the bald Arhat died, the earth-shaking eight-armed form did not disappear. Instead, it turned into a palm-sized colored pottery and fell into Jian Wushuang’s hand.","His eight arms were stretched out, and his eyes were as big as bells. It was a mini version of the eight-armed buddha image form used by the bald Arhat. He was actually a little ugly and cute...","Landing on the ground from the sky, Chun Qiu rushed forward excitedly. “Brother Jian, you’re amazing!”","“What is this?” Chun Qiu caught it in a flurry and started fiddling with it curiously.","As soon as the bald Arhat died, his disciples, who had scattered like birds and beasts, were also killed by Jian Wushuang.","He jumped onto the deck and returned to his old position at the bow of the ship. He sat up and began to meditate.","Zheng Ying looked at his back, then walked back to the boat.","In the battle in the Whirling Heaven, the originally large team was left with less than 20 people. More than half of them had died in the sea area of the giant Sea Sky Octopus.","And this treacherous great voyage was about to come to an end.","After passing through the swirling world and continuing forward, the mysterious Zheng Ying disappeared once more.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang was worried about the mysterious woman.","As the sea route neared its end, the world filled with Immortal Qi replaced the previous waves and clouds.","The mysterious atmosphere also made Jian Wushuang’s vigilant heart relax.","From time to time, Yan Immortals riding on cranes would leave a trail of white in the sky, and all kinds of powerful figures seemed to form the main color of the Great Yan Domain.","After several years, the ship finally sailed to the end — Jingchuan.","This was a Super Heavenly Domain that was majestic to the extreme. It was said that this was once a Dao Field that was comprehended by a mighty Emperor. The derived power was extremely abundant, but it was eternal.","The top cultivators were already used to the sight of the huge ships sailing in the sea. They did not even look at them curiously.","As they swam through the river, several huge ships entered one after another. At this time, more than ten black-robed Yan Immortals stepped on the air and arrived.","The skinny purple-robed man threw out a faint golden seal from his hand and it landed in the hands of the leader.","After a few breaths, the leading Yan Immortal in black waved his hand and a Heavenly Gate made of clouds and mist opened.","“We’ve finally arrived.” Chun Qiu stretched his back lazily. He subconsciously looked forward from the corner of his eye, and his body suddenly froze.","Jian Wushuang frowned.","Behind the Heavenly Gate, a figure dressed in luxurious clothes stood there with a somewhat relaxed expression, as if he had been waiting for a long time.","Seeing that the ship had arrived safely, the Young Emperor smiled and jumped onto the deck.","“Greetings, Young Emperor.” The skinny purple-robed man and the other purple-robed men knelt down on one knee to report.","“Thank you for your trouble, my companion.” Young Emperor nodded and Yan power turned into a breeze to carry the skinny purple-robed man and the others. Then, he shifted his gaze to Jian Wushuang.","“Well done, what do you want? Goddess, cultivation technique, Heaven and earth realms?” He listed more than ten types and waited for Jian Wushuang’s reply.","“50 years.” Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and said something unexpected.","The young Emperor smiled. “70 years.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then said, “Since there’s nothing else, I’ll go back and take a nap.”","“There’s no rush, you probably haven’t been to this Jing Chuan land before. I’ll take you around here, and it won’t be too late to return when the time comes.” Without waiting for Jian Wushuang’s reply, the Young Emperor put his hands behind his back and hurried to Jingchuan.","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly and then said to Chun Qiu, “Wait for me here. I’ll be back soon.”","Chun Qiu looked around and shook his head. “Forget it. I’ll just follow Brother Jian. We can look out for each other.”","Jian Wushuang did not say much and moved forward.","As one of the most vast worlds, Jingchuan had a terrifying foundation, and the cultivators who could come here were all top cultivators.","With just a glance, he could see dozens or hundreds of Ancestor realm cultivators.","Jian Wushuang had a brief discussion with Chun Qiu about Ancestor realm problems not long ago.","In the Great Yan Domain, which was the ultimate realm of all things, there was no such thing as the Ancestor cultivation realm. Over here, they were just known as the ‘Entry Yan’ level.","In other words, every Ancestor-level cultivator in the Great Yan Domain was actually known as ‘Entry Yan’. This was because they were ‘Entering the Yan’.","At the same time, the Ancestor realm cultivators in the Great Yan Domain were slightly weaker than the Ancestor realm cultivators in the Divine Power Universe.","And this half of it belonged to the fate energy of the Great Dao, which could not be replicated and was unique.","They walked side by side with the Young Emperor and stopped at the gate of Jingchuan, walking on the vast plain."]},{"number":4708,"title":"Chapter 4708 Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor","paragraphs":["4708 Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor","In addition to the flocks of cranes in the sky, there were also top cultivators flying over their heads from time to time.","After advancing to the Yan Immortal stage, other than using telepathy to travel, the simplest minor divine power like the Earth Shrinking Mountain River had a wide range of uses. It was mainly a movement technique, allowing one to travel immense distances.","Obviously, this Young Emperor was also a Yan Immortal.","The two of them used the minor divine power of Earth Shrinking Mountain River to travel around the continent.","However, it was difficult for Chun Qiu. He could only barely follow behind the two of them even though he was flying with all his might.","They travelled across the Jingchuan Heaven Domain, taking in the sights of the the mountains and rivers.","Among them, there were no less than a hundred bustling cities, and even Yan Immortals would exchange their insights and techniques here.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor strolled in the largest Tian City. It was bustling with thousands of top cultivators.","Countless rare and precious treasures were placed on the ground for trade and exchange.","“This thing is a hard currency. You can basically buy everything you need.” The Young Emperor caressed a thumb-sized black mountain crystal and threw a storage bag to Jian Wushuang. “There’s a whole ship’s worth of crystals inside. You can use them as you wish.”","“...”","Although there were many top cultivators in this bustling Tian City, none of them were noisy. Everyone seemed to have a goal in mind and would leave immediately after they completed it without saying a word.","Walking among them, even Jian Wushuang, who was used to seeing Supreme Treasures, began to be tempted.","There were all kinds of Supreme Treasures, and some of them were broken. Some of them even contained a tiny bit of Imperial Emperor’s fate.","Jian Wushuang also picked out some of the sword principle books that were still useful.","As the Young Emperor had said, the black mountain crystal was really hard currency. With only half a ship of crystals, he had bought four or five books about sword principles.","As for sword principle, Jian Wushuang hoped to gain some insight from each unknown sword principle so as to enrich his entire Sword Dao framework.","The Young Emperor beside him, on the other hand, liked to buy some little things that were not of much use but were extremely ingenious.","Along the way, he had stuffed no less than a hundred trinkets into his storage bag.","Jian Wushuang did not like crowded places. Just as he was about to explain the situation and leave, he had a strange feeling that made him subconsciously look at the inconspicuous stall beside him.","Among all kinds of broken treasures that seemed to have been abandoned for countless years, a palm-sized bone armor engraved with complicated and incomprehensible patterns came into his eyes.","Jian Wushuang stopped and walked to the front of the stall with his eyes wide open.","“Xuan...”","“Xuan Yi!”","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and he subconsciously reached for the bone armor.","An extremely old palm suddenly grabbed his wrist like an eagle’s claw, making it impossible for him to move an inch further.","“I only trade and not sell anything in this stall.”","A hoarse and low voice came from under the tattered robe. Half of his face, which was only exposed from the hood, was full of black and white stubbles, looking extremely old.","Jian Wushuang, who had intended to throw the whole storage bag to him, was stunned and did not know how to answer.","Just as Jian Wushuang was in a daze, the claw-like palm cut open his palm and took out something.","Everything happened in an instant. It was so fast that Jian Wushuang could only react when everything was over.","He suddenly pulled back his palm, only to find that his palm was completely undamaged, without the slightest injury.","However, the slight pain still reminded Jian Wushuang that what had happened was real.","“What did you do to me just now?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was low and his cold eyes were filled with killing intent.","“It’s just a harmless and insignificant exchange condition. It’s yours now.” The stall keeper hidden in the black robe said in a low voice and put the bone armor in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","After realizing that there was nothing wrong with his divine body, Jian Wushuang did not bother to investigate. He looked at the bone armor in his hand with a frown.","The Young Emperor, who was standing to the side, was also interested when he saw him acting like this. He squatted down and looked at the bone armor as well.","The words that could be vaguely seen from a certain angle had disappeared when he looked at them carefully.","The ‘Xuan’ word and ‘Yi’ word that were getting clearer and clearer did not show their shape anymore.","However, Jian Wushuang had a feeling that the bone armor definitely recorded something that had broken the ancient times and was definitely related to that person!","“Where did you get this bone armor?” Jian Wushuang looked up at him and asked.","The stall keeper shook his head. “I don’t know either. No one knows where he came from. Perhaps everything will only be clear when he has no choice but to appear.”","The unorganized sentence was like a premonition or omen, obscure and difficult to understand.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to ask more, the stall-keeper spoke again, but this time it was about their safety.","“There’s someone watching you in the dark.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang thought of something and subconsciously looked into the distance.","The thousands of cultivators who had deliberately concealed their auras all looked over at this moment.","Swish!","Nearly a hundred arrows came from all directions, carrying mighty Yan power.","Jian Wushuang suddenly waved his arm and a pure barrier enveloped the three of them.","Clang, clang, clang!","Each of the arrows, as thick as an arm, pierced through the barrier, but could not move any further.","Looking at the sharp arrow less than a finger away from his eyes, the Young Emperor’s face darkened.","Jian Wushuang remained silent. He raised a palm and waved it in the air. Suddenly, the void collapsed and a black-robed man was directly brought over.","However, before anyone could say anything, the black-robed man who had been captured directly shattered his own life source and turned into dust on the spot.","The next moment, the sky above the entire Tian City cracked. Hundreds and thousands of black-robed men swept over like an endless sea.","Even Jian Wushuang’s expression turned ugly.","From these figures that were coming from all directions, he could sense the aura of at least 15 Yan Immortals and an uncountable number of Ancestor-level Entry Yans.","“Are these people here to seek revenge?” Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the Young Emperor.","The Young Emperor’s eyes sank. “How did these scumbags know I was here?”","Chun Qiu nudged Jian Wushuang and signaled him to leave.","Jian Wushuang did not make a decision. He did not have a good impression of the Young Emperor, but he did not hate him either.","He had stayed in the Six Heavens Realms because he had been threatened, but now the situation seemed to have changed."]},{"number":4709,"title":"Chapter 4709 Battle to the Death in Tian City","paragraphs":["4709 Battle to the Death in Tian City","If the Young Emperor died in the encirclement, the promise between the two of them would no longer be valid. He would also find out and go to find everything hidden behind the fog.","All kinds of thoughts came to Jian Wushuang’s mind, but he did not express his opinion.","At this moment, all the top cultivators in the city had fled. In the vast city, it was so quiet that only the sound of breathing could be heard.","Nearly a thousand figures surrounded him from all directions, cautious and murderous.","The interconnected forces formed the strongest cage, enveloping the entire Tian City.","The Young Emperor was extremely calm. He stood where he was and adjusted his luxurious clothes. Then, he tightened the jade belt around his waist and pulled out a slender soft sword.","This was the first time that Jian Wushuang had seen him fight. A unique and cold aura surged.","Then, the Young Emperor held the soft sword upside down and cut off the long hair that reached his waist without any hesitation.","All the figures took half a step back without a trace, but the cold and deadly gazes were still there.","“I was careless to let you know my whereabouts, but if you want my life, let’s see if you have the qualifications.”","The Young Emperor’s eyes slowly swept over everyone, and the long hair that had been cut off in his hand fell to the ground.","The silent battle to the death began!","As he swung his sword, the mighty Yan power was like a dragon, charging toward the black-robed man who was the closest to him.","Some of the weaker cultivators were killed by the Sword Intent that Yan power transformed into.","Holding the slender soft sword, the Young Emperor seemed to have entered a no-man’s land. As he slashed out with his sword, he also struck out with his palm.","In just a few seconds, dozens of Ancestor-level experts had fallen at his hands.","However, when the 15 Yan Immortals surrounded him, the Young Emperor who had the upper hand was at a disadvantage.","He was at most at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage. How could he block the killing moves of 15 other Yan Immortals?","The finger hit his waist, and the Young Emperor took half a step back. Both sides of his cheeks flushed red.","His luxurious clothes were torn apart, and traces of divine blood seeped out.","At the same time, the 15 Yan Immortals, 15 rays of mighty Yan power, combined into one and shot toward the Young Emperor.","At this moment of life and death, Jian Wushuang made his move. His palm, which contained a surging Sword intent, directly passed him and struck forward!","An extreme bright light flashed past, and the layers of shockwaves prevented even Ancestor-level experts from moving in the center of the explosion.","1 against 15!","Jian Wushuang took a heavy step back and completely offset the combined attack of the 15 Yan Immortals.","The Young Emperor’s Lord’s eyes widened and he looked at him with an indescribable expression.","“If you don’t want to die, then use all your strength to kill your way out of here,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice without turning his head.","The Young Emperor smiled. “Understood.”","The 15 Yan Immortals who were also forced back looked at each other and once again rushed forward, using more violent Yan power than before to surround the three.","Jian Wushuang obviously did not want to fight a prolonged battle. In order to cause more widespread destruction at the first moment, he directly released the Ancestral Skill, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","The giant finger broke the cage barrier in the sky, like thousands of suns falling.","All the black-robed men felt a strong sense of danger and tried to avoid it.","However, when the Transcendence Heavenly Gate was completely released, hundreds of Ancestor-level cultivators who tried to resist were killed on the spot and turned into dust!","Even the pavilions in Tian City were torn apart by this move.","As the Transcendence Heavenly Gate dissipated, an even more majestic and terrifying Sword Intent poured out, turning into a long river of Sword Intent that pressed forward!","Some Ancestor-level experts died on the spot, and a black-robed Yan Immortal even had half of his divine body cut off.","The Young Emperor stood beside Jian Wushuang. His luxurious clothes fluttered in the wind and he easily seized any Ancestor-level expert who came forward.","Three against thousands, this was impossible and crazy.","Although Ancestor-level experts could not do much damage to Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor, with them attracting the damage, the 15 Yan Immortals still caused great trouble for them.","After killing the first Yan Immortal, Jian Wushuang released a vast Sword Intent to block them.","At the same time, more than a dozen purple-robed figures approached from afar and instantly charged over.","“Young Emperor, your companion is late.” The skinny purple-robed man waved his arm and pushed away the Ancestor-level experts, standing in front of the Young Emperor.","“You’re not late. You’re just in time,” the Young Emperor smiled and said. “Let’s go out together!”","After he finished speaking, a thick Yan power rose up and swept in all directions!","Chun Qiu struggled to hold on. He was only at Ancestor-level. If he did not have Jian Wushuang’s protection, he would have been crushed into powder.","Unwilling to give up, Chun Qiu reached out and took out the eight-armed pottery that Jian Wushuang had given him.","The eight-armed pottery expanded in the wind in the hands of Chun Qiu. In the blink of an eye, it had grown into an earth-shaking eight-armed Arhat.","“It’s done!” Chun Qiu smiled excitedly. Even Jian Wushuang did not dare to underestimate the eight-armed Arhat.","The complete form of the eight-armed Arhat was almost at the same level as the Whirling Patriarch of the Whirling Heaven.","For some reason, it had surpassed the ordinary peak of the Yan Immortal stage and reached a more profound and mysterious realm.","And this eight-armed Arhat had naturally surpassed the peak of the Yan Immortal stage and had reached an unknown level.","Looking at the hideous figure, all the black-robed men subconsciously stopped for a moment.","It was also at this moment that a total of eight black-gold palms smashed down on the ground with unstoppable momentum.","Boom boom boom!","Some of the Yan Immortals did not manage to dodge in time, and their life sources were crushed on the spot. Ancestor-level Immortals even had their bodies and souls destroyed, turning into nutrients that were absorbed by the eight-armed Arhat.","“Brother Jian, let’s go!” it’ll be too late if we don’t leave now! Chun Qiu turned around and shouted.","Jian Wushuang nodded and summoned Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate to seize the opportunity to escape.","A giant palm formed by thousands of divine weapons descended from the Heavenly Gate and fell to the ground.","The group of Yan Immortals, who already knew of its power, tacitly dispersed and rushed in all directions, blocking the escape route of these people.","The light faded, but there were still thousands of black-robed figures like the deep sea, so oppressive that it was hard to breathe.","One of the black-robed Yan Immortals stepped forward, pointed at the Young Emperor, and said, “Leave him here, and any one of you can leave. I won’t stop you.”","Chun Qiu looked at Jian Wushuang anxiously. To him, it would be great if he could see his sworn enemy being besieged and killed.","However, before Jian Wushuang could speak, the skinny purple-robed man took a step forward and slowly pulled down the hood on his head, revealing an old face full of scars. “If you want to take the Prince’s life, you have to go through me first. Even your Master can’t do anything to you, let alone you scumbags.”"]},{"number":4710,"title":"Chapter 4710 Chen Qing","paragraphs":["4710 Chen Qing","The black-robed Yan Immortal’s eyes focused and his killing intent leaked out, “Old man, you will die today!”","“If you have the guts, then come and take it. Although this old man’s power has declined, crushing you is just like crushing a group of smelly bugs.”","Before they could say anything else, the remaining 12 Yan Immortals all moved out at this moment. The terrifying Yan power that was enough to control a Heavenly Domain poured out.","Jian Wushuang frowned. With his current strength, he could easily crush three to five ordinary Yan Immortals. However, there were 12 Yan Immortals attacking him at the same time. Unless the three Emperor Lords were summoned, none of them could escape!","However, the three Emperors were his last trump card. In the treacherous Great Yan Domain, Jian Wushuang would not reveal them to anyone unless his life was in danger.","He was confident that even if he was surrounded by so many Yan Immortals, he could still escape, but the Young Emperor and the others probably could not.","With a single palm strike, an even more vigorous Yan power forced back the hundred Ancestor-level experts in front of him. With Jian Wushuang as the leader, they began to escape through the gates of Tian City!","Chun Qiu also summoned his eight arm’s furious eyes at this moment. Every time he waved his hand, several Ancestor-level experts who could not dodge in time would die!","At this moment, the Young Emperor’s cold eyes looked like they were about to drip blood, and his pale face was getting redder.","This time, the number of people surrounding him was so high, and their cultivation realms were so high that it was obvious that they were really here to take his life!","A life-and-death battle was inevitable, but his fate seemed to have been determined.","As a dark purple terrifying force rose, the thin black-robed man’s purple robe fluttered. When he put his palms together, countless purple radiances linked together and turned into the thinnest and straightest long blade.","An ordinary slash was swung out, but it caused the ground to crack instantly. A pillar of light that shook the sky and earth spewed out, carrying a destructive aura and exploding among the top cultivators.","There was no sound. Even when every top cultivator’s body and spirit were destroyed, and no one made a sound. There was only the tragic situation of fighting.","This was a team with a clear goal and strict discipline. Even Jian Wushuang could not imagine who had such great power to organize such a team led by nearly 20 Yan Immortals and over 1000 Ancestor-level experts.","Could it be an Emperor?","There was no answer. At this moment, Jian Wushuang was like an emotionless wandering swordsman. Every time he waved the invisible long sword in his hand, he could easily take the lives of several Ancestor-level experts.","On the other hand, Chun Qiu’s strength had skyrocketed after he had eight arms Arhat, and he could barely move around in the encirclement.","As for the Young Emperor, as his face became redder, his strength decreased at a visible rate. If it was not for the thin purple robe, he would have died in the encirclement.","The 12 Yan Immortals surrounded the Young Emperor, clearly aiming to take his life.","Jian Wushuang, who was not far away, subconsciously looked back at the stall in front of him. The mysterious stall-keeper had disappeared without a trace.","He rubbed the Emperor’s Bone Armor with his hand and quickly stuffed it into the Boyang Bottle.","At the same time, the tall and thin old man’s voice came into his ears from the Boyang Bottle, “Little Friend, what trouble have you encountered again? We can sense a strong killing intent from the outside world.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang transmitted his voice into the bottle with his divine sense, “I’m fine for the time being. I’m confident that I can leave this place.”","When the three Emperors heard this, they responded, and everything returned to silence.","The sky City in Jingchuan Heaven Domain began to collapse on a large scale. Such a terrifying battle had already attracted the law-enforcement officers of the Heaven Domain.","Nearly a hundred strong figures in embroidered robes rushed over from all directions.","The leader, a middle-aged man in the Yan Immortal stage, rushed forward, but he was immediately stopped by more than ten Ancestor-level experts.","One of the Ancestor-level experts faintly flashed a golden seal and said in a low muffled voice, “Idlers, step back.”","The middle-aged man’s eyes were calm at first, but then without any warning, he was filled with killing intent. A light pillar of Yan power suddenly exploded in front of him, directly crushing the Ancestor=level expert into dust.","“Idlers step back? I’ve come here today to take your lives!”","As his deep voice fell, hundreds of embroidered robes rushed down from the sky and suddenly joined the battle.","A total of five Yan Immortals, the moment they entered the battle, the pressure on everyone was lifted.","“Young Emperor, I’m late. Please forgive me.” The middle-aged man tore through the encirclement with a long sword surrounded by Immortal Qi and came to the Young Emperor.","The Young Emperor smiled sadly. “Good, you’re not late. Jing Chuan is so big, but you’re the only one who’s willing to come and save me.”","After sending several Ancestor-level experts flying with a single sword strike, Chen Qing’s expression turned grave, “They might have their own difficulties.”","Without saying anything more, the Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang, who was trying his best to tear a hole in the encirclement.","He, who had been silent all this time, seemed to have made a decision in his heart and did not choose to leave.","The Young Emperor’s furrowed brows suddenly became sharp. He looked at the top cultivators who surrounded him like a sea and smiled gloomily. A dark purple flame surged out of his palms.","A Dark Domain spread out with him at the center, quickly and madly devouring every inch of the land.","Countless buildings were turned into dust in this strange domain. At the same time, the other black-robed top cultivators in the domain felt their vision go dark. Their divine bodies seemed to have fallen into a swamp, and their movements became unnatural.","The skinny purple-robed man, who was drenched in divine blood, had a pained look in his eyes when he saw this.","In his own Domain, the Young Emperor seemed to have returned to his original state, and his peak level of the Yan Immortal realm seemed to be still rising.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly and his eyes narrowed. He could feel that the Young Emperor’s cultivation realm seemed to have broken through the shackles and reached an incredible level.","his long hair, which had been cut off to his shoulders, fluttered in the wind, and his luxurious clothes, which were drawn with golden and silver threads, fluttered.","As he pointed out his finger, the space was shattered. The nearest Yan Immortal did not even have time to react before his chest crumpled into a ball. Then, the life source in his body was destroyed.","One-finger kill!","Everyone’s eyes widened in disbelief. With just a finger, he was able to kill a Yan Immortal. How terrifying was this?","Chun Qiu turned his face away as he recalled some past events.","In the past, the elder who had been serving him in the Heavenly Court was also crushed like this. His Immortal Source was destroyed along with the Heavenly Court.","As the Young Emperor killed Yan Immortal with one finger, he stared at all the top cultivators in front of him with a cold gaze."]},{"number":4711,"title":"Chapter 4711 Sealing With the Array","paragraphs":["4711 Sealing With the Array","With another finger, a Yan Immortal’s divine body and immortal source were destroyed in the same way.","Out of the 12 Yan Immortals, only 10 were left. At the same time, there were over 800 Ancestor-level cultivators left.","Seeing him kill a Yan Immortal so easily, even Jian Wushuang was shocked. One must know that even he himself could not do it so easily.","Standing in his own domain, the Young Emperor was like an unquestionable ruler. With every wave of his hand, he took away dozens of black-robed Ancestors.","The skinny purple-robed man, Cheng Qing, and the others also reacted and began to counterattack.","Jian Wushuang looked back and continued to break through the encirclement.","After being killed, there were only eight Yan Immortals left!","Finally, a black-robed Yan Immortal reacted. He took out an item from his chest pocket with great difficulty and nailed it to the ground.","It was a palm-sized flag. As the first flag fell, all the black-robed top cultivators took out the same flag and threw it.","There were nearly a hundred flags enshrouded in a strange energy. As soon as they fell into the air, they immediately linked with each other and formed a large array that directly suppressed them.","The skinny purple-robed man’s expression changed drastically. He wanted to grab the flag, but he was too late.","The flag was like the eye of the formation. As soon as it landed, the vast sealing force broke the Young Emperor’s Domain in an instant and trapped him firmly like a big bell.","As if he had suffered a backlash, the Young Emperor suddenly oozed out a wisp of red divine blood, and his terrifying Yan power weakened at a rapid pace.","Chen Qing was shocked. He raised the long sword in his hand, which was surrounded by Immortal energy, and stabbed at the array.","However, the invincible blade had lost its former effect this time, and it did not even shake the array.","“Young Master!” The skinny purple-robed man rushed forward, but due to his anxiety, he immediately vomited another mouthful of divine blood.","The black-robed Yan Immortals who were gradually surrounding them stopped and looked at them with mocking expressions.","This formation was specially made for the Young Emperor. Once he was trapped, his divine body and Immortal Source would be destroyed and he would have no chance of survival.","With just him and Chen Qing, it was impossible to break this great formation that was as deep as the abyss. The thin purple-robed man’s eyes were slightly red, and he had already crazily urged his Yan power to destroy this formation without caring about anything.","As for the Young Emperor, he seemed to have anticipated his fate. He sat on the ground calmly and wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth. He looked at the skinny purple-robed man and chuckled, “My companion, leave now. The further the better. If Jian Wushuang is willing to take you with him, you can follow him.”","The skinny purple-robed man shook his head. He seemed to have realized something and suddenly turned back to look at Jian Wushuang, who was not far away. Then, he knelt down on one knee and said, “Please save the Young Emperor.”","Hearing this, all the Yan Immortals’ expressions changed slightly. After glancing at Jian Wushuang, they attacked again to prevent any unexpected changes!","He flew into the formation, and nearly ten terrifying forces intertwined, trying to take the Young Emperor’s life in one blow.","Sighing in his heart, Jian Wushuang finally took a step forward. A thick and unparalleled Yan power surged out and cleared the ground around him.","One of the black-robed Ancestors wanted to step forward to stop them, but to their surprise, they found that they could not even take a single step forward!","Chun Qiu followed behind him, controlling the eight-armed Arhat to block some of the attacks.","A magnificent river completely constructed by Sword Intent swept forward with Jian Wushuang’s finger, like a Reverse Heavenly River!","Chen Qing’s eyes widened to their maximum. He had also entered the Dao with the sword, so how could he not understand how terrifying this ocean-like Sword Dao was!","Even if he had cultivated the way of the sword to a point where even Yan Immortal could not catch up, after seeing this magnificent Sword Intent, he knew directly and clearly that there was no way to stop it.","Who was this mysterious young man?","Everything seemed to have frozen. The eight Yan Immortals were still in mid-air, and only the Sword Dao was rushing forward.","The sealing array formed by hundreds of flags only existed for an instant under the impact of this vast river of Sword Intents before it shattered.","The terrifying Yan power that was supposed to be aimed at the Young Emperor was also destroyed in the river.","The divine bodies of those who were close to the Sword Dao were cut in half!","“Whoever takes another step forward will die,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently, but he did not look at the Yan Immortals from the beginning to the end, as if they were insignificant to him.","The formation was broken. The Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled.","The skinny purple-robed man, Cheng Qing, and the others immediately stood by his side to protect him.","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and then turned his head slightly, “Let’s go.”","The eight Yan Immortals surrounded him. The oldest Yan Immortal in a black robe stepped forward and gritted his teeth. “You are not his subordinate. Do you know that letting him go means you are making an enemy out of us?”","Jian Wushuang glanced at him and said calmly, “Nothing more, nothing less. If you leave now, I’ll let you go. If you insist on stopping me, you can all stay here forever.”","As soon as he said that, all the top cultivators in black robes were stunned. Then, they looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange expression.","This young man, who was dressed like a Ranger and had no identity or cultivation base, although his control of Yan power was extremely terrifying, he was not invincible. In the face of nearly a thousand black-robed top cultivators, not only was he not afraid, but he was also arrogant?","Did he really have the ability or a trump card, or was he just acting out of courage?","The group of Yan Immortals was the first to react. The older man in the lead sneered, “It’s not us who should stay, it’s you!”","With that, a majestic Yan power light pillar poured out and went straight to Jian Wushuang’s face.","Without even looking at him, Jian Wushuang struck his palm to the side and a wave of Yan power with a strong killing intent attacked him.","The sinister smile of victory was still on his face, but in the next moment, that elderly Yan Immortal was sent flying.","This attack was enough to make even Whirling Patriarch, who had surpassed the Yan Immortal stage, be on guard. It was clearly enough to make this Yan Immortal elder suffer.","Jian Wushuang, who had completely let go, was now free of the burden in his heart. He walked calmly in the encirclement as if he had entered a no-man’s land.","If he really could not deal with it, he could simply summon the True Shadows of the three Emperors and wipe out the place.","If the Young Emperor pursued the matter in the later stages, he might not even find much.","“Don’t dawdle. You guys leave first. I’ll cover you,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","The skinny purple-robed man solemnly thanked him and then led the way with Cheng Qing and the others!","The Young Emperor looked back at Jian Wushuang and said, “Thank you. I owe you one.”","“Let’s save our lives first,” Jian Wushuang said. He still did not show any expression."]},{"number":4712,"title":"Chapter 4712 Returning to the Six Heavens","paragraphs":["4712 Returning to the Six Heavens","Jian Wushuang always seemed to know everything and was not in a hurry. In the Young Emperor’s opinion, no one around him was like him, a lone wolf.","Invisible Sword Intent rose quietly and condensed around his body.","One...","Ten...","Ten thousand!","Countless Invisible Swords rose into the sky and turned into a terrifying light that covered the sky, hanging above the heads of every black-robed top cultivator.","A great horror of life and death surged in everyone’s heart. Even Yan Immortals felt a chill under the sword curtain.","Chen Qing, who was escorting the Young Emperor, turned around and looked at this scene in shock. A deep sense of fear flashed through his eyes before he turned around.","Jian Wushuang’s clothes fluttered in the wind like a lonesome sword. No one could see through his thoughts. With every step he took, the sword curtain hanging in the sky moved forward.","A bold Ancestor-level cultivator took a step forward to test the waters. A sword appeared in the sky and slashed down!","Swish.","A sound that could not be any softer, like the sound of death, rang out in Tian City that was about to shatter.","The Ancestor-level cultivator was crushed into powder, and even the life source in his body was shattered. There was no possibility of resurrection!","A single Sword Intent had killed an Ancestor-level expert. Looking at the dense sword screen in the sky, all the Ancestor-level experts took a step back subconsciously, their faces filled with shock.","For a moment, even the few Yan Immortals did not dare to act rashly.","Jian Wushuang glanced at all of them coldly and quickened his pace.","Although the sword curtain was powerful, he knew that if they really fought, these sword curtains could only kill over a hundred Ancestor-level cultivators. If the eight Yan Immortals worked together, the effect would be greatly reduced.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang was betting that they would not dare to go forward.","Once he left Tian City, it would be much easier to escape.","However, after a few miles, the Yan Immortals looked at each other, and a sense of ruthlessness surged out. They no longer cared about the sword curtain in the sky and actually joined forces to attack!","Jian Wushuang was shocked and released his sword curtain without thinking.","However, while this sword screen may be intimidating to Ancestor-level cultivators, it was still a little weak against Yan Immortals.","The first black-robed Yan Immortal waved his hand and threw out a wave of Yan power, which swept away the approaching sword curtain and went straight for Jian Wushuang.","“Brat, I don’t care who you are, you’ll die here today!” The eight Yan Immortals rushed forward at the same time. The Yan power ribbons in their hands changed in a myriad of ways and went straight for Jian Wushuang.","The majestic and terrifying Yan power turned into a huge net that covered the sky. After Jian Wushuang pushed Chun Qiu far away from the battle, he snorted coldly and took the attack with his long sword.","100,000 sword strikes in an instant. Just as the leading Yan Immortal waved his palm, he suddenly felt a sharp Sword Intent breaking through the void and coming at him.","In the nick of time, he made the most correct choice. His body suddenly slanted, and half of the left side of his body instantly shattered.","His divine body shattered, and the unbearable pain made him cry out in pain. A look of hope was still hanging in his eyes, but in the next moment, the sword light that completely erupted tore him into pieces.","All the top cultivators went crazy. No one cared about Jian Wushuang’s strength and they all pressed down on him like a flood.","If the Young Emperor escaped, they would have no chance of surviving even if they went back to report. They could only survive if they killed him completely!","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. At that moment, the boundless Yan power poured down on him. The entire vast Tian City was turned into dust under the terrifying pressure.","He no longer hesitated and drew his sword. He combined the two moves — Star and River — of the Wushuang Sword Dao into one move, forming an indomitable Extinctive Sword Strike!","The crazy aura that rose from the sky and wanted to suppress the sky was rapidly rising, and then resolutely crashed into the enemy with great momentum!","There was a huge light flashing and the ground of Jingchuan Heaven Domain was cracking. The ground was covered with cracks like a deep abyss.","Every Heaven Domain in the Great Yan Domain was far stronger than any place in the Divine Power Universe!","In fact, there was no comparison between them. A place that could accommodate the Enlightenment and cultivation of Immortals was already the ultimate place in the world.","However, even such a Heavenly Domain began to collapse under the collision of the two.","The Young Emperor, who was being surrounded by Cheng Qing and the skinny purple-robed man, suddenly blushed when he felt the destructive power.","Then, he suddenly broke free from Chen Qing and the other man. He took a step in the air and stepped on the eight-armed Arhat’s waist. He borrowed the force and ran back quickly.","“Young Emperor!” Cheng Qing shouted, but it was too late to stop him. He could only watch the Young Emperor’s figure leave.","As for the skinny purple-robed man, he returned without any hesitation almost at the same time as the Young Emperor moved.","Cheng Qing gritted his teeth and then flew behind the fierce battle.","Chun Qiu, who was sitting on the shoulder of eight-armed Arhat, was also a little confused. To him, the Young Emperor’s death could be considered an end to his hatred and resentment, but he also thought of Jian Wushuang, who had covered the retreat by himself.","The eight-armed Arhat stopped and glared at him. Chun Qiu turned around and looked at the figure that was like a moth flying into the fire.","The next moment, he also flew back without any hesitation!","“Young Emperor? It’s better to die in my hands. I’m only going back to save Brother Jian!”","The Extinctive Sword Strike that had transcended the meaning of the Sword Dao of the past broke through the supreme power layer by layer, but it was immediately replaced by the more vigorous Yan power theory.","Jian Wushuang was holding on, and the Yan power in his body was flowing out crazily. He was already beyond his usual power!","Just as he was about to summon the three Emperors, a pair of pale hands pressed against the mighty force.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. It was the Young Emperor who could pass out at any time.","“Didn’t I tell you to leave?” Under such pressure, Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and said in a deep voice.","The Young Emperor smiled, and a stream of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth again. “I need you to return to the Six Heavens...”","“Dont, don’t forget, you still have a promise to help me ascend to the throne...”","“If you die, I’ll suffer... a great loss...” The Young Emperor had tried his best to release his Yan power, but it seemed to put a heavy burden on his divine body. He could not even open his eyes.","However, even so, the Young Emperor seemed to have something else to say. “Remember, return to the Six Heavens, you must be there.”"]},{"number":4713,"title":"Chapter 4713 Destroying Jingchuan","paragraphs":["4713 Destroying Jingchuan","Jian Wushuang was speechless. He had thought that he could call the three Emperors to end the battle when they left, but he did not expect that this Young Emperor would come back. This made Jian Wushuang’s firm state of mind loosen a little, but he felt helpless.","Looking at his exhausted appearance, just as he was considering whether to kick him away, another two or three powerful auras appeared.","Cheng Qing and the skinny purple-robed man caught the Young Emperor on both sides.","Chen Qing said awkwardly, “Brother, I’m sorry. We have to leave with the Young Emperor.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief and quickly said, “Leave quickly.”","Cheng Qing nodded and prepared to leave with the Young Emperor.","“No, I can’t leave.” The Young Emperor struggled.","Jian Wushuang said helplessly, “I’ll be there soon.”","“Really?”","“Of course.”","The Young Emperor nodded in satisfaction and passed out.","Then, Chun Qiu arrived and smiled. “Brother Jian, it’s time to fight side by side again.”","Jian Wushuang smiled in return and looked back at the Young Emperor and the others who had gone far away. He secretly heaved a sigh of relief and opened the lid of the Boyang Bottle with one hand. “Emperors, I need help.”","“Damn, Boy, you’re actually so calm. I’m in this bottle, and even I can’t hold it in anymore!” The True Shadow of a long-bearded old man appeared from the bottle.","Then, an old man with strange polycoria followed closely behind, and the tall and thin old man was the last.","Along with the three True Shadows wearing tattered Emperor clothes, the entire Jingchuan was on the verge of collapse.","Their appearance had almost instantly reversed the situation in Tian City.","The brows of the leading Yan Immortals twitched at the same time. The figures that came out of nowhere had strange ripples on their bodies.","“Why do these guys have a familiar aura?” the tall and thin old man said.","“Who cares who they are, let’s kill them all first!” the awe-inspiring old man shouted domineeringly and immediately flicked his sleeves. The supreme pressure pressed forward almost instantly.","The power that belonged to another level directly withstood the pressure of nearly 1,000 Ancestor-level experts, which made Jian Wushuang relax and free up his hands.","The three Emperors attacked at the same time, and the outcome was almost decided.","The force was easily broken, and the three Emperors charged forward with ferocious smiles. With every wave of their hands, a group of Ancestor-level cultivators was destroyed, and even the few Yan Immortals could not resist them.","If Jian Wushuang could barely keep these True Souls in check, then with the appearance of the three Emperors, he would be reassured.","Ever since taking these three Emperors away from the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, Jian Wushuang had felt that it was unreal. He had gotten the help of the three Supreme almighties in a muddled state, which had almost allowed him to have the most terrifying trump card in the Great Yan Domain.","Jian Wushuang could not imagine how powerful the True Soul could be to kill a top cultivator so easily.","Looking at the three Emperors who had been destroyed so easily, Chun Qiu, who had been waiting for death, opened his eyes wide. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled bitterly. “Brother Jian, when we went to the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, we were lucky that we didn’t use force. Otherwise, we would have been in trouble.”","Jian Wushuang agreed. If they had destroyed Yang Jun’s True Shadow, the tall and thin old man’s True Shadow, they would not be standing here in one piece.","At the same time, it could be seen that the Young Emperor sent them into the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes eyes to get rid of them through the hands of the three Emperors.","In this way, Jian Wushuang’s image of the Young Emperor became worse.","He was already planning to escape with Chun Qiu after eliminating the enemies in front of him.","No matter how powerful the Young Emperor was, could he possibly extend his hand to the entire Great Yan Domain?","After making up his mind, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate any longer. He activated his Yan power and his aura surged, turning into the sharpest long sword, piercing forward.","This extremely brutal battle eventually turned into a one-sided massacre with the arrival of the three Emperors.","With a miserable howl, the last Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source was crushed by the old man!","At this point, there were less than a hundred Ancestor-level experts left in the mighty army!","“Let, let us go...” The black-robed Ancestor-level expert in the lead retreated slowly, his eyes filled with despair.","Jian Wushuang looked at him coldly and clenched his fist in the air. The black-robed Ancestor clutched his neck in pain and struggled.","“Who sent you? Why are you trying to kill the Young Emperor?”","The two consecutive questions caused all the surviving black-robed Ancestors to reveal expressions of fear. If they were to reveal the truth, it would be no different from an immediate death sentence.","“Speak!” Jian Wushuang’s sharp brows furrowed and he increased the strength in his hand.","Feeling the horror of life and death that could not be any more real, the Ancestor-level expert in black robe was gasping for breath with difficulty. He no longer dared to hide anything. “I-I’m not sure either. It’s the P-Prince...”","Before he could finish his sentence, a strange black light burst out from his chest and burned his life source!","When the remaining black-robed Ancestors saw this, their faces were filled with horror as they scattered and fled in all directions!","Looking at the figures that were shooting in all directions, the dual-pupiled old man snorted coldly. The four pupils in his eyes started to spin in a strange manner.","In the next moment, the entire sky turned pitch black. Along with the darkness, countless strange eye rings that looked like the sun appeared!","All of the fleeing black-robed Ancestors felt as if they had entered a swamp, and the air around them began to stagnate.","Then, they subconsciously looked up at the sky and stared at the countless sun-like eyes.","It was as if something was being rapidly stripped away from their bodies, and at the same time, their long, almost endless lives began to flow backward...","Every top cultivator’s pupils turned from fear to listlessness, and finally to death. Then, they fell to the ground like pools of mud.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly. When the top cultivators died, streams of origin flowed into the chakra in the sky.","This kind of power should be the sacred technique of the elder with polycoria.","“You’ve killed again. It’s a sin, a sin. Old man Su He, come and reflect with me,” The tall and thin old man said with a serious expression as he pulled the dual-pupiled old man.","The dual-pupiled old man retracted his sacred technique and pouted in disdain. “Stop it. The two of you have killed Yan Immortals. I’m afraid even the Heavenly Court can’t handle them. How dare you call it the karma of killing?”","“Look, your killing intent is almost covering up your True Heart. It seems that I will have to guide you in the future.” The tall and thin old man pouted.","“That’s enough,” the awe-inspiring elder said and then looked at Jian Wushuang, “What’s your next plan?”"]},{"number":4714,"title":"Chapter 4714 Prince Jiu","paragraphs":["4714 Prince Jiu","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with uncertainty. Finally, he said slowly, “Destroy this Jingchuan completely before leaving.”","The three Emperors nodded without retorting.","Then, a terrifying scene played out.","With Jian Wushuang as the leader, they combined the power of the three Emperors and turned into an unimaginable supreme power that descended on the ground.","The river that had already cracked was completely destroyed!","The ravines that were as deep as the abyss extended to the depths of the earth’s core, radiating across the entire plane like a spider web.","In the end, this super Heaven Domain was shattered. Countless broken walls turned into giant rocks that floated in the void.","Many top cultivators who lived in the river had left.","Looking at the Heaven Domain that had been reduced to dust, Chun Qiu’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets. According to the legends, Jingchuan was the Daoist Rite of an Emperor, and it almost became the backup Heavenly Court!","Chun Qiu sighed in his heart and ignored the broken Heaven Domain that had no value anymore. He followed Jian Wushuang and was ready to leave.","The three Emperors reentered the Boyang Bowl as if they had never appeared.","“Brother Jian, from now on, we’re like birds flying in the sky and fish swimming in the ocean. Wherever you go, I, Chun Qiu, will follow you without a word!” Chun Qiu was a little excited. He had been a prisoner for countless years, and he desperately wanted freedom.","Jian Wushuang also smiled. Looking at the strange and unfamiliar Great Yan Domain, even he began to feel a sense of powerlessness.","In this Great Yan Domain that had transcended his knowledge, who knew that it would be an unknown road to find those two existences?","“Let’s take it one step at a time. I need to come up with a good idea,” Jian Wushuang said with a bitter smile.","Chun Qiu nodded. “If Brother Jian still doesn’t know what to do next, why don’t you come with me to my Imperial Father’s old Heavenly Court?”","Jian Wushuang neither nodded nor refused. He was thinking about his next step.","Unknowingly, the two of them had stepped out of the Jingchuan gate. However, what happened next made Jian Wushuang’s expression change slightly.","They saw three figures sitting on a huge rock in the void. They seemed to have been waiting for a long time. As soon as they saw them, they hurried over.","“Brother Jian, I thought you guys had also encountered such a huge commotion...” Cheng Qing stood up and waved from a distance.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was obviously not good. He did not expect that the Young Emperor and the others had not left but were waiting far away.","Chun Qiu frowned and asked in a low voice, “Brother Jian, how is it? do you want to fight your way out?”","Just as Jian Wushuang was hesitating, the Young Emperor slowly opened his eyes. He did not know whether he was confused or careless, but he took a step forward subconsciously and fell from the rock into the void.","Jian Wushuang quickly controlled the rippling force to pull his falling body to his side.","“I knew you wouldn’t die.” The Young Emperor said these last words while he was unconscious.","Jian Wushuang was helpless. Beside him, Chun Qiu’s eyes were cold, indicating that he should just kill him with one stroke.","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head. He did not have a good impression of the Young Emperor, but it did not escalate to the point where he would kill this guy.","Chen Qing and the skinny purple-robed man hurried over and took the Young Emperor from Jian Wushuang.","Then, the thin purple-robed man took out an item from his arms and threw it into the air, which expanded into a huge ship in the wind.","“Lord Jian, please board the ship.” He looked at Jian Wushuang and then nodded.","As he was too embarrassed to leave, Jian Wushuang had to board the pirate ship that led to the Six Heavens Realm again.","Because Jingchuan Heaven Domain had been completely destroyed, Chen Qing had no place to stay, so he had to go to the Six Heavens Realm with them.","Sitting at the bow of the ship, Jian Wushuang was stroking the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor he had obtained from the Tian City. The patterns on it were carved by some unknown tool, which looked strange and a little old.","“Xuan... Yi... Damn it, why can’t I see anything now? Is it a problem with the angle?” Jian Wushuang looked at the bone armor carefully. He had seen the words ‘Xuan Yi’ on the bone armor that day.","“Also, what did the stall-keeper take from my body? Divine ability, Ancestral Skill, or life force?”","Jian Wushuang looked at his palm with a frown and tried to find something different. However, just as he was concentrating, he was interrupted by a cold and deep voice.","“Prince Jiu, I know it’s you. I’ll kill you when I get back!”","Jian Wushuang looked back and saw that the voice came from the Young Emperor. However, it was probably sleep talk as he fell asleep again after the shout.","The thin purple robe was constantly transmitting Yan power, trying to make the Young Emperor feel more comfortable.","Chen Qing also walked toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not have much conflict with this tough and straightforward middle-aged man. After nodding to him, he prepared to continue studying the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in his hand.","“Brother Jian, there are not many who enter my eyes, but you are one of them,” Chen Qing sighed. “In Tian City, the Sword Intent that you released was something I felt inferior to.”","“You flatter me. If you use your heart to comprehend it, you will definitely reach that step,” Jian Wushuang said.","Chen Qing smiled bitterly, “I... I’m afraid that I can’t integrate my Sword Dao anymore. However, after I go to the Six Heavens Realm, I really hope to be able to fight with Brother Jian and see the gap between us.”","“You’re always welcome.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","A touch of joy appeared on Chen Qing’s face and he cupped his hands slightly to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have recalled something. He turned to look at Chen Qing and asked, “Who is the Prince Jiu that he was talking about?”","Hearing this, Chen Qing’s expression changed slightly. He turned to look at the Young Emperor and said, “It’s not a big secret. Everyone under Lord Young Emperor knows a thing or two.”","“The Prince Jiu that Young Emperor mentioned is actually his Second Brother.”","“Second Brother?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. Apparently, he was thinking about the second half of the Young Emperor’s words.","Chen Qing also realized what Jian Wushuang was thinking. He smiled bitterly, “But the two brothers are now almost mortal enemies.”","I had my suspicions about the assassination attempt at Tian City. Now that the Young Emperor has said it, it’s clear that it was most likely his second brother, Prince Jiu, who had instructed it.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows again. He clearly remembered the battle formation this time. There were more than 15 Yan Immortals and nearly 1,000 Ancestor-level experts. Such a terrifying move was definitely aimed at eliminating them completely. It was definitely not an ordinary battle between brothers."]},{"number":4715,"title":"Chapter 4715 The World Tree","paragraphs":["4715 The World Tree","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was also very curious. How did this so-called Prince Jiu possess such great power?","One must know that this was not a team that could be formed by just anyone who came to treat them to a meal. It was an army made up of 15 Yan Immortals and over 1,000 Ancestor-level experts.","To be able to pull out such a team, it seemed that they were determined to kill his brother.","It was no wonder that the Young Emperor had threatened to kill Prince Jiu in his sleep.","If it had not been for Jian Wushuang, he would have died in Jingchuan.","However, without Jian Wushuang, he might not have gone to Jingchuan, and all of this would not have happened.","“Are you so sure that it was his Second Brother’s doing?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","Chen Qing frowned and then shook his head slightly. “I can’t be sure, but it’s highly suspicious. After all, after the Young Emperor ascended to this position, the Seven Princes began to fight.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then asked in surprise, “Wait, Seven Princes?”","Chen Qing nodded. Emperor Yang Zhenwu had seven sons. They are Prince Yan, Jiu, Yu, Qian, Mo, Hua, and Lin.”","“The Young Emperor’s name is Prince Yan, and he’s the elder brother of the other six sons.”","Jian Wushuang listened to Chen Qing’s detailed explanation and nodded. He looked at the Young Emperor, who was still unconscious, leaning on the deck not far away. He could not help but sigh that he had been killed by his younger brother’s subordinates. It was indeed not easy to be a big brother.","He knew that there must be a reason for this, and at the same time, he recalled the conditions that he was forced to agree to in the bronze palace.","The first condition was to help him ascend to the throne, and within 70 years.","However, when he thought of the Princes who had experienced their terrifying means before they even met, Jian Wushuang felt an inexplicable headache.","“Why are they trying to kill the Young Emperor?” Although he knew that the Young Emperor was not a good person, Jian Wushuang still asked out of curiosity.","A bitter smile appeared on Cheng Qing’s face, “This, I’m afraid it’s not convenient to say. The things involved are more secretive and complicated.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Just as he was about to reply, the skinny purple-robed man walked over slowly. There was no joy or sorrow on his old face.","“There’s nothing I can’t tell you. You’ve saved the Young Emperor many times, so you should know some secrets,” the skinny purple-robed man said calmly.","“Prince Yan died when he was young and his foundation was destroyed. He could no longer cultivate, but his Imperial Father, Emperor Zhen Wuyang, doted on him. As he was the eldest son, he eventually let him sit on the position of the Young Emperor. However, the six sons that he had were all talented and powerful, so they naturally would not trust the Young Emperor.”","“Becoming a Young Emperor means that all the resources of the Heavenly Court will be given to you.”","“As a result, the inevitable conflict has continued to this day.”","After listening to the skinny purple-robed man’s brief description, Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart. It turned out that he was involved in such a chaotic matter. He did not know whether to be happy or sad.","At the same time, he was also keenly aware that the thin purple-robed man’s hesitant appearance meant that he was hiding something.","However, Jian Wushuang did not intend to continue asking. In his opinion, he did not have much to do with the Young Emperor and the others, so it was meaningless to pursue it too deeply.","After leaving the broken Jingchuan Heaven Domain, Jian Wushuang and the others did not return to the huge sea. Instead, they left in another direction.","After all, it would be a real problem if an existence even more terrifying than the vast Sea Sky Octopus appeared under the vast sea.","Under the control of the skinny purple-robed man, the huge ship flew through the vast void. It took twice the time to return to the Six Heavens Realm.","This made Jian Wushuang curse the Young Emperor in his heart.","The voyage had ended in less than ten years after he returned to the Six Heavens Realm. However, the bizarre twists and turns he had experienced had given Jian Wushuang a preliminary understanding of the Great Yan Domain.","Just a small part of the Heavenly Domain was already so terrifying. However, this was only a small part of the Great Yan Domain. He could not think of what he would encounter next. He could only take one step at a time.","After returning to the Six Heavens Realm, the skinny purple-robed man and Cheng Qing carried the Young Emperor back to the Big Lonely Heaven.","Although he had given the Small and Big Lonely Heavens to Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang had never been there even once.","A barrier as warm as water was opened and Jian Wushuang entered it with Chun Qiu.","As far as the eye could see, it was as if they had entered a primitive forest that had never been set foot in. The rich emerald green was the main color of the entire lonely sky.","All kinds of exotic flowers and plants bloomed on the ground, and the life-force in the wild forest, which was almost thousands of meters tall, was extremely dense.","However, this was not the most shocking part. In the middle of the Big Lonely Heaven, there was a huge tree that stood like a pillar.","The thick main branch had become much wider, and the dark green crown above its head was like a cloud hanging from the sky, almost covering the entire sky of the Big Lonely Heaven.","It was as if the entire ecosystem of the Big Lonely Heaven was like this giant tree.","The skinny purple-robed old man in the lead carried the Young Emperor, who was still unconscious, and jumped to the top of the giant tree.","“Brother Jian, please follow us.” Chen Qing slightly cupped his hands and then stomped his feet, his body flying forward.","Looking at the huge tree in front of him, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He stopped and flew forward.","As he stepped into the cloud layer, he felt a soft touch under his feet. Jian Wushuang looked around and then slowly walked forward.","At the crown of this huge tree, there was a rather elegant pavilion.","Chun Qiu did not want to enter, so he waited for Jian Wushuang outside the pavilion.","Walking into the warm room, he saw a bed made of an unknown material in the middle.","The Young Emperor’s face became much calmer after he was placed on the table, and the cold sweat on his temples stopped flowing.","If one looked closely, one would see countless strands of powerful life energy gathering in the air into the bed, then continuously nourishing and repairing his body.","Jian Wushuang guessed that this special bed should be closely related to the World Tree of the Big Lonely Heaven.","Chen Qing and the others were secretly relieved when they saw the Young Emperor’s expression gradually calm down.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang stopped for a while and then slowly left the warm pavilion.","Outside the warm room, Chun Qiu was alone, looking at the world in a daze. When he saw him coming out, he retracted his thoughts and forced a smile to greet him. “Brother Jian.”"]},{"number":4716,"title":"Chapter 4716 About the Realm","paragraphs":["4716 About the Realm","Jian Wushuang nodded. He could tell that Chun Qiu was in a bad mood, but he did not say anything and left the Great Lonely Heaven with him.","In Little Lonely Heaven, above the clouds, Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked, “You want to kill the Young Emperor for revenge?”","Chun Qiu was stunned for a moment, then he shook his head slightly and said, “Although he’s someone I want to kill on the spot, compared to others, I’d rather be the first to kill his Imperial Father with my own hands!”","Jian Wushuang knew that there must be a secret behind this. He had known long ago that Chun Qiu was not an ordinary top cultivator, but the son of an Emperor of the Heavenly Court.","“My Imperial Father, Emperor Fenghua, died at the hands of Zhen Wuyang. The entire Heavenly Court was destroyed along with him. In the end, I was the only one left, and I became a prisoner.”","The past was long gone, but it still wrapped around him like chains, causing him to sink into anger and hatred all the time.","Even though he wished he could kill Zhen Wuyang, he was not even qualified to see him. He did not even know where the Heavenly Court was.","Jian Wushuang did not comfort him. Instead, he placed his palm on Chun Qiu’s shoulder and patted it gently.","Chun Qiu looked at him gratefully and said slowly, “Brother Jian, if it wasn’t for your appearance, I’m afraid I would still be a prisoner in that black mountains. I’ll remember all the kindness you’ve shown me, and I’ll never forget it until I die.”","Jian Wushuang said, “Live well and keep improving your strength so that you can kill your enemies one day.”","Chun Qiu nodded. “Don’t worry, Brother Jian. I believe that day will come.”","“By the way,” he suddenly hesitated and said after a moment. “Brother Jian, if such a day really comes, will you help him?”","The ‘him’ that Chun Qiu was referring to was naturally the Young Emperor.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head without hesitation and said, “By then, I’m afraid I’ll have already left this place. What you’re worried about won’t happen. What you need the most now is to constantly improve your strength.”","Chun Qiu nodded and took out the palm-sized eight-armed pottery Arhat. He returned it to Jian Wushuang and said, “Brother Jian, I’ll return it to you. It can only display its strongest power in front of an expert.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and pushed the eight-armed Arhat back. “This thing is not of much use to me. I can give it to you for self-defense, but don’t rely on it too much.”","Chun Qiu did not decline and carefully put the eight-armed pottery Arhat back into his arms.","“Chun Qiu, the Emperor you’re talking about, is it the cultivation realm after Yan Immortal, or is it just a title?”","Jian Wushuang had never asked this question before. Now that he suddenly thought of it, he decided to ask.","Even though Chun Qiu had yet to become a Yan Immortal, he was still the son of an Emperor. Naturally, he would know more about the situation than Jian Wushuang.","When Chun Qiu heard this, he explained carefully, “Emperor is actually a form of respect. It’s not a cultivation realm, but it’s a true dividing line.”","“When I was young, I heard my Imperial Father’s admonishments. I vaguely knew that to become an Emperor, one must have fate energy, the Great Dao to build the Heavenly Court, and one’s own cultivation realm.”","“The most important step to becoming an Emperor is to enter that level. However...” Chun Qiu’s memory seemed to be a little blurry. “I seem to have forgotten what level it is.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He had long realized that the True Souls of the three Emperors that he had first come into contact with had all surpassed the level of Yan Immortal.","If one wanted to become an Emperor that could create a Heavenly Court, they would have to step out of the mysterious realm of the Yan Immortal.","As for what other realms there were, Jian Wushuang was at a loss. He could only move forward carefully and comprehend.","With the three Emperors’ True Shadows by his side, he could protect himself from any powerful force.","There was no sun in the sky of Little Lonely Heaven, but it was never dark. It was always a peaceful day, very similar to the scene of a mountain sky.","After a few days of casual discussion with Chun Qiu, Jian Wushuang began to cultivate.","He took out a few books on the way of the sword that he had bought in Jingchuan Sky City.","Looking at the ancient marks on the books, Jian Wushuang estimated that the age of these books was probably tens of thousands of years older than him.","There were a total of four books, and the ancient aura sealed on them had been severely exhausted. With a casual wave of his hand, the seal disappeared with the wind.","These four books were randomly selected from the hands of various Yan Immortals, and they were the oldest Sword Dao in the Great Yan Domain.","Three of them taught the foundation of sword principle, which was of great benefit to cultivators of the Sword Dao. From the residual aura of these isolated books, the writers had already reached the realm of the derived immortal when they created these sword principles.","Like a whale sucking in water, Jian Wushuang quickly absorbed the sword principle knowledge in the three books. Finally, he looked at the last book.","The two simple and sharp words ‘Collection of Swords’ seemed to have been casually written on the first page with a straw stick dipped in ink.","Jian Wushuang was a little puzzled. He seemed to have forgotten which stall he had bought this book from, and he had no impression of it.","Casting aside the distracting thoughts in his mind, he waved his hand and flipped to the first page.","What he saw was a blank space.","Not a single word appeared on the yellow paper that was suffused with dark green.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. “No way. Did I meet a scammer?”","He did not believe it and hurriedly turned it over and over to check.","In the end, he came to the conclusion that he had been cheated by a profiteer.","This was a wordless heavenly book.","Jian Wushuang did not know whether to laugh or cry. After checking it again with Yan power and confirming that it was of no value, he was ready to throw it away.","However, the next moment, a warm and cool aura flashed in his hand. If one did not pay attention, it would be impossible to notice.","He subconsciously looked at the ‘Collection of Swords’ in his hand. An extremely dense Immortal Qi, like clouds and smoke, rotated on the lone book for a moment and then fell into the book in an instant.","As if he had realized something, Jian Wushuang hurriedly opened the wordless heavenly book in his hand.","On the withered yellow paper that was suffused with dark green, the Immortal Qi was dense to the extreme. It was like a terrifying dragon the size of a finger, circling the paper.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were wide open. He could not figure out where the aura, which was both familiar and strange, came from.","Soon, the cloud-like aura suddenly condensed and instantly transformed into a figure the size of a fingernail.","He completely held his breath. The scene before his eyes seemed a little mysterious.","That thumb-sized figure was extremely small, but the White robe he wore made him look like an Immortal, with the air of a Grandmaster.","Although the figure had no facial features, the aura it gave off was very familiar to Jian Wushuang. It felt like he was an old friend."]},{"number":4717,"title":"Chapter 4717 The Sword Integration Is Refined","paragraphs":["4717 The Sword Integration Is Refined","Jian Wushuang did not dare to speak at all. He held his breath with all his might, afraid that he would blow away the little person with one breath.","Standing on the yellow pages, the little person’s white clothes fluttered in the wind, and then he moved.","He rose up with the wind, and another wisp of cloud and smoke condensed into a real sword in his hand.","The aura changed, and the page seemed to have turned into a martial arts field. The tiny man was in the center, freely practicing his moves, stirring up the wind and clouds around him.","In Jian Wushuang’s eyes, every move of the tiny person was like a sword move that had been broken down and was being performed very slowly.","The more he looked at it, the more shocked he became. He actually felt a sharpness that could not be ignored from this sword technique, and it was terrifying.","But soon, Jian Wushuang was immersed in it and began to fight with the small person through his divine sense.","The two vastly different sword principles collided in such an unbelievable way. If Chun Qiu was beside Jian Wushuang, he would definitely be able to see this strange yet comical scene.","Jian Wushuang tightly furrowed his brows as he held a book with an open page. It was as if he was on a boat. His body swayed left and right, and from time to time, he would flip over greatly. It was extremely funny.","This scene ended with the little cloud smoke person standing on the page of the book, standing straight and upright, and a simple sword strike.","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes and a drop of sweat flowed out of his temple. He then hurriedly looked at the page.","The little person standing on the page seemed to have completed its task. His tiny body dissipated and turned back into clouds and smoke, landing on the page.","Then, an even more mysterious scene appeared. On the page of the wordless heavenly book, tiny words the size of a fly were outlined by the clouds and smoke!","“This, how is this possible...” Jian Wushuang was shocked beyond words.","After the divine exchange, he was already very clear that this small cloud smoke person was Ding Baiyi, who had exchanged Sword Dao forms with him for 100,000 years in the divine power universe!","However, why would his Sword Dao villain appear here?","There was no answer. The last word meant that Ding Baiyi’s Sword Dao had finally been completely integrated into the book!","A total of five pages filled with the analysis of Sword Dao were rustling in the wind.","Swallowing his dry throat, Jian Wushuang focused his eyes on the page.","With just a glance, his heart could not help but tremble.","The Sword Dao written on the page was the full Sword Intent of the first move of the Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi’s Invincible Sword!","“It’s too heaven-defying... This book can’t be a spirit, right...”","After immersing himself in it for nearly a day, Jian Wushuang sighed with emotion. The ‘Collection of Swords’ completely analyzed Ding Baiyi’s Extinctive Sword Strike.","Not even Ding Baiyi’s personal description would have been as detailed as this.","Jian Wushuang was confused. He could not understand how Ding Baiyi’s sword principle was recorded in such a wordless heavenly book.","A total of five pages, all describing that Extinctive Sword Strike, from this one could see how detailed it was.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had a strong ability to accept things. Since he could not figure it out, he might as well put it to the back of his mind.","After a short hesitation, Jian Wushuang eagerly practiced according to the analysis in the book.","The more he studied, the more shocked Jian Wushuang was. The strange collection of swords that had appeared out of nowhere almost tore ding Baiyi’s underwear out ...","However, there was only one move from ding Baiyi on it, and everything else after that was blank.","“What’s the origin of this wordless heavenly book? Could it be that it can copy everyone’s Sword Dao?” Jian Wushuang closed the Collection of Swords and flipped through it again.","Then, he subconsciously injected a part of his Sword Intent into it.","The mysterious scene happened again. The ever-changing cloud and smoke formed by Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent finally condensed into a pocket-sized Jian Wushuang. He stood on the page and began to practice sword principle.","The Wushuang Sword Dao and Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, which had already constructed a complete framework, poured onto the page like a great river and sea.","This time, the entire ten pages were filled with tiny words, five pages for the Star sword technique and five pages for the River sword technique.","Jian Wushuang was dumbfounded. He hurriedly checked it carefully and his face turned pale.","The Sword Intent that was engraved on the page described the essence of the two Sword Intents in detail, as if it was a copy of all the thoughts in Jian Wushuang’s divine sense.","“It’s too terrifying. What is this?!” Jian Wushuang suppressed the shock in his heart and started to investigate carefully.","At this moment, Chun Qiu’s strange voice sounded.","“Brother Jian, what’s wrong? You’re holding a wordless book and is both happy and surprised...”","Jian Wushuang suddenly lifted his head and looked at Chun Qiu, who seemed to have stayed there for a long time and was still in a daze.","“Did you say wordless book?”","Chun Qiu nodded and then pointed at the book in Jian Wushuang’s hand, “This is a wordless book. It’s blank.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the open book. The book was filled with dense records of sword principle, but in Chun Qiu’s view, there were no words.","“Are you sure this book is wordless?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Chun Qiu looked down at him and said, “It’s indeed wordless. What’s wrong, Brother Jian? Did you receive some kind of shock?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and seemed to have made up his mind.","This Collection of Swords seemed to contain all kinds of terrifying skills that could be copied into it, and it seemed that only the user could see them.","In other words, with this Collection of Swords, wouldn’t he be able to copy other people’s sword principles without any worries?","Suppressing the restlessness in his heart, Jian Wushuang was about to reply to the Chun Qiu when a clear voice came from the enchantment of Little Lonely Heaven.","“Brother Jian, I, Chen Qing, have come to pay you a visit.”","Chen Qing, who had changed into a white robe, appeared in the fluctuations and ripples. He had a vast Immortal aura.","Jian Wushuang also stood up, cupped his hands, and smiled. “I welcome you.”","Chen Qing laughed heartily again. He quickly stepped on the air and landed in front of Jian Wushuang. “It’s been ten days since we last met. Brother Jian, you’re still as mighty as ever.”","“Brother Chen, you’re too kind. I’ve been lacking in practice recently,” Jian Wushuang replied with a bitter smile.","Although Jian Wushuang did not dislike Chen Qing, he subconsciously kept a distance from him.","However, Chen Qing did not seem to sense Jian Wushuang’s distancing. He smiled and said, “It just so happens that the Young Emperor’s condition has stabilized. I have nothing to do, so I came to Little Lonely Heaven to catch up with Brother Jian.”","“Speaking of which, this Little Lonely Heaven is really not bad. It’s full of derivation power and the aura of life is far beyond ordinary realms. Brother Jian, you will definitely benefit greatly from cultivating here.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, “It’s not bad. I’m only staying here temporarily, so I don’t know much about the mystery.”"]},{"number":4718,"title":"Chapter 4718 Exchanging Pointers","paragraphs":["4718 Exchanging Pointers","Cheng Qing smiled and said, “With brother Jian’s ability, it’s not difficult to get Little Lonely Heaven from the Young Emperor.”","Jian Wushuang also smiled. Chen Qing still did not know that the Young Emperor had given him both the Little and Big Lonely Heavens. Since he did not know, he did not answer.","This was not something to be proud of. On the contrary, it was a way to restrain Jian Wushuang.","Cheng Qing did not mind his silence. He raised his eyebrows and smiled, “Brother Jian, since we have nothing to do today, why don’t we have a spar?”","Jian Wushuang wanted to refuse, but he seemed to realize something and nodded. “As you wish.”","“Alright!” Cheng Qing replied, “Then, Brother Jian, let’s begin.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Chen Qing quickly retreated a thousand feet. His peak Yan power shot up into the sky, like a dragon in the sky, wantonly showing off.","Chun Qiu’s expression changed slightly. He hurried forward and said in a low voice, “Brother Jian, I can feel that this is not the limit of this Chen guy’s Yan power. We can’t treat him with a normal attitude.”","“Don’t worry. We’re just sparring on the way of the sword. It’s not a life-and-death battle,” Jian Wushuang replied.","Chun Qiu nodded and quickly left the battle.","Within a radius of 1,0000 feet, the green grass was slightly hunched.","A True Sword with an emerald green touch quietly appeared in Cheng Qing’s hand, causing his entire aura to change. It was like a treasure sword that was hiding its sharp edge, waiting to be activated.","Jian Wushuang also pulled out the broken Tarot Divine Sword from his waist and looked forward calmly.","The Tarot Divine Sword, which had been broken in the middle of the sword, not only did not show any signs of decline, it even let out a few excited cries.","Cheng Qing’s eyes focused slightly. He then reminded in a clear voice, “Brother Jian, let’s only talk about the Sword Dao.”","“Come on,” Jian Wushuang replied in a deep voice as he gripped the hilt of his sword. How could he not know that Chen Qing was taking care of him?","If he were to completely release his realm, this Chen Qing would definitely not be inferior to the Patriarch of the Whirling Heaven. He might even be superior.","He did not say anything else, but a cold killing intent rose up. The entire area within a thousand feet was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","In the next moment, Chen Qing took the lead. His whole body was like an unstoppable arrow, carrying a great power, and he went straight to Jian Wushuang.","The space exploded and cracked rapidly. The ordinary stab was so fast that even Chun Qiu, who was watching from afar, could not react in time. It went straight for Jian Wushuang’s chest.","If this attack hit him, even if he did not die, he would definitely be seriously injured!","However, Jian Wushuang was faster than him. As soon as the attack was about to hit him, his broken sword blocked his heart.","Clang!","The two swords clashed, and a series of trembling sounds erupted.","Chen Qing, who was flying through the air, felt as if the tip of the True Sword in his hand had encountered a tall mountain and could not advance an inch further.","Jian Wushuang also felt an unparalleled force that made him take half a step back.","Seeing that his attack had missed, Cheng Qing laughed and immediately retreated a thousand feet with his sword.","This short test allowed the two to have some ideas in their hearts.","“Brother Jian, watch my Sword Dao!”","A proud voice resounded. In the next moment, a strong wind rose within a thousand feet. Jian Wushuang felt an inexplicable sense of danger.","The color of the sky changed slightly, and the earth quietly cracked. Cheng Qing held the hilt of the sword with both hands, and Sword Intent seemed to be floating in his eyes.","Countless wisps of light green Sword Intent emerged from his body and then all gathered in the sky above his head, condensing into True Swords.","Jian Wushuang was very familiar with such a sword curtain. It was a kind of Sword Intent manifestation, which was simple and easy to learn. It was suitable for group fighting.","However, in a situation where his swordsmanship was equal or even higher than his own, using this move was equivalent to seeking death and falling into a disadvantageous position.","Jian Wushuang did not understand Chen Qing’s intention, but when he looked above his head again, his eyes narrowed.","In the center of their heads, a giant sword that seemed to carry the power of millions of mountains descended.","It turned out that the sword curtain that was rising up was just a smokescreen. The real sword move was the sword that was hidden within the screen!","Jian Wushuang’s mouth slowly curved into a smile as the sword mountain came down.","Rumble!!!","The ground of the entire Little Lonely Heaven trembled violently. The sword mountain, which was hundreds of thousands of feet high, fell to the ground without any resistance. Jian Wushuang’s body was also pressed under the sword mountain.","Everything within a 10,000 feet radius collapsed!","When Chun Qiu saw this scene, his heart almost jumped out of his throat, and then he ran forward with all his might.","In the sky, Chen Qing’s heart trembled. Based on Jian Wushuang’s performance in Jingchuan’s Tian City, it was impossible that he could not withstand his first move!","But soon, he seemed to realize something. He patted his head and said anxiously, “I’m confused! Brother Jian, I’m coming to save you!”","Chen Qing recalled that Jian Wushuang had just fought a fierce battle at Jingchuan dozens of days ago and destroyed Jingchuan with his own power. He definitely could not recover in such a short time, so it was normal that he could not withstand his sword.","“Please don’t get seriously injured. Otherwise, the Young Emperor will not let me go,” he recalled nervously in his heart. Just as Cheng Qing was about to reach the sword mountain, an extremely pure Sword Intent soared into the sky.","The entire sword mountain shone with billions of the most brilliant light beams.","The explosion resounded!","Cheng Qing was shocked and immediately retreated. He then looked at the rapidly collapsing peak of the sword mountain.","On the highest peak, a figure dressed in a black Ranger’s attire was sitting on top, looking down at the sky with a smile.","The broken Tarot Divine Sword in his hand could not help but tremble, as if it could not hold back.","In the next moment, as the entire sword mountain collapsed, Jian Wushuang floated down. He held the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed down casually.","It was as if the river of stars had fallen from the Nine Heavens, and the entire sky exploded under this heavy pressure!","It seemed to be endless, but it also seemed to be a casual slash. It expanded tens of thousands of miles across the sky, as if the might of the heavens had descended!","Cheng Qing, who was standing on the ground, raised his head and looked at this scene. His right hand, which was holding the true sword, was trembling slightly.","The majestic and vast sword move was the sword move that he desired the most. It was also the sword that move he found the most unbelievable.","It turned out that other than that person, there was another man who could cultivate the way of the sword to such a terrifying and unprecedented level!","Cheng Qing’s eyes flashed with a touch of excitement. His realm, which had been suppressed, had unconsciously climbed back to the peak.","He had already made up his mind to use his peak state to collide with that sword move and comprehend it to make up for his own Sword Dao!","His terrifying peak strength caused Chen Qing’s aura to rise to an impossible level. It seemed that even the Whirling Patriarch, who was about to break through to the Yan Immortal realm, could no longer be compared to Chen Qing.","The True Sword in his hand gave off a red light and pointed at the sky!","The world was flourishing!"]},{"number":4719,"title":"Chapter 4719 The Glory of the Three Swords Moves","paragraphs":["4719 The Glory of the Three Swords Moves","Chun Qiu, who was in the middle of running, felt as if he had been punched in the head, and his entire body flew out.","As he was sent flying, the earth-shattering power exploded.","As if an ancient bell had been rung, the extremely bright light also lit up.","Chun Qiu was shocked, but he realized that he could not escape from the terrifying shock wave with his own cultivation realm.","At this moment, he felt a gust of wind behind him. It was as if a large palm had firmly supported his body.","Chun Qiu subconsciously looked behind him and saw the Young Emperor, who was still pale and dressed in luxurious clothes, and the purple-robed figure, who had not changed for 10,000 years, standing behind him.","The three of them were enveloped by the immense Yan power, which turned into a barrier to block the terrifying explosion.","“My companion, guess who will win and lose,” the Young Emperor’s expression did not change as he looked forward and said slowly.","The skinny purple-robed man raised his head, his pair of unclear eyes looking towards the center of the explosion. “Cheng Qing has already lost.”","During this simple conversation, the explosion slowly dissipated, and a huge pit of a thousand miles appeared.","On the two sides of the pit, there were two figures.","Jian Wushuang’s face was calm. Only the hem of his black robe seemed to be stained with dust. The Tarot Divine Sword in his hand was trembling.","On the other side, although Cheng Qing’s figure was a bit miserable, the excitement and warlike light in his eyes was getting stronger.","He knew very well that if he had not released his cultivation realm, he would not have been able to withstand Jian Wushuang’s attack with his first move of Sword Intent.","But so what? Today, he was going to try out all of Jian Wushuang’s sword principles and learn them for his own use.","After all, it was almost impossible to meet another person like that ancient Sword Immortal.","A sharp aura surged once again. If Chen Qing’s first sword attack was still in a state of hiding his edge, then now, his edge was fully revealed!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang said two words from afar, “Second Sword.”","Cheng Qing’s eyes focused and a Sword Intent that far exceeded the previous one floated around his body. At the same time, a light wheel that was like the sun appeared behind him!","This time, Cheng Qing was still the first to attack.","A great power rose in an instant. In the light wheel, there were actually tens of thousands of light swords!","As the light wheel spun, the light swords with scarlet-golden patterns smashed toward Jian Wushuang like huge waves.","Jian Wushuang was speechless. He did not understand. Although Chen Qing’s sword principle was not very strong, he should be an existence that could stand proudly in a region.","But now, although the Sword Intent he released was powerful, it was too broad and lacked exquisiteness. As a result, Jian Wushuang could see its weakness at a glance.","The Sword Dao that Chen Qing cultivated was broad, but it was slightly weak in general.","Jian Wushuang floated forward with the Invisible Sword on his back. He faced the wall that was almost made of sword edges and stabbed out.","This was Ding Baiyi’s Extinctive Sword Strike, a sword that abandoned everything, including his own body.","A white light that could not be more subtle flickered, and the seemingly powerless tip of the sword touched the water like a fish in water.","A layer of ripples appeared.","This sword was a mix of 100,000 sword strikes. It pressed forward with indomitable will, a sword strike that was about to kill!","As the ripples rose, the swords were shattered and the light was destroyed.","Chen Qing, who was carrying the light wheel on his back, trembled slightly when the Sword Intent was destroyed.","He seemed to smell a familiar aura, and the memory that was so long ago that it was about to be erased quietly came back to his mind.","The Young Emperor and the skinny purple-robed man beside him could not hide the surprise in their eyes.","As a result, when Jian Wushuang’s sword strike cut off a strand of Chen Qing’s hair, he came back to his senses.","“You are very strong. I have already lost in the Dao of the sword.” A trace of bitterness appeared on Cheng Qing’s face. In the two Sword Intents that he had exchanged in a row, he had lost completely.","Jian Wushuang did not put away the long sword in his hand. Instead, he looked at Chen Qing and smiled. He did not care about Chen Qing’s unfair actions.","“Brother Chen, let’s spar without a winner or loser. We’ll only talk about Sword Dao. If I’m not wrong, you should still have one more sword move.”","Hearing this, Chen Qing’s eyes brightened, but then dimmed again, “Brother Jian, you are right. However, this sword move of mine is still only a framework. It has not been connected.”","“If the way of the sword is not put into practice, then it is just a framework. We must put it to practice,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice. Then, he shook his wrist and the Invisible Longsword made a trembling sound.","Cheng Qing’s eyes were burning, and his desire to battle rose again.","“Then I’ll be embarrassing myself!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the True Sword in his hand trembled. The earth trembled and a chasm appeared. Ten dark blue Sword Intents that were like giant pillars that reached the sky tore the ground apart and rose like dragons.","Chen Qing stood in place, the True Sword in his hand pointing to the sky. The ten grand rays of light dyed everything with a layer of dark blue.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and looked forward calmly. Then, he threw the Invisible Sword into the air.","In the next moment, ten dark blue pillars of Sword Intent wrapped around each other and crushed down.","At the same time, the Invisible Sword that had been thrown into the air quietly disintegrated, turning into hundreds of millions of wisps of Sword Intent.","Jian Wushuang put his hands behind his back and the hundreds of millions of Sword Intents gathered under his body like the galaxy in the sky.","The Young Emperor, who was watching from afar, squinted his eyes and seemed to have a faint smile on his lips.","After seeing Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent, which was even stronger than the previous one, Chen Qing’s extremely nervous eyes were replaced with bitterness.","This was only the framework of the Sword Intent, and it seemed that it would disappear before it was even created.","Jian Wushuang stepped on the Heavenly River Sword Intent, his eyes extremely calm.","As the two of them were about to collide, everything seemed to have stopped for a moment.","There was no earth-shaking sound, only the sound of a clear spring.","Cheng Qing was stunned.","The Sword Intent that belonged to Jian Wushuang disappeared. It disappeared the moment it was about to collide.","The magnificent dark blue Sword Intent exploded in the sky without any resistance.","Everyone subconsciously covered their eyes with their hands for a moment, and then focused on the scene in front of them.","Jian Wushuang had appeared on the ground at some point in time. He pressed his right hand on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword at his waist and nodded slightly at Chen Qing.","Everyone could clearly see that in this last confrontation, Jian Wushuang had dispersed the Heavenly River Sword Intent on his own and did not contend with it.","This meant that he had fulfilled Cheng Qing’s Sword Dao.","Chen Qing came back to his senses and solemnly cupped his hands at Jian Wushuang, “Thank you, Brother Jian.”","He knew very well that if Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent had landed, his sword move would have had no chance of winning."]},{"number":4720,"title":"Chapter 4720 With the Emperor as a Guarantor, Everything Is in Sight","paragraphs":["4720 With the Emperor as a Guarantor, Everything Is in Sight","Not only would he have no chance of winning, but his Sword Dao would also be unable to recover from this. It would completely stop at this framework and be stunted from growing.","Jian Wushuang dispersed his sure-win sword move and fulfilled Chen Qing’s Sword Heart.","Chen Qing’s swordsmanship was not amazing, but it was magnificent and had the intention of transcendence. Jian Wushuang could not bear to destroy it, so he stopped.","However, the power of the three sword moves left an indelible mark in Chen Qing’s heart.","At that moment, a lazy clapping sound came from afar. Jian Wushuang looked over and realized it was the Young Emperor and the others.","As he descended from the sky, Chun Qiu was the first to rush over. He gave him a thumbs up and said, “Brother Jian, you’re amazing.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and then looked at the Young Emperor.","“Thank you, Brother Jian, for letting me witness such a brilliant sword sparring.” The Young Emperor smiled. “I, Prince Yan, am impressed.”","“Is there something the matter?” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The Young Emperor said, “It’s not really a matter. I just wanted to catch up with you.”","Chen Qing scratched his head. “Young Emperor, I’m really sorry to have messed up your Little Lonely Heaven like this.”","“Little Lonely Heaven is no longer mine, and even Big Lonely Heaven has been handed over to Brother Jian. You should ask him if he blames you,” the Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and said.","Cheng Qing immediately understood. “Brother Jian, this Little Lonely Heaven is already yours?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “It’s just a temporary residence. It’s not what I own. When the time comes, I’ll return it.”","Cheng Qing was also an understanding person. In order to not make the atmosphere too awkward, he hurriedly yawned and said, “Brother Jian, just based on the sword sparring just now, I prostrated myself in admiration. You are definitely the number one Sword Dao I’ve seen other than that old friend from back then.”","“Brother Chen, you’re too kind. I just have some insights, but there’s still a long way to go before I can truly comprehend the way of the sword,” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","Cheng Qing sighed, “That’s right, I had planned to focus on cultivating the way of the sword, but my talent was lacking. The way of the sword may seem simple, but I have not been able to understand it until now. In my opinion, such an illusory thing is far more difficult than cultivation.”","Jian Wushuang did not answer. His comprehension of sword principle never seemed to stop at a certain moment. Naturally, he could not resonate with it.","The atmosphere was delicate. If it were not for Chen Qing’s chatter, Jian Wushuang would have left on the spot.","“Cheng Qing, I’ll take you for a walk in the Big Lonely Heaven.” The skinny purple-robed man who had been silent all this time suddenly spoke.","Cheng Qing, who was speaking excitedly, waved his hand. “What’s there to see in the Big Lonely Heaven? I’ve already gone through it more than ten times.”","Then, he realized that something was amiss. He suddenly stopped talking and said with a serious expression, “Yes, I haven’t seen the Big Lonely Heaven yet. It’s indeed time to go and take a look. Take care, Brother Jian!”","After cupping his hands, Cheng Qing left Little Lonely Heaven with the skinny purple-robed man.","There were only three people left in Little Lonely Heaven.","“Chun Qiu, go and sit down.” Jian Wushuang looked at Chun Qiu and said.","Hearing this, Chun Qiu nodded and whispered a word of caution before leaving.","“Let’s go for a walk. This is the first time we’ve met since we came back from Jingchuan,” The Young Emperor said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and the two of them walked forward slowly.","In mid-air, he could feel the dense Yan power surging around him, and his tensed nerves relaxed.","“Jingchuan has been destroyed, and my power has weakened a little. You should know some of these things, such as who sent those guys who tried to kill me,” the Young Emperor said faintly.","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “When I was on my way back, your companion told me about it, so I have a rough idea of it.”","The Young Emperor nodded. “Then you should prepare. There are still five years left. I want you to go to the banquet with me.”","“Attend a banquet?”","His eyes suddenly turned cold. “Yes, my Imperial Father invited me to a banquet in the Heavenly Court. Those bastards will also be there.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He wanted to see what kind of existences the so-called Heavenly Court and Emperor in the Great Yan Domain belonged to.","“Are you planning to kill them at the banquet?” Jian Wushuang asked.","The Young Emperor sneered, “Them? They’re just a bunch of conceited trash. Let them go for now. I have more to do.”","“Five years. I’ll come and find you when the time comes. You can also go to the Big Lonely Heaven to cultivate.”","“I’m right here.”","The Young Emperor’s eyes were burning as he said seriously, “Without you, I’ll never be able to recover. So, no matter what, please stand with me.”","Jian Wushuang felt an inexplicable uneasiness. “I won’t go back on my word.”","After hearing the answer, the Young Emperor left with a laugh and left a few words.","“With Your Majesty as a guarantor, everything is in sight.”","At this point, the entire Little Lonely Heaven was completely silent.","Watching the Young Emperor’s figure disappear outside the magic barrier, Chun Qiu quickly came to Jian Wushuang and said, “Is this guy up to something again?”","Jian Wushuang did not hide anything and told him about his plan to attend a banquet in the Heavenly Court five years later.","“I knew this guy’s character,” Chun Qiu said anxiously. “He has so many brothers who don’t get along with him. When the time comes, blood will be shed. Brother Jian, are you really going to get involved?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Let’s take it one step at a time. It’s not too late to leave after I figure out the situation here.”","“In any case, be careful. He’s far more sinister than he looks. He’s definitely not a good person,” Chun Qiu said with a serious expression. “Back then, he was only at the Entry Yan realm, but he was already so bloodthirsty. He couldn’t escape the destruction of my Imperial Father’s Heavenly Court.”","“If his six brothers are really evil, then he is not any better.”","Jian Wushuang nodded as he listened to Chun Qiu’s warning. He had his own judgment.","Judging from the number of prisoners who were trapped in the Lower Three Heavens, the Young Emperor was not a good person.","What Jian Wushuang could do now was to protect himself to the greatest extent and then slowly explore.","After discussing with Chun Qiu for half a day, the two of them stepped into the hall of Little Lonely Heaven.","Little Lonely Heaven was not vast, but it was several times larger than a Star Field in the Divine Power Universe.","At the same time, apart from a few rare beasts in the forest, very few people set foot there.","In the center of Little Lonely Heaven, there was a grand palace.","He stepped into the quiet hall, sized it up, and sat down in meditation.","The wind blew gently as Jian Wushuang sat on the square outside the hall, breathing in and out.","There were 18 bronze pillars on the left and right of the square, which were covered with solemn bronze patterns. It was vaguely similar to the Cloud Palace of the past."]},{"number":4721,"title":"Chapter 4721 The Eve of the Banquet","paragraphs":["4721 The Eve of the Banquet","Jian Wushuang looked around again before he finally entered meditation.","After breaking away from the past clay idol from the Divine Power Univers, he had jumped from Ancestor level to Yan Immortal.","With his strength in the Yan Immortal stage, he had not encountered a life-and-death situation for the time being in the Great Yan Domain.","Even the giant Sea Sky Octopus and the Patriarch of the Whirling Heaven did not give him a real fear of death.","Jian Wushuang vaguely guessed that only by leaving the Yan Immortal realm could he really take that step.","Not long after he sat in meditation, he seemed to realize something and reached out to take out the wordless heavenly book from his arms.","Jian Wushuang turned to the first 15 pages, which were full of tiny words. His eyes stopped on the 16th page, but there was nothing else on it except for the blank space.","“That shouldn’t be the case. Wasn’t I just having a sword duel with Cheng Qing? Why is there no indication of this in the book?”","With some suspicion, Jian Wushuang tried to transfer a wisp of the battle memory in his divine sense.","The wisp of consciousness quickly sank into the page.","Jian Wushuang was not disappointed. The wisp of spiritual awareness started to write directly. Neat, tiny words appeared on the blank page one by one.","And this time, the writing speed was extremely fast. In almost ten breaths, he had finished writing everything.","The number of pages had also changed from the original several to a thin page.","“It can’t be, right? Cheng Qing’s Sword Dao actually took so little little space of writing?” Jian Wushuang could not believe it. He quickly flipped through it and after confirming that there was only one page, he did not know whether to laugh or cry.","But immediately after, an even more mysterious scene appeared. That originally only one page of Cheng Qing’s sword technique actually disappeared line by line!","It was as if there was a pair of big hands in the dark, wiping away everything.","“No, no way. What is this?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “Could it be that the Collection of Swords looked down on Chen Qing’s sword principle and erased it?”","Without an answer, Jian Wushuang could only watch as Chen Qing’s sword principle disappeared completely.","“What an extremely strange Collection of Swords.” He looked at the one and only copy in his hand, and at the same time, he thought that if he met someone like Ding Baiyi again in the future, wouldn’t he be able to copy it and steal his mastery?","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. The Collection of Swords was a heaven-defying treasure. The senior who had created it must have been an interesting guy.","After keeping the Collection of Swords, Jian Wushuang took a seat.","To him, five years was not even as long as the time he had spent fishing in the heavenly Cloud Palace.","He strived to adjust his Yan power and realm to their peak state in these five years so that he could deal with everything that would happen next.","The Boyang Bottle was also opened, and the three Emperors only wandered around Little Lonely Heaven once before returning to the bottle to sleep.","Everything went smoothly. Jian Wushuang did not know what was waiting for him, so he was forced to accept it.","Often, under the seemingly calm water, there would be undercurrents.","Five years had passed in a flash.","When the brilliant flowing light transformed by Yan power surged out from the tip of Jian Wushuang’s hair again, the boundary of Little Lonely Heaven was opened.","The Young Emperor took off his luxurious clothes and changed into the court clothes that symbolized the Prince.","On this dark gold court dress, every stroke of the threaded needle depicted mountains, rivers, lakes, and seas, symbolizing nature’s meaning.","On his collar, two small, symmetrical beasts with thin ears were embedded with dark gold threads.","This court dress made the Young Emperor lose some of his feminine charm and look more heroic and majestic, but the paleness of his face could not be hidden.","Behind him, there were nearly a thousand figures.","“Young Emperor, I’ll go and invite Brother Jian over,” Chen Qing cupped his hands and said. Then, just as he was about to move, he was suddenly called out.","“You guys wait here. I’ll go there.” After leaving these words, the Young Emperor went to the depths of Little Lonely Heaven alone.","Cheng Qing’s eyes were filled with envy. “Brother Jian is truly amazing. I, Cheng Qing, have followed the Young Emperor for so many years, but I have never seen anyone receive such treatment.”","The thin purple-robed man looked up at the Young Emperor’s figure and lowered his eyes again.","As if he had sensed something, Jian Wushuang, who was sitting in meditation, slowly opened his eyes and saw a figure floating over.","“Brother Jian, Prince Yan is here to see you.” The Young Emperor smiled and landed on the square.","After exhaling a mouthful of turbid breath, Jian Wushuang stood up and nodded.","The Young Emperor sized up Jian Wushuang and asked with interest, “How’s your recovery? ”","“Not bad, when do we leave?”","“It’s all ready, we’re just waiting for you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. At this moment, Chun Qiu also walked out of the hall and stood behind him.","Just as he was about to leave, the Young Emperor suddenly stopped him and gave him a set of clothes.","“Change into it. The embroiderers in the Great Si Region made it for you. It’s not bad.”","Jian Wushuang felt helpless but he could not lose his temper. He had to quickly rush into the hall and change his clothes.","After a while, Jian Wushuang appeared in a long robe with silver silk embroidery.","Although the clothes made him look extraordinarily handsome, it also made him feel a little uncomfortable when he wielded his sword. It was far less comfortable than the black-robed Ranger’s clothes.","The Young Emperor’s eyes were filled with satisfaction, and he turned around to lead the way.","“Brother Jian, I didn’t expect you to look so similar to the Emperor.” Chun Qiu sized up Jian Wushuang and there was a flash of envy in his eyes.","“Don’t talk nonsense. This outfit doesn’t suit me.” Jian Wushuang laughed bitterly, loosened his belt, and stepped forward.","Chun Qiu scratched his head. “It does look a little similar to my Imperial Father’s figure in the past. It’s really strange.”","He would never have thought that this quiet young man who seemed to have endless stories was once a Cosmos God.","A total of more than 1,000 Ancestor-level top cultivators and 20 Yan Immortals stood in the void. At that moment, they revealed their true fangs that they had been hiding all along.","Outside the Six Heavens Realm, in the void of the Great Si Region, the Young Emperor looked at the figure in front of him with a rare calm gaze.","At that moment, the void of the Great Si Region was filled with the sound of footsteps.","Strange beasts that Jian Wushuang had never seen before rode the wind and came over on flowing clouds.","This strange beast was like a dragon or a sheep, with curved horns and thin ears. Its body was covered in golden scales and was engraved with cloud stripes. It was not strange, but at the same time, it was quite mysterious.","A total of 20 strange beasts and ten Imperial carriages arrived.","Each carriage had a flag with the word ‘Yan’ engraved on it.","After a long time, the Young Emperor’s calm and majestic voice resounded through the entire Great Si Region.","“Everyone, follow Prince Yan to the Heavenly Court for the banquet!”"]},{"number":4722,"title":"Chapter 4722 You Still Dare to Intercept","paragraphs":["4722 You Still Dare to Intercept","None of them spoke, and they all stood there with their hands cupped.","Each of them had been by the Young Emperor’s side for countless years, so they did not need to say a word to know what he meant.","A murderous intent rose to the sky.","The thin purple-robed man stepped out of the formation, held the Young Emperor’s hand, and sent him into one of the ten Imperial carriages.","The other nine carriages were used to confuse the enemy.","After sending the Young Emperor into the Imperial carriage, the skinny purple-robed man returned and said to Jian Wushuang, “Follow me.”","Jian Wushuang did not suspect anything. After exchanging a glance with Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and the others, he went straight ahead.","When he was pushed into the carriage, Jian Wushuang saw that the Young Emperor was among them.","“Uh...” He was embarrassed and wanted to leave.","“Brother Jian, please stay. I was the one who asked my companion to let you in here.” The Young Emperor waved his hand. “I can’t tell if there will be any danger on this journey, so I’m asking you to come along.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then sat in the luxurious carriage.","Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and the rest of the Yan Immortals all entered the other nine Imperial carriages.","The remaining thousand or so Ancestor-level experts didn’t follow them in. Instead, they only followed a hundred or so of them to serve as guards of honor. The rest of them were scattered across the entire Great Si Region.","As the preparations were completed, a total of ten Imperial carriages took off with the wind. The dragon-sheep-like beast stepped on the clouds, and each step it took covered a distance of hundreds of millions of miles!","Even though the speed was so terrifying, sitting in the Imperial carriage, he could not help but feel the slightest bit of turbulence.","At that moment, only Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor were sitting in the carriage that could accommodate dozens of people.","The atmosphere was a little awkward, so Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and fell into deep thought.","With the rising clouds and smoke from the golden furnace, the entire Imperial carriage had become an excellent place for cultivation.","“Brother Jian, this trip will take several months. If you have nothing else to do, you should take a good rest,” the Young Emperor reminded.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “I will.”","At this point, the long journey had entered a silent stage.","The Imperial carriage traveled through the void, passing through many void worlds as it headed toward the most mysterious place.","The Young Emperor’s Six Heavens Realm was just the six common Heavenly Realms in the Great Si Region. Beyond the Great Si Region was an even more vast universe.","He did not know when he would arrive at the Heavenly Court that was ruled by Zhen Wuyang.","Jian Wushuang was really curious about this legendary figure who had basically lived under the curses of the three Emperor’s True Shadows.","To be able to destroy the bodies of three Emperors and the Heavenly Court on his own, how terrifying must Zhen Wuyang be?","Emperor Fenghua, Chun Qiu’s Imperial Father, had also died at the hands of Zhen Wuyang. Jian Wushuang knew four of them, which showed their terrifying strength.","Perhaps, a God Emperor of such a level would know something.","While Jian Wushuang was thinking about his next step, almost 20 days had passed.","He did not know if he was in a dream or when he was awake, but he felt a sense of danger.","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes. The Young Emperor opened his eyes at the same time, and there was a chill in his eyes.","“Are these b*stards crazy? Do they actually dare to intercept and kill us here? Do you really think I’m made of mud?” The Young Emperor said coldly and was about to step out.","Jian Wushuang reached out to stop him and said in a low voice, “Don’t go out yet. We’ll wait and see.”","He nodded slowly, and Yan power appeared in his hand.","In the next moment, an extremely powerful Yan power broke through the void and exploded in the ten Imperial carriages!","Jian Wushuang felt the space around him stagnate and then the Imperial chariot in front of him shattered.","The three Yan Immortals sitting in the carriage were heavily injured!","He could no longer wait and see. Jian Wushuang rushed out of the carriage and stood in the void.","Chun Qiu, Cheng Qing, and the others also quickly gathered.","“Brother Jian, how’s the Young Emperor?” Cheng Qing said in a deep voice as he held his True Sword.","“I’m fine.” A gloomy voice sounded, and the Young Emperor stepped out slowly.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly. He felt that there were no less than 40 strong auras rushing toward him from all directions!","In the starry void, there were indeed close to 40 Yan Immortals!","Twenty against forty, they were at a huge disadvantage.","However, Chen Qing and the other Yan Immortals still surrounded the Young Emperor.","Then, a gloomy-looking Yan Immortal stepped forward and pointed at the Young Emperor. “Leave him here and I’ll let you live. Otherwise, you’ll die!”","“Who sent you? Is it Prince Jiu or Prince Yu?” the Young Emperor asked in a deep voice.","Yan Immortal laughed sinisterly again. “What’s the use of a dead man knowing more? However, you still have a way out. As long as you turn back, I promise not to hurt a single one of you.”","The Young Emperor sneered. “Are you so sure that you’ve got me?”","“Of course, if I want to, none of you will be able to leave here alive!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire void seemed to have turned into a quagmire. The vast Yan power directly crushed toward the Young Emperor and the others.","Jian Wushuang snorted and the Invisible Sword in his hand cut through the encirclement. Everything returned to normal.","When Yan Immortal, who was still laughing, saw this, his eyes dimmed and he said, “I thought you were just a bunch of motley crew, but you do have some ability.”","When Chen Qing heard this, he immediately took a step forward and released a vast Yan power.","His realm was rising, and even Jian Wushuang felt that Chen Qing’s realm was far more than just Yan Immortal.","All of the Yan Immortals that surrounded him had a change in expression, “Attack!”","Rumble! Rumble!!!","A total of over 40 Yan Immortals released a terrifying Yan power!","The void was collapsing rapidly, and the violent Yan power shot over like a waterfall.","Cheng Qing waved his hand and a Yan power barrier immediately surrounded everyone, blocking the terrifying power.","Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated. He summoned the invisible sword and moved forward.","This barrier would not last for long. Even though Chen Qing’s cultivation level showed signs of a breakthrough, he was still a Yan Immortal. He could not protect himself from the siege of so many Yan Immortals.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang took the lead and killed the most number of Yan Immortals as soon as possible.","40 Yan Immortals, which was several times more than the time in Jingchuan Tian City.","The Young Emperor’s eyes were bloodshot. The repeated attacks were far beyond his imagination. He did not show any mercy at all.","“Prince Jiu, if I’m still alive, I’ll kill you first!”","The void trembled. With Jian Wushuang as the leader, a total of 60 Yan Immortals began to fight!","After forcing Yan Immortal to retreat a thousand feet, Jian Wushuang threw out the Transcendence Heavenly Gate to severely injure all the enemies who dared to come forward."]},{"number":4723,"title":"Chapter 4723 Graceful","paragraphs":["4723 Graceful","One of the Yan Immortals did not manage to retreat in time and was crushed into dust by the power of the Transcendence Heavenly Gate, his Immortal Source was shattered.","The intense battlefield immediately became empty. The ten Yan Immortals all looked at Jian Wushuang vigilantly.","The power of that mystical divine ability was so vast.","On the other side, Chen Qing was on a killing spree. Every attack was enough to severely injure several Yan Immortals who dared to rush forward.","However, even so, the Yan Immortals under the Young Emperor were still very tired.","20 against 40, how could they be a match?","Without the help of the three Emperors, Jian Wushuang could at most face several Yan Immortals without being defeated. However, there were more than 10 Yan Immortals surrounding him.","He alone had attracted a quarter of the firepower, and he was extremely depressed.","“Obediently hand over the head, and I can let you suffer less pain!” A powerful rippling force waterfall smashed towards Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang turned the sword in his hand and tore the attack apart. He smiled disdainfully and said, ” do you think you can take my head? ”","The Yan Immortal leader’s expression turned serious. He waved his hands and a total of 11 Yan Immortals exerted their strength together. A ray of light that covered the sky pressed down with the force of the entire void.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were solemn. He first used a force to block it and then stabbed forward with his sword.","The extinctive sword!","1 sword strike with the power of 100,000 swords strikes, breaking the surface with a single point!","Booom!!!","Tens of thousands of flowing lights shot up. Jian Wushuang held the long sword in his hand and advanced forward.","The light that covered the sky was split into two and quickly dissipated.","Jian Wushuang was not in a good state either. The combined attack of the 11 Yan Immortals was not something he could withstand. The surface of his skin seemed to be burning.","“Brother Jian, let me help you!” With a low growl, Chun Qiu controlled the eight-armed Arhat and charged forward. The eight giant arms followed Jian Wushuang and blasted into the sky-covering light.","Jian Wushuang felt his body relax and the light in front of him disappeared.","Chun Qiu came to him and said quickly, “Brother Jian, let’s retreat. There are 40 Yan Immortals here. If we continue like this, we will definitely die!”","“I can’t leave.” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. He had his own set of rules. If he left without a care, it would be a disaster for Chen Qing, the Young Emperor, and the others.","If they retreated without a fight, the first blow would be their morale.","No matter what, he could not retreat today.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand to block the huge power that was coming at him again. Then, he turned around and pushed Chun Qiu into the protective circle.","He was only at the Ancestor-level, even with the eight-armed Arhat, he could be killed by Yan Immortal’s attack if he was not careful.","The only thing Jian Wushuang could do now was to try his best to protect him.","Yan Immortals were dying constantly. Such an existence could destroy the world with a wave of his hand, not to mention that there were nearly 60 Yan Immortals fighting.","The void was torn apart, and the nearby planes were also affected and collapsed.","Almost a hundred ancestor-level cultivators had been killed in the beginning, and the number of Yan Immortals brought by the Young Emperor was also decreasing rapidly.","The few of them were already arrows at the end of their flight. Even though Chen Qing’s Yan power was at the peak, he was still weak in the face of so many Yan Immortals.","A wave of Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent burst out, barely blocking the group of Yan Immortals that pounced at him again. Jian Wushuang and the others were already surrounded.","At this point, there were only 8 Yan Immortals left beside the Young Emperor.","Chen Qing’s right arm, which was holding the sword, was full of wounds, especially his right rib, where the scars were shocking.","These injuries caused by the same level of Yan Immortal would be very difficult to heal in a short period of time, which also meant that their combat strength would drop to a certain extent.","Looking at the remaining 25 or 26 Yan Immortals, Jian Wushuang and the others felt their hearts sink.","“Young Emperor, I’ll stay behind to cover your retreat. You guys go back to the six heavens realm and don’t go to the heaven court again. Cheng Qing said in a low voice, ” only by living can I continue to fulfill my long-cherished wish.","“Brother Jian, I’ll leave the Young Emperor’s safety to you,” he looked at Jian Wushuang and said.","Before Jian Wushuang could speak, the Young Emperor said coldly, “Chen Qing, when did I need you to make decisions for me?”","Chen Qing was anxious. “But Young Emperor, if you don’t leave now, you won’t be able to leave!”","“As the next emperor, I have to go to the Heavenly Court. Even if I die on the way, it can not be changed.” The Young Emperor’s voice was indifferent, and his eyes were filled with the will to die.","“Heh, a Successor Emperor, a piece of trash who can only cultivate and can’t achieve Dao, dares to call himself a successor Emperor?” A feminine looking Yan Immortal sneered in disdain. Behind him, the 20 over Yan Immortals also started to laugh.","“Young Master, leave it to me.” The skinny purple-robed man lowered his head slightly. When he took a step forward, he was pulled back by the Young Emperor.","“Let the trash he spoke of send him on his way.” His voice was indifferent, but it carried a heavy sense of authority.","In the next moment, the battle resumed!","A Domain filled with darkness spread out and the Young Emperor seemed to have become a True Emperor who controlled an area.","“Whoever kills Prince Yan will be heavily rewarded!” The feminine Yan Immortal was not afraid. Instead, he smiled and charged at the Young Emperor like a ghost.","His sword pierced through one of the Yan Immortal’s shoulder blades. Jian Wushuang shouted and the Yan power smashed forward.","The Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate’s terrifying power once again sealed it.","However, the Yan Immortals, who had already experienced how terrifying it was, joined forces to block it. Under Jian Wushuang’s full-power attack, none of them were injured!","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank, but he still raised the Invisible Sword and rushed forward.","All kinds of supreme Yan power and divine techniques bombarded his body, and even his indestructible divine body began to be injured.","The Young Emperor released his Domain and destroyed a Yan Immortal with a single strike, but he was immediately blocked by the other Yan Immortals.","Cheng Qing and the others were barely able to protect themselves.","Ghastly wounds began to appear on everyone’s bodies.","Just as Jian Wushuang and the others were about to be completely surrounded and killed in this fierce battle, there was a sudden monstrous force in the boundless void.","Jian Wushuang pulled the Young Emperor in front of him almost subconsciously and retreated.","Clang!","A terrifying slash that could easily shatter the void seemed to be able to split the heavens and earth. The void within hundreds of millions of miles was torn apart by this strike.","Almost at the same time, a destructive slash came from nowhere.","More than ten Yan Immortals did not manage to dodge in time, their bodies turned into dust and their Immortal Sources disappeared.","This terrifying and graceful sword strike directly plowed out a ravine that was billions of miles long in the void!","Deathly silence, extreme deathly silence. All the surviving Yan Immortals were stunned at this moment."]},{"number":4724,"title":"Chapter 4724 Entering the Heavenly Court","paragraphs":["4724 Entering the Heavenly Court","The sword strike was hundreds of millions of miles long, and its brilliant power poured out.","It was impossible for anyone to cause damage to any part of the world in the Great Yan Domain unless they were Yan Immortals.","Even Jian Wushuang had to borrow the power of the three Emperor Lords to destroy the river. The difficulty was obvious.","What kind of existence was this sword that had the power to destroy millions of miles of space?","“A bunch of ignorant people. Do you know that you have to protect the environment?” An extremely impatient voice resounded in the void.","Jian Wushuang looked at the source of the voice and saw a figure emitting a hazy brilliance standing in the distance. Even from such a distance, he could feel a supreme pressure that was beyond his knowledge.","However, the figure only appeared for a moment before it disappeared.","“This is just a warning. If you dare to cause any more destruction and treat all living things as nothing, you can all disappear.”","The majestic voice resounded through the void and only disappeared after a long time.","Such a terrifying sword move and such a mysterious figure had only appeared for a brief moment before disappearing.","Looking at the sword mark that tore apart the void, all the Yan Immortals’ mouths twitched. It was too overbearing.","The indiscriminate attack had killed nearly 20 Yan Immortals. If Jian Wushuang had not delayed the Young Emperor at the critical moment, the two of them would have died.","After recovering from the shock, Jian Wushuang looked at the remaining Yan Immortals and sneered.","The originally one-sided suppression situation was directly reversed by the mysterious man’s sword strike.","Including Jian Wushuang, there were 6 Yan Immortals and 1 Ancestor-level expert left on the Young Emperor’s side. On the other hand, there were only 12 Yan Immortals left from the enemies they had killed.","Just he and Chen Qing alone could fight against 12 Yan Immortals, not to mention the Young Emperor and the skinny purple-robed man.","The feminine Yan Immortal no longer had the heart to fight. After shouting out to retreat, he prepared to escape without a care.","An extremely dark vine seemed to grow out of nothingness and attached itself to his body with a strong aura of death.","The surrounding void seemed to stagnate, and even the Yan power in his body was stiff.","The great terror of life and death made this feminine Yan Immortal extremely terrified. “Quick, save me!”","However, the other Yan Immortals who fled in a panic did not even look at him. They all scattered in the void and disappeared.","What was waiting for him was an extremely terrifying experience.","Yan Immortal turned around with difficulty, unable to even speak clearly.","“Open your mouth and stick out your tongue.” The Young Emperor’s face was gloomy and he held a True Sword.","When he heard this, he was overjoyed in his heart. Even if his tongue was cut off, it would grow back in at most 1,000 years. At least, he could still keep his life.","Immediately, this effeminate Yan Immortal stuck out his tongue and mumbled, “M-many thanks, Young Emperor.”","The blade of the sword slashed across, and a section of the tongue was directly cut off.","He grunted and divine blood spurted out of his mouth. Before he could close his mouth, another sword pierced through his face. A terrifying Yan power came out of the blade and blew his entire head and Immortal Source into pieces.","Jian Wushuang took half a step back and frowned.","This Young Emperor’s killing intent was too strong, which was evident.","Without his head and Immortal Source, the Yan Immortal fell into the void without a sound.","In the entire void, only the remains of many Yan Immortals were left floating silently.","The Young Emperor slowly turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang with raised eyebrows. A stream of divine blood gushed out of his nose without warning","Then, he passed out.","The skinny purple-robed man seemed to have expected this. He grabbed the Young Emperor and ran straight into the Imperial carriage that had not broken yet.","Cheng Qing smiled bitterly and said, “His old issue is acting up again.”","Jian Wushuang did not ask any meaningless questions. He took Chun Qiu to the other Imperial carriages.","In this fierce battle, only three out of the ten Imperial chariots were left. On the other hand, there were almost no casualties for the thin-eared beasts that were like dragons and sheep.","Chen Qing waved his hand and grabbed the reins on the Imperial carriage before leaving and continuing forward.","They were intercepted halfway and only six of them were left. It was a tragic situation. If the mysterious man did not interfere, they would probably be in a situation where they had a 90 percent chance of annihilation.","At this moment, even Jian Wushuang was a little puzzled. How did he survive until now under layers of attacks?","The carriage moved forward, and the only person sitting with Jian Wushuang was Chun Qiu.","“Brother Jian, does Prince Yan have any hidden injuries? Did you see that? This is the second time,” Chun Qiu said in a low voice.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then said, “I can’t rule out this possibility. According to the repeated attacks, it’s a miracle that he survived.”","When Chun Qiu heard this, he facepalmed and said, “It’s hard to believe that I, who wanted him dead the most, am actually standing on the same side as him.”","Jian Wushuang laughed and said, “When the time is right, we can leave.”","“I guess that’s the only way.” Chun Qiu nodded helplessly and then said in a low voice, “However, it’s easier now that we know he has an underlying injury. If we really have to fall out with him one day, we can also deal him a heavy blow.”","He shook his head and stopped talking.","There was only the faint howling of the strong wind left in his ears.","After another 20 days of travel, there were no more accidents.","The emptiness in the surroundings is about to reach the end, and is gradually replaced by a Heavenly Realm filled with vast Yan power.","The Yan power was so dense that it seemed to have substance. There was also the aura of living beings spread in the void.","The seven-colored rainbow stretched across the heavens and set up above the Heavenly Realm.","Walking through this place, it was as if one had entered a dream. It was relaxing and pleasant.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and pulled open the curtain in front of the window. After seeing this scene, even Jian Wushuang sighed.","The Nine-Side Super Heavenly Realm was like a gateway, like the stars surrounding the moon, setting off the vast Heavenly Court in the center.","There were thousands of waterfalls flowing down from the edge of the Heavenly Court like jade belts, which were indescribably magnificent and mysterious.","“Brother Jian, this should be the Heavenly Court of that Zhen Wuyang.” Chun Qiu’s expression was solemn.","Then, a restless movement came from the Boyang Bottle, and the cork was slightly opened. Then, the voices of the three Emperors rang out.","“Little Friend, what’s going on? Why do I feel like something’s wrong here?”","“Why does this aura feel so familiar? It makes me feel inexplicably irritated.”","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and said in a low voice, “Seniors, we should be entering the Heavenly Court of Zhen Wuyang now.”","“...”","“What? Little Friend, are you going straight to the lair of Zhen Wuyang? My True Shadow has yet to recover!”"]},{"number":4725,"title":"Chapter 4725 Ascending to the Heavenly Court","paragraphs":["4725 Ascending to the Heavenly Court","Jian Wushuang’s face was full of black lines. Looking at the magnificent posture of the Heavenly Court in the Heavenly Realm, he was afraid that even if he really wanted to attack the lair of Zhen Wuyang, he would not be able to.","“I’m not thinking of doing anything. You’ve misunderstood.” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and then told the whole story.","In the end, there was silence in the Boyang Bottle, which was then followed by a burst of excitement that could not be suppressed.","“That’s great! Young Friend, you can continue to maintain your relationship with that troublesome Young Emperor and gain his trust. When the three of us recover, we can come and destroy Zhen Wuyang’s old nest. It’s so convenient and fast!”","“T-that’s not very good.” Jian Wushuang’s mouth twitched.","“Young Friend, don’t feel too much psychological pressure. Just act as usual and make your presence known. Leave the rest to us!”","“...”","“This really saved us a lot of effort. This old man Zhen Wuyang would never have thought that we are right beside him!”","“Shush, keep quiet. We must not reveal our aura. We’ll leave everything to our Young Friend.”","“Little Friend, you have to take care of yourself from now on. Don’t call us out unless you have no choice. We’ll recharge our energy.”","Jian Wushuang still wanted to speak, but the cork of the Boyang Bottle was directly closed, not giving him any chance.","He smiled bitterly.","At this moment, Cheng Qing’s voice came from outside the carriage. “Brother Jian, we should get off the carriage.”","Jian Wushuang responded and then left the Imperial chariot with Chun Qiu.","Stepping on the vast clouds, Cheng Qing took the lead and ran over. He laughed and said, “Brother Jian, how do you feel?”","Looking around, Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Not bad.”","As they conversed, figures that were either riding on cranes, flying swords, or riding carriages gathered in front of the heavenly gate.","Looking around, without exception, they were all in the Yan Immortal stage.","Countless seven-colored lotus peaks shone in the sky. In the center of the nine boundless Heavenly Realms, there was a Great Road paved by the clouds.","There were already close to a hundred figures gathered outside the Heavenly Gate.","Under the guidance of the thin purple robe, the Young Emperor, who was wearing a bloodstained court dress, slowly walked down the Imperial carriage.","The hundreds of Yan Immortals who were also waiting looked at each other when they saw the Young Emperor in a sorry state. They then cupped their hands unwillingly and said, “Greetings, Young Emperor.”","Without even looking at the perfunctory Yan Immortals, the Young Emperor walked toward Jian Wushuang with light steps.","“Brother Jian, follow me.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. After looking around again, he stood behind the Young Emperor.","There were only six Yan Immortals left, with one Ancestor level following by his side. He did not even have a guard of honor.","Looking at the Young Emperor’s slightly embarrassed figure, the hundreds of Yan Immortals all had different thoughts.","The guards of the Heavenly Gate were tens of Yan Immortals in silver helmets.","The two Yan Immortals in the front split their axes and stepped forward, cupping their hands. “Greetings, Young Emperor. The Emperor has ordered that before the time is up, you are not to...”","Before he could finish, the Young Emperor suddenly raised his leg without any warning and kicked the two Yan Immortals.","“Get lost!” the Young Emperor said gloomily, then strode into the Heavenly Gate. No one dared to stop him","The two Yan Immortals who were kicked away were covered in dust and dirt, standing in a daze.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and threw the axes at the two of them. Then, he followed the Young Emperor and stepped on the Great Road.","The figures waiting outside the Heavenly Gate began to discuss in low voices.","One of the Elders with white hair and beard held a horsetail whisk and snorted coldly. “He’s getting more and more arrogant. In my opinion, after this banquet, the position of the Young Emperor should belong to Prince Jiu!”","“Fujie, aren’t you afraid that the wind will cut your tongue? If your words were to reach the Young Emperor’s ears, you’ll probably be stabbed twice before you can even leave the Heavenly Court.”","One of the middle-aged men with an extraordinary temperament seemed to be at odds with the white-haired Elder and sneered in response.","The expression of the Elder named Fujie changed slightly as if he had recalled something. He no longer spoke and closed his eyes in deep thought.","At this moment, more and more Imperial carriages gathered in front of the Heavenly Gate.","On these Imperial banners, there were different words.","In front of the ten Imperial chariots, the ‘Ji’ flag fluttered in the wind.","Then, a figure wearing a white court dress stepped out of the carriage.","Seeing this, the group of Yan Immortals who were standing on their own hurriedly stepped forward and cupped their hands, “Greetings, Second Young Master.”","The handsome young man, who was dressed in a plain court robe, raised his eyebrows when he saw the carriage, which had the ‘Yan’ flag on the back. He then looked at the Yan Immortals who had come to greet him and smiled. “Immortals, please follow Prince Jiu to the Heavenly Court.”","“Yes.” The group of Yan Immortals agreed with smiles on their faces.","As the Prince strode into the Heavenly Realm, dozens of Imperial carriages gathered in succession.","And in front of these Imperial carriages, there were their own words.","Yu, Qian, Mo, Hua, Lin.","The figures who were dressed in court attire and walked out of the carriage slowly had different expressions. After smiling at each other, they followed their respective companions and stepped into the Heavenly Gate.","As he walked on the Great Road, Jian Wushuang felt that Yan power in his body was changing at a perceivable speed.","At the same time, a majestic voice resounded throughout the entire Heavenly Realm.","“The Heavenly Court is open. Immortals, please take your seats.”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the front. At the very front of the Great Road was the magnificent Heavenly Court.","Ever since the Young Emperor woke up, his face had been extremely gloomy, and his hostility was so dense that it seemed to have materialized. It was as if he was not going to a banquet, but to kill.","On the way here, after being intercepted and killed, the clothes of Jian Wushuang and the others were more or less damaged and stained with blood. They looked very fierce.","They did not know how much time had passed as they strolled forward. When the Heavenly Court with thousands of waterfalls appeared in front of them, a rainbow bridge connected the heaven from the Heavenly Realm to the Heavenly Court, which was magnificent and bold.","More than 100 children came over on the rainbow bridge, their red lips and white teeth. No one would have thought that these children were all extremely powerful top cultivators.","“Amy greets the Young Emperor.” A little girl in the lead flew into the Young Emperor’s arms and grinned.","Only then did the Young Emperor’s hostility subside.","“Little Amy, have you been slacking off in your cultivation all these years when I wasn’t around?” His expression softened a little, which was a rare sight. He carried the little girl and slowly walked forward.","The little girl tilted her head and said in embarrassment, “Amy is a little lazy. After all, cultivation is very boring. Look, I’ve lost a lot of hair because of this.”"]},{"number":4726,"title":"Chapter 4726 There’s No Room for Discussion When Kicking You","paragraphs":["4726 There’s No Room for Discussion When Kicking You","The Young Emperor scratched the little girl’s nose and then reached for the thin purple-robed man behind him.","“You’ll lose your teeth if you eat too much sweet food.” The skinny purple-robed man muttered in a low voice, and then took out a handful of rainbow-colored sugar balls from his bosom.","The Young Emperor took out two sweets, one into the little girl’s mouth, and the other into his own.","The little girl crossed her arms in the Young Emperor’s arms and said smugly, “I’m not afraid of losing my teeth. Don’t lie to me, Da Ban. They all say that I won’t lose my teeth.”","The skinny purple-robed man named Da Ban, who the Young Emperor calls ‘companion’, did not say much. He distributed the candy in his hand to the rest of the children.","With the candy in her mouth, the little girl looked at Jian Wushuang curiously with her big eyes.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang was reminded of his childhood and his old brothers in the Divine Power Universe when he saw the girl’s red lips and white teeth.","“Young Emperor, who is this big brother?”","The Young Emperor turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang. Then, he smiled and said, “He’s my good friend. You have to call him Brother Jian.”","“Yes, yes, Big Brother Jian.” The little girl smiled sweetly at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang smiled in return and subconsciously reached out to touch her small hair bun.","The Young Emperor patted her gently. “Go and play. I’m going to see my Imperial Father.”","The little girl nodded and said, “Young Emperor, don’t make the Emperor angry this time. He was really angry when you went back last time.”","The Young Emperor did not say anything. He just reached out and carried her on the rainbow bridge.","After leaving the escort girl, the hostility on his body quietly rose again, and his face also darkened, as if he was a different person from before.","He stepped onto the rainbow bridge and walked towards the Heavenly Court’s grand gate.","There were also more than 10 Yan Immortals guarding the Heavenly Gate.","The leading two Yan Immortals in golden armor, upon seeing this fiendish expression, immediately made way for him and almost dropped their axes on the ground.","The Young Emperor stepped into it, followed by Jian Wushuang and the others.","Buzz...","The flowing cloud water ripple spread between heaven and earth. Feeling the warm brilliance flowing around him, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes.","He saw countless majestic mountains and waterfalls that looked like jade belts embedded in them, forming a vast river.","In the center of the Heavenly Court, a vast green jade hall was located in the clouds. A grand sun was shining behind it.","“Is this the Heavenly Court?” Jian Wushuang looked at the magnificent and majestic momentum in front of him and was moved.","In front of the green jade hall, there was a road paved with smooth jade that led to the Heavenly Gate.","The Young Emperor took the lead and stepped onto the exquisite jade pathway, moving forward.","After sighing in his heart, Jian Wushuang and the others followed.","Feeling the brilliance around them, they did not say anything and headed straight for the Heavenly Court!","Just as they were about to step into the Heavenly Court, the flowing clouds condensed into two figures in robes on the smooth jade-paved ground.","“Greetings, Young Emperor.” Two figures that looked almost exactly the same bowed to the Young Emperor.","“Get lost!” The Young Emperor blurted and used his Yan power to push the two away, stepping into the giant hall.","As for the twin-like figures, they seemed to be used to it. After amicably bowing to everyone, they turned into clouds and dispersed.","As he entered the green jade hall and stepped into the vast square, Jian Wushuang saw that hundreds of Elders had already gathered.","Every Elder was surrounded by a layer of warm light. It was difficult to see their cultivation level, but one thing was certain. Every Elder gathered here was not below Cheng Qing’s.","Looking at the Young Emperor, who was filled with hostility, the hundred-odd Elders all cupped their hands and said, “Greetings, Young Emperor.”","The Young Emperor’s expression softened slightly when he saw the Elders, but he only said, “Let’s go in.”","With that, he went straight into the main hall.","A helpless look appeared on the faces of the Elders. This banquet would probably not end well again.","The Young Emperor sat down on the side of the Emperor’s throne with a cold expression.","Then, the group of Elders who had been waiting in the square entered the giant hall one by one.","None of them spoke. They all had their hands crossed in their sleeves and were looking down at their surroundings.","As the Yan Immortals entered one by one, the atmosphere in the heaven’s expanse palace became a little strange.","Surrounded by many Yan Immortals, a handsome young man in a white court dress walked into the palace.","Their eyes met, and the Young Emperor’s face grew darker.","It was the young man who broke the silence first. He said with a faint smile, “Second Brother, Prince Jiu, greets Eldest Brother.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him with a glint of amusement in his eyes.","The young man in white looked at Jian Wushuang subconsciously, as if he had sensed something.","At this moment, the Young Emperor slowly walked down from the side of the Emperor’s throne with a gloomy and majestic aura.","He slowly retreated, his expression unnatural.","“Tell me, did you send them?” The Young Emperor’s voice was cold and his eyes were filled with anger.","The corners of Pince Jiu’s mouth twitched unconsciously. “B-big brother, what are you saying? Why don’t I...”","Before he could finish his sentence, a powerful and heavy slap landed on Prince Jiu’s face. Immediately after that, he was kicked away by a powerful flying kick.","This combination of skills was simply too fast. After a series of afterimages flashed past, the Immortals finally reacted, and the two of them had already flown out of the hall.","“Brother Jian, let’s go and watch the show together!” Chen Qing said excitedly and pulled Jian Wushuang out of the hall.","In the corridor, the Young Emperor was riding on Prince Jiu’s body. He stretched out his two palms and began to slap him wildly.","On the other hand, Prince Jiu’s face was swelling rapidly.","“Young Emperor, stop fighting. The Emperor will be here soon!” One of the black-haired and black-bearded old men tried to stop him, but he did not dare to go forward.","For a time, there were many voices of admonishment, but the Young Emperor did not seem to hear it and continued to slap left and right.","“Prince Yan, that’s enough!” Prince Jiu, who was pressed to the ground, let out a furious roar. Just as he was about to attempt to resist, Chen Qing smiled evilly. He immediately released Yan power and firmly fixed both of Prince Jiu’s arms, rendering him unable to move.","“Cheng Qing, don’t be presumptuous. Why are you interfering in the fight between the Princes?!” a Yan immortal with an angry voice chided.","Cheng Qing glanced at him and then said disdainfully, “I’m going to interfere. If you have the guts, come and beat me up?”","“How dare you? You’re behaving like a dog, have you wasted all your cultivation?” the Yan immortal beside Prince Jiu pointed his halberd and shouted angrily.","Chen Qing’s expression suddenly turned cold, and his sword-like eyes shot toward him.","The Yan Immortal was about to continue scolding, but he saw this and immediately swallowed, retreating backward."]},{"number":4727,"title":"Chapter 4727 Uncle Yu","paragraphs":["4727 Uncle Yu","For a moment, only Prince Jiu’s anger and the Young Emperor’s left and right slaps were left outside the hall.","More than 200 Elders in the Heavenly Court shook their heads and sighed at the sight. This was not the first time the Young Emperor had been so domineering. There had been a total of five banquets, and he had fought three times.","However, even though the Emperor had some complaints about this, he never stopped it. He did not even punish or teach it a lesson.","This also caused the banquet participants to be angry but not dare to speak out, afraid that the Young Emperor would be unhappy and stab them for no reason.","With Chen Qing as his ‘accomplice’, the Young Emperor slapped Prince Jiu without restraint. Prince Jiu could only endure the humiliation. As for the Yan Immortals he brought, although they were tempted, they did not dare to stop him.","At this moment, a loud shout rang out.","“Prince Yan, don’t treat the Heavenly Court as your Six Heavens Realm. Is the Heavenly Court a place where you can do whatever you want?!”","A man dressed in a plain court dress stepped into the green jade hall. His handsome brows were filled with coldness.","The Young Emperor raised his head slowly when he heard that. He looked at him with his dark eyes, then let go of Prince Jiu who was under him, and walked toward him slowly.","“What are you doing?” The rather valiant young man unconsciously took half a step back, his eyes revealing vigilance.","The response he got was a strong and heavy slap.","The young man seemed to have expected this. He dodged the attack with a slight tilt of his neck, but then he felt a sharp pain in his abdomen.","The Young Emperor kneed him in the stomach at an incredible speed, forcing him to lose his ability to resist. At the same time, he slapped him with his palm.","Prince Jiu stood up in a sorry state. He covered his bruised face and glared at the Young Emperor, who was still abusing him. Then, he raised his palm, which was surging with violent force.","“Second Young Master, you’ve already done sneak attacks many times. This time, let’s stop.”","Chen Qing’s mocking voice rang out. At the same time, an even thinner Yan power blocked in front of Prince Jue.","Prince Jiu’s eyes turned cold. A murderous intent flashed across his eyes as he looked at Chen Qing. “Chen Qing, what’s the meaning of this?”","“Nothing much. The Heavens are watching what we do. Oh right, I almost forgot. Second Young Master, you’re already in the Heavens,” Cheng Qing crossed his arms behind his head and said leisurely.","The killing intent in his eyes grew stronger and stronger uncontrollably, but Prince Jiu only snorted coldly. With a flick of his sleeve, he retreated to the side and closed his eyes to recuperate.","“Brother Jian,” Chen Qing leaned toward Jian Wushuang and said mysteriously, “Guess who the Young Emperor is fighting?”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Another one of his brothers again?”","Cheng Qing nodded, “Third brother, Prince Yu.”","He could not help but laugh. “Don’t tell me he’s going to beat up all of his brothers?”","“I can’t say for sure,” Cheng Qing shrugged. “But I think the Emperor will probably arrive when the fourth one is beaten up.”","The valiant young man, Prince Yu, took dozens of slaps from the Young Emperor before he let out an angry roar and smashed his palm at the Young Emperor’s face with a strong force.","However, the space seemed to stagnate for a moment. The Young Emperor turned his head slightly and walked over. Then he took half a step back and kicked Prince Yu away.","There was an uproar. The companion that Prince Yu brought could not help but step forward and say in a low voice, “Eldest Young Master, you are the Crown Prince. Why do you want to embarrass Second Young Master and Third Young Master in the Heavenly Court? Are you really so arrogant because of the Emperor?”","The Young Emperor glanced at him coldly, and a True Sword surrounded by Immortal Qi quietly appeared in his hand.","Seeing this, the purple-robed Da Ban took a step back and gritted his teeth. “The Heavenly Court must not be stained with blood!”","Just at this moment, four figures in white court clothes walked into the green jade hall.","However, after seeing this scene, the four figures took half a step back in tacit understanding and looked at the Young Emperor vigilantly.","“All of you, come over.” The Young Emperor withdrew his real sword and waved at them.","“Yes,” one of the young men replied. “Big Brother, how have you been?”","The atmosphere was heavy, and all the Yan Immortals were looking at the square where a fight was about to happen.","The Young Emperor sneered and took out a soft sword from his waist without a trace.","The five people’s expressions changed slightly. Among them, a thin young man stepped forward and said, “Big Brother, stop. Don’t make Imperial Father unhappy again.”","The Young Emperor acted as if he did not hear her and walked forward step by step with his sword in hand. Killing intent was revealed in his eyes without any concealment.","Cheng Qing’s expression changed slightly, “Brother Jian, the Young Emperor seems to have the intention to kill. Come with me to stop him.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. If the magnificent Heavenly Court was really stained with blood, the Emperor who had yet to show himself would definitely not forgive the Young Emperor.","The face of Prince Jiu, who was covering his cheek, was filled with joy. The expression in his eyes was as if he could not wait for them to start a fight on the spot.","A total of five majestic forces filled the square in the green jade hall.","All the Princes in court attire were prepared for battle.","The Young Emperor did not seem to be worried at all. He held the soft sword in his hand and moved forward firmly as if he had entered a no-man’s land.","Just as Jian Wushuang and Chen Qing were about to stop them, a brilliant seven-colored charm appeared in the sky.","The entire sky, which was filled with flowing clouds, changed at this moment.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have realized something and looked over.","A black-robed figure was formed from the clouds. He stepped on the colorful clouds and descended from the sky. It was as if the rules of the great path were flowing around him.","“Is that Emperor Zhen Wuyang?” Jian Wushuang murmured in his heart. He was shocked by his momentum.","With a casual palm strike, he directly suppressed the battle between the Young Emperor and the others, and Yan power dissipated.","Even Jian Wushuang could clearly feel that the Yan power in his body had been suppressed.","The man in the black robe stood in the middle of the square like a statue.","The five people’s expressions all changed. Then, they cupped their hands at the same time and said, “Greetings, Uncle Yu.”","The Young Emperor did not speak. He put the soft sword on his waist and said, “Uncle Yu.”","The black robe fluttered slightly, and a pair of turbid eyes slowly swept around. Finally, the man looked at the Young Emperor. “Young Emperor, don’t be angry anymore. The Emperor will be here soon.”","As soon as he finished speaking, another voice that seemed to shake the world and carried supreme might resounded. “Are you killing your own family?”","When all the Yan Immortals gathered in the heaven court heard this voice, they all cupped their hands and said solemnly, “Greetings, Emperor.”","The hazy seven-colored sky split into two sides, and a majestic figure wearing the Emperor’s robe of mountains and rivers emerged.","There were 99 figures behind him."]},{"number":4728,"title":"Chapter 4728 Emperor Zhen Wuyang","paragraphs":["4728 Emperor Zhen Wuyang","Each of them was surrounded by a bright light, and the light wheels formed by Yan power shone on the entire Heavenly Court.","This made the majestic figure in the mountain river Emperor’s robe a little sad.","However, any Yan Immortal who could come to the Heavenly Court would not be so stupid to think so.","The majestic figure that could ascend to the throne and annihilate dozens of Emperors on his own was hundreds of millions of times more terrifying than what he revealed.","Looking at the majestic Emperor who stepped into the sky, Jian Wushuang finally saw his true face.","In an instant, the atmosphere in the vast square of the giant hall was extremely tense.","The angry question was obviously from the Emperor.","The Young Emperor looked up at Emperor Wei Yi, who was standing on the clouds, and said, “Imperial Father, Prince Yan doesn’t dare.”","“Then what were you doing just now? Are you trying to stain the Heavenly Court with blood?” Another question was asked.","Immediately after, Emperor Zhen Wuyang arrived at the vast square with endless power.","“They are all your younger brothers. As the Crown Prince, not only did you not set an example, but you even lowered your status again and again. Do you really think I don’t dare to punish you?”","The Young Emperor did not say a word, and there was no fear in his lowered eyes.","At this moment, the black-robed figure known as Uncle Yu slowly came before Emperor Zhen Wuyang and said in a low voice, “Emperor, the Young Emperor has not made a big mistake yet. It is not unforgivable. You can deal with him after the banquet.”","The majestic figure glanced at the Young Emperor and then at Uncle Yu. A hint of helplessness flashed in his eyes. “Forget it. Let’s start the banquet first.”","With that, he took the lead and walked into the main hall, followed by 99 Elders with colorful lights on their backs.","“Yes,” The hundreds of Yan Immortals responded in unison.","Prince Jiu glared at Chen Qing and the rest, then strode into the main hall.","This farce finally ended with the arrival of Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","The Young Emperor looked at them deeply and then went to Jian Wushuang and the others.","He seemed to be a little tired and forced a smile. “Let’s go. The banquet is about to start.”","“Young Emperor, are you hurt anywhere?” Cheng Qing was a little worried.","He shook his head, then stepped into the hall under the guidance of the thin purple-robed man.","In the main hall, Emperor Zhen Wuyang sat on the Emperor’s throne. Beside him, the Young Emperor with a gloomy expression sat on the side.","Meanwhile, Uncle Yu stood behind the Emperor like a black statue.","In the vast hall, the Elders with light wheels of various colors on their backs sat on both sides in a row. A little lower were the Princes in white court robes.","Under the Young Emperor’s instructions, Jian Wushuang and the others sat with the six Princes, but they were clearly separated.","Sitting in the misty clouds, Jian Wushuang looked down and ignored the judgmental looks of the Princes.","Then, Chun Qiu, who was sitting beside him, said in a low voice, “Brother Jian, I really didn’t expect to be able to come to the Heavenly Court of Zhen Wuyang one day.”","“Please don’t do anything stupid.” Jian Wushuang looked at him and smiled.","Chun Qiu nodded. “Don’t worry. I know the severity of this.”","From time to time, in the midst of low-pitched conversations, goddesses who came on clouds brought out plates of delicacies and fruits.","Zhen Wuyang sat on the Emperor’s throne and looked at the heavenly court with a smile. He then let out a long sigh.","From this, Jian Wushuang learned that there had only been five banquets in the Heavenly Court since the beginning.","It was held every one Hua Year.","Jian Wushuang did not know exactly how long this one ‘Hua Year’ would be, but his initial estimate was that it was very likely to be the time to cut off ten silver rivers...","Time had long been the most meaningless thing here. After becoming a Yan Immortal, one’s lifespan was endless. Other than the destruction of external forces, most things would have little effect on Yan Immortals.","After all, the creation of the Great Daos and the ultimate order in a world could very likely have been the work of a certain Yan Immortal.","The Elders who carried light wheels of different colors were so powerful that even Chen Qing was afraid of them. They were the first Elders who helped Zhen Wuyang to open up the Heavenly Couort and become Emperors. They were deeply trusted by Zhen Wuyang and even the six Princes were not as important as them.","It was an honor to be able to attend a banquet in the Heavenly Court. Therefore, even an unremarkable Yan Immortal was a respected existence in the Heavenly Domain controlled by the Zhen Wuyang.","As the table in front of him was gradually piled with precious fruits, the beautiful Fairies also overwhelmed him.","Chen Qing, who was sitting beside Jian Wushuang, fixed his bright eyes on one of the Fairies.","“Fairy Guang, it’s me, it’s me, don’t you remember me? I’m Cheng Qing, the one who controls Jingchuan. We talked about it in the wind platform last time.”","Cheng Qing’s eyes lit up as he chatted with the Fairy who was bending over to pour wine.","The Fairy pursed her lips and smiled. “I don’t remember.”","“It doesn’t matter if you remember or not. After the banquet is over, I’ll still be waiting for you at the wind platform. How about it?” Cheng Qing grinned.","The Fairy smiled and did not answer. She took the jade pot and left.","“There’s a chance!” Cheng Qing exclaimed in a low voice, extremely excited.","Jian Wushuang, who had heard the whole story, smiled, picked up the cup of wine, and sipped it.","As these Fairies retreated, nearly 30 more Fairies rode on clouds and arrived. In the center of the hall, they danced, and the sleeves formed by Yan power set off their graceful figures, looking extremely beautiful.","“Brother Jian, I can see that you’re not that old. Do you have someone in your heart? if not, this elder brother can help you matchmake?” Cheng Qing walked over with a glass of wine, a mysterious smile on his face.","“Don’t. You should worry about your own problems first. My heart already belongs to someone, and I will never forget it,” Jian Wushuang replied firmly.","When Cheng Qing heard this, he nodded, “Brother Jian’s Dao Heart is firm. No wonder you could reach the Yan Immortal realm with such a heart.”","He did not answer. Looking at the dancing Fairy in front of him and the slightly noisy surroundings, Jian Wushuang actually sat down.","Chen Qing did not know whether to laugh or cry. After having a drink with Chun Qiu, he began to appreciate the dance.","Zhen Wuyang sat on the throne and looked at the Young Emperor from time to time, as if he wanted to say something to ease the atmosphere, but the Young Emperor did not seem to feel it at all. He just kept drinking wine.","In the end, Zhen Wuyang could not help but lean forward and ask in a low voice, “Yan’er, how have you been all these years?”","“Imperial Father, I’m doing pretty well,” the Young Emperor said calmly and then said nothing else.","“Isn’t the Six Heavens too far away? After this banquet is over, you can come and stay by my side,” Zhen Wuyang looked at him and asked."]},{"number":4729,"title":"Chapter 4729 Chen Qing’s Mischief","paragraphs":["4729 Chen Qing’s Mischief","The Young Emperor’s lips curled into a sinister smile. “I think I’d better not. I’m in the Six Heavens Realm, and some Yan Immortals are eager for me to die. If I stay with Imperial Father, I’m afraid it will be even more chaotic.”","Hearing this, Zhen Wuyang frowned. Then, he looked around the hall with an oppressive and majestic gaze. Eventually, he stopped in front of the six Princes.","“Yan’er, do you have any evidence?”","“Evidence? Most of them are dead,” the Young Emperor said. Then, he held the jade pot and drank directly from the mouth of the pot.","A trace of gloominess flashed across Prince Jiu’s eyes as he looked at the Young Emperor who was sitting on the side of the head in such a frivolous manner. However, he concealed it immediately.","He could not understand why his Imperial Father had chosen such a useless person who could not cultivate to be the Crown Prince and was so biased towards him.","A large amount of resources had pushed him from a good-for-nothing to a Yan Immortal. Almost every drop of blood in his meridians was made from the best resources in the Heavenly Domain!","Since his Imperial Father was unwilling to do it, he would do it on his behalf. The death of a piece of trash was ten thousand times better than the death of the entire Great Si Region!","At that time, even the Imperial Father would understand him.","A cruel sneer unconsciously appeared on his face, but he was met with the Young Emperor’s gaze. Shocked, Prince Jiu quickly put away his expression and pretended to drink.","The Young Emperor retracted his disdainful gaze and unconsciously looked at the only person who was acting alone.","In the Heavenly Court, where Fairy music was heard and goddesses were dancing, this guy actually closed his eyes and meditated. He was really unique.","“What a strange guy. Is he not interested at all?”","With this in mind, the Young Emperor flicked a touch of Yan power on Cheng Qing’s body, then pouted slightly.","Chen Qing understood and elbowed Jian Wushuang, “Brother Jian, please wake up. I have something good to show you.”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and looked at Chen Qing helplessly.","Cheng Qing laughed in a low voice. He then opened his mouth and breathed out a mouthful of Yan power towards the Fairies who were close at hand.","Yan power turned into a strange wind and rose from the ground without any warning. It directly blew the skirts of the Fairies up.","For a time, a beautiful scene lit up.","“Ah!”","The Fairy maidens cried out in alarm and were already in a mess, each of them hurriedly holding onto the hem of their skirts that had been blown up by the strange wind.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was speechless. He shook his head and said, “Brother Chen, stop joking.”","Chen Qing scratched his head. Before he could speak again, Prince Jiu, who had already sensed it, suddenly slammed the table and shouted in anger, “Chen Qing, How dare you!”","The Heavenly Court was dead silent. After Prince Jiu finished shouting, he immediately turned to Emperor Zhen Wuyang and said solemnly, “Imperial Father, Chen Qing has openly wreaked havoc in the Heavenly Court. He has no respect for the law and clearly does not respect you. He deserves to be executed for his crime!”","“It’s not me, I didn’t. No one saw where this evil wind came from, so how can you be so sure that it was me? It’s clearly a trap!” Cheng Qing stood up and said angrily.","Zhen Wuyang shook his head helplessly. Then, he waved his hand and said, “Cheng Qing, get out. Without my summons, you are not allowed to return to the Heavenly Court.”","“Yes,” Chen Qing agreed dejectedly. However, when he turned around, he raised his brows and glanced at Prince Jiu.","After this little episode, the Fairies who were forced to reveal their true colors no longer had the face to dance. They all covered their faces and ran out of the Heavenly Court.","The first half of the banquet ended hastily.","Then, Zhen Wuyang’s lengthy speech was heard.","Since he could not meditate again, Jian Wushuang decided to observe each of the Yan Immortals.","The Elders with light wheels of various colors, who were the Elders who had followed Emperor Zhen Wuyang in battle, were the first echelon. They had an extremely deep Yan power and an unfathomable realm that even Chen Qing could not compare to.","Jian Wushuang could vaguely guess that they might have already taken that step and reached another unknown and mysterious realm.","As for the second group, it was a group of Yan Immortals, with Chen Qing being the best. They were at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage, but they were unable to break through.","Jian Wushuang was in the middle of the second and third group. After all, ordinary Yan Immortals, even four or five Yan Immortals, could not cause him any effective damage.","Even if he were to fight with Chen Qing, Jian Wushuang was confident that he would be able to retreat safely even if he was no match for him.","What would be above the peak of the Yan Immortal stage?","Old Master, what kind of existence was he?","And what role did his Master play?","No one could give him an answer. He could only get closer and closer to everything.","As Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s emotional speech came to an end, a piece of news was transmitted to every Yan Immortal’s ears along with Yan power.","“Snatch the Peach?” Jian Wushuang murmured softly and then looked at Emperor Zhen Wuyang in confusion.","A green jade immortal Peach enshrouded in a myriad of beauty appeared in the Emperor’s hand.","“Everyone, just like before, this Peach contains the opportunity of the Great Dao. It is the most indispensable part to break through to the Yan Immortal cultivation realm. If you can get it, it will be of great benefit.”","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals could not suppress their joy.","The most important part of the feast, the fight for the Peach, had finally begun.","Those who were able to attend this banquet were all the most powerful Yan Immortals in the Heavenly Domain. Ordinary Supreme Treasures started to pale in terms of utility.","Only things related to breaking through Wang Mi could he attract them.","This Peach contained a great opportunity for a breakthrough. Once obtained, it was basically one step out of the cultivation realm of Yan immortal!","However, there was only one Immortal Peach, and there were more than 300 Yan Immortals participating. The competition would be intense.","And the Yan Immortals who were likely to be the runners were still eager to try. After all, even if they failed, the Emperor would still reward them handsomely.","The hot topic of fighting for the Peaches had always been the sixth son of Emperor Zhen Wuyang. Just Prince Jiu alone had won two immortal Peaches.","This time, he was also sure to win.","As for the Young Emperor, he had never participated in the battle for the Peaches.","“The Immortal Peach will land in one year. The person who can last ten days will be the final winner,” Zhen Wuyang stated the rules, and with a flip of his palm, the fruit that was enshrouded in the brilliance of the Great Dao fell through the palace of the Heavenly Court and landed on the entire land of the Heavenly Court.","“Everyone, please begin,” Emperor Zhen Wuyang said with a smile.","Due to the rules, other than the few Elders, all Yan Immortals can participate. However, the six Princes can only bring one Yan Immortal into the arena.","Prince Jiu took the lead to ask for the order. Behind him stood a white-robed Yan Immortal, who was also his companion who had taken care of him since he was young.","Following Prince Jiu’s request, Prince Yu, Prince Qian, and the others also joined in the battle for the Peach."]},{"number":4730,"title":"Chapter 4730 The Seven Sons Fighting for the Peach","paragraphs":["4730 The Seven Sons Fighting for the Peach","The six Princes were all on the move. Although they all had friendly smiles on their faces, there was already an undercurrent.","This was the best time to show off. It was directly related to their position in the hearts of Emperor Zhen Wuyang and the 100 Elders.","In the past few fights for the Peach, Prince Jiu had become an existence that stood above everyone else. Even the Elders had taken a liking to him and had the intention of replacing the Young Emperor.","Therefore, all the Princes tried their best to push their cultivation to the peak. After all, they could only get more attention by reaching the end.","Just as all the Yan Immortals finished their preparations and were heading down to the Heavenly Realm, a calm voice rang out in the Heavenly Court. “Imperial Father, I’ll participate in the battle for the Peach this time.”","The Zhen Wuyang and all the Yan Immortals in the Heavenly Court were stunned for a moment, and then they all looked at him.","The Young Emperor stood up slowly and glanced at the group of Yan Immortals.","“Yan’er, Are you sure?” Zhen Wuyang also stood up, and there was a hint of joy in his eyes.","“I’ve never participated in it before, which is why some people have ignored my existence. This time, I just want them to know what’s important and what’s not.” The Young Emperor’s voice was low and majestic as he looked at the Yan Immortals below him without hesitation.","The six Princes looked at each other at the same time, and their expressions were completely different.","Prince Jiu did not speak, but his hands were tightly clenched under his sleeves.","“Good. Yan’er, it’s been a long time since I’ve seen your cultivation level. Today is a good opportunity for me to take a look.” Zhen Wuyang laughed heartily. At the same time, he waved his sleeve and said, “Someone, tell Cheng Qing to get his ass in here. Tell him to accompany Yan’er to the event.”","“No need, Imperial Father. I don’t need Cheng Qing this time,” the Young Emperor said and looked at Jian Wushuang.","Their eyes met. He said, “Brother Jian, can you come with me?”","All the Yan Immortals looked at Jian Wushuang again.","Zhen Wuyang also looked at Jian Wushuang. The divine consciousness of an Emperor was beyond imagination and could easily see through everything he wanted to know.","Soon, he was a little confused. This kid was only in the Yan Immortal stage. Other than his amazing talent, his physique seemed to be a little unique. Even he could not see through him.","At the same time, he had an indescribable feeling. Even though this youth’s Yan Immortal realm was not that profound, he looked extremely comfortable, as if there was some unknown level of connection.","Zhen Wuyang retracted his divine consciousness and nodded. “Go, Yan’er.”","To the silent and shady Eldest Prince who never liked to reveal his talents, once he had decided on something, even as an Emperor, it was difficult for him to change his mind.","The Young Emperor suddenly came in front of Jian Wushuang and said, “Let’s go. It seems that they can’t wait any longer.”","Without much hesitation, Jian Wushuang nodded and walked out of the Heavenly Court.","The skinny purple-robed man suddenly grabbed Jian Wushuang’s arm. He seemed to want to say something to Jian Wushuang with his cloudy eyes, but in the end, he only said in a low voice, “I’ll leave the Young Emperor to you.”","The Young Emperor walked forward and patted the thin purple-robed man’s shoulder before walking out of the Heavenly Court with Jian Wushuang.","The flowing clouds swirled, and the power was vast.","Standing outside the Heavenly Court, all the Yan Immortals scattered down. The six Princes also brought their respective companions and descended to the Heavenly Realm.","The fight for the Peach, which involved over 300 Yan Immortals, began.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang, who was sitting in the Heavenly Court, waved his hand, and an ethereal picture scroll formed by Yan power was reflected in the hall.","The scene within the scroll was the brilliant Heavenly Realm.","“Everyone, guess who will be the winner of this battle for the Peach?” Zhen Wuyang asked.","“It should be Second Prince.” A long-bearded old man stroked his beard and laughed.","Another black-robed Elder retorted, “The Fourth Prince is not weak either.”","“The Third Prince is the one who might be able to take the Immortal Peach. If I’m not wrong, he has a basic understanding of the immortal style.”","The hundreds of Elders in the Heavenly Court all expressed their opinions, but they all pointed to the Second, Third, and Fourth Princes.","Zhen Wuyang seemed to have another answer. He looked at Uncle Yu, who was standing next to him like a statue, and said, “Yu Chang, what do you think?”","Uncle Yu raised his head and looked at the sky with his dark and deep eyes, as if he could see through the clouds.","“The little guy beside the Young Emperor is not ordinary.”","“So you also think that he’ll win the Immortal Peach this time?”","“The Young Emperor is a calm and composed person. He won’t do anything he’s not confident in. Once he makes a move, everything will be set in stone.”","After hearing what Uncle Yu said, Zhen Wuyang stopped talking. Together with the other Elders, they carefully looked at the painting.","Among the vast clouds, two black-robed figures dressed as Rangers sat upright in the clouds. They did not seem to be in a hurry to fight for the Immortal Peach, but rather seemed to be traveling.","The Heavenly Realm that carried the entire Heavenly Court was completely formed by rivers and rivers, and it was quite mysterious and vast.","“How confident do you think we are to make it to the end of this?” The Young Emperor shouted on the empty flowing cloud as if he was afraid that Jian Wushuang could not hear him.","Jian Wushuang replied, “I don’t know. I’ll try my best.”","“Then what if my brothers come to kill us again?”","“That’s easy. We’ll just kill our way back. But I think they’ll be more restrained in the Heavenly Court. At most, they’ll just do some small tricks.”","“No matter what, I’m going to get the Immortal Peach this time. There can’t be a single mistake.”","“You’re so confident? I can feel that your disciples have a deep resentment towards you. Perhaps they will join forces to surround you.”","“What, are you scared?” The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and asked.","“Of course I’m scared. I’ve been dragged into this for no reason. I still want to live for a few more years,” Jian Wushuang said leisurely as he lay in the clouds.","The Young Emperor pouted. “Those who can become Yan Immortals don’t care about longevity. You, an old monster who has lived for God knows how many years, are also so attached to Immortality?”","Jian Wushuang felt very helpless. It had been less than ten million years since he started cultivating, but now he was called an old monster, which added to his old age for no reason.","Moreover, he could not explain it as there were too many implications. It was extremely likely that he would cause unnecessary trouble because of a slip of the tongue.","Even the Yan Immortals of the great Yan domain would find it hard to imagine a Yan Immortal with a lifespan of only a few million years.","After some perfunctory talk, the Young Emperor pulled the two of them into the Heavenly Realm.","In the roaring and surging water, two figures were moving forward.","A Yan Immortal who was also participating in the fight for the Peach passed by. He only glanced at them and quickly dodged.","Until the very last moment, none of the Yan Immortals were willing to fight with the Princes of Emperor Zhen Wuyang."]},{"number":4731,"title":"Chapter 4731 A Slight Display of Cooking Skills","paragraphs":["4731 A Slight Display of Cooking Skills","After all, other than the Young Emperor whose strength was not announced, the other six had once fought to a draw with three Yan Immortals.","In addition, each Prince could also bring along a companion with a profound cultivation base, which could basically eliminate any single Yan Immortal.","Of course, ‘erase’ did not mean killing directly, but teleporting out of the game.","In the end, only the Princes were left to fight for the Peaches.","Even so, the Yan Immortals who were able to participate in the Heavenly Court’s banquet were still in a rush for it.","Although it was impossible to obtain Immortal Peaches, there were countless opportunities in the Heavenly Realm of the Heavenly Court. If he could obtain even a trace of Immortal Enlightenment somewhere, it would be a great transformation!","Therefore, apart from the few Princes, most of the people who participated in the Peach fight were after the supreme opportunity.","The huge river stood for eternity, and the vegetation was lush.","Every blade of grass, every tree, every mountain, and every river in the Heavenly Realm already had the fate of a living being. As they shuttled through it, the Yan power in their bodies was sublimating at a subtle speed.","At the same time, there were also Immortal spirits that inherited the fate of the Heavenly Dao, which were very unfriendly to these intruders.","Unfortunately, when Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor were preparing to cross the river on a reed booaoot, an unknown Immortal spirit at the bottom of the water raised a huge wave and threw them into the water.","Fortunately, the Immortal spirit in the water did not have any evil intentions. After teasing them for a while, it disappeared.","“Damn it, it’s really impossible to guard against things like this!” Jian Wushuang, who had reached the shore in a sorry state, fell on his back.","After the previous big voyage, he developed some resistance to water. He was afraid of encountering the giant Sea Sky Octopus again, an unknown and terrifying creature.","The Young Emperor’s performance was not much better than Jian Wushuang’S. He was also panting slightly and looked helpless.","“Since the water route is not easy to take, then let’s take the mountain route. One year seems sufficient, but in this vast Heavenly Realm, it is not enough,” Jian Wushuang analyzed and looked at the wild forest.","The Young Emperor nodded. “Up to you.”","However, just as the two were about to plan the route, an Immortal Spirit that looked like a giant ape but had a dragon’s head quietly poked out its huge head from the forest in front of them.","The black hole-like nostrils spewed out turbid breath, which was far more violent than a hurricane.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor looked at each other and saw a touch of bitterness in each other’s eyes.","...","Boom!","A Yan Immortal was defeated with a single palm strike. At this moment, the space between Prince Jiu’s handsome brows was filled with gloominess.","Behind him, dozens of Yan Immortals had gathered.","A moment later, Prince Jiu said in a low voice, “Go and check in groups. Try not to cause a big conflict with the Yan Immortal who is following Prince Yan. However, if you can eliminate them directly, don’t hold back.”","The dozens of Yan Immortals agreed at the same time and scattered all over the Heavenly Realm.","“Do you think Prince Yan will get the Immortal Peach this time?”","The white-robed Yan Immortal revealed a strange smile. “Second Young Master, you must be joking. Do you think a weak and sick Young Emperor can achieve anything?”","The Prince furrowed his brows and said in a deep voice, “My Friend, watch your words and actions. You’d better keep the fact that Prince Yan is sick to yourself. Otherwise, if my Imperial Father finds out, I’ll be implicated too.”","“Yes, Second Young Master,” the white-robed Yan Immortal lowered his head and admitted his mistake. “In other words, he is no match for you.”","Prince Jiu did not speak, but his brows slowly relaxed.","“That’s right, if it wasn’t for Imperial Father’s protection, this shameful guy would have died before he was even born.”","With the True Blood and fate energy of an Emperor flowing in their bodies, whether it was in terms of the level of life or the perception of the Great Dao, they were far superior to the top cultivators of the same realm. This advantage was even more obvious after entering the realm of the Yan Immortal.","However, there was a special case among the seven of them, and that special case was Prince Yan.","As the eldest son of an Emperor, his life force and physique had been extremely weak since birth, and he almost died. He was also accompanied by all kinds of illnesses and could not cultivate at all.","This was simply a humiliation. As the person who controlled the Great Dao and created the Heavenly Court with the bloodline of an Emperor, he had actually suffered from such an unimaginable illness.","He really could not figure out how his Imperial Father, who had a domineering mind, could have a bloodline that was sick and sick.","Not even a single treasure in the Heavenly Realm could cure him. It was like some kind of curse that accompanied him until his death.","The Young Emperor who was sick became the exclusive property of Emperor Zhen Wuyang. Other than the six Princes and their companions, no one else knew about it.","“How can a guy who spits out blood from the slightest bit of strenuous exercise be worthy of competing with me?”","A glint of pleasure appeared in the depths of Prince Jiu’s eyes. He thought to himself, ‘Since I can’t stop you from coming to the Heavenly Court, I’ll stomp you under my feet ruthlessly in front of Imperial Father and the others this time!’","...","“What’s the approximate location of the Immortal Peach?”","“Second Prince, there is a special fluctuation in the direction of Jiao Province. Fourth Prince and Fifth Prince are likely to be there.”","“Go to Jiao Jiao Province and spread the news that all the Yan Immortals along the way must kill Prince Yan!”","...","“Ang!”","A deafening roar reverberated through the forest, and at the same time, the ancient trees began to collapse.","An extremely huge monster ape ran through the forest, its strong body easily crushing the giant trees in its way.","Upon closer inspection, two figures dressed like Rangers were lying on the monster ape’s broad silver-furred back, seemingly satisfied.","Jian Wushuang burped and gave the Young Emperor a thumbs up.","Just a moment ago, a fish the size of a small mountain had entered the stomach of the two of them and the monster.","What Jian Wushuang did not expect was that this Prince, who always had a gloomy face and looked like someone owed him cash, was actually an expert at roasting fish.","With just a piece of rock salt and a pile of towering trees, a delicious grilled fish was simply roasted.","Jian Wushuang had long given up on food.","The reason why he wanted to grill the fish was that when he was fighting with the monster ape under him, a fish Immortal with intelligence floated up from the water to join in the fun. Coincidentally, a stray sword strike from Jian Wushuang accidentally hit it and sent it to heaven.","Adhering to the principle of not wasting anything, Jian Wushuang reluctantly took it out of the water and prepared to sacrifice it.","The Young Emperor took over and grilled the fish to delicious perfection.","“You ate my grilled fish, so you have to help me get the Immortal Peach.” The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and looked at Jian Wushuang, who was satisfied."]},{"number":4732,"title":"Chapter 4732 The First Battle in the Heavenly Realm","paragraphs":["4732 The First Battle in the Heavenly Realm","Jian Wushuang patted the monster’s broad hairy back helplessly, “Can I say no? More than half of the fish went into this guy’s stomach.”","“No, you didn’t eat any less than this big guy. You should put in more effort when it comes to snatching the Peach,” the Young Emperor said seriously.","“It’s tough to put food on the table,” Jian Wushuang said leisurely, which was considered an agreement.","After that, the two humans and one beast continued to travel leisurely through the Heavenly Realm.","At this moment, the Elders in the Heavenly Court who were watching the scene in the Heavenly Realm all had strange expressions. Even Zhen Wuyang, who was on the Emperor’s throne, twitched his mouth.","What was originally an extremely tense fight for the Peach had suddenly turned into a road to survival for the two of them?","‘My Heaven Hanging Wood... This kid just lit it up to be used as fire to roast fish.” Zhen Wuyang’s heart was bleeding. The Heaven Hanging Wood was the top raw material for the creation of the Heavenly Court, and it could not grow in the Heavenly Realm without the fate energy of an Emperor.","And now, the Heaven Hanging Trees growing in the Heavenly Realm were all cleared by the Young Emperor and burned to the ground just to roast fish...","However, when he saw that the Young Emperor’s face was no longer gloomy, Emperor Zhen Wuyang suppressed his complaints and began to look at the two-person group with interest.","“Young Emperor, is he not taking this seriously?” In the Heavenly Court, some of the Elders could not help but discuss in low voices.","“I can’t say for sure. From the looks of it, the Young Emperor doesn’t seem to want to fight for the Immortal Peach.”","“In my opinion, the Young Emperor’s actions are a wise one. It shows your brother’s demeanor and humility.”","“If you keep talking, I’ll punish you to go to the Heavenly Realm and look after the Heaven Hanging Wood for me!”","The Heavenly Court was silent.","Sitting on the monster ape’s back, Jian Wushuang looked at the chain iron plate on the monster ape’s neck with a strange expression. “What is that chain iron plate of yours? It can even imprison a Yan Immortal?”","The Young Emperor nodded, “That’s right. Unless you can take that step, none of the Yan Immortals will be able to escape my control.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang felt awkward. If it was not for the imprisoning chains, he would not have been a prisoner for a few days.","The Young Emperor seemed to have noticed the knot in his heart and said, “This is a Supreme Treasure in my Imperial Father’s hands. It’s called the Sky-Devouring Lock. My Imperial Father gave it to me when I took over the Six Heavens Realm. Also, it wasn’t me who trapped you at that time. It was those blind little bastards.”","Jian Wushuang did not take what happened to heart. After all, he had been a prisoner for less than a day and he had eliminated a Yan Immortal without suffering a great loss.","However, he was curious about where he was caught.","Before Jian Wushuang could open his mouth to ask, an indescribable sense of life-and-death crisis burst forth from his divine sense.","Without thinking, he released Yan power and patted the monster ape’s head.","The monster ape understood tacitly. Its huge body suddenly stopped and then lay on the ground.","A total of more than ten rays of majestic Yan power swept over from all directions, almost brushing past Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor’s heads.","A large area of the forest was cut in half, and a terrifying power exploded.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor stood in the air with cold faces.","If he had been hit by the attack just now, he would have been seriously injured and eliminated on the spot.","Then, 11 powerful Yan Immortals appeared and looked at the two of them with strange expressions.","“A bunch of trash, you dare to hurt me in the Heavenly Realm?” The Young Emperor’s face was dark and his eyes were dark. If it was not for Jian Wushuang, he would have been severely injured even if he did not get eliminated.","The leader was a Yan Immortal, the one who had previously talked big outside the Heavenly Gate, Fujie. At this moment, he was holding a horsetail whisk in his hand, looking like an Immortal.","He did not care about the Young Emperor’s insults. Instead, he smiled and said, “I’m sorry for offending you, but I had no choice. I hope you can quit voluntarily so that we don’t have to fight.”","The Young Emperor’s eyes were cold. “Did the Prince send you here?”","Fu Jie did not speak. Instead, he flicked his horsetail whisk and said softly, “Young Emperor, please withdraw now to avoid a big fight.”","“Bastard, you’re looking for death!” he roared in anger. Not only did he not back off when facing the 11 Yan Immortals, he even attacked them!","A thin and long flexible sword stirred the wind and clouds, bringing with it a supreme power that pressed down on Fujie.","A look of disbelief flashed in Fujie’s eyes. He then laughed coldly and the horsetail whisk in his hand covered the sky, “Everyone, attack.”","The horsetail whisk expanded a million feet in the wind and descended with a bearing as it swept away.","At the same time, the other 10 Yan Immortals moved as well, and a vast amount of Yan power smashed toward the Young Emperor.","He would try his best to make him withdraw from the battle with one strike!","However, in the next moment, an extremely sharp Sword Intent, caught in the wind, suddenly slashed forward like a cloth being torn.","The horsetail whisk that was about to cover the sky was directly cut into two by this Sword Intent that had quietly risen!","The Young Emperor also stabbed out from the crack!","The terror of life and death surged into his heart. Fu Jie subconsciously tilted his head to the side and barely dodged the unparalleled Sword Intent.","A drop of dark red Immortal blood rolled down from the slender cut on his neck, soaking his white robe on his shoulder.","Fujie recovered from his shock and looked at the Young Emperor with eyes full of hatred.","“Don’t hold back, attack with all your might!” he shouted loudly and immediately controlled the horsetail whisk in his hand, which had been cut off by an inch, to attack.","The Young Emperor stood where he was fearlessly. A Dark Domain with him as the center spread out like vines.","Fujie, whose mind was clouded by hatred, did not notice the slight change in the air around him. He spread his halberd and was about to smash it at him.","However, the air around him seemed to have become muddy, and he felt that the release of Yan power in his body had slowed down.","The other Yan Immortals had the same feeling.","Time seemed to have stretched on for a very long time. Fujie felt that he had been gliding in the air for a very long time, but he had yet to land.","The Young Emperor’s gloomy face gradually enlarged, and at the same time, a figure holding a broken sword slowly appeared. His cold eyes were exactly the same.","“No, why are there two Young Emperors?!”","What responded to him was a Sword Intent that was almost terrifying to the extreme.","Each of the multi-colored swords reflected a seven-colored radiance in the air. The brilliant rainbow shadows connected with each other and carried an endless killing intent as they all slashed toward Fujie.","The Yan Immortal’s body exploded in an instant.","With just one sword move, a Yan Immortal’s body was cut in half!","Fujie’s Immortal body shattered and turned into dust. At the same time, a pill-sized Immortal Source escaped from it and fled in a panic.","The Young Emperor clenched his fist from a distance, and the surrounding space rippled. It was like an invisible hand that directly took the Immortal Source back."]},{"number":4733,"title":"Chapter 4733 The Heavenly Court Must Not Be Stained With Blood","paragraphs":["4733 The Heavenly Court Must Not Be Stained With Blood","It was as if a heart was beating vigorously. Fujie’s extremely frightened voice rang out from the celestial source.","“Young Emperor, it’s all my fault, it’s all my fault. I won’t target you anymore. Let me go. I quit voluntarily.”","The Young Emperor looked calm. “Tell me, who sent you to kill me?”","Fujie’s Immortal Source was silent for a moment, as if it was struggling. In the end, it said with difficulty, “It’s... It’s Second Young Master...”","He was not surprised to hear this answer, and there was not even the slightest ripple in his eyes.","“Young Emperor, this, this is the Heavenly Realm, you can’t...”","Before he could even finish his sentence, the Young Emperor had crushed his Immortal Source.","In the Heavenly Realm, he killed a Yan Immortal!","The Yan Immortals around were all shocked. They did not think that the Young Emperor would really dare to kill him!","This was the Heavenly Realm that had the Heavenly Court. One of the rules set by the Emperor was that the Heavenly Court must not be stained with blood.","But now, the Young Emperor had killed a Yan Immortal in the Heavenly Realm.","They all took a step back, fear flashing in their eyes.","Some things were destined to be irreversible once they started.","When Jian Wushuang, who was holding the broken sword, killed a Yan Immortal without any restraint, the remaining nine Yan Immortals’ fighting spirit was replaced by fear.","Then, they all scattered and fled in all directions without any backbone.","However, how could they leave so easily?","Jian Wushuang, who adhered to the principle of cutting the weeds and eliminating the roots, directly released the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent and slashed down with a majestic Star move!","It was an ordinary slash, but it seemed to sweep up the surrounding space of a million miles. It also contained the power of the stars, sealing every inch of space where the sword was pointed!","At the same time, countless beams of light that were condensed from Sword Intent rose from the ground and swept up.","This was an explosive strike. Even Yan Immortals would be helpless against this.","Three Yan Immortals could not dodge in time and were devoured on the spot, not even leaving behind a trace of Immortal Source.","The Young Emperor also moved forward like a ghost. Every time he attacked, he would directly erase a Yan Immortal’s Immortal Source!","In this short moment, six Yan Immortals were killed.","Their speed was too fast, so fast that the Emperor and the group of Elders did not even have time to attack before only two of the Yan Immortals were left.","Finally, just as Jian Wushuang’s sword was about to land, the two Yan Immortals under the sword disappeared.","Buzz...","The space rippled, and the two Yan Immortals who were scared out of their wits fell into the palace of the Heavenly Court.","Jian Wushuang could not control his strength and the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand almost threw him out.","The Young Emperor raised his head and looked at the Heavenly Court’s direction with a cold gaze.","“Prince Yan, do you know you’ve broken the law? ” A voice filled with irrepressible anger resounded in the heaven realm. It was the voice of Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","“Prince Yan doesn’t know which heavenly rule he broke. Please tell me,” the Young Emperor said coldly, unafraid.","“The Heavenly Court can not be stained with blood, but you killed Yan Immortal in the Heavenly Court. You still refuse to admit your guilt?!”","Hearing this, the Young Emperor sneered, “It’s true that I killed Yan Immortal, but this is not the Heavenly Court, but the Heavenly Realm. Which rule did I break?”","The Heavenly Realm was deathly silent. In the end, an extremely angry groan came from the direction of the Heavenly Court, and everything returned to peace.","“You bastard!” He slapped the table in front of him, and Emperor Yang’s lips trembled in anger.","All the Elders did not say a word. The scene in the Heavenly Realm just now was all seen. The performance of those two people was too shocking.","Especially the young man with the broken sword. He could easily kill a Yan Immortal of the same realm as him with ease.","It was unbelievable even to them.","“Emperor, please calm down. The Young Emperor will be more restrained in the following journey,” Uncle Yu consoled him in a low voice.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang closed his eyes and shook his head slowly.","At this moment, the two Yan Immortals that were saved knelt on the ground in fear, “Thank you, Emperor, for your kindness.”","“Where is Cheng Qing?”","“Emperor, I’m here!” A middle-aged man in green robes hurriedly ran in from outside the hall.","“Throw these two guys out. They’re never allowed to step into the Heavenly Court again!” Emperor Yang of Zhenwu placed his hand on his forehead and said without any doubt.","Cheng Qing smiled and said, “Understood.”","Then, he smiled and flew out of the Heavenly Court, one in each hand, as if he was carrying little chicks.","All the Elders looked at the scroll again with a hint of anxiety in their eyes.","The originally unsuspecting outcome had changed. It was broken by two guys who did not follow the rules at all. Everything had become interesting.","Ever since the Heavenly Domain had expanded to the extreme and Zhen Wuyang became the new emperor, these Elders had not fought a single battle. They had not even used Yan power for a long time.","Following the rules and spending days after days of lifespan seemed to have piqued his interest.","They were all filled with anticipation and curiosity.","In the Heavenly Realm, the dozen Yan Immortals who came to surround him were dealt with. Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath and put the Tarot Divine Sword back into its sheath.","“Brother Jian, you’re indeed powerful.” The Young Emperor looked at him and smiled, some color returning to his pale face.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “If it is possible, the best decision is to cut the weeds and eliminate the roots, in case there are uncontrollable changes in the future.”","The Young Emperor nodded. He realized that some of his views were surprisingly in line with Jian Wushuang’s.","In order to avoid any changes in the following journey, Jian Wushuang had already decided not to let a Yan Immortal escape when the battle started. The Young Emperor naturally also decided to kill Fujie. That was the beginning.","Jian Wushuang kicked the mountain-like monster ape on the ground. He did not know whether to laugh or cry. The monster ape had been observing the situation and had been lying on the ground and playing dead the moment the fight had started.","Sensing that the crisis was over, the big guy hurriedly got up and looked at Jian Wushuang with its dragon-like big head.","“Hey, hey, I’m your Master. You should know who you’re trying to please.” The Young Emperor pretended to be dissatisfied.","Jian Wushuang leaped onto the monster ape’s back.","Right at this moment, a rainbow-colored ripple appeared in the entire Heavenly Realm. A pillar of light that seemed to hold up the clouds reached up to the Heavens.","“The Immortal Peach has appeared!” The Young Emperor said softly.","Jian Wushuang also noticed the seven-colored light pillar and his calm heart started to tremble.","That level of Yan power was extremely special, but it seemed to fit with the shackles of some kind of opportunity. It was a great temptation to every Yan Immortal!","The appearance of the Immortal Peach also meant that an even more intense battle had begun.","The battle of the seven sons for the Peach officially began."]},{"number":4734,"title":"Chapter 4734 The Battle Between Two Princes","paragraphs":["4734 The Battle Between Two Princes","In the vast Heavenly Realm, almost at the same time as the pillar of light rose, nearly 100 figures with great momentum swept across the wilderness.","...","“Congratulations to the fourth Prince for obtaining the Immortal Peach.”","A handsome young man in a white court robe stood on the peak of a mountain with a misty mountain. He was holding a glazed Immortal Peach in his hand, which seemed to contain a great opportunity.","Behind him stood close to 20 powerful Yan Immortals.","The handsome young man was Prince Qian, Prince Yan’s fourth brother.","The Immortal Peach was constantly emitting a weak aura. Relying on his five senses, he rushed to the continent at the center of the Heavenly Realm almost immediately. He cut open the divine mountain and obtained the Immortal Peach.","A smug expression appeared on his face. This was his first time obtaining an Immortal Peach.","In the previous Peach-snatching competitions, he had never been the leader. It had always been Prince Jiu.","However, this time, the winner would probably change.","The first person to obtain the Immortal Peach was almost certain of the outcome. In fact, they only needed to hide in the following period of time.","Apart from the planned encirclement, it would be too easy to pass seven days.","However, Prince Qian did not think that victory was already in his grasp. His brothers were not easy to deal with, and they were all extremely powerful in terms of strength and influence.","It had been almost 20 days. Other than his big brother who posed no threat, the other Yan Immortals who participated in the fight for the Peach were most likely divided into different camps.","Thinking of this, he reached out and took out a wisp of energy from the Immortal Peach and handed it to a Yan Immortal beside him.","“Take this aura and leave. Go as far as you can. Find Prince Yan along the way and try to make him the target of everyone.”","The middle-aged Yan Immortal understood tacitly and used a small technique, changing the energy in his hand into the shape of an Immortal Peach.","“Don’t worry, Fourth Prince. Leave the rest to us.”","Prince Qian nodded in satisfaction. The 20 Yan Immortals behind him split into two groups. One group followed him while the other escorted the fake Immortal Peaches away.","The Immortal clouds were vast, but he did not stop. He was about to leave with the 12 Yan Immortals.","At this moment, a terrifying sense of danger suddenly surged from behind him.","“Fourth Brother, where are you going in such a hurry?”","That slightly thin figure with a pair of dark eyes slowly walked out of the forest, alone.","However, when this one figure appeared, it made all the Yan Immortals feel like they were facing a great enemy.","Prince Qian’s pupils constricted as if he had seen the last thing he wanted to face.","In this fight for the Peach, other than Prince Jiu, there were two other people that he was most afraid of.","One of them was Prince Yu, and the other was the figure in front of them, his fifth brother, Prince Mo.","There was no other reason. It was rumored that the two of them had already comprehended their own Immortal styles.","Once one comprehended the Immortal style, even if it was just a trace, it meant that one had taken the step forward. When the opportunity came, one could completely advance to the next cultivation realm.","They had thought that they would only find out after at least two or three days, but they did not expect that the most troublesome guy would come after them in less than half a day.","Prince Qian smiled stiffly. “Oh, so it’s you, Fifth Brother. Why? Did you detect the aura of the Immortal Peach? Where is it?”","Prince Mo, who was all alone, obviously did not want to say anything. He pointed at him and said in a low voice, “Fourth Brother, hand over the Immortal Peach and I’ll let you leave. It’s better than being eliminated on the spot.”","A look of disgust flashed across Prince Qian’s eyes. “Do you know how many Yan Immortals are blocking your way? I advise you to get as far away as you can, so that I won’t have to do anything later.”","“It seems like there’s no room for discussion.” Prince Mo spread his hands and sneered.","“Do it!” Following Prince Qian’s furious shout, all the Yan Immortals moved. Their vast Yan power turned into a dense net and descended on Prince Mo.","“A motley crowd.”","With Prince Mo as the center, dark blue crystals suddenly refracted in the air. Like ripples on the surface of a Lake, they started to move rhythmically.","At the same time, Prince Mo waved his hand. A long whip that was completely condensed from dark blue crystals, hundreds of feet long, fell from the ripples.","A faint sense of transcendence burst forth, shaking the heavens and earth.","The long whip stopped, and an unimaginable potential energy spread out in ripples.","Anyone who got close to it would have their divine body shattered in an instant. Then, with a flash of white light, they would leave the Heavenly Realm.","While holding the crystal whip, Prince Mo’s body seemed to be surging with a terrifying energy.","Every time the long whip was swung, it could destroy a Yan Immortal.","Every one of them was a top existence in the Heavenly Domain, yet they could not even withstand a single strike from Prince Mo.","In just a few dozen breaths, the 12 Yan Immortals were all eliminated by Prince Mo’s attack!","Cold sweat trickled down from Prince Qian’s sideburns. Everything had happened so quickly that it was too late for him to escape.","Prince Mo’s companion walked out of the darkness and blocked his way.","“Fourth Brother, hand over the Immortal Peach and I’ll let you two go,” Prince Mo said indifferently. The crystal whip in his hand was like a swimming dragon that coiled behind him.","“Fourth Prince, give it to him. As long as there’s life, there’s hope,” Prince Qian’s companion advised in a low voice.","He gritted his teeth and remained silent. If he handed over the Immortal Peach, it would be equivalent to him being eliminated. In the later stages, the winner of the Peach competition would be selected from Prince Jiu, Prince Yu, and Prince Mo.","A moment later, Prince Qian made up his mind and gritted his teeth as he threw the Immortal Peach to Prince Mo.","Looking at the Immortal Peach in his hand, which was glowing with treasure light and had overlapping rainbow shadows, Prince Mo smiled secretly and put it in his arms.","“Partner, let’s go!” Prince Qian did not have the slightest intention of stopping. He stomped on the ground and suddenly rose up.","However, in the next moment, the crystal whip that was coiled in the air shot out and struck Prince Qian and his companion.","The two of them did not even have time to make a sound before they completely disappeared.","It was as if nothing had happened. It was extremely quiet.","At this moment, there were only two figures left on this broken mountain peak.","The corners of Prince Mo’s mouth curled up into a smile, and his figure disappeared.","Everything returned to silence.","Not far away from the broken mountain peak, a monster ape was curled up under a huge cliff. Its eyes were as big as wheels, and they were filled with anxiety.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor, who were lying on the monster ape and witnessing everything, looked grave. They were obviously shocked by Prince Mo’s fierce attack."]},{"number":4735,"title":"Chapter 4735 One After Another","paragraphs":["4735 One After Another","Within ten breaths, he wiped out 12 Yan Immortals by himself. What kind of existence could do it so easily?","Even Jian Wushuang could only take a roundabout route when he was surrounded by dozens of Yan Immortals. It was almost impossible for him to do it so easily.","But that impossible scene actually happened.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor had only arrived a moment after Prince Mo had appeared, led by the monster ape.","They had wanted to take advantage of the fact that both sides had suffered heavy losses to take the Immortal Peach, but they had not expected to see such a shocking scene.","From this, he had a preliminary judgment of the non-existent Prince Mo.","“Isn’t this guy a little too strong?” Jian Wushuang looked at the Young Emperor with a grave expression.","An indecipherable look flashed across the Young Emperor’s eyes. “It seems that they’ve also been breaking through their cultivation realms.”","Just as he was about to speak, a powerful force surged from the broken mountain peak.","Then, the Prince brought over 20 Yan Immortals to this place.","Sensing the fluctuation of Yan power in the air around him that had yet to stabilize, the space between Prince Jiu’s brows furrowed deeply.","It was clear that a battle had taken place here not long ago, but he was still a step too late.","“The Immortal Peach is in Jiao Province. He shouldn’t have gone far. Go and find it,” Prince Jiu said in a deep voice.","The group of Yan Immortals behind him accepted the order and scattered across the entire Jiao Province.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor rode on the monster ape’s head and hid under the cliff. They planned to continue moving after Prince Jiu had left.","In the next moment, the monster ape, which had been holding its breath, suddenly snorted.","The tremendous force caught the two people riding on top off guard, directly sending them flying. Then, they landed right behind Prince Jiu.","Prince Jiu, who was lost in his thoughts, was suddenly startled. He turned around and saw the two people who had appeared out of nowhere. He was at a loss and on guard.","“It’s you, Prince Yan?!”","The two of them were equally confused. They did not expect to meet in such a way.","The Young Emperor calmed down quickly and looked at Prince Jiu with a calm expression. “So what if it’s me?”","As if he had thought of something, Prince Jiu began to examine the two of them. “Is the Immortal Peach in your hands?”","“So what if they it is? Do you have the qualifications to take it away?” The Young Emperor’s eyes were filled with disdain.","Prince Jiu sneered. “I still have my reservations in the Heavenly Court. But here in the Heavenly Realm, let’s settle our old and new scores together!”","“Do you think you can?” The Young Emperor’s eyes were filled with faint contempt and disdain from the beginning to the end.","As if he felt humiliated, Prince Jiu growled in a low voice. A strong force surged and stirred the forest.","At the same time, the white-robed Yan Immortal on his back naturally matched Jian Wushuang.","The four figures were about to engage in a great battle!","The monster ape was lying on the cliff, waiting for an opportunity to attack.","In the blink of an eye, Prince Jiu’s aura had risen to its peak. His cold gaze seemed as if he was going to swallow the Young Emperor whole.","Just as they were about to attack, a voice suddenly sounded.","“Eh, Big Brother, Second Brother, you guys are here too.”","The Young Emperor and Prince Jiu looked at the voice at the same time.","He saw a thin, young, and handsome young man in a white robe flying over. He had no sense of retreat at all.","“What are you doing here?” Prince Jiu was on guard as he secretly increased Yan power’s power.","The handsome young man scratched his head and said, “Of course I’m here to find the Immortal Peach. Just now, my partner said that there was a strange phenomenon in Jiao Province, so I ran over to try my luck.”","The Prince said, “Aren’t you afraid that you will be eliminated right now?”","“Uh, then I’ll take my leave first, you guys continue.” The handsome young man grinned and quickly urged his companion to leave.","With the sudden participation of this handsome young man, this inevitable battle came to a tacit end.","They all had their concerns. Now that an Immortal Peach had appeared in Jiao Province, the center of the Heavenly Realm, the other princes and Yan Immortals were also coming. If they fought until both sides were injured, they would be in a very passive position in the following fight.","With a wave of his sleeve, Prince Jiu gave the Young Emperor a cold look, then turned and left.","The entire Jiao Province seemed to have quietened down.","“There’s no time to lose. We have to hurry and find Prince Mo,” the Young Emperor turned around and said to Jian Wushuang.","He nodded and looked around. When he realized that there were no hidden traps, he waved his hand and picked up the monster ape that was still lying on the edge of the cliff.","“If you expose us again, be careful that we don’t roast you on the fire!” Jian Wushuang said in a bad mood after slapping the big guy’s head.","When the monster ape heard that, it quickly shook its huge head and looked at him as if it was trying to please him.","The two of them had originally planned to release the monster ape on their way to Jiao Province, but they had discovered that it was extremely sensitive to the aura of the Immortal Peach and great danger, so they naturally continued to bring this burden.","They sat on the monster ape’s back again and followed the path that Prince Mo had disappeared in.","“Big Brother, long time no see.”","As he was traveling through the forest, a voice suddenly rang in his ears.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat and he subconsciously looked to his side.","The handsome young man who had left earlier appeared out of nowhere and grinned at the Young Emperor.","A slender soft sword was suddenly pulled out and pointed forward. It was an inch away from piercing his neck.","The handsome young man hurriedly retreated to create a safe distance.","“Get as far away as you can. If you dare to take one more step forward, you’ll die,” the Young Emperor glanced at him coldly and said casually.","He smiled awkwardly. “Actually, Big Brother, I don’t have any ill intentions toward you. I just want to tell you that it’s best if you don’t fight with Second Brother and the others for the Immortal Peaches. Their strength and realm are only a step away from the Elders. I’m afraid you...”","The Young Emperor’s eyes were as sharp as knives as he looked at him. “Sy one more word and I’ll cut your tongue off.”","The handsome young man had no choice but to leave with his companion.","Just as he was about to leave, he suddenly turned back and said, “Don’t worry, Big Brother. No matter what, I’ll definitely help you with all my might when we get the Peach.”","After saying this, the handsome young man disappeared without a trace.","The Young Emperor looked ahead calmly as if he had not heard anything.","“This little brother is not bad. Is he your brother too?” Jian Wushuang turned his head and asked.","“The seventh son, Prince Lin.” The Young Emperor did not seem to want to mention the identities of the Princes. After revealing their identities, he fell silent.","Jian Wushuang was not too interested in it. After a simple nod, he sat in meditation on the monster ape’s back.","More than a month had passed since the battle for the Peach, and everyone knew who the Immortal Peach belonged to. The only important thing now was how to deal with these terrifying Princes and obtain the Immortal Peach."]},{"number":4736,"title":"Chapter 4736 Immortal Style","paragraphs":["4736 Immortal Style","Judging from Prince Mo’s previous performance, even Jian Wushuang was not confident that he could defeat him.","In addition, it would be far more difficult for Prince Jiu and the other Princes to seize the Immortal Peach and keep them for seven days than they had imagined.","By accident, they had captured a monster ape that was extremely sensitive to the aura of Immortal Peaches. This saved them a lot of time. They could get close to their target by sitting on the monster ape’s back.","In the following journey, Jian Wushuang and the young Emperor sent away another 20 Yan Immortals.","With the warning from Emperor Zhen Wuyang, the two of them restrained themselves and no longer focused on killing. They did not bother to block those who did not provoke them.","At the same time, just as Prince Mo, who was hiding the Immortal Peach, was about to step out of Jiao Province, a great danger descended.","When he saw nearly 30 Yan Immortals surrounding him, a young man with a similar heroic appearance to Prince Jiu also arrived.","This time, it was Prince Mo’s turn to narrow his eyes. Prince Yu.","If Jian Wushuang was here, he would definitely realize that the young man called ‘Prince Yu’ was the one who had been beaten up by the Young Emperor in the Heavenly Court.","“Fifth Brother, how have you been?” Prince Yu’s mouth twitched and he said with a fake smile.","Prince Mo did not reply. After taking a deep breath, he prepared to leave with his companion.","“Since Fifth Brother is in such a hurry to leave, then leave the Immortal Peach behind.” Prince Yu stretched out his palm slowly.","His expression changed slightly before he gritted his teeth and said, “I’ll give you the Immortal Peach, but you have to let me go!”","“Naturally, I, your Third Brother, will do as I say.”","Then, he threw a palm-sized package at Prince Yu.","Prince Yu’s eyes were filled with eagerness. He reached out and caught the package. Then he frowned.","At the same time, Prince Mo suddenly burst out with unparalleled Yan power and rushed toward the sky.","Knowing that he had been tricked, Prince Yu crushed the bag of stones in his hand. “Catch up with them!”","He had greatly underestimated the terrifying power of the 30 over Yan Immortals, but at the same time, he had overestimated himself.","It was as if all the escape routes around him were cut off before he could even escape a hundred miles.","Countless majestic Yan power connected with each other, and the power could shake the heavens. Even if he understood the foundation of the Immortal style, it was of no use.","Dark blue crystals started to appear in the air. At the same time, a long whip that was like a swimming dragon landed in Prince Mo’s hand. He was still not prepared to compromise and was making his final struggle.","“Prince Mo, has your brain been kicked by a donkey? Don’t forget what we’ve done. Now, you’re actually going to turn against me for an Immortal Peach?” Prince Yu’s eyes were dark as he growled in anger.","Prince Mo remained unmoved. “If I give you the Immortal Peach, I will definitely be eliminated. Do you think I will give it to you directly? If you want it, then come and take it yourself.”","A touch of disgust appeared in Prince Yu’s eyes. He clenched his right hand in the void, and an extremely sharp long sword appeared.","Facing Prince Yu, Prince Mo had no chance of winning at all.","He had been able to defeat Prince Qian with the help of the Immortal style he had comprehended.","One could imagine what kind of blow Prince Yu, who had been immersed in the Immortal style for a long time, would be to him.","Even so, he did not intend to give up the Immortal Peach.","The 300-meter-long whip, which looked like a dragon, attacked first. The blade of the whip, which could tear any realm, left a faint white mark in the Heavenly Realm and smashed at Prince Yu.","For the first time, the ever-successful whip met with a tough obstacle.","Facing the sword Mountain, Prince Yu directly used the almost complete Immortal movement to meet it!","The surrounding space seemed to reflect a diamond-shaped seven-colored brilliance at this moment, directly devouring and resolving Prince Mo’s swift and violent attack.","At the same time, needle-like rays of light emerged from each diamond-shaped brilliance. There were hundreds of millions of them!","The dense light came down with the sword mountain, easily breaking Prince Mo’s long whip and extinguishing his aura.","With a flash of light, he and his companion disappeared. They were out of the game.","The Immortal style contained a unique and domineering energy. When it wiped out Prince Mo easily, it also put a lot of force on Prince Yu.","He panted slightly and reached out to grab the Immortal Peach that had fallen to the ground. He did not stop for a moment as he prepared to leave.","At this moment, an abrupt yet familiar opening remark rang in Prince Yu’s ears, which made his heart sink.","“Third Brother, how have you been?” Prince Jiu floated out from the dark. There was a hint of mockery in his eyes.","Prince Yu looked at him. “You’ve been following us for a long time, haven’t you? You’ve been hiding in the dark, waiting for an opportunity?”","“That’s right, I did come here before you, but you were too impatient, so I might as well let you perform a little more.”","“Now, it’s time for me to reap the rewards.” Prince Jiu smiled and extended his palm just like he had done earlier.","“Do it!” How could Prince Yu sit still and wait for his death? He gave the order and the 30-odd Yan Immortals moved. They charged at the 10-odd Yan Immortals brought by Prince Jiu.","The most intense battle since the start of the battle for the Peach had begun.","Prince Yu took the Immortal Peach and prepared to escape as soon as the situation became chaotic.","However, what happened next made his mood drop to the bottom of the valley.","“Prince Hua?!” Prince Yu gritted his teeth and said, “Are you going to get involved too?”","The noble figure, who was called Prince Hua, raised his eyebrows. “Third Brother, I don’t want to get involved. As long as you hand over the Immortal Peach, I’ll let you go. Is that okay?”","Hearing this, Prince Yu sneered. “Prince Hua, even if the Immortal Peach falls into your hands, do you think you can take it for yourself? Do you think Prince Jiu will let you go?”","Prince Hua shrugged his shoulders. “I don’t care. The most important thing now is to take the Immortal Peach from your hand and eliminate you.”","As his voice fell, another 20 Yan Immortals appeared and joined the battle!","A force that covered the sky came down.","Prince Yu flicked his wrist, and the extremely sharp Sword Intent tore the encirclement apart.","Prince Yu was not afraid of Prince Hua, who had surrounded him. He had already mastered an Immortal style. Other than his second brother, Prince Jiu, who he could not see through, he could easily be the leader of the seven disciples.","What he was worried about was that once he entered the chaotic battle, he would lose all his advantages and might even miss the Immortal Peach.","Therefore, a chaotic battle was the last thing Prince Yu wanted to see. It was full of uncertainties.","Other than the Young Emperor Prince Yan, who had never shown his face, and the Seventh Prince, the three Princes here had already engaged in the most intense competition.","After defeating a Yan Immortal with one palm strike, Prince Yu did not care about anything else and fled the battle!"]},{"number":4737,"title":"Chapter 4737 Greed","paragraphs":["4737 Greed","A brilliant aura burst forth from his body, forcibly squeezing a gap in the battle.","Prince Yu laughed complacently as he watched Prince Jiu and Prince Hua being surrounded by dozens of Yan Immortals. Then, he stepped on the mountain rocks and flew away!","“You want to leave?” Prince Jiu’s eyes were cold. He stretched out his hand and clenched it in the air. Instantly, an unparalleled force distorted the air and blocked Prince Yu’s way.","Almost at the same time, Prince Hua jumped up. His companion blocked the attacks of more than ten Yan Immortals and sent him away.","Yan power turned into a cone and stabbed at Prince Yu’s back. If such a desperate strike hit him, he would definitely be severely injured!","However, at this critical moment, Prince Yu’s figure dimmed for a moment. The arrow-like Yan power passed through his back but did not hurt him at all.","Prince Yu turned around and smiled secretly. Then, a pair of huge crystal wings grew from his back and he flew up into the sky.","“Get lost!” Prince Jiu bellowed in rage. He slammed his palms on the ground and a crimson scroll swept across the peak of the mountain.","All the Yan Immortals felt their vision go dark, and those at the center of the red scroll were eliminated!","The peak of the mountain was now empty. Prince Jiu stood in the middle of the scroll, which was densely covered with complicated patterns. The Yan power around him had also turned into a crystal-like dark red color.","The remaining Prince Hua and more than 10 Yan Immortals all looked at Prince Jiu with unsightly expressions.","Watching helplessly as Prince Yu ran away with the Immortal Peach, Prince Jiu shifted all the hatred in his heart to Prince Hua.","Seeing the undisguised killing intent in Prince Jiu’s eyes, Prince Hua slowly stepped back. “No, Second Brother, you’d better think it through. Without me, you...”","Before he could finish his sentence, Prince Jiu’s Yan power crushed his divine body without any hesitation and eliminated him.","At this point, three Princes had been eliminated.","The only Young Emperor left was still at the edge of the battle. Now that Prince Lin had disappeared, the only one who could pose a threat to Prince Jiu was Prince Yu.","He had also comprehended an Immortal style and Prince Yu was about to take the final step. He did not want to see Prince Yu become stronger than him.","Snatching the Immortal Peach was the first step.","...","In order to avoid unnecessary trouble, he would get rid of all the Yan Immortals from the other Princes’ camps.","Jiaozhou had a vast terrain and was the peak of the Heavenly Realm. However, there was also a celestial mountain and river that were hundreds of millions of feet high. Its peak was adjacent to the Heavenly Court.","Before their eyes, a figure with dark blue wings on its back broke through the layers of flowing clouds formed by dense Yan power and headed straight for the celestial mountain and river.","It was the second day since he had the Immortal Peach. There were still five days left before the seven-day limit. As long as Prince Yu could keep ascending at such a high speed, he would most likely become the last one to seize the Peach.","At that time, he only needed to enter the celestial mountains and rivers to hide. Even if the young master wanted to find him, he would not have much time left.","Thinking of this, he smiled complacently and sped up his body as he rose up into the mountains.","In order to avoid being exposed, Prince Yu moved forward alone. He did not even bring his companions with him.","What he did was to try his best to completely hide himself in the flowing clouds.","Feeling the warm aura in his arms, Prince Yu could not resist the temptation and held the Immortal Peach in his hands again.","It seemed to contain the shackles of fate, and the purest power of derivation was surging, which was extremely attractive.","If Prince Yu did not know that there was a restrictive spell outside the Immortal Peach, he would have swallowed it on the spot.","The more he looked at it, the more he drooled. Prince Yu’s head was getting hot. He had been trapped in the Yan Immortal realm for too long, so long that he had almost forgotten the meaning of his existence.","Five days passed in the blink of an eye, but the variables that could happen were too great. If they missed this chance again, they would have to wait another Hua Year!","He could not wait any longer. He could sense that Prince Jiu was quietly brewing something.","If he was unable to improve, then what awaited him in the future would be a storm.","With this thought in mind, Prince Yu’s hesitant eyes gradually became firm. He raised his head and looked at the celestial mountain that was almost adjacent to the Heavenly Court and was hundreds of millions of feet high. An idea came to his mind.","In the next moment, the Immortal Peach was back in his arms. Then, he gathered a vast amount of Yan power in his arms.","Like a whale sucking in water, the thick Yan power in the entire Heavenly Realm rushed towards him.","Every part of the space began to reflect a magnificent light.","A power that surpassed the level of a Yan Immortal spread out, and at the same time, strands of black hair turned white.","This power should not have belonged to Prince Yu, but he had used it. The only possibility was that he had overused it.","He was drawing from the future Wang Mi realm!","However, there was only madness in Prince Yu’s eyes.","Only a power that surpassed the Yan Immortal realm could shake the holy mountain!","The next moment, Prince Yu moved. He was like an ancient God. Every step he took shook the heavens and the earth. His feet could easily tear apart mountains and rivers. Every breath he took was filled with surging Yan power.","Then, he stopped at the celestial mountain that was hundreds of millions of feet tall and was close to the Heavenly Court. He actually intended to uproot it!","He used his body to destroy the divine peak with an infinite amount of power.","The entire Heavenly Realm began to shake, and the chasms tore the earth apart.","The heavenly river surged and rolled back, and countless Immortal spirits wailed.","A rumbling sound that could reach the core of the earth rumbled and trembled, and countless fine cracks spread from the roots of the mountain.","This hundred-million-feet-tall celestial mountain was actually about to collapse!","Prince Yu, who had transformed into a giant form, had a crazy look in his eyes. He put his shoulder on the mountainside and tried his best to uproot the celestial mountain.","“What’s this kid doing?”","Sitting on the Emperor’s throne in the Heavenly Court, Zhen Wuyang frowned. “Could it be that he has strength but has nowhere to use it?”","When the other hundred Elders saw this, they were also shocked and confused.","They could not imagine why Prince Yu would do that. They could only wait and see.","It was like a contest of strength. Prince Yu hugged the celestial mountain and exerted all his strength.","The feedback from the collapse of the earth’s core indicated that the interior of the celestial mountain was beginning to crack.","Just as Prince Yu was about to be unable to withstand the force, the entire celestial mountain, which was hundreds of millions of feet tall, suddenly broke from the root.","Countless huge rocks fell, causing a series of disasters. The ground caved in and formed deep pits.","The unimaginable weight and height would make even Yan Immortals despair.","But now, it was broken by Prince Yu.","Even Zhen Wuyang was slightly surprised. He actually had such a terrifying power that could cause heavy damage to the Heavenly Realm.","At this moment, Prince Yu’s black hair had become mottled. No one knew why he did this, except for himself.","The restriction on the Immortal Peach was planted by Emperor Zhen Wuyang, and none of the Yan Immortals who participated in the battle could undo it.","However, Prince Yu knew that this Heavenly Realm and the restrictive spell on the Immortal Peach had the same origin."]},{"number":4738,"title":"Chapter 4738 Uprooting the Celestial Mountain","paragraphs":["4738 Uprooting the Celestial Mountain","Since they could not use their own power to destroy the restrictions on the Immortal Peaches, what if they used the Emperor’s power to destroy the restrictions?","This mountain was the foundation of the Heavenly Realm that Emperor Zhen Wuyang had built a long time ago.","Prince Yu wanted to use the power of an Emperor to destroy the restriction on the Immortal Peach.","He held the mountain peak with one hand and took out the Immortal Peach with a trembling hand. Then, he threw it into the abyss-like mountain root.","When the time came, he only needed to smash the mountain heavily and it would be crushed!","At the same time, the cry of a monstrous ape resounded through the heavens and the earth. In the middle of the destroyed mountains and rivers, a ten thousand feet tall giant ape nimbly shuttled back and forth. With a wave of its extremely long arms, it reached out and grabbed the Peach, which contained the shackles of a cultivation realm. It fell into the hands of the monstrous ape.","“Well done!”","At this moment, even the dark and calm Young Emperor could not help but smile.","Prince Yu, who was hugging the celestial mountain and the divine peak, saw everything clearly. When he saw the monster ape intercept the Immortal Peach in the air, he was both shocked and angry. “Bastard, How dare you!”","The monster ape raised its head and grinned in a human-like manner. Then, it twisted its huge body and disappeared into the broken mountains.","Prince Yu was furious. He hugged the celestial mountain that was hundreds of millions of feet tall and threw it at the giant ape.","This was a catastrophic moment. The entire Heavenly Realm was actually unable to bear it and began to collapse.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting on the back of the giant ape, raised his head to look at the shadow that was covering the sky. He suddenly drew the Tarot Divine Sword from his waist and stabbed the monster ape’s butt.","The monster ape cried out in pain and scuttled away at an extremely fast speed.","A million miles in an instant!","A dense fog that covered the sky rose, and the celestial mountain and peak that crashed into the ground could not withstand the huge force and broke from the mountainside.","Prince Yu seemed to have gone completely crazy. He released supreme Yan power from his palms and attacked Jian Wushuang.","The Heavenly Realm’s aura was already in chaos, and the shock waves from the impact of the mountains were so strong that even Yan Immortals could not stand still.","Almost at the same time when Prince Yu was uprooting the celestial mountain, Prince Jiu had already set off. Many powerful figures also surrounded him from all directions.","However, after such an intense attack had stopped for a moment, two figures dressed in black Rangers slowly emerged from the mountains and rivers, stepping into the sky.","Prince Yu panted heavily. Overdrawing from beyond his cultivation realm had caused irreversible damage to him, which could only be compensated by the Immortal Peach.","“Give it to me, quickly return the Immortal Peach to me,” panting heavily, Prince Yu looked at the Young Emperor and said with hatred.","Holding the Immortal Peach in his hand, the Young Emperor smiled gloomily, “You want it? Do you have the right to take it now?”","“Quickly give it to me, you piece of trash!” Prince Yu growled in anger. The constant loss of his cultivation realm scared him.","Hearing the word ‘trash’, the Young Emperor’s cold face suddenly darkened, and a slender soft sword quietly condensed in his hand.","In the next moment, he threw the Immortal Peach to Jian Wushuang and charged forward with his sword alone!","The vast Sword Intent surged and turned into an invincible sword, which was aimed at Prince Yu!","Prince Yu, who was in a fit of rage, was not afraid at all. He put his palms together and blasted out Yan power, which was as deep as hell.","The two collided and destroyed the Young Emperor’s Sword Intent.","At the same time, Prince Yu was filled with killing intent. The sky behind him began to reflect the seven-colored light.","An image form that could cause changes in the Heavenly Realm was formed, and then he faced the Young Emperor. His giant palm fell heavily.","This was an Immortal Style! Immortal Styles were profound signature moves that could only be controlled by those who had surpassed the Yan Immortal stage.","In the current situation, once it was used, it meant that a situation of life and death would unfold!","“I want you to die, you lowly piece of trash.” Prince Yu’s full-strength move seemed to be aimed at killing, as if he had released all the negative and evil thoughts that had been suppressed at the bottom of his heart.","As long as the Young Emperor could not escape, the only way was to destroy the Immortal Source.","However, the Young Emperor stood where he was, his eyes calm.","“Prince Yan, dodge!” Jian Wushuang’s voice was heard from afar.","The Young Emperor slowly raised the corner of his mouth and raised a thin arm in the face of the great power.","“I’ve never wanted to be the Big Brother of any of you, so I naturally won’t carry out the corresponding duties. Today, you want to kill me, so I’ll naturally return the favor in the same way.”","His voice was so indifferent that it was almost indifferent. There was no emotion in his eyes from the beginning to the end.","His long hair broke through the ribbon and danced in the air.","An aura of death, nothingness, and black and white mixed together spread out, like a sun without any warmth, slowly rising.","Prince Yu’s crazy eyes became clear. He could not believe it.","That aura was that of an Immortal Style!","“No, it’s impossible. How can a guy who can’t even comprehend and cultivate comprehend the Immortal Style?”","The giant palm that covered the sky collided with the black and white silent sun, triggering the most terrifying explosion.","It had already surpassed the power of the Yan Immortal realm and instantly cleared everything in sight.","The Heavenly Realm was collapsing, and the mountains and rivers were all destroyed.","The extreme light caused every Yan Immortal to cover their eyes.","Jian Wushuang was also shocked. He had a vague understanding of the Young Emperor’s condition.","The Young Emperor seemed to have some kind of hidden disease. Whether it was his realm or his divine body, he could only compete with ordinary Yan Immortals.","But now, he was able to release such a terrifying move with his weak body. Jian Wushuang was shocked and confused.","Could it be that the Young Emperor had been hiding the situation all along, and now he was showing his true strength?","When the extreme light dissipated, the two figures were still standing in the sky.","Prince Yu was in an extremely sorry state. From his heaving chest to his gray hair, it was obvious that he was an arrow at the end of its flight.","Pulling up the celestial mountain earlier had already overdrawn his cultivation realm, and he had also released an Immortal Style crazily, which had almost exhausted his derived power to the extreme.","On the other hand, the Young Emperor was not injured at all, except for a touch of red on his face.","Looking at the Young Emperor walking toward him step by step, Prince Yu stepped back unconsciously. He could not understand how his useless brother could master an Immortal Style.","“As I said, you were the one who had the intention to kill first, so I will return the favor in the same way.”","A strong killing intent shot out of the Young Emperor’s eyes. He never knew how to restrain himself, not even when he was facing the Emperor.","The sharp glints formed by Yan power condensed and blocked Prince Yu’s retreat from all directions.","Prince Yu’s face turned pale. He saw the coldness, disdain, and determination in the Young Emperor’s eyes.","“You can’t kill me. I’ll quit right now.”","However, as the thunderbolt struck, nearly a hundred giant rays of light stabbed at him without any hesitation."]},{"number":4739,"title":"Chapter 4739 Great Battle","paragraphs":["4739 Great Battle","It was impossible for Prince Yu to escape now. If this attack hit him, he would not even be eliminated, and his Immortal Source would be completely destroyed!","“Imperial Father, save me!”","With the last of his strength, Prince Yu’s panicked voice resounded through the entire Heavenly Realm.","Zhen Wuyang, who was sitting in the heaven court, could not stay calm anymore. No one knew the Young Emperor better than him. He was a lawless guy who had no fear.","If he had the intention to kill, there was almost no room for maneuver.","Just as Zhen Wuyang was about to descend with his True Shadow, the Heavenly Realm shook.","Each of the huge rays of light, which contained a terrifying killing intent, seemed to be blocked by a transparent barrier when they stabbed at Prince Yu. They could not move an inch further.","At the same time, a faint red Yan power surged up and crushed every single one of the huge rays!","The Young Emperor’s expression froze, and the soft sword in his hand began to tremble.","It was Prince Jiu who came along with the faint red glow.","He instantly stood in front of Prince Yu and looked at the Young Emperor with a complicated expression.","“Y-you...” After surviving the disaster, Prince Yu could not even speak properly.","Looking straight ahead, Prince Jiu fixed his gaze on the Young Emperor. “Prince Yan, I don’t know how you comprehended the Immortal Style, but if you want to get the Immortal Peach with just one Immortal Style, I’d advise you not to waste your energy.”","As he spoke, more than 30 Yan Immortals rushed over from all directions and surrounded the Young Emperor and Jian Wushuang.","“Prince Yan, hand over the Immortal Peach. If you back out now, I’ll spare your life,” Prince Jiu said indifferently.","“You want the Immortal Peach? Do you have the ability?” The Young Emperor smiled disdainfully.","For some reason, every time he faced the Young Emperor, the anger in Prince Jiu’s heart would surge uncontrollably. Even a single word from him would make him furious.","“Kill them where they stand!” Prince Jiu shouted angrily in a deep voice.","The 30 over Yan Immortals immediately moved. The most powerful Yan Immortals joined forces and pressed down on the two of them.","Jian Wushuang moved and released his Yan power without any reservation.","At the same time, he used the Ancestral Skill, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate!","With the support of the Yan power of the Yan Immortal realm, this Ancestral Skill had completely transformed.","As the giant finger pressed down, the net formed by the 30 Yan Immortals could not press down and was stuck.","The Young Emperor raised his soft sword, and his Sword Intent soared into the sky.","The two combined their powers and actually broke through the attacks of the group of Yan Immortals.","Prince Jiu, who was far away from the battle, revealed a trace of surprise in his eyes. He looked at Jian Wushuang with a vigilant gaze.","The move that Jian Wushuang had released earlier had actually made Prince Jiu feel a little intimidated.","“How confident are you in winning if you fight him?” He stretched out his finger and pointed at Jian Wushuang, who was fighting.","The eyes of the white-robed man beside him focused, and then dimmed. “Less than 30 percent.”","“Is that so?” The corners of Prince Jiu’s lips curled up slowly. “No wonder Prince Yan didn’t even bring Chen Qing along. It turns out that there’s an even more unfathomable fellow by his side.”","“Young Master, let me go. I’ll definitely bring back the Immortal Peach,” the White robed Yan Immortal requested.","Prince Jiu shook his head and turned to look at Prince Yu.","Feeling nervous, Prince Yu took half a step back. His eyes were alert and nervous. In his current condition, if Prince Jiu wanted to eliminate him, it would only take a wave of his hand.","“Help me do something. Consider it as you repaying me for saving your life,” said Prince Jiu. He suddenly stuck his palm to his abdomen.","All of a sudden, a stream of pale red Yan power gushed into Prince Yu’s limbs and bones, filling up his extremely dry meridians again.","Prince Yu’s condition recovered rapidly.","“Remember how Prince Yan treated you just now? Return the favor. I’ll be waiting for your good news.” Prince Jiu patted his shoulder and retreated slowly with his companions.","How could Prince Yu not know what he was up to? But without Prince Jiu, he would have died long ago. How could he have escaped unscathed?","Even without Prince Jiu’s reminder, he would have taken his revenge and returned the terror of life and death.","Prince Yu, who had returned to his peak state, felt the uncontrollable power in his body. He took a step forward. The vast and terrifying power swept forward like a huge wave.","After sending a Yan Immortal flying with a single strike, Jian Wushuang fixed his eyes on the huge wave of Yan power that was coming at him.","The next moment, the Young Emperor appeared in front of him and blocked the wave with his back.","Boom boom boom!","The indiscriminate attacks eliminated any Yan Immortals who were not careful.","Jian Wushuang came to his senses and waved his hand to create a barrier to protect the two of them.","The Young Emperor’s face turned redder and redder after taking on most of the Yan power waves, and his black robe was torn.","Without him, Jian Wushuang would have been the one who was severely injured.","“Hold on for a while, I’ll take you away.” Looking at the Young Emperor who was about to faint, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. He immediately supported the Young Emperor’s body and prepared to escape.","He had already prepared for the worst and reached into his clothes to touch the Immortal Peach.","“Don’t, you can’t give it to me.” The Young Emperor looked up at Jian Wushuang and shook his head slowly but firmly.","“Let’s see if we can get out of here,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice as he pointed the broken Tarot Divine Sword forward.","Prince Yu walked in the air with a hideous smile. His palms gestured, as if he was pushing away clouds, and a powerful force was released.","Supporting the Young Emperor with his left arm and raising the Tarot Divine Sword with his right hand, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and used the Extinctive Sword Strike.","In such a situation, he was at the end of his rope and was struggling to survive. The most ordinary sword attack had released the most terrifying power.","This was an Extinctive Sword Strike that was a gamble. It could only release its peak power in desperate situations, and there was no upper limit.","One sword could block a million swords, breaking the surface with a single point.","Prince Yu’s all-out attack only lasted for a moment before it was shattered. Like a boiling lake, it dissipated.","“Ahem, if... if I had known that you could block such an attack, I wouldn’t have done it,” the Young Emperor said reluctantly with Jian Wushuang’s help.","His body was weak to begin with, and even if he had comprehended the Immortal style, it could not change his physique at all.","Jian Wushuang pouted his lips slightly, “I can block it now, but I might not be able to block it earlier.”","The Young Emperor smirked and looked ahead. “There’s such a huge difference in strength. I’m afraid we’re really going to lose this time.”","“What if there’s a change in the situation?” Jian Wushuang said slowly.","As if to confirm his words, in the next moment, nearly 20 magnificent rainbow shadows rose from the giant river under him, their vigorous momentum shaking the sky and earth.","At the front of these rainbow shadows, a giant monster ape roared. Its thousands of feet long body left a shocking impression on all the Yan Immortals."]},{"number":4740,"title":"Chapter 4740 Sneak Attack and Serious Injury","paragraphs":["4740 Sneak Attack and Serious Injury","If one were to look carefully, on the back of the giant ape, there was a slightly young and thin figure, who was looking at everything that was happening in the sky with excitement.","More than 20 new Yan Immortals surrounded Prince Yu and the other Yan Immortals like dumplings.","“Prince Lin?!” At this moment, the Young Emperor, Prince Yu, and Prince Jiu all shouted the same name.","It was the Seventh Prince, who he had met twice before and was the only one who had a good impression of the Young Emperor, Prince Lin.","“Big Brother, your mount is really cool! This is the first time I’ve used an immortal spirit as a mount!” Sitting on the monster ape’s back, the Seventh Prince looked at the Young Emperor and exclaimed.","The Young Emperor frowned. He did not expect this Prince to interfere at this time.","Prince Yu also looked at him in surprise and suspicion. Then, he asked in a deep voice, “What are you doing here? Are you going to fight for the Immortal Peach too?”","“Third Brother, please don’t misunderstand. I don’t have much interest in that kind of thing,” Prince Lin scratched his head and then raised his eyebrows and smiled. “I’m purely here to help Eldest Brother. You and Second Brother have gone too far.”","Prince Yu sneered and said, “Are you looking for death? Even if you join us, will you be able to change the result?”","“It’s hard to say if I’ll change, but I have to try, right?” Prince Lin said and stretched lazily on the monster ape’s back.","“Since you’re looking for death, I’ll just finish you off!” Prince Yu smiled and took the lead to attack.”","When Prince Lin saw this, he patted the monster ape’s head and fled.","Almost at the same time, a Yan Immortal who was in the same camp as Prince Lin also moved out and started fighting.","Jian Wushuang felt the pressure around him suddenly lighten and he no longer had the sense of urgency to resist.","Close to 50 Yan Immortals were engaged in a chaotic battle, and the explosion of different Yan powers was extremely beautiful.","Jian Wushuang looked at Prince Yu, who was attacking Prince Lin, and his eyes brightened.","“Be careful,” the Young Emperor reminded him in a low voice.","He nodded and placed his palm on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword. His figure disappeared like a ghost.","Just as he was about to force the Prince back with his palm, he felt a strong sense of danger, which made him turn his head subconsciously.","“Tsk tsk...”","However, it was too late. The knife had cut half an inch into his flesh, almost cutting off his entire head.","Prince Yu retreated quickly and released Yan power to protect himself.","Looking at the mysterious young man dressed like a Ranger in black, Prince Yu felt a bone-deep pain from the wound on his neck.","With a shake of his wrist, the divine blood on the Tarot Divine Sword fell off. Jian Wushuang looked at him calmly.","He waved his hand to heal the wound on his neck. The craziness in Prince Yu’s eyes disappeared. He looked back at Jian Wushuang vigilantly.","To be able to get close to him without him knowing and almost behead him with a sword strike, such a terrifying strength made Prince Yu shudder.","Without any unnecessary pleasantries, Jian Wushuang directly lifted his sword and pressed down. The broken Tarot Divine Sword was full of great power.","The sword cut down and easily broke Prince Yu’s Yan power.","He was greatly shocked, and at the same time, he used all his strength to resist.","Although the body of the sword was broken, the sword principle was still there. Each sword carried a powerful momentum, which actually forced Prince Yu to start panicking.","Each sword move was as slow as water and wide open, making it difficult for Prince Yu to respond with the corresponding Yan power.","Although there was only one sword strike each time, it split into thousands of Sword Intents, forcing him to suffer more and more.","Jian Wushuang was like a blacksmith, while Prince Yu was like an iron embryo that was constantly being hammered. During this hammering process, each of his sword strikes was becoming more and more condensed.","Prince Yu almost fainted. In such a confrontation, he was actually being used as a whetstone?","He was so humiliated that he was ready to release his immortal move to kill Jian Wushuang like a bug.","But soon, Prince Yu was horrified to find that he could not summon the Immortal Style at all in his current state...","The powerful sword slashed down and directly plowed a shocking wound on Prince Yu’s lute bone. Divine blood gushed out.","This sword almost cut him into two from the middle.","Prince Yu was terrified. He found that this Grim Reaper-like young man was much more terrifying than he had imagined.","If the Young Emperor had brought him shock and confusion, then Jian Wushuang was the symbol of coldness and death.","By the time he realized the terror of life and death, it was already too late.","Without any unnecessary words, Jian Wushuang raised the broken divine sword in his hand high, as if it was a punishment and judgment, and then he struck down the last Invincible Sword.","However, the next moment, a sudden change occurred.","A light red scroll quietly swept out, and at the same time, a light beam directly pierced through Jian Wushuang’s back.","The warm divine blood sprayed on Prince Yu’s face.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale. In the end, he did not manage to slash down.","The Tarot Divine Sword slipped from his hand and fell into the abyss.","He also lost his strength and fell from the clouds like a fallen leaf.","“Jian Wushuang! What?” The Young Emperor cried out in shock and moved to pull him back almost at the same time.","However, a faint red barrier soon appeared and blocked him.","Prince Jiu walked out of the painting and looked at him with a faint smile. “I’m really sorry. My mistake has caused such an outcome. I’m afraid he can’t even be eliminated.”","The Young Emperor’s eyes turned from cold to furious. “Prince Jiu, you will die in my hands.”","“Oh, really? However, to prevent this from happening, I will make you, the Big Brother, disappear completely before that.” Prince Jiu spoke in a tone that only the two of them could hear.","A sun without any warmth lay across the sky. The black and white mixed colors revealed a deathly silence and nothingness.","This was the Young Emperor’s Immortal Style, a mysterious Immortal Style that came from an unknown origin.","Prince Jiu’s eyes were also burning with passion. He, who was the most unpredictable and as deep as an abyss, had finally revealed his strength at this moment.","An unknown and extremely suppressed aura, which seemed to be muddled and unclear, emerged like silk and mist.","“Although I can’t kill you in the Heavenly Realm, it’s not a bad choice to be able to add a heavy blow to your weak body.”","...","“It hurts ...”","Jian Wushuang, who had lost consciousness, gradually regained consciousness as he felt the stream flowing beside him.","At this moment, half of his body was soaked in the stream, and most of his black clothes were torn.","He barely managed to support his body and fell to the ground, panting slightly.","His originally broken chest was rapidly healing. The lost Yan power and life force were also quickly recovering.","This was all thanks to Jian Wushuang’s Perfect Life Form characteristics.","As he cut off the past and achieved the Yan Immortal stage, his Perfect Life Form did not disappear. Instead, it became more and more powerful after entering the Great Yan Domain."]},{"number":4741,"title":"Chapter 4741 The Mysterious Stone Bead","paragraphs":["4741 The Mysterious Stone Bead","With his Chaos Overlord Body, he had become undying and imperishable. Even if the Celestial Source was shattered, if there was a bit of obsession left, it was enough to resurrect him.","This was truly terrifying, as it involved all sorts of complicated layers.","However, Jian Wushuang was sure that his imperishable Immortal body was definitely related to the Super Perfect Life Form.","If he did not have this kind of physique, the previous blow would have been enough to kill him.","His broken chest had completely recovered in a few breaths, but the deadly pain still made Jian Wushuang break out in cold sweat.","He propped himself up from the ground and began to look around.","This was still the Heavenly Realm’s plane, but due to the great battle, the earth at the most central position of the Heavenly Realm had already begun to fall apart.","A series of cracks as thin as a spider’s web separated the rivers and mountains, and the river bed was blocked by broken rocks.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was in a destroyed mountain stream.","Falling from the sky, he created a hole in the entire divine mountain peak. He did not expect that there would be such a dark space in the peak.","Everything was still reacting to the violent explosions. He looked at the dark red sky. He wanted to rush up to help again, but his divine body was still recovering. He could not even control Yan power right now.","Helplessly, Jian Wushuang could only wait for his divine body to recover and walk along the stream.","The stream that was formed by the dense Yan power had a nourishing effect on the dried up meridians.","The further they went, the more the dim space was gradually filled with a faint blue color.","Jian Wushuang felt uneasy.","At the same time, layers of dark blue light began to cling to the stone walls around him.","‘Could this be the place where Zhen Wuyang hides his opportunities?’ he thought.","There were nearly 400 Yan Immortals participating in this fight for the Peach, but there was only one Immortal Peach, so it was impossible to split it equally.","Thus, Zhen Wuyang had spread out countless opportunities in the Heavenly Realm for the Yan Immortals to find and comprehend.","From a certain perspective, this was a great fortune for the Yan Immortals who were able to attend the banquet in the Heavenly Court.","He walked forward with curiosity, but not long after, he came to the end of the hidden space.","As far as the eye could see, there was only a stone wall covered with vines.","However, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to leave. He continued to move forward and came to the stone wall. He stretched out his hand and pushed away the dense vines.","The stone wall revealed its true appearance. Man-made ravines connected with each other to form complicated and obscure lines.","These dried-up lines seemed to be some kind of restriction, blocking the way forward.","If it was before, Jian Wushuang might have tried to use violence to dismantle it. However, he could not even control Yan power at the moment, let alone use violence.","Somehow, he felt that there was something hidden behind the stone wall that had not been discovered.","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang looked at the stone walls on both sides behind him.","With a thought, he turned around and took the blue light that was clinging to the stone wall into his hand.","After a moment’s hesitation, Jian Wushuang pressed his palm, which was wrapped in light, against the stone wall.","In an instant, a magnificent light bloomed.","Wisps of blue light spontaneously poured into the grooves and patterns on the stone wall, quickly surging and filling the patterns.","The entire stone wall began to emit a strange light, filling up the dark space.","Buzz...","With a deep buzz, the restriction on the stone wall started to operate quietly. At the same time, a strong light lit up, which made Jian Wushuang cover his eyes subconsciously.","At the same time, a musty smell with a faint rotten smell entered his nose.","After the strong light dissipated, Jian Wushuang looked forward.","The stone wall had already disappeared, and the small world behind him came into view.","The dark blue beams did not disappear. Instead, they flew freely in the small world in front of them.","Jian Wushuang slowly stepped into it. The green stone slabs on the ground were covered with a layer of dust.","This small world seemed to be a Dao Field opened up by some powerful person.","An ancient aura that had settled over the years hit him in the face.","As soon as he stepped in, a gust of wind blew.","Then, before he could calm down, the thousands of lights in the Dao Field seemed to be excited and all rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","It was like a great river, pouring down in torrents.","Jian Wushuang did not even have time to dodge as the brilliant light wrapped him up.","“What?”","An indescribable suffocation almost made him breathless, but then a surge of Yan power was produced in his meridians.","At the same time, the shackles of his realm seemed to have loosened.","Almost at the same time, the Boyang Bowl on Jian Wushuang’s waist suddenly trembled. Then, a pellet-like thing directly squeezed out of the cork and flew out.","Whizzz...","The pellet-like object was a broken stone bead. Jian Wushuang obtained it when he killed the giant Sea Sky Octopus in the sea area.","The originally dusky surface began to quietly rotate at this moment. It was as if heaven and earth were hidden within it, and the stars were moving.","As soon as the stone bead appeared, the blue light rays that were originally surrounding Jian Wushuang began to fall off and then all rushed towards the stone bead.","Jian Wushuang stood on the spot, panting slightly as he watched the mysterious scene.","In less than ten breaths, all the blue light that filled the entire space had disappeared by the stone bead.","The surroundings sank into extreme darkness, and only the stone bead that was emitting a lustrous light was slowly turning.","It was like a blue planet with a vast and boundless aura.","Soon after, tiny stars silently floated around the stone bead, looking extremely mysterious.","These stars were connected by white threads, forming a small but vast galaxy.","Jian Wushuang looked at the stone bead in shock. The magnificent galaxy was reflected in his clear eyes.","There seemed to be a strange energy that was drawing him closer to the stone bead.","“Could it be that there’s something hidden within this stone bead?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled. He stretched out his right hand and slowly touched the galaxy on the surface of the stone bead.","In an instant, a tiny star turned into a white light and surged into his body.","Buzz...","Like ripples on water, the surface of the stone bead began to ripple.","Jian Wushuang was stunned and then looked at the stone bead in disbelief.","“One, touch the mountains and rivers...”","The star that had burrowed into his body carried an unprecedented power and was reflected back to Jian Wushuang.","In his divine sense, that energy was being nurtured.","He tried to do it again in his divine sense.","With just a finger, a grand and strict galaxy was constructed in his divine sense.","In this constructed galaxy, he became the only master."]},{"number":4742,"title":"Chapter 4742 The Ancient Secret","paragraphs":["4742 The Ancient Secret","However, in Jian Wushuang’s divine sense, the galaxy that he had constructed shattered as if nothing had happened.","This seemed to be of little value, but it was indeed a little value. It seemed that other than being vast and boundless, it had no other use.","Could it be that this comprehension that could only be formed in the spiritual awareness was only used to trigger his intracranial climax?","Soon, Jian Wushuang denied it. When the realization that this move could build galaxies appeared in his mind, it made him recall the Divine Power Universe back then.","In the Divine Power Universe, a Supreme realm being could build a Divine Kingdom, which was equivalent to an extension of his own Domain. In the Divine Kingdom he built, the enemy’s power would be greatly weakened.","And now, the galaxy that was constructed in his mind seemed to have the same effect as the construction of a Divine Kingdom.","Since it was roughly the same, could he materialize the galaxy in his mind?","As Jian Wushuang thought about it, he started to try.","His finger pointed in the air, and a star pattern fell out, which was extremely mysterious and profound.","However, just as Jian Wushuang was about to take a step further and comprehend the realization, a sigh that seemed to be tortured to the extreme interrupted his thoughts.","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang suddenly became alert. He retracted all of the Yan power that had just dissipated on the surface of his body and was ready to deal with the situation at any time.","With this sigh, the stone bead, which was originally like a small planet, returned to its previous gray appearance and rolled to Jian Wushuang’s feet.","The atmosphere was deathly still. He lowered his body, his hand already on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword, warily looking in the direction of the sound.","To be able to stay in this space without Jian Wushuang noticing at all, how terrifying was his strength?","He did not act rashly. He was thinking about how to escape.","As the sigh stopped, the space that had fallen into extreme darkness suddenly brightened up like the sun, making everything visible.","Jian Wushuang was shocked, because he just realized that there was a figure sitting cross-legged in front of him!","It was a tall and strong figure. Even though his back was facing Jian Wushuang, he still gave off an oppressive feeling.","“Why, why...”","An extremely bitter voice suddenly sounded. Then, under Jian Wushuang’s gaze, the majestic figure actually reached out his palm and patted his head.","“Why can’t I figure it out? why can’t I figure it out...”","“There must be a problem somewhere. Right, there must be a problem with my comprehension.”","In the midst of the bitter mumbling, the breathtaking figure slowly stood up, and the magnificent clothes on his body fluttered without any wind.","Then, Jian Wushuang finally saw the face of the majestic figure.","His extremely handsome face looked somewhat delicate, perhaps because he was too young. His brows were like distant mountains, and his eyes were like stars. He looked like a figure that had walked out of a painting.","At such a close distance, he ignored Jian Wushuang and was completely immersed in his own comprehension.","The terrifying pressure from the Yan power surged around him, as if a million divine mountains were pressing down.","Jian Wushuang felt extremely suffocated and the divine blood in his body flowed faster.","Such a terrifying derivative skill was beyond his knowledge. Even the aura of the three Emperor’s True Shadows could not resist it!","However, the power of this cultivation realm disappeared as the attractive figure opened his eyes.","His eyes were filled with death and pain, which made Jian Wushuang feel that he was facing some kind of bottleneck and could not break through.","“Why? I’ve already taken that step. Why can’t I sense the Emperor’s fate energy...” The eyes of the terrifying figure were listless and he started to lose his soul.","“Will it be difficult for me to become an Emperor even after this?”","Jian Wushuang was a little confused. He stood up slowly and walked toward the figure.","Surprisingly, the breathtaking figure did not look at Jian Wushuang. No matter how he waved his hand, it was of no use.","“Strange, he can’t see me. Is he not alive?” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. Then, he stretched out his palm and tried to touch him.","However, the next moment, the attractive figure suddenly raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with sharp eyes, “Who is it?”","Jian Wushuang took a few steps back and his heart almost stopped beating.","However, he soon realized that the figure was not looking at him. Instead, it bypassed him and looked at an unknown place.","Jian Wushuang looked back and did not see anyone else.","He began to understand something. He had mistakenly entered this space, and everything that had happened was most likely an image that had been sealed away for countless years.","Then, the figure seemed to be talking to someone, and a trace of pain flashed in his eyes.","“No, I can’t. I can’t make this decision.” The breathtaking figure retreated, the pain in his eyes also began to show hesitation.","However, as time passed, the pain and hesitation in his eyes gradually wavered.","This terrifying figure seemed to have reached a certain condition with an unknown object.","In the end, he reluctantly said, “Fine.”","As soon as the word fell, the entire hidden space began to shake violently, and fine cracks covered the entire green stone slab.","The space seemed to be collapsing.","Jian Wushuang did not have much time to think. He hurriedly retreated and prepared to escape.","A huge tremor resounded, and the hidden space began to fall apart. Countless gravel fell down.","Fortunately, the passage could still hold on and did not break.","Jian Wushuang ran away. Just as he was about to escape from the hidden space, he looked back.","The image in the hidden space was dying. However, just as it was about to die, the human-like image received some kind of sublimation, and a unique fate was added to it.","Boom boom boom!","The entire divine peak collapsed completely, and even the hidden space was destroyed.","Jian Wushuang stood on a mountain and looked at the broken divine peak that was still kicking up dust. He had a complicated expression.","Everything he had just experienced was like a dream. Even though it had only been a few days, it made him feel as if he had traveled to an unknown era.","Who could have left behind that scene just now?","He gently clenched his fist and realized that he had returned to his peak condition. His Yan power seemed to be able to make a breakthrough at any time.","The fierce battle in the sky was now eerily silent, but Jian Wushuang knew that the fight for the Peach was not over.","He could feel that the aura of the person who had ambushed him was still in the sky.","Since he had not died, he had to do something, such as revenge.","His feet stomped on the ground and Jian Wushuang’s figure disappeared. The entire divine peak under his feet collapsed.","“Still not giving up? Do you really want me to kill you here?”"]},{"number":4743,"title":"Chapter 4743 A Little Mountain and River","paragraphs":["4743 A Little Mountain and River","In the dark red sky, violent squalls began to wreak havoc.","In this place, there were very few Yan Immortals who could stand.","Prince Lin, who was slightly weaker, managed to stall Prince Yu at the last minute and was directly eliminated.","At this moment, there were less than ten figures still standing.","Prince Jiu’s expression was dark. His ivory-white court robe was already torn, and his long black hair was fluttering in the wind.","Standing in front of him was the Young Emperor, who was extremely weak and had divine blood in his mouth.","His palm, which was holding the soft sword, was trembling, but he was still looking at Prince Jiu with disdain and ridicule in his eyes.","“I’ll say it one last time. Give me the Immortal Peach, and disqualify yourself.” Prince Jiu’s voice grew even colder. The killing intent in his eyes was gradually unconcealed.","The Young Emperor coughed out a wisp of divine blood and said, “How many days do you think the Immortal Peach has been in my possession? It should be six days, right?”","Prince Jiu’s face turned cold. The Immortal Peach had indeed disappeared for six days. During these six days, he had several opportunities to kill the Young Emperor, but he held back because of some concerns.","This also caused time to pass quickly.","Once the Immortal Peach was in the hands of a Yan Immortal for seven days, the fight for the Peach would be over.","And this was the last day.","“You really don’t intend to hand it over to me?” Prince Jiu took a step forward, and a terrifying Yan power swept out.","The Young Emperor’s thin figure seemed to be about to fall at any moment.","However, there was no fear in his eyes at all, and the mockery in his voice became even more obvious. “Idiot, you don’t really think that the Immortal Peach is in my hands, do you?”","Prince Jiu’s eyes focused. Just as he was about to speak, a stone that was infused with Yan power hit the back of his head without any warning.","“Idiot, look here.”","A clear voice rang out. Looking over, he saw a black-robed Ranger holding an Immortal Peach in his left hand, looking at him with a faint smile.","Prince Jiu’s pupils constricted. He clearly remembered that he had killed him with one strike.","“How did you not die?”","“If I die, how can I take revenge with my own hands?” Jian Wushuang said calmly as he put the Immortal Peach into his pocket.","In the next moment, he moved abruptly and crashed fearlessly into Prince Jiu with an endless power.","Looking at the figure who had returned, the Young Emperor let out a deep breath and completely relaxed.","The most magnificent form of the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate came pressing down. The unparalleled surging force completely suppressed Prince Jiu almost at the moment of collision.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed down with great force.","One sword could block 10,000 swords. Jian Wushuang, who had recovered to his peak, made a wide range of sword moves that were full of domineering and invincible Sword Intent. For a moment, he suppressed Prince Jiu so much that he could not fight back.","Prince Jiu felt very aggrieved. At the same time, he also understood why it was difficult for Prince Yu to defeat him previously.","This Yan Immortal is not ordinary!","A stream of Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent burst forth. The terrifying Sword Intent swept up and caused Prince Jiu, who was caught off guard, to suffer a heavy blow!","With a kick, Jian Wushuang used the force to retreat ten thousand feet away from the battle.","The ivory-white court dress was completely torn, and the skin cut by thousands of sword essences oozed red divine blood.","Prince Jiu was extremely furious. The seemingly terrifying Sword Intent only tore his clothes apart and did not even cause him any serious injuries. It was an insult to him.","He could not bear it. He clenched his fist, and a pale red 10,000-mile-scroll spread out.","At the same time, a wisp of mist-like chaotic aura materialized behind Prince Jiu’s back. An unimaginable power was surging within it.","Jian Wushuang stopped looking down on him. He could feel that this move had already surpassed his current cultivation realm.","“Damned thing, since you’ve come back to die, I’ll fulfill your wish!” Prince Jiu could not suppress his violent rage as he shouted. At the same time, he stretched out his palms and suddenly put them together.","The wisp of mist-like chaotic aura rose into the air.","Jian Wushuang wanted to avoid it, but he realized that the light red scroll painting had spread to his feet. It was like some kind of restriction that trapped him firmly in place.","With two Immortal Style moves surrounding Jian Wushuang, he had no chance of survival!","A cold sneer had even appeared on Prince Jiu’s heroic face.","The wisps of chaotic aura devoured Jian Wushuang as expected.","The Young Emperor, who was watching from afar, was shocked. He had truly understood how terrifying Prince Jiu was.","If Jian Wushuang did not have an Immortal Style, it would be impossible for him to escape from his hands!","No matter how powerful Jian Wushuang was, he would not be able to escape.","“This guy definitely won’t die so easily.” The Young Emperor shook his head and looked into the distance.","There, the chaotic aura of unknown monster seemed to be devouring something.","A glint of pleasure flashed across Prince Jiu’s face. There was nothing more delightful than watching those who dared to resist him die in front of him.","Looking at the wriggling chaotic aura, he calculated that it was almost time. He waved his hand and prepared to recall it.","However, in the next moment, an extremely lofty mountain suddenly pushed away the chaotic aura.","At the same time, a waterfall descended from the sky, pouring down.","Another huge sun appeared out of thin air, shining with brilliant light.","Such a strange phenomenon actually dispelled the chaotic aura in a moment.","One had to know that that was the most difficult Immortal Style move to deal with.","Prince Jiu widened his eyes and looked at the scene in disbelief.","When the chaos aura completely dissipated, the thin and firm figure appeared again!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes reflected the boundless stars.","Between his brows, a galaxy formed by seven stars was moving rhythmically.","He pointed a finger at Prince Jiu.","The giant water formed by Yan power roared and surged forward.","At the same time, the wind, mountains, rivers, sun, and other natural scenes appeared one after another.","An unimaginable scene was taking place on the same stage at this moment. All of them were aimed at Prince Jiu.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gradually became clear and he slowly raised the corners of his mouth.","The grand galaxy that he had constructed in his mind earlier was now being conjured.","The so-called little mountains and rivers were mountains and rivers with a single thought.","With just one thought in his heart, he could form mountains and rivers.","All these wonders were what Jian Wushuang was thinking.","‘Whatever I want, the mountains and rivers are all under my control.’","At that moment, Jian Wushuang could use everything in the entire Heavenly Realm.","The double-fingered halberd spread out. The giant mountain’s divine peak, which was originally broken by Prince Yu, grew out from the clouds at that moment. Facing Prince Jiu, the boundless divine peak pressed down.","Prince Jiu, who had barely escaped from the giant rush of water and endured the scorching heat of the sun, was already in unspeakable pain.","This method was actually an Immortal Style technique!"]},{"number":4744,"title":"Chapter 4744 The Final Victory","paragraphs":["4744 The Final Victory","He, Prince Jiu, had never expected this. This fellow should have died, but not only did he not die, he had also returned with an Immortal Style.","A seemingly unremarkable and unfathomable fellow had actually comprehended an Immortal Style. How could he not be shocked?","One must know that to be able to comprehend an Immortal Style, it meant that the Yan Immortal realm was complete and one had touched a higher level.","Understanding it and using it well, it further explained how terrifying it was. Breaking through to the Yan Immortal realm was only a matter of time.","Since ancient times, countless top cultivators had been unable to enter the Yan Immortal stage. And the Wang Mi realm above the Yan Immortal stage made even the Yan Immortal feel despair.","The Yan Immortal was a dividing line. Even if one’s lifespan was endless, one could not feel the mysterious and elusive fate energy, and could only despair.","At the same time, even among the Yan Immortals who had transcended the mortal world, there were very few who could die well.","If they could not break through to the next cultivation realm, their endless lifespan was like a trap or a cage to them.","A Yan Immortal who had not broken through the shackles could die in a terrible war with the turbulence of a Heavenly Region, or he could cut off his own Immortal Source and not even enter reincarnation.","This was a path of cultivation with no path of retreat. The vast silence of death was far more than the tragic slaughter.","The first step to breaking through the shackles was to comprehend the Immortal Style.","...","Right now, this spectacular scene that was happening one after another, if was not an Immortal Style, what could it be!?","The Young Emperor was also shocked. When he saw the figure commanding the mountains and rivers like an Emperor, the scene he least wanted to see appeared.","“So, this is his true strength...”","...","“Enough! Stop right there.” Prince Jiu’s eyes began to turn red. He waved his palm and tore apart the mountain that was pressing down on him.","The continuous fierce battles had made Prince Jiu tired, especially after the Young Emperor’s Immortal Style, which had consumed more than half of his physical strength.","The few Yan Immortals present all retreated, afraid of becoming cannon fodder.","Jian Wushuang, who had an ancient galaxy between his eyebrows, looked at him indifferently.","Prince Jiu was panting slightly. He sounded a little hysterical. “Do you think that you can defeat me with just one Immortal Style?”","“Be prepared to regret it.”","The light red scroll that stretched for thousands of miles became more and more intense. Prince Jiu stood in the middle of the scroll, slowly gathering a vigorous Yan power in his hand.","Immediately after, the picture scroll twisted and rolled up, forming many True Shadows.","Each of the true shadows was Prince Jiu.","The faint red True Shadows were so solid that they surrounded Jian Wushuang.","“You guys won’t shed a tear until you see your coffins. Since you want to fight to the end, I’ll have to send you to your coffins.”","Prince Jiu let out a strange smile. After he uttered the word ‘Exterminate’ in a low voice, the space of the scroll was devoured by the extreme darkness in an instant.","Outsiders were unable to see what was going on inside.","The hundreds of True Shadows in the scroll space all moved at this moment, carrying a powerful force as they rushed forward.","Jian Wushuang noticed the change immediately. He waved his hand and a brilliant sun rose high in the sky, shining for a hundred miles.","The indescribable light barely tore through the darkness. The True Shadows that were rushing forward turned into puddles of mud when they touched the light of the sun.","However, Jian Wushuang immediately felt that something was wrong. The True Shadows that had turned into mud were rolling and running. In an instant, they turned into thousands of chains and bound him from the bottom to the top.","In the next moment, countless strange eyes appeared in the originally dark space!","Each of these eyes were either mocking, cruel, or cold, as if they were an endless abyss that one could sink into with a single glance.","Jian Wushuang was trapped by the chains and could not move at all. He could only watch as the ten thousand eyes above his head devoured the Yan power in his body.","Outside this extremely dark space, the corners of Prince Jiu’s lips curled into an inexplicable smile. “If we weren’t in the Heavenly Realm, I would have treated you well.”","Then, he slowly turned around and said to the helpless Young Emperor, “Your backer chose to die ahead of you. Are you still not backing out? Are you waiting for me to throw you out?”","The Young Emperor looked at Prince Jiu coldly. Based on his intuition, he knew that Jian Wushuang would not be eliminated so easily.","As expected, before the smile on Prince Jiu’s face faded, the extremely dark space that stretched for thousands of miles behind him exploded with a loud bang!","A miserable wail was heard along with the wind, and a huge amount of mixed black Yan power exploded.","A figure holding a divine peak in his hand suddenly arrived!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were extremely cold. Then, he faced Prince Jiu and threw the divine peak in his hand at him.","Caught off guard, Prince Jiu did not even have the chance to make a sound before he was crushed by the divine peak that came flying at him.","The divine peak, which was already ten thousand feet tall, expanded with the wind and turned into a divine mountain that was ten million feet tall. With irresistible power, it sealed Prince Jiu’s body in the root of the mountain.","The earth collapsed, the great river flowed in reverse, and strange phenomena appeared.","With the principle of taking advantage of the enemy’s weakness, Jian Wushuang gathered all the Yan power in his body under his feet. Then, he stomped heavily on the peak of the sacred mountain with a powerful and earth-shaking kick.","Boom boom boom!","Even the divine mountain that was tens of millions of feet tall could not withstand this kick, and a deep ravine appeared.","The tremendous force went straight to the surface of the ground. Prince Jiu, who was pressed firmly under the mountain’s root, had his vital Qi sink into his Dantian. Just as he was about to burst out with a surge of power, his Immortal Source was almost destroyed by the tremendous force.","His vision darkened, and dark red divine blood gushed out from his nose.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to take Prince Jiu’s life in one go, the morning bell and evening drum’s loud sound reverberated.","“It’s time. Everyone, please stop and head to the Heavenly Court.”","In a black robe, the extremely mysterious Uncle Yu appeared in the Heavenly Realm, looking at every last Yan Immortal with his cloudy eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a touch of coldness. When he was about to release the last thunderbolt, he found that the air seemed to stagnate and Yan power was suppressed.","As if sensing something, he turned around and looked at Uncle Yu, who had just appeared in the Heavenly Realm.","As their eyes met, a slight ripple could be seen in Uncle Yu’s cloudy eyes. Then, he turned around, waved his sleeve, and sent Prince Jiu, who was sealed under the divine peak, back to the Heavenly Court.","“Everyone, please head to the Heavenly Court immediately.”","After saying this last sentence, the entire Heavenly Realm fell silent.","The remaining Yan Immortals looked at each other and quickly left for the Heavenly Court.","Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath of turbid air and finally relaxed.","The fight for the Peach, which had lasted for half a year, had ended with Jian Wushuang sealing Prince Jiu and winning the Immortal Peach."]},{"number":4745,"title":"Chapter 4745 Face the Wall and Be Punished","paragraphs":["4745 Face the Wall and Be Punished","None of the Yan Immortals from the Heavenly Court could have predicted such an ending.","Jian Wushuang was like a startled swan, barging into every line of sight.","It was too unbelievable. This was the first time that the Immortal Peach was taken by a Yan Immortal, who was not one of the seven Princes.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was not the Young Emperor’s companion, so the Immortal Peach in his hand was completely his.","He took out the Immortal Peach that contained the shackles of fate from his arms. He did not even look at it longingly. It was like an ordinary fruit.","“Hey, catch.” Jian Wushuang smiled and threw the Peach to the Young Emperor.","A stream of light streaked across the air and then landed in his hand.","Looking at the fruit in his hand, the Young Emperor raised an eyebrow. He only needed to take a bite and the Fortune in the Immortal Peach would rush into his body and help him break through.","However, the next moment, the Young Emperor opened his palm and cut the Peach in half.","“Hey, catch.” He said the same and threw half of the Immortal Peaches to Jian Wushuang.","The two of them smiled at each other before biting down on the Immortal Peach in their hands.","...","The Immortal aura was vast, and the smoke was flowing.","The Heavenly Court, which was still filled with singing and dancing, was extremely quiet at this moment.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang, who was sitting on the Emperor’s throne, was suppressing his anger with his intimidating eyes.","Below him, the Princes were all silent and dejected.","Prince Jiu, who had just woken up from his coma, had a pair of cold, heroic eyes.","Two figures slowly walked into the giant hall of the Heavenly Court.","The Young Emperor, who had changed into a luxurious court dress, had a rare smile on his face. He did not care that all the eyes were on him.","Jian Wushuang looked calm as he slowly walked forward. It was as if he had mountains and rivers in his heart, vaguely revealing a majestic aura.","He did not panic at all in the face of such a scene. He even wanted to say that it was a small scene in his heart.","Before he entered the Great Yan Domain, he had stood at the peak of the Divine Power Universe and had the experience of controlling the Great Dao. This had made his every move carry a sense of awe that could not be erased.","Even Zhen Wuyang, who was sitting on the Emperor’s throne, felt that he was on the same level as this young man.","However, this feeling was soon erased from his mind. Zhen Wuyang suddenly slapped the desk and shouted, “Impudence!”","All of the Yan Immortals were silent. They naturally knew why the Emperor was so angry.","All the taboos that could not be broken in the previous Peach-seizing battles had been broken this time.","They formed their own groups and became the weapons and dogs of the Princes. They no longer behaved like the Yan Immortals of the Heavenly Court.","However, most importantly, the rule that the Heavenly Court must not be stained with blood was broken by the Young Emperor and the strange guy beside him.","Thus, at this moment, all the Yan Immortals that were participating in the fight for the Peach were looking at the two of them with meaningful looks.","“Why aren’t you kneeling, you good-for-nothing!” Zhen Wuyang shouted angrily again, and his palm almost broke the desk in front of him.","However, the two figures did not move at all.","Jian Wushuang was baffled and looked to the side.","The Young Emperor smiled and said, “Imperial Father, if you want me to kneel, you must have a reason. After all, I’m a good-for-nothing and I can’t stand in front of them.”","Then, he looked at the other six Princes with a mocking expression.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang was furious and slammed the table again. “I’m your father! Isn’t this reason enough? Yes or no?”","The Young Emperor knelt down on one knee. “That’s enough.”","Seeing the Young Emperor kneel down, Zhen Wuyang’s expression softened a little, and he glanced at the Yan Immortals with his attractive eyes.","“What a foul atmosphere. It was a good match, but dozens of Yan Immortals died. Do you think you can ignore this iron law?!”","Prince Yu, who was full of anger. stood up and said, “Imperial Father, those Yan Immortals were killed by Prince Yan and the guy beside him. We didn’t fail...”","“Do you think your mistake is lighter than theirs?” Zhen Wuyang looked at him and said, “You destroyed the divine mountain peak that supported the Heavenly Realm with your own hands and tried to break the rules in vain. You wanted to use it to undo the restriction on the Immortal Peach. Tell me, did you do it?!”","Prince Yu broke out in a cold sweat. He did not expect that his true intentions would be discovered by his meaningless actions. “Imperial Father, listen to me...”","“No need to explain. Later, go to the Heavenly Realm and receive 100 strikes with the cane, not a single strike less!” Zhen Wuyang said angrily.","Prince Yu’s face turned pale. The 100 strikes in the Heavenly Realm were all personally carried by the great master, and each strike was enough to make an ordinary Yan Immortal suffer.","If he were to be hit 100 times, he would probably be unable to get out of bed for 100 years!","“Yes, Sir.” Prince Yu gritted his teeth and returned to his original seat. Prince Mo, who was not on good terms with him, almost laughed out loud.","Zhen Wuyang said in a deep voice, “I’m very disappointed in your performance in this Immortal Peach battle. Later, all of you will go to the Heavenly Realm and receive 50 flogs to reflect on yourselves!”","All of the Yan Immortals had bitter expressions on their faces. They did not gain much from the Heavenly Court’s feast, but instead, they received 50 cane strikes.","However, no one dared to refute him. They all cupped their hands and said, “Yes, Sir.”","At this time, the Young Emperor pretended to cough, and his pale face turned red.","“Father, Prince Yan’s body is weak. I’m afraid I can’t take the cane...”","Emperor Yang of Zhenwu nodded and waved his hand. “Prince Yan is exempted from punishment. The rest of you will be punished as usual.”","Hearing this, the other six Princes were all indignant. They glared at the Young Emperor but did not dare to say anything for fear of being hit a few more times.","As if he was afraid that the Yan Immortals would think that he was biased, Zhen Wuyang said, “But Prince Yan’s behavior was terrible, so he will be punished to be face the wall of the Wind-Listening Platform for 10 years.”","It would have been fine if he did not say this, but once he did, all the Yan Immortals’ gazes almost burned the Young Emperor to ashes.","He said he was going to the Wind-Listening Platform to be punished, but wasn’t it more appropriate to say he was going on a vacation?","The entire platform was filled with peach and bamboo trees. The Heavenly Court’s Immortals were chatting among them, and from time to time, one could even see the Fairies dancing.","In such an environment, how could he face the wall and reflect?","“What are you waiting for? Do you think the punishment isn’t enough?” The voice of Zhen Wuyang rang out.","Hearing this, all the Yan Immortals rushed out of the Heavenly Court, afraid of falling behind.","After taking a deep look at the Young Emperor, a glint of gloominess and ruthlessness flashed in Prince Jiu’s eyes. Then, he strolled out of the Heavenly Court.","For a moment, there were only 100 figures left in the vast Heavenly Court.","All the Elders looked at the Young Emperor and Jian Wushuang with great interest, as if they were very interested in their team.","Zhen Wuyang looked at Jian Wushuang with a domineering gaze and said, “Why don’t you go and receive your punishment?”"]},{"number":4746,"title":"Chapter 4746 The Wind-Listening Platform","paragraphs":["4746 The Wind-Listening Platform","The Heavenly Court was silent. Jian Wushuang looked at him and said, “I’m not in the wrong, so there’s no need to talk about punishment.”","Zhen Wuyang said in a deep voice, “The Heavenly Court is forbidden from being stained with blood, but you killed more than ten Yan Immortals. Do you not care about the Heavenly Rules?”","Jian Wushuang was calm and composed. “If I didn’t threaten them with death, I wouldn’t be standing here now. If they don’t attack me, I don’t need to care. But if they attack me, the best choice is to eliminate the threat.”","“I don’t see a threat as any different if it’s in a different setting or place, no matter if it’s in the Heavenly Realm or anywhere else.”","“All I can do is use any means to eliminate these threats.”","The Heavenly Court was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop. Only Jian Wushuang’s voice was heard as he recalled. All the Elders looked over.","They did not expect that this guy, who suppressed all the Yan Immortals in the Heaven Realm and eliminated threats by himself, would have such similar words and actions.","Zhen Wuyang sat on the Emperor’s throne without saying a word. He stared at Jian Wushuang expressionlessly.","At the same time, a supreme aura quietly covered the Heavenly Court.","Jian Wushuang felt an indescribable pressure pressing down on every inch of his skin. It was as if 100,000 divine mountains were pressing down on him.","He bit the tip of his tongue without leaving a trace. He did not even use Yan power and used the strength of his physical body to resist it.","Uncle Yu, who was standing behind Zhen Wuyang, also raised his turbid eyes to look at Jian Wushuang, then lowered his head again.","The Young Emperor also sensed it. His face turned cold, and he immediately drew the soft sword from his waist and cut it off to block the pressure.","“Imperial Father, we’re tired. Let’s hurry up and finish up so that we can go to sleep... I mean, go and face the wall.” The young Emperor put away his soft sword and looked at Zhen Wuyang with an indignant expression.","Looking at the fearless Young Emperor, Zhen Wuyang surprisingly did not get angry. He wanted to say something, but in the end, he sighed and said, “Get lost.”","The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and pulled Jian Wushuang away.","“Wait,” Zhen Wuyang’s majestic voice sounded again. “Let Yu Chang supervise you as you reflect on your mistakes so that you repent properly.”","The old man standing behind Zhen Wuyang took the lead and walked toward the two. Then, he tied them up with his hands and left the Heavenly Court’s giant hall quickly to the Wind-Listening Platform.","When the Young Emperor disappeared, Zhen Wuyang’s eyes flashed with a touch of loneliness.","“Immortals, it’s rare for us to get together. Let’s go to the Moonrise Pavilion and have a drink.”","...","“Uncle Yu, can you let me go? Although I’m facing the wall to reflect on my mistakes, you don’t have to restrict my freedom...”","In a beautiful place with tens of thousands of peach flowers and a gentle north wind, two figures were bound together, back to back, sitting in a pavilion.","Jian Wushuang was depressed. He had only killed 10 to 20 Yan Immortals and was punished to be trapped here for 10 years.","Although the scenery was excellent, it was still a little uncomfortable to be trapped in this pavilion for ten years.","The Young Emperor, who was standing with his back against Uncle Yu’s, also looked helpless. He tried to persuade Uncle Yu, but failed.","“Young Master, ten years will pass by very quickly. Just take it as a nap.” Uncle Yu raised his head and glanced at the two of them, then sat down in a meditative state not far away.","When he saw that Uncle Yu had sat down, the Young Emperor pushed Jian Wushuang and whispered, “I have a soft sword on my waist. Pull it out gently and cut the chain...”","Jian Wushuang immediately reached for the Young Emperor’s waist.","“The sword is in my belt. Why are you touching under my waist?”","“My mistake, my hand is a little numb... Don’t move.”","“How can I not move? That part is itchy.”","...","After a difficult struggle, Jian Wushuang finally pulled out his soft sword and cut off the chains on the Young Emperor.","The Young Emperor flicked his hand, got up, took the soft sword, and also cut off the chains on his body.","“Let’s go, I’ll take you to a good place.” The Young Emperor showed a rare smug look and left with Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang could not refuse, so he turned back to look at Uncle Yu, who was still in meditation, and then followed him out of the pavilion.","As they left, Uncle Yu slowly opened his eyes, shook his head helplessly, and went back to observing his surroundings.","The two of them were just short of saying ‘I’m leaving’ out loud, so how could Uncle Yu not notice? However, he did not stop them and allowed them to leave.","As long as he did not leave the platform, he would be safe.","As Jian Wushuang strolled through the peach forest, his tense state of mind relaxed a little.","According to the Young Emperor, more than half of the noble goddesses in the Nine Heavenly Realms around the Heavenly Court lived in the Wind-Listening Platform, and there were countless Immortals who had attained Dao.","They had only walked a thousand steps when a peach Immortal sitting on a peach branch brought out a beautiful Immortal wine.","“Brother Jian, how’s your alcohol tolerance?” He took the two pots of peach wine from the peach Immortal and gave one to Jian Wushuang.","“It’s alright.” Jian Wushuang did not refuse. He raised the wine pot and took a long drink.","The slightly pinkish wine entered his throat, and a clear sweetness spread through the peach forest.","The Young Emperor smiled and followed Jian Wushuang’s example. He raised the wine pot and drank.","Although there was only one pot of peach wine made by the peach Immortal, there was a cave in the pot and it could hold at least several thousand tons of wine.","Jian Wushuang only stopped after drinking about 50 tons. He felt that his body was completely clear and he was extremely comfortable.","On the other hand, the Young Emperor drank like a whale gulping down a thousand tons of wine.","“I say, don’t you feel bloated from drinking like this?” Jian Wushuang asked.","To Yan Immortals like them who had transcended the mortal world, they could no longer get drunk from things like wine, whether they were pure or not.","Even if it was Immortal wine, it was just a taste in the throat, and not something to get drunk from.","However, when he looked at the Young Emperor, whose eyes were already hazy, he found that things were not so simple.","“No way, you’re drunk?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","The Young Emperor’s face turned red and he shook his head. “No, I’m not drunk. How can I get drunk from this peach wine?”","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to snatch the wine pot from his hand when he heard him talking.","“Hey, little peach Immortal, give me another pot of aged wine.”","“...”","Jian Wushuang would never have thought that as a Yan immortal, he would be drunk by drinking wine.","“Don’t drink anymore. If you cause any trouble later, you’ll be taken back again!”","After 1,000 tons of wine entered his stomach, the young Emperor was still conscious, but his feet were already floating."]},{"number":4747,"title":"Chapter 4747 I’ll Take You to a Good Place","paragraphs":["4747 I’ll Take You to a Good Place","Without Jian Wushuang’s help, he would not have been able to walk steadily.","“Brother Jian, my good brother, you’re the only one by my side,” the Young Emperor murmured. ” I, Prince Yan, have never been as happy as I am today.”","“If it wasn’t for you, I wouldn’t have been able to ruthlessly trample on those guys to vent the hatred in my heart.”","“It’s you who gave me some hope.” The Young Emperor smiled and punched Jian Wushuang’s chest.","“In addition, I’ve already said that with the Emperor as a guarantor, everything is in sight.”","Smelling the faint fishy smell, Jian Wushuang took half a step back and said, “Sleep for a while. We’ll talk about other things when you’re awake.”","“We can’t sleep. Since we’re in the Wind-Listening Platform, I’ll take you to a good place.” With a meaningful smile on his face, the Young Emperor pulled Jian Wushuang and rushed forward with a goal in mind.","“Where are you going?”","“You’ll know later... It’s definitely a good place for you to linger.”","“...”","The ethereal peach forest that stretched for thousands of miles was left behind, replaced by green bamboo.","The entire Wind-Listening Platform was like the back garden of the Heavenly Court. It was extremely beautiful, and all the Immortals and Goddesses were playing in it.","Jian Wushuang, who was being led by the Young Emperor, was confused. He had a feeling that something bad was going to happen.","The further they went into the Wind-Listening Platform, the faint smell of incense began to appear in the misty clouds.","“Where are we going?” Jian Wushuang asked again and again.","The Young Emperor’s eyes became more and more hazy. “It’s a good place. It’s definitely a place you’ll like. I’ve been thinking about it for a long time. I’ll take you there today.”","Jian Wushuang stopped talking and followed him.","When the clouds receded, a beautiful peach garden with a myriad of flowers appeared in front of them.","The Young Emperor seemed to be a little impatient. The two of them stopped at the peak of a small mountain.","“Brother Jian, please follow me.”","They were only a few dozen steps away from the peak, but the Young Emperor rushed up to the peak in one big stride.","Jian Wushuang followed closely behind. At the same time, he was suspicious of what could make him so excited.","Jian Wushuang strode to the peak and looked ahead.","With just one glance, his eyes were completely wide open, revealing disbelief.","After crossing the mountain peak, they saw that there were nearly a thousand Goddesses taking a bath in the clear river water that was like an Immortal Source...","It was a beautiful scene.","The sounds of frolicking like silver bells reverberated in the valley. They were teasing each other, like real Fairies coming out of the bath.","With just a glance, Jian Wushuang hurriedly squatted down and completely hid in the Immortal grass and divine flowers.","“Did you drink too much fake wine? Is this a place we can come to?” Jian Wushuang was furious that the Young Emperor had brought him to this place.","The Young Emperor’s hazy eyes were also filled with confusion. He rubbed his eyes hard and stared at it for a while before he mumbled, “This shouldn’t be. Why am I here...”","“Let’s hurry up and leave.” Obviously, Jian Wushuang did not want to stay here any longer. If he was discovered, it was a small matter for his reputation to be damaged, but it would be bad if he was caught and beaten up...","These seemingly delicate and beautiful Fairies were all real Yan Immortals.","The Young Emperor nodded in a daze, and the two got up and prepared to run.","“Aiya, who stepped on my hair?!”","The two of them froze on the spot and slowly turned around.","Behind him, in the midst of the colorful flowers, a little flower Immortal was rubbing her head and waking up.","...","Their eyes met, and a cry of surprise rang out throughout the entire valley.","“Sis, it’s them. They were peeking at you guys while you were bathing!”","At that moment, little flower Immortal pointed at Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor with her hands on her hips.","At the same time, nearly a thousand Fairies who had come ashore from the water had already leaped onto the peak of the mountain, blocking the two of them in the middle.","They all had unfriendly expressions and murderous gazes, as if they wanted to eat them alive.","“This is a huge misunderstanding. We accidentally entered this place. We’ll leave now.” Jian Wushuang looked embarrassed. It was obvious that he could not even convince himself with such an excuse.","Then, the Young Emperor closed his eyes and fell asleep.","“Sister, don’t believe their nonsense. I’ve already seen that Prince Yan is a pervert. Do you believe that they came here by accident? It was clearly planned for a long time!” a Fairy dressed in a thin purple robe raised her eyebrows and said angrily.","Another yellow-robed Fairy said in embarrassment, “I’ve long known that the Emperor’s Eldest Prince is not a good person. Cheng Qing, who is by his side, is not a good person either. Naturally, he is not a good person either!”","“Right, we can’t let them go!” All the Fairies agreed.","However, at the very front of these Goddesses, there was an older but energetic white-robed Fairy who did not say anything. Her nose twitched slightly as she had already detected the smell of alcohol on the Young Emperor.","“Did he drink?” the white-robed Fairy maiden asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “We had some drinks in the peach forest before, so we accidentally came here. I hope you can forgive us.”","The white-robed Fairy did not seem to want to make things difficult for the two of them. After looking at Jian Wushuang carefully, she said slowly, “You may be spared from death, but you can’t escape punishment. Whether it’s unintentional or sincere, you won’t be able to escape today’s beating!”","“Sisters, vent your anger and beat them to death!”","“...”","Jian Wushuang moved at once. He ran with all his strength!","The Young Emperor, who was pretending to be asleep, sobered up after hearing this. He fled from the sea of flowers at a speed not much slower than Jian Wushuang’s.","However, there were simply too many of them. In order to pursue the two of them, they even used all sorts of divine abilities.","Even a random punch from these Immortal cultivators could kill an old master, not to mention these embarrassed and angry ladies...","A beating was already set in stone.","...","“Don’t touch me, my face still hurts.”","In a pavilion on a mountain peak, two figures in black clothes were sitting side by side on the roof.","“Brother Jian, it’s indeed my fault. I apologize to you... I can’t drink in the first place, but the smell of alcohol got to me, so I didn’t know how I somehow brought you to the place where they took a bath...”","“But heaven and earth can be my witness. I have no intention of peeking. I have really gone to the wrong place.”","“Shut up, let the past be the past.”","“... Also, brother Jian, I’m really not a pervert.”","“...”","On the roof of the pavilion, two figures looked at each other speechlessly. If one looked closely, their originally handsome faces had long been swollen, and they had suffered some real external injuries."]},{"number":4748,"title":"Chapter 4748 Sword Heaven","paragraphs":["4748 Sword Heaven","Jian Wushuang’s face was red and swollen because he could not dodge in time, but it was far less shocking than the Young Emperor’s swollen face.","The Fairies seemed to have determined that the Young Emperor was a real lecher and took care of him with all their might, so Jian Wushuang escaped a mighty beating.","The Young Emperor picked up a cloud and put it on his face before continuing, “Brother Jian, I’m actually taking you to a place called Sword Heaven in the Heavenly Court.”","“I saw that the sword at your waist was already broken, so I wanted to find another one or try to integrate your Sword Dao in the Sword Heaven.”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang started to believe what he said.","After all, judging from the Young Emperor’s previous style of doing things, he would not frivolously take him to peek at Fairies bathing.","“What kind of place is the Sword Heaven you mentioned?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s probably a place to keep the obsessions,” the Young Emperor said. “The obsessions of some of my old brothers who fought with my Imperial Father are sleeping there.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not speak anymore.","The two of them rested on the pavilion’s roof for a few days before they set off for Sword Heaven.","After leaving the platform, Jian Wushuang saw a small world at the edge of the Heavenly Realm, which was shrouded in chaos.","Even with his abilities as a Yan Immortal, he was unable to investigate what was in the chaos.","However, from the powerful auras that would occasionally be emitted from this world, any of these obsessions had most likely been extremely terrifying existences when they were alive.","Led by the Young Emperor, they entered the chaotic and hazy mist before they truly entered the so-called Sword Heaven.","As his foot landed on the ground, it stirred up a cloud of gray sand.","As far as Jian Wushuang could see, all he could see was gray sand and stones. The dried tree trunks and branches were facing the sky, as if they were crying.","The gray sandy surface extended into the distance and intersected with the sky.","“Guard your heart. The killing intent and obsession here are too strong. If you’re eroded, it’ll be hard to pull it out,” the Young Emperor warned in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang nodded. From the moment he entered Sword Heaven, he felt that the whole world was made up of killing intent and an indescribable obsession.","It was hard for him to imagine that there would be such a place in the peaceful Heavenly Court and Heavenly Realms.","As if it had sensed the invasion of external forces, the Sword Heaven began to fluctuate, and a supreme obsession shuttled back and forth.","The Young Emperor threw out a golden seal, and then all the obsessions disappeared.","After traveling through the sword sky for a few dozen breaths, a huge black stone hall appeared in the gray sand.","Perhaps it was because no one had set foot here at all, that giant hall was almost half-buried in the gray sand, appearing desolate and desolate.","“This giant hall is where my father’s brothers placed their obsessions,” the Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and said. “Your sword principle is unparalleled. However, the people in this hall are not ordinary. I think they will be of some help to your sword principle.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but think of the heaven-defying book, the Collection of Swords, in his arms. If there was really a Heaven’s Favorite with perfect swordsmanship, he could make a copy and study it carefully...”","As he pushed open the heavy doors of the hall, a familiar smell of forging entered Jian Wushuang’s nose.","To the sword-wielder, this aura of iron and fire was the most intimate aura.","This was the taste of forging swords.","Jian Wushuang, who had been calm, could not wait to see the person the Young Emperor had mentioned.","The entire hall was vast and spacious, and it was built without any order.","The entire hall was like a burning furnace, and the entire ground seemed to be like magma, emitting a crimson color.","Jian Wushuang scanned the entire main hall. Apart from the hundreds of seats, there were only the faded murals on the surrounding walls that were somewhat eye-catching.","Due to the long passage of time, the color of the murals had faded by more than half, but Jian Wushuang could still guess that the murals depicted the most tragic battle.","The Heavenly Region was torn apart, countless Yan Immortals were dying, determined.","Jian Wushuang did not delve into the meaning of the murals. He believed that all the Heavenly Regions had a tragic past and nothing could be changed.","It seemed that it was not the Young Emperor’s first time here. He led Jian Wushuang forward with great familiarity.","After leaving the main hall, the air began to turn from stuffy to dry.","Even the Yan power that was scattered outside the surface of his body seemed to be burning, which showed how high the temperature was.","“This fellow is not good with words and has a quiet personality. But when it comes to sword forging, no one would dare to claim first if he said he was second.”","As they walked, the Young Emperor said, “In addition, he is the only disciple of an old friend of my Imperial Father. His swordsmanship is unfathomable.”","“Speaking of my Imperial Father’s old friend, he’s the only Sword Immortal I’ve ever seen who has reached the peak of perfection in Sword Dao.”","Jian Wushuang listened quietly. He had yet to come into contact with the Sword Immortal and the entire situation of the Great Yan Domain.","The only one he had met so far was the Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi, who was unbelievably powerful when he was in the Divine Power Universe.","It was only the Extictive Sword Strike, but it made all the other sword moves pale.","However, Jian Wushuang suddenly remembered that before he went to the Heavenly Court, there was a mysterious man who never appeared from the beginning to the end. He tore apart the Heavenly Region with his sword and killed dozens of Yan Immortals.","Could that mysterious man be a Sword Immortal?","Without an answer, some people or things might always be fleeting.","“In order to let this guy concentrate on forging swords, I’ve given him all the swords in the entire Sword Heaven without telling Imperial Father.”","“The last time I saw him was during the Heavenly Court’s banquet. I wonder if he has made any progress.”","He strolled forward. After an unknown amount of time, when the ground beneath his feet disappeared, he had reached the end of the hall.","However, the next scene shocked Jian Wushuang.","Behind this giant hall, there was actually a huge chasm!","In this chasm, there was purple-red lava flowing from the earth’s core, roaring and surging.","Countless True Swords hung high above the chasm, and silver-white water droplets were slowly dripping from the tip of each True Sword.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly and found it even more unbelievable.","Every drop of the silver-white water was actually Sword Intent!","It was a condensed and concretized Sword Intent!","What kind of technique was this to be able to refine True Swords and extract Sword Intent like this?"]},{"number":4749,"title":"Chapter 4749 Ding Beichun in His Prime of Sword-Forging","paragraphs":["4749 Ding Beichun in His Prime of Sword-Forging","The so-called Sword Dao and Sword Intent were all illusory, and only a medium could carry them.","The blade itself was a kind of medium, while divine power, void power, and even the more profound Yan power were the bearing and the path to realization.","However, the scene in front of Jian Wushuang truly shocked him.","These Sword Intents had no master’s will, and there was no way to guide them. They could only be used by the blade itself, which acted as the medium.","However, they were actually refined and conjured into silver-white water droplets.","At the same time, these Sword Intent water drops fell into the natural moat.","Due to the frighteningly high temperature, the lava here was a strange purple-red color.","Even the temperature of the real sun’s core could not be compared to this purple-red lava. It was simply too hot.","These raindrops of Sword Intent did not fall into the lava after falling. Instead, they seemed to be guided by something and gathered together.","It was only then that Jian Wushuang realized that in the center of the 10,000 miles of lava, there was a furnace.","This furnace seemed to be burning fiercely, as if it was refining and creating a brilliant sun. Tens of thousands of rays of golden light spilled out from the tightly-sealed furnace, which was extremely dazzling.","The Sword Intent was like a drop of water was all guided into the furnace.","At the same time, a 10,000-foot tall figure attracted Jian Wushuang’s attention.","On one side of the furnace, a 10,000-feet-tall, bare-chested figure held an iron hammer in his hand. Without any emotion, he hammered it down on a red Sword Embryo, causing sparks to fly.","Such a shocking scene made Jian Wushuang’s blood boil.","It did not have the complexity and exquisiteness of the way of the sword and the Sword Intent, but only pure iron and fire.","A swordsmith needed great perseverance and great Enlightenment to forge a sword that could seize the fate energy of heaven and earth.","This fusion of iron and fire was the most soul-stirring.","After two or three calls, Jian Wushuang finally came back to his senses.","“Brother Jian, do you want to watch it up close together?” the Young Emperor said with a smile.","Suppressing the agitation in his heart, Jian Wushuang said slowly, “Okay.”","The two Yan Immortals had floated down into the natural moat.","The hammer in his hand, the 10,000 feet tall figure did not feel that there were outsiders coming, he was completely focused on the red Sword Embryo.","Stepping on the land that was floating on the lava like a lonely boat, Jian Wushuang felt that the Yan power on the surface of his body began to burn.","“Beichun, I’m here,” the Young Emperor said in a clear voice, a rare smile in his eyes.","After the 10,000-feet-tall figure heavily smashed the Sword Embryo with his hammer, he stopped his mechanical hammering and turned his head to look at them.","His face was blackened by metal scraps, and it was almost impossible to tell where his facial features were.","However, what Jian Wushuang saw next was a row of bright teeth.","“Brother Yan.”","The Young Emperor laughed. “I thought you’d become a fool. It turns out you still remember me.”","In just a few breaths, the 10,000-feet-tall figure had shrunk to a normal height, and then he quickly ran forward.","His upper body was bare, and his well-proportioned muscles were covered with flowing clouds and water ripples, looking extremely profound.","“Brother Yan, how did you find the time to come here? I remember that it wasn’t long before you came here,” the figure covered in flowing clouds scratched his head and said.","The Young Emperor said helplessly, “It’s been a Hua Year since I last came to see you. This time, it’s the Heavenly Court’s Grand Banquet again.”","“It’s been another Hua Year, but I don’t feel anything,” the figure pouted and said. “I don’t know when my Master will come back.”","“He’ll be back soon, you just need to wait,” the Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and smiled. Then, he put his palm on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder. “Let me introduce you. Brother Jian, Jian Wushuang.”","“Ding Beichun.” The charred-face young man cupped his hands and grinned.","Jian Wushuang smiled in return. Deep in his heart, he felt that the guy in front of him, who grinned with big white teeth, was not as difficult to get along with as he had imagined.","Looking at the churning sea of fire and lava around him, the Young Emperor said, “Beichun, it’s been a few years. It’s time for you to go out and travel. After all, you’ve been alone here for too long.”","The young man, whose name was Ding Beichun, wiped the metal scraps off his face and said, “I’ll be leaving when Master comes to pick me up. I’m also focusing on forging a sword now. I’ll forge a scabbard for you.”","Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised. He did not expect that Ding Beichun was only forging a scabbard.","At the thought of this, he could not help but ask, “The materials and Sword Intent refined in this furnace are all prepared to forge a sword sheath?”","Ding Beichun nodded. that’s right. These things are not good enough for my Master. I might as well make these things into a scabbard for my Master.","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth, but he did not say anything. There was a bitter smile at the corner of his mouth.","Ding Beichun’s words were too shocking. There was so much unparalleled Sword Intent, but it was only enough to make a scabbard...","The Young Emperor’s natural expression also proved that Ding Beichun was not lying.","“By the way, Beichun, I’ve come here to ask for a favor,” the Young Emperor said. “One of Brother Jian’s swords has been broken. Can you repair it?”","Ding Beichun did not hesitate. “Of course. Can you let me take a look at the condition of the broken pieces?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then drew the Tarot Divine Sword from his waist.","The sword was unsheathed and let out a clear cry. Even though the sword had been broken in the middle, it did not affect its sharpness.","Ding Beichun’s eyes brightened. He took the broken Tarot Divine Sword and looked at it carefully. “This is incredible. Such an extraordinary sword actually contains such great fate energy.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded in his heart. It seemed that Ding Beichun was a true master swordsmithing master. He was able to sense the fate energy in the Tarot Divine Sword almost immediately.","As one of the seven Supreme Ancestral Weapons in the Divine Power Universe, the fate energy contained in the Tarot Divine Sword was naturally extremely terrifying.","This was also why Jian Wushuang still carried the Tarot Divine Sword with him even though it was broken. A mysterious thing like fate energy controlled too many thoughts of the Great Dao and could deepen his comprehension when he was meditating.","“How is it? Can it be completely repaired?” the Young Emperor asked.","Holding the Tarot Divine Sword tightly, Ding Beichun could not help but nod. “I definitely can. To be able to repair such a real sword is another kind of Enlightenment for swordsmithing.”","The Young Emperor nodded. “I’ll leave it to you then. If you can’t fix it, I’ll hold you responsible.”"]},{"number":4750,"title":"Chapter 4750 A Brief Confrontation","paragraphs":["4750 A Brief Confrontation","Ding Beichun grinned, his eyes never leaving the Tarot Divine Sword. “Don’t worry. There’s no True Sword that I, Ding Beichun, can’t handle.”","“Speaking of which, to be able to use such a True Sword, Brother Jian must have already comprehended his own Sword Dao.”","The Young Emperor smiled and then raised his eyebrows. “Beichun, if I say that his Sword Dao and Sword Intent will definitely not be inferior to your Master’s in the future, would you believe me?”","Ding Beichun raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief. “Surpass my Master? Brother Yan, don’t joke with me. So far, I’ve never seen anyone who can surpass my Master in the Sword Dao.”","“Then you’ve seen it now,” the Young Emperor said.","The light in Ding Beichun’s eyes grew brighter. “Brother Jian, you’re a Sword Immortal?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head and smiled bitterly. “I can’t be considered a Sword Immortal. At most, I have my own comprehension of Sword Dao.”","“That’s great! I’ve been cultivating swordsmanship with my Master for a long time. I only started forging swords when my swordsmanship came to a standstill,” Ding Beichun said excitedly. “Brother Jian, why don’t we have a spar? It’s been a long time since I’ve sparred with someone else.”","“Nonsense, we’re here,” the Young Emperor was stopped by Jian Wushuang before he could finish.","He said, “We have nothing to do anyway. Why don’t Brother Beichun and I have a spar here?”","“I’ll go and prepare now.” After Ding Beichun said this, he hurriedly leaped toward the cauldron that was tens of thousands of feet tall.","Ding Beichun used a huge force to turn the lid of the cauldron. He threw the Tarot Divine Sword into the cauldron in a hurry, then flew back to the two of them.","“I say, you just threw the sword in like this. Is it going to be fine?” The Young Emperor was puzzled.","“Don’t worry. If you want to reforge a sword, the first step is to melt the Sword Embryo. I know what to do.” Ding Beichun could not wait any longer. “Brother Jian, shall we start?”","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. He took a step back and moved a thousand feet away. He had already formed a battle formation.","Ding Beichun did not say anything else. He raised his hand, and a True Sword broke through the sky and fell into his palm.","As he held the True Sword, the aura of his entire person condensed. It was as if he had taken out an ultimate sword from his box and pressed forward with an indomitable will.","The iron chips fell off, slowly revealing a handsome face. His bare upper body seemed to have sword principle and flowing clouds and water patterns.","Jian Wushuang held his breath and concentrated. The Invisible Longsword formed by the Wushuang sword principle appeared in his hand.","Ding Beichun’s eyes glowed even more brightly when he saw this. Even though he had observed countless Sword Dao, he had only seen someone who could materialize the Sword Dao a few times.","And to be able to do this, they were all great swordsmen.","The Young Emperor retreated helplessly when he saw this scene.","When sword fanatics faced each other, no one could dissuade them.","In the next moment, Ding Beichun took the lead, bringing with him a vast Sword Intent.","In just an instant, the two swords faced each other, and the blades collided.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","It looked like one sword clash, but in reality, they had exchanged tens of thousands of moves!","The sharp longsword swung wildly. At that moment, Ding Beichun seemed to be immersed in the forging of the sword. He slashed down rapidly without any fancy moves.","If it was any other Yan immortal, they would have died under this attack.","Even Jian Wushuang felt great pressure. This guy could not only swing the hammer, but also swing the sword without any hesitation.","Although Jian Wushuang did not retreat from the attack, the ground under his feet had cracked.","However, in the next exchange, Ding Beichun’s True Sword could no longer adapt to such a high-intensity confrontation and was directly cut in half by Jian Wushuang.","“Exhilarating.” Ding Beichun, who had been forced back a thousand feet by the sword strike, laughed out loud. He casually threw away the broken sword and retrieved a True Sword from the sky.","“Brother Jian, it’s my Sword Intent next,” He said in a deep voice, and the flowing clouds and water ripples on his body began to surge.","Yan power in the entire heavenly chasm seemed to have been awakened by him. He brought along a huge amount of purple-red lava and conjured a precious image behind him.","An indescribable heavy pressure hit his face. Jian Wushuang took half a step back with his right foot and held the Invisible Longsword in front of him.","He was extremely calm as he looked at the 30,000-meter-tall treasure form in front of him, as if he was used to it.","After Ding Beichun had formed the Sword Intent image form, he raised the True Sword in his hand and slashed at Jian Wushuang.","Rumble! Boom boom!","The space was torn apart, and the purple-red lava was surging. The image form was not holding a long sword in its hand, but a blunt weapon.","The blunt weapon that was as heavy as a ten-thousand-ton hammer smashed down heavily. At this moment, Jian Wushuang also summoned a move of the Sword River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","The Star-style Sword Intent was fully unleashed, and an unparalleled image form that was also 10,000-feet in size descended, clasping its palms together to meet the attack.","When the Young Emperor saw this, he immediately flew away.","Boom!!!","An unparalleled explosion occurred. The two image forms were destroyed at the same time, causing the heavens and earth to shake. Endless squalls violently tore open the space.","Almost at the same time as the two forms collided, a black-clothed Ranger broke through the explosion and slashed at Ding Beichun.","Clang!","Ding Beichun hurriedly raised his sword to resist, but he did not expect the True Sword in his hand to be directly cut into two.","The tip of a sword that seemed to be condensed from flowing clouds was then pressed against his neck.","Everything happened too quickly. From the first confrontation to the first collision of the sword principles, only 100 breaths had passed.","However, it was in these 100 breaths of time that the current situation was formed.","Even if Jian Wushuang’s sword strike could not kill him directly, it could at least severely injure him.","In a collision of this level, if one was seriously injured, the only outcome was death.","However, Ding Beichun could not believe that he had been defeated just like that. He had lost so smoothly and easily.","He was a little aggrieved. He had only used the first move of his Sword Dao, but it had ended up like this.","Jian Wushuang left a deep impression on him.","His moves were ruthless, and he did not drag things out at all. He was a very strong opponent.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have seen the frustration in Ding Beichun’s eyes. He smiled and retreated a thousand feet away with his longsword on his back.","“Again.”","Ding Beichun’s eyes brightened. Although he knew the gap between him and Jian Wushuang, he was not willing to give up such an opportunity. He chose to fight again.","This time, he did not draw the True Sword from the sky. Instead, like Jian Wushuang, he slowly formed an Invisible Longsword.","It was a blade that was formed from one’s own comprehension of the sword Dao, and it was the most suitable for the Master. The Invisible Sword was essentially a formless sword that a swordsman could condense and fight with.","However, since there was no sword blade that could be materialized, the power that was unleashed was extremely unstable.","For example, although Ding Beichun had also condensed an Invisible Sword, his Sword Intent was fluctuating so violently that it seemed like it could dissipate at any moment.","However, Jian Wushuang’s Invisible Longsword had never been unstable.","This was the impasse Sword Intent that he had comprehended in the desolate Land of Sorrows, and it had long been tempered to its peak."]},{"number":4751,"title":"Chapter 4751 The Tarot Divine Sword Is Destroyed","paragraphs":["4751 The Tarot Divine Sword Is Destroyed","Sword Intent and Sword Dao were mountains and seas of their own.","Even if he did not use his Sword Intent to form a blade, he was confident that he could exert 100 percent of the sword power of Wushuang’s sword principle with just a tree branch!","Long ago, in the Divine Power Universe’s Cloud Palace, he had sparred with Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi for more than 100,000 years, and they had used a peach branch.","An Invisible Sword was formed, and Ding Beichun’s aura turned cold. It was as if he had become a sword.","Wisps of Invisible Sword Intent escaped from every pore of his body. On his naked upper body, the flowing clouds and water ripples began to fluctuate, as if a great river and sea were rising.","As he pointed his sword forward, thousands of water ripples climbed onto the blade of the sword, like a dragon ready to strike.","“My sword principle is called the Seven Swords of Northern Spring. Although it has the name of ‘Seven Swords’, it only has three actual Swords Intents. I’m afraid it’ll be difficult to complete the remaining four Sword Intents.”","Ding Beichun said slowly, “However, I’ve forced back 6,000 peak Yan Immortal realm cultivators with only three of these sword moves, and I’ve never been defeated before. Brother Jian, please take a look today.”","Jian Wushuang replied, “My pleasure.”","A ripple quietly appeared in the air. Ding Beichun stood still, but his aura, along with the Invisible Sword in his hand, suddenly expanded.","It was only then that Jian Wushuang realized that the flowing clouds and water patterns on Ding Beichun’s body were not a pattern, but a Sword Intent that was transformed from a prop!","Every flowing cloud water ripple was a Sword Intent. At this moment, almost half of the space in the chasm was covered by Ding Beichun’s Sword Dao.","It was as if there were a million swords pointing at him. An unprecedented pressure made Jian Wushuang solemn.","The ‘Star’ Sword Intent had forced Ding Beichun to retreat.","The Sword Intent of the ‘River’ also rose up. A more vigorous and majestic Sword Intent turned into a surging sky river and flowed out of Jian Wushuang’s sleeve.","Jian Wushuang had a deeper understanding of the first two moves of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","The two Sword Intents, Star and River, not only complemented each other, but also had their own unique sword momentum.","These two styles of Sword Intents were the framework and cornerstone of the entire Wushuang Sword Dao, so that there was no situation of crushing each other between the two. They were both powerful and had an endless momentum of peak Sword Intent.","Perhaps, only the latter two moves, Lake and Sea, would have a more terrifying and stunning performance.","The so-called Sword Dao, sword technique, and Sword Intent.","No matter how gorgeous it was, it was still a killing technique. The ultimate goal was to become more powerful and limitless.","This time, Jian Wushuang took the lead.","One sword strike was enough to destroy a million enemies, and the sword waterfall surged toward Ding Beichun.","Jian Wushuang was no longer sitting on the long river. Instead, he stood on the spot, raised his hand, and condensed an Invisible Sword. He buried it in the sword waterfall and attacked!","At this moment, Ding Beichun’s eyes were filled with fanaticism. The sword patterns on his body had been personally carved by his Master, and a full-force attack from him could push back 6000 top cultivators.","If this sword move of his failed, did it mean that the young man before him really had the strength to fight with his Master?","The dazzling flowing clouds churned like hundreds of dragons, coiling around each other as they swept over.","The two sword principles that belonged to the peak of the world collided.","The Young Emperor, who was watching from afar, was shocked again. He immediately retreated from the natural moat without thinking.","Whirrr– Boom!!!","The earth-shattering clash tore apart everything in sight.","The sea of purple-red lava surged and rose thousands of feet high, crazily devouring the last piece of land.","At the same time, the entire black stone hall began to collapse. The 10,000 swords hanging in the sky trembled and then broke.","Such a destructive clash shook the entire Sword Heaven. At the same time, invisible shockwaves spread across half of the Heavenly Realm.","The Faries, who was still washing up in the sea of flowers, was the first to feel the shockwaves. They all looked in Sword Heaven’s direction in shock.","“Sister, isn’t that a place strictly forbidden by the Emperor? Why is there such a loud noise?” the yellow-robed fairy asked nervously. “Should we report this to the Emperor?”","When the white-robed fairy heard this, she raised her delicate hand to silence her. “Don’t bother about things that we shouldn’t ask about. The Heavenly Court will send someone to investigate.”","When the other Fairies heard this, they did not say anything more and continued to wash up.","Only the white-robed fairy hesitated. The only person who had the right to enter Sword Heaven at this moment was the Young Emperor.","However, what was his purpose in entering?","Thinking of this, a stream of light formed by Yan power spread out from her hand and quickly swept into the clouds and disappeared.","At the same time, Uncle Yu, who was meditating in the Wind-Listening Platform, suddenly opened his eyes and disappeared in the next moment.","More than half of the black stone hall was damaged, and the ground was cracked open for nearly ten thousand miles. Purple-red lava seemed to boil the sky.","Under the ground that was as deep as the abyss, three figures stood above the lava.","Ding Beichun, who was half-naked, was gasping for air. Although Jian Wushuang looked calm, his palms were bleeding, which showed that he had not won easily.","Although Jian Wushuang had added an Extinctive Sword Strike into the River move Sword Intent, he had almost lost the battle.","He had not expected that Ding Beichun’s sword technique actually contained three Sword Intents.","The three of them combined into one profound sword move.","It had to be said that Ding Beichun’s sword principle was extremely powerful. With an indomitable aura, Jian Wushuang vaguely felt that it was similar to Ding Baiyi’s Extinctive Sword.","Even so, Jian Wushuang still won. He won not because of his cultivation realm or Yan power’s background, but purely because of the sword principle.","After Ding Beichun calmed his breathing, he cupped his hands at Jian Wushuang and said, “Brother Jian, I lost.”","“Continue to cultivate diligently. When your Sword Dao is complete, come and find me,” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","Ding Beichun laughed. “If there comes a day when my Sword Dao is fully integrated, I will definitely prove my Dao to Brother Jian.”","The Young Emperor floated between the two of them and asked with slight confusion, “By the way, do you smell anything?”","Ding Beichun was taken aback. He turned to look at the huge cauldron that had been half-swallowed by the lava.","“My, my furnace!”","As the wind blew, his body grew tens of thousands of feet. He jumped into the magma and pulled the huge furnace up.","However, it was too late. The sun-like light in the furnace was no longer there, and it had become extremely dim.","Ding Beichun’s hands trembled as he slowly opened the lid of the furnace.","Immediately, countless pungent black smoke scuttled out.","“Brother Jian, your sword seems to have been destroyed...” With a long face, he reached out and took out a Sword Embryo that was beyond recognition.","Jian Wushuang, “...”","The young Emperor said, “Beichun, have you thought about how you’re going to get beaten up?”"]},{"number":4752,"title":"Chapter 4752 Heavenly Dao Library","paragraphs":["4752 Heavenly Dao Library","In the end, thanks to Jian Wushuang’s intervention, Ding Beichun was not beaten up.","“Don’t worry, brother Jian. I’ll definitely forge a perfect sword for you in less than a century,” Ding Beichun said shamefully. “However, I’m afraid that the fate energy...”","Jian Wushuang did not scold him. Instead, he patted his shoulder and said, “Don’t feel too pressured. It’s fine if you don’t have it. That sword is no longer suitable for me. I’m looking forward to the sword you will give me in the future.”","Even though he said that, he still felt a sense of reluctance and loss in his heart.","He had ascended to this ultimate Great Yan Domain from the Divine Power Universe by himself, and the only Tarot Divine Sword had become his sustenance.","The familiar fate energy had disappeared, and even the last half of the Tarot Divine Sword had been reduced to dust.","Ding Beichun nodded heavily. “Don’t worry, Brother Jian. I, Ding Beichun, never go back on my word. Even if we don’t see each other again in the future, I’ll still personally deliver the sword to you.”","“Alright, I’ll wait for that day.” Jian Wushuang laughed.","“And brother Jian, I can feel that your way of the sword is completely different from my Master’s. I look forward to seeing you two discuss the sword one day. That was definitely an amazing battle,” Ding Beichun said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang became interested. Whether it was from the Young Emperor or Ding Beichun, he had heard about his mysterious Master too many times.","Just as he was about to ask, a supreme pressure quietly appeared behind the three of them.","Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor looked back at the same time and saw Uncle Yu staring at them with a cold face.","“U-Uncle Yu, listen to me...”","Below the platform, the two figures who were tied tightly to the pillars by Yan power ropes looked as if they had lost all will to live.","In the blink of an eye, Sword Heaven was tied up and brought back to the platform. To prevent the two from escaping again, the Yan power rope was almost tied to their heads.","“I say, Uncle Yu, the confinement is not that strict, is it? We didn’t do anything bad in there...” the Young Emperor said helplessly.","But no matter how hard he tried to open his mouth, Uncle Yu remained silent like a rock.","“Uncle Yu, please don’t imprison us like this. Why don’t you lock us up in the Heavenly Dao Library? We can read more books there.”","Uncle Yu opened his eyes slowly, then waved his hand to untie the ropes that bound the two.","“You are only allowed to go to the Heavenly Dao Library. If I discover that you guys have gone to other places, your confinement will be increased by another ten years.”","The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and pulled Jian Wushuang out of the Wind-Listening Platform again.","“I’m telling you, don’t drag me to some random place again,” Jian Wushuang said in dissatisfaction among the clouds.","The Young Emperor turned his head and smiled. “Don’t worry. I promise I won’t take you to any messy places this time.”","The Heavenly Dao Library was located in the center of the platform. Other than the Emperor and some Elders, it was not open to any Yan Immortals or Goddesses.","After flying in the Immortal cloud for half a day, Jian Wushuang saw a lofty pavilion sitting in the light wheel.","Nearly 20 overlapping light wheels rotated slowly, surrounding the pavilion in the middle. It looked sacred and mysterious.","When their feet landed on the ground, a few of the little attendants who were cleaning the square saw the two of them and bowed.","“This library is rarely visited by people. There are countless scrolls in it, including all the cultivation techniques and Daoist scriptures of the entire Great Si Region.”","The Young Emperor explained as he pushed open the dusty library.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was tempted. If what he said was true, he might be able to find some clues in the Heavenly Dao Library.","Even if he only understood some of the situations in the Great Yan Domain, it was much better than running around like a headless fly.","He pushed the door open and entered. A spiral wooden ladder that led upwards appeared in front of him.","“Although this is called a library, the space here is not much smaller than some ordinary Heavenly Regions. You can see all the profound cultivation techniques here.”","The Young Emperor explained as he walked forward slowly. At the same time, he waved his hand, and the clouds on both sides of the wooden ladder retreated, revealing a wall of books piled up with countless ancient books.","There were countless scrolls in it. Jian Wushuang took out a single book named ‘Mighty Secret Method’. It described the rudiments of the technique in great detail and was a rare treasure.","After flipping through another six to seven books, he truly felt that the Heavenly Dao Library was a treasure vault.","The secret techniques and cultivation techniques recorded in each of these books were no weaker than the Ancestral Skills. If they were placed in any Heavenly Region, they would probably cause a bloody storm.","However, these were not what Jian Wushuang wanted. He wanted to find a book that described the Great Yan Domain in detail and the mystery of the cultivation realms above Yan Immortal realm.","After he told the Young Emperor about this idea, he only got a shake of the head.","“You want to know the situation of the entire Great Yan Domain? Do you know how vast the entire Great Si Region is? I’m afraid even my Imperial Father can’t be sure of the situation in the Great Yan Domain.”","“A Heavenly Region is like a lone boat in the Great Yan Domain. Unless you can sense the existence of that realm, you will never be able to understand it.”","“The prerequisite for exploring this place is to have the Emperor’s fate energy.” The Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang with a meaningful look.","“And the prerequisite to becoming an Emperor is to completely step past the Yan Immortal realm and become a Grand Yan Immortal.”","“Grand Yan Immortal?” This was the first time Jian Wushuang had heard of a new realm other than the Yan Immoral realm.","The Young Emperor nodded. “That’s right. All the Elders you saw in the Heavenly Court, including my Imperial Father, were all at the Grand Yan Immortal realm.”","“However, there are differences between Grand Yan Immortals. Although my Imperial Father is also a Grand Yan Immortal, he has the Imperial Emperor’s fate energy. He can create the Heavenly Court and control the Heavenly Region.”","Jian Wushuang quickly absorbed the questions about realms and then asked, “What realms are above the Grand Yan Immoral?”","“I’m afraid only my Imperial Father can explain this. As for me, I haven’t broken through to the Grand Yan Immortal realm.” The Young Emperor laughed at himself and walked forward slowly.","Jian Wushuang did not ask any more questions. He learned that there was a Great Yan Immortal realm above the Yan Immortal realm. As for Emperors, they were people who showed control and dominance in the Great Yan Immortal realm.","It made him subconsciously feel that the realms above the Grand Yan Immortal were very likely to be known or advanced only after becoming an Emperor.","As the wooden ladder under his feet spiraled up, Jian Wushuang continuously took out books and read them.","Just as he finished reading another book and was about to continue, a book that was slightly thicker than the other books came into view."]},{"number":4753,"title":"Chapter 4753 Seeing the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor Again","paragraphs":["4753 Seeing the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor Again","Jian Wushuang’s intuition told him to take out the ancient book.","This was a rather practical body-strengthening secret technique, but the title page did not even have a Yan power seal, so it was obviously not very precious.","However, he immediately noticed a hard object in the middle of the ancient book.","He impatiently flipped to the middle, and a palm-sized bone armor covered in cracks came into view.","As if a thunderbolt had exploded in his mind, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and the scene in Jingchuan Tian City reappeared.","Based on his intuition, Jian Wushuang was sure that the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in front of him definitely came from the same source as the bone armor Jingchuan had encountered earlier.","He hurriedly looked over and saw the intricate patterns on the bone armor slowly moving, gradually forming the words ‘stop the war’.","Furthermore, the words on this piece of bone armor were clearly several times more than those on the first piece.","Just as the fourth word was about to appear, the Young Emperor’s voice interrupted Jian Wushuang’s thoughts.","“Is this bone armor very important to you?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and nodded heavily. Then, he hurriedly looked at the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in his hand.","However, this time, the patterns on the bone armor were all scattered back to their original appearance, and there was no longer any shape of a character.","The bone armor seemed to contain some kind of energy. It could only be seen clearly at first glance, and could not be cracked after that.","After another round of testing, Jian Wushuang realized that he really could not distinguish it, so he had no choice but to give up.","Then he looked at the Young Emperor and asked, “Can I take this thing with me?”","The Young Emperor shrugged. “Just don’t burn this place down. You can take whatever you want.”","After thanking him, Jian Wushuang carefully kept the bone armor close to his chest.","It did not matter if this bone armor had any connection to Xuan Yi. As long as there was a small possibility, he would not miss it.","When the Young Emperor saw this, an inexplicable look flashed in his eyes. He stood up and said, “Let’s continue to walk around here. We have ten years of confinement after all.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. At the same time, he was looking forward to it. Could there be other Heaven-patterned Bone Armors in the Heavenly Dao Library?","As he walked forward slowly, he kept scanning through some of the ancient books that were in a rather unusual state.","The Young Emperor, who was a hundred steps away from him, looked back and then secretly waved his hand to take out a slightly bloated ancient book from the wall on the right.","A moment later, he put the ancient book back on the wall.","“Brother Jian, the most important thing to do from the Yan Immortal realm to the Grand Yan Immortal stage is to comprehend the immortal Style.”","“This is very easy for you. During the fight for the Peach in the Heavenly Realm, Brother Jian, you sealed Prince Jiu with an Immortal Style. You’re really powerful.”","The Young Emperor said, “Once you comprehend an Immortal Style, it means that you will break through to the Grand Yan Immortal one day in the future. When that time comes, I’m looking forward to seeing your transformation, Brother Jian.”","After listening to him, Jian Wushuang gradually understood that the terrifying power that he had mastered in the hidden space in the Heavenly Realm was the so-called Immortal Style.","He was not too surprised or happy. That ‘Little Mountain and River’, which was an Immortal Style, was extremely powerful, but it was too complicated and vast. When he used it for the first time, he felt that there were hundreds of galaxies rotating in his spiritual sense, which was too exhausting.","The two of them continued to chat in the Heavenly Dao Library. After an unknown period of time, Uncle Yu’s cold and emotionless voice rang out.","“The Emperor has ordered that the punishment of ten years of confinement for the two of you is revoked. Return to the Heavenly Court now without delay.”","“What’s going on? The punishment has been revoked so quickly?” the Young Emperor murmured softly. Although the ten years of confinement had passed in a flash, the news that it could be revoked in advance made the two of them feel a lot more relaxed.","Uncle Yu stood outside the Heavenly Dao Library, waiting for the two of them silently.","After leaving the Heavenly Dao Library and the Wind-Listening Platform, Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor finally returned to the Heavenly Court.","The banquet was coming to an end, and the Elders with light wheels had already left the Heavenly Court.","“Yan’er, are you really not going to stay by my side?” Zhen Wuyang asked as he sat on the Emperor’s throne and exudisSupreme Emperor’s might.","The Young Emperor shook his head. “I’m still in charge of the Six Heavens Realm, and I can’t stop mining the black mountain crystals. I don’t have the power to stay by Imperial Father’s side.”","“But...” Zhen Wuyang hesitated and finally let the Young Emperor leave.","Watching him leave, the sadness in Zhen Wuyang’s eyes became more obvious.","Walking out of the Heavenly Court, the inexplicable pressure on Jian Wushuang disappeared. He felt unspeakably comfortable and clear.","At the same time, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others who had been waiting for a long time came up to him.","“I thought that the two of you were really going to be locked up for ten years. It’s only been two years and you’ve been released. I was worried for nothing,” Cheng Qing said with exultation.","The Young Emperor shook his head helplessly, then turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “Brother Jian, wait for me at the entrance of the Heavenly Realm. I’ll bid farewell to my Imperial Father for the last time.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and followed Chen Qing to the entrance of the Heavenly Realm.","Their figures gradually disappeared. The Young Emperor and the skinny purple-robed man exchanged a look and returned to the Heavenly Court.","With the departure of the various Elders and the group of Yan Immortals, the entire Heavenly Court fell silent again.","However, in order to leave a good impression in front of Zhen Wuyang, the Princes were the last to leave.","At this moment, the Young Emperor, who had changed into luxurious clothes, was leaving the Heavenly Court with the skinny purple robe.","As he left, another Prince wearing a white court robe walked out of the Heavenly Court. It was the ordinary-looking Fifth Prince, Prince Mo.","Prince Mo, who had been hit 50 times, still felt a dull pain in his back even after several years. Naturally, his hatred for the Young Emperor was even deeper.","At this moment, when he saw the Young Emperor’s back, he wanted to rush up and give him a kick.","However, his rationality restrained his actions. Just as Prince Mo was thinking about how to teach him a lesson, a palm-sized white jade object fell from the Young Emperor’s waist to the ground.","Immediately after, the white jade item rolled to Prince Mo’s feet.","“What’s this? Is it the bone that Prince Yan gnawed on?”","Prince Mo was extremely confused. He kicked the palm-sized white jade bone that was covered in cracks.","Then, he bent down and picked up the strange bone. “My friend, do you know what this is?”","The white-robed Yan immortal beside Prince Mo shook his head. “I don’t know, but I don’t think Prince Yan would carry a useless item with him. It’s very likely that it’s something very important to him.”"]},{"number":4754,"title":"Chapter 4754 The Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture","paragraphs":["4754 The Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture","Upon hearing this, the corners of Prince Mo’s mouth curled up. “This fool actually has the habit of being forgetful. Now that it has fallen into my hands, you can forget about taking it back forever.”","Prince Mo and the white-robed Yan Immortal sneered as they watched the Young Emperor walk away, not knowing that he had lost something.","In a place they could not see, the Young Emperor’s lips curved up slightly.","After leaving the Heavenly Court and sitting on the Imperial carriage, he turned around and took a look at the Heavenly Court above the Nine Heavens.","Perhaps in the next year, everything would change dramatically.","As the winner of the Peach contest in the Heavenly Realm, in addition to the Immortal Peach as a reward, Emperor Zhen Wuyang waved his hand and gave him more than ten carriages of Supreme Treasures. He then drove back to the Six Heavens Realm.","Fortunately, they did not encounter any more ambushes on the way back and returned safely.","After returning to Little Lonely Heaven, Jian Wushuang began to examine the two Heaven-patterned Bone Armors and consolidate the Immortal Style move he had just comprehended.","The path of cultivation above the Yan Immortal stage in the Great Yan Domain was difficult and illusory.","Jian Wushuang now had two powerful Ancestral Skills, two sword moves for the Star River Lake Sea Sword Sword Intents, the newly obtained Immortal Style ‘Little Mountain and River’, and the True Shadows of the three Emperors in the Boyang Bottle.","Whether it was his trump cards or his foundation, they were enough to allow him to gain a foothold in the Great Yan Domain.","He was confident that even if he were to face Grand Yan Immortals who carried light wheels, he would not be killed in one move.","In the following years, he re-consolidated his Immortal Style. The more he comprehended, the more he felt how terrifying the stone bead was.","One had to know that this Immortal Style, Little Mountain and River, was only an extremely small galaxy among the countless galaxies in the stone bead.","What would it be like if all of them were developed?","Also, who could have left this stone bead in the mind of the vast Sea Sky Octopus?","All kinds of mysteries were like a mess that firmly entangled Jian Wushuang. While he was extremely confused, he grew up quickly without him knowing.","Just as he was studying the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor, the Young Emperor came to visit with the Supreme Treasure bestowed by Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","It had been five years.","“Brother Jian, it’s been several years since we last met. Your aura has become much steadier,” the Young Emperor said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang looked away from the bone armor and asked, “You’re here? Isn’t Chen Qing with you?”","The Young Emperor shook his head slightly. “There’s something wrong with the black mountains in the Lower Three Heavens. I sent him to investigate.”","When he heard about the black mountains in the Lower Three Heavens, Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. It was obvious that he had some reservations about that place.","Sensing the displeasure in his eyes, the Young Emperor patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and said sincerely, “It’s not my wish to trap those prisoners. You’ve seen my situation. If I didn’t have the black mountain crystal to exchange for a large number of treasures to cultivate my power, I’m afraid I would’ve died in the non-stop assassination attempts for my life.”","“I promise you, as long as I break through to Grand Yan Immortal and the Emperor’s fate energy enfolds me, I will immediately return them their freedom.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. The reason why he was still here was because of the oath he had made with the Young Emperor. On the other hand, he felt that the time was far from right. If he were to travel around the Great Yan Domain rashly now, it would be even more difficult for him to obtain any clues.","With the Heavenly Court as the foundation, it would be much easier and more convenient to explore.","The Young Emperor also consciously stopped talking about this topic, but looked at the two bone armors on the table.","“Brother Jian, how’s the investigation going? Did you get the answer you wanted?” He pointed at the bone armor.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “It’s not that easy. I’m afraid I’ll have to wait until all of them are gathered before I can understand them.”","“Are these things important to you?” The Young Emperor asked the same question again.","Jian Wushuang said, “Before I figure it out, these things are not of much value to me. But I do need them.”","The Young Emperor nodded, then lowered his voice slightly. “Since this thing is useful to Brother Jian, I’ll tell you.”","“Actually, this isn’t something that only appeared in the Heavenly Dao Library. I’ve seen this bone armor on a person before and now that I think about it, it should be what Brother Jian needs.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was moved. w”Where?”","“The Fifth Prince, Prince Mo,” the Young Emperor looked at him and said softly.","‘Prince Mo.’ Jian Wushuang repeated the name in his heart and asked, “If he really has it, can I use something to exchange for it?”","The Young Emperor shook his head and said, “He is the most unreasonable and ruthless of my Imperial Father’s seven sons. In the early years, he enjoyed slaughtering cities and taking advantage of others. He only restrained himself after being locked up in the Heavenly Realm for 10,000 years.”","“I’m afraid bartering won’t work in his place.”","Jian Wushuang also frowned slightly. He had a bad impression of Prince Mo during the fight for the Peach.","After Prince Mo had obtained the Immortal Peach, he had gone back on his word and ambushed Prince Qian.","Moreover, his attacks were quite fierce. Even though he looked quite ordinary, in terms of scheming and control of his realm, he was probably the best among the Seven Princes.","From the Young Emperor’s description of Prince Mo, combined with what he had seen in the Heavenly Realm, Prince Mo was obviously a powerful and cunning fellow.","“There’s still one more way, and that’s to snatch that bone armor,” the Young Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and said in a calm voice.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. He was hesitating.","Based on his previous impression, the only way to obtain the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in Prince Mo’s hands was to snatch it.","“Are you sure that Prince Mo really has a bone armor?”","“I’m sure. If I’m lying, I’ll surrender my head to you.”","Jian Wushuang’s gaze passed through the door of the hall and looked at the foggy sky outside Little Lonely Heaven.","The temptation of a Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was too great for him.","The main reason why he broke his clay idol and Ascended to the Great Yan Domain alone was not only because he was pursuing the ultimate realm of all creation, but also to find his Master Xuan Yi and Old Master.","He had a strong feeling that they were in the Great Yan Domain!","Although this only clue was vague, it could not be broken.","Slowly exhaling a long breath, he asked softly, “Where is Prince Mo?”","“The Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture,” the Young Emperor replied. “Brother Jian, have you made up your mind?”","“No matter what the result is, I have to take this path.”","“Alright,” he said.","Outside Little Lonely Heaven, the wind was howling, and three figures stood in a triangular formation.","The young man at the front took off his black Ranger shirt and changed into a set of warm jade-like clothes."]},{"number":4755,"title":"Chapter 4755 The Heavy Snow and the Strong Wind, the Vast Heaven and Earth","paragraphs":["4755 The Heavy Snow and the Strong Wind, the Vast Heaven and Earth","After many transformations, Jian Wushuang, who originally looked ordinary, had become handsome and had a unique ethereal aura around him.","From time to time, faint golden divine patterns would sublimate between the ends of his black hair that were tied behind him, giving him the feeling of a young master who had transcended the mortal world.","And behind him stood two tall and strong figures that looked like gods.","Cheng Qing was like a swordmaster, and with his tall stature, he had an aura full of oppression. Even the slightly thin Chun Qiu was close to nine feet.","When the three of them stood together, there was an indescribable disharmony, but there was also a little bit of meaning.","After giving them some instructions, the Young Emperor watched the three of them leave.","“Da Ban, tell me, am I doing the right thing?”","“There’s no right or wrong, Your Highness. There’s only success or failure.”","...","In the Heavenly Region dotted with countless stars, three figures were moving freely.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had traveled so freely since he came to the Great Yan Domain.","With the stars above his head and the flowing clouds beneath his feet, he was indescribably comfortable and relaxed.","Countless Heavenly Regions were flowing under their bodies, and the fate energy in each Heavenly Region was like an eggshell, full and mysterious.","Each Heavenly Region contained dozens of continents, and each continent had countless lives.","However, this was only one of the most unremarkable Heavenly Regions in the Great Si Region.","Although they were rushing to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, where Prince Mo was located, with Cheng Qing following them, this journey that should have been boring and somber had unknowingly become quite interesting.","The wind blew and the snow fell. The world was vast.","Many different Heavenly Regions and Realms appeared in front of them.","There were nine-headed dragons that even Yan Immortals could not match, and there were countless precious stones in the Super Heavenly Regions.","They also had a prosperous sect with a terrifying foundation that spanned three to four Heavenly Regions.","Of course, most of them were Heavenly Regions where there were few living beings and few top cultivators.","Cheng Qing seemed to be very familiar with the routes. He always reached some interesting Heavenly Regions with little energy.","Of course, when traveling across the Heavenly Regions, there were always some people who liked to rob.","Even if one was born in the mortal world and achieved the Yan Immortal stage, there would definitely be many who liked to make money.","Everything brought a lot of fun to the boring journey.","“How is it? You haven’t experienced this kind of life in many years, have you?”","On a vast land of yellow sand, three figures sat on the back of a heavenly beast that looked like a dragon and a horse, slowly moving forward.","Heavy snow fell from the sky above, falling on everyone’s shoulders.","Carrying the snowflakes on his shoulder, Jian Wushuang did not deliberately use Yan power to evaporate them. In his opinion, comprehending the natural life and death of all living things was a meaningful thing.","“Brother Chen Qing, do you often travel between these Heavenly Regions?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Chen Qing, who was sitting on the heavenly beast’s back, laughed and said, “It’s quite embarrassing. Before I met the Young Emperor, I was still a brat who was at the Entry Yan realm.”","“I used to be young and aggressive, and I made a lot of enemies. In the end, I had to run for my life. That’s how I got to know more than half of the Great Si Region.”","“For example, we are about to go to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. At first, I had no choice but to seek shelter with Prince Mo. I didn’t expect that before I could even enter the Heavenlyy Region, I would be beaten up and my foundation would almost be destroyed.”","Chen Qing was still smiling, but Jian Wushuang could tell from his trembling voice that he was not going to calm down.","“Therefore, I’m going to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture this time for two reasons. One is to help you find what you want, and the other is to settle the score with Prince Mo. I’m going to take back the beating I suffered back then with interest.”","Looking at Chen Qing, who was feeling uneasy, Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart. He was afraid that this trip to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture would not be peaceful at all.","Just as the three of them were about to leave the Heavenly Region, a bulge suddenly appeared on the ground not far away.","Then, the sand and stone separated, and an extremely sloppy, three-inch-long pocket-sized old man came out.","The three of them looked at each other and then looked forward.","When the sloppy old man who had emerged from the ground saw the three of them, his eyes lit up with joy and he ran over with his short legs. “Everyone, my honored guests, this old man greets you.”","What responded to him was the long saber in Chun Qiu’s hand.","The long saber cut through the air, but it was suspended above the sloppy old man’s head, not slashing down.","Even so, the old man was so shocked that he knelt on the ground and could not even speak properly.","“Tell me, what are you waiting for us for?” Cheng Qing looked at him with interest.","When the sloppy old man heard this, he swallowed with difficulty. “My Lord, I have no ill intentions. I just want to use the map to exchange for some rare treasures. That’s why I suddenly appeared and alarmed the three of you.”","Hearing this, Chen Qing looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Instead, he carefully sized up the sloppy old man.","He was only at the Half Ancestor realm, and his strength had yet to reach the advanced stage.","The skin of this three-foot-tall figure that was exposed outside of his clothes had a quicksand-like texture. He should be a goblin that stole the fate energy of this realm, so he was not too threatening.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang let down his guard and asked slowly, “What map?”","Seeing that the killing intent in the three’s eyes had receded, the sloppy old man let out a long sigh of relief in his heart. Then, he said in a low voice, “I saw that the three of you have extraordinary Yan power. Obviously, you are Yan Immortals who are traveling in the Heavenly Region. So, I thought of handing over a map I picked up a few years ago to you in exchange for some precious treasures. As for what kind of map it is, I can’t tell...”","As he spoke, he took out a badly damaged notebook from his shabby clothes.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang looked at Chun Qiu.","Chun Qiu understood tacitly. He waved his hand and threw a storage bag containing thousands of black mountain crystals to the sloppy old man.","He did not expect to get anything in return, but he subconsciously opened the storage bag and saw the black mountain crystals.","With a ‘plop’, the sloppy old man sat on the ground.","One had to know that the most ordinary black mountain crystal was enough for peak cultivators who had not reached the Entry Yan realm to use for several months. It was a treasure in the entire Heavenly Region.","Not to mention the peak crystal produced by the black mountains.","The top crystal was black with a thread-like purple glow. Even if all the black mountains in the entire mountain heaven were added together, the production rate was extremely low.","At this moment, the appearance of these thousands of apex crystals caused the Yan power that was so dense that it turned into water to form a thin layer of mist around the sloppy old man."]},{"number":4756,"title":"Chapter 4756 Serve the Wine","paragraphs":["4756 Serve the Wine","Even in the entire Great Si Region, Yan Immortals would fight for the peak crystal of the black mountains.","However, Jian Wushuang had no idea about it because the Young Emperor had given him more than ten interspatial rings before he left. Each of the rings was full of crystals of this standard.","As for the storage rings that were filled with apex crystals, Jian Wushuang had given them to Chun Qiu for safekeeping to save time.","Judging from Chun Qiu’s rough estimation, the ten storage rings contained the peak crystals that were produced in one Hua Year from the continuous mining of the black mountains...","This was also the reason why Chun Qiu was so generous.","Ignoring the old man’s shock, Jian Wushuang reached out and took the badly damaged notebook.","There was a unique texture in his hand, and it was accompanied by a weak derivation power, which made him a little suspicious that the map notes seemed to be written on some kind of unique leather scroll.","With a wave of his hand, he removed the faint Yan power seal on it, and a peerless pattern appeared before his eyes.","The picture on the scroll was extremely complicated and grand. One could vaguely see that the crisscrossing picture had gone beyond the scope of the heaven domain. It seemed to be the vastness of the universe.","Moreover, this map seemed to have suffered some kind of damage. Apart from the rough outline, most of the details were undetectable. It was obviously a brainless and useless map.","“F*ck, this old man is trying to scam us!” Cheng Qing slapped his thigh and looked at the sloppy old man with a face full of anger.","But where could he find his avatar in the vast yellow sand?","“This old man, how dare he lie to me. Even if I have to dig three feet into the ground, I’ll burn his bones and scatter his ashes!” Cheng Qing rolled up his sleeves in anger and was about to stir the yellow sand.","Jian Wushuang reached out his hand to stop him. “Although this map looks useless now, it may come in handy in the future. As for the crystals, just take it as a gift.”","Cheng Qing was indignant, but he also knew that their primary goal was to go to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, so he suppressed his anger and continued to move forward.","However, before he left this Heavenly Region, Cheng Qing left behind a Yan power clone. He was waiting for the sloppy old man to appear again so that he could give him a good beating.","After this brief interlude, the three of them continued to move forward without stopping.","Sitting on the back of the heavenly beast, Jian Wushuang took out the map and read it carefully.","The leather scroll depicted the rise and fall of various territories, and they were all drawn with some kind of dark red paint, which was inexplicably mysterious and strange.","However, since the map did not have any name, he could not see anything.","Jian Wushuang simply stopped studying it and stuffed the map into the Boyang Bottle.","After traveling for several months, the three of them stopped in a small Heavenly Region to rest under Cheng Qing’s strong request.","It was a small Heavenly Region, but it contained three independent plane continents.","With the fate energy of the Great Yan Domain, even the cultivators who had just stepped into cultivation would have a very long lifespan. Their own cultivation realm would also grow with their longevity, and it was very easy for them to reach the peak of the Entry Yan realm.","However, 99 percent of these top cultivators would stop here, and the higher Yan Immortal realm was extremely cruel.","Even though Jian Wushuang had seen thousands of Yan Immortals along the way, it was purely because of him. Once he entered the Great Yan Domain, he was close to the peak of the cultivation realm and power.","If he had landed on a random continent in a Heavenly Region, it would have taken tens of thousands of years for him to reach where he was today.","At the same time, after reading through the thousands of Heavenly Regions, Jian Wushuang found that there were no mortals in the Great Yan Domain.","Even the most insignificant people could use Yan power proficiently and their lifespans would also increase.","Stepping into this plane continent with extremely thin distribution of Yan power, the bustling streets came into view.","The number of cultivators on a continent was determined by the number of Yan power. On this continent, there were very few cultivators. Occasionally, he would see cultivators, but they were not ordinary cultivators even in the Entry Yan realm.","“I’m craving liquor again. Brother Jian, Brother Chun Qiu, let’s go to a quiet place to have a drink and rest.” Cheng Qing scratched his head. With his height of more than three meters, he could attract quite a lot of attention when walking on the street.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Then, the three of them entered a quiet restaurant on the street.","Without the wine boy or waiter to guide them, the three of them directly chose a secluded place by the window and sat down.","Cheng Qing then slammed the table. “Where are you? Serve the wine!”","There were very few customers in the entire restaurant, and only one or two tables of customers could be vaguely seen at the corners.","“He’s here, what are you shouting for!” A tall and strong man wearing gray clothes and a white handkerchief around his waist walked out from the back of the car. His face was fierce-looking.","Hearing this, Chen Qing wanted to get up and give him two slaps, but he was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","“Serve three jars of wine, as soon as possible,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","Then, Chun Qiu threw out a black mountain apex crystal. “Remember, I want good wine.”","The tall and strong man caught it subconsciously, and his eyes flashed with great greed.","“Sure, sure. No problem. We have all the good wine you want!” After saying that, the tall and strong man stumbled into the back of the shop.","“Motherf*cker, how dare a small fry like him act so outrageously. If it wasn’t for Brother Jian stopping me today, I would have definitely smashed his brain out,” Cheng Qing said angrily.","Jian Wushuang looked at the street outside the window and said lightly, “It’s better to avoid unnecessary trouble. They are not the owners of this restaurant.”","Cheng Qing was startled, but he quickly understood the meaning behind his words.","Not long after, the tall and strong man dressed in nondescript clothing jogged over with two large jars of wine in his arms. There were three or four other men following behind him.","There were more than ten jars of wine and side dishes in front of the three of them.","“M-my distinguished guests, drink to your heart’s content, there will be enough!” The tall and strong man grinned. He carefully opened the seal of the jar before leaving.","Cheng Qing did not suspect him and directly slapped the jar, and the crystal clear wine line fell into the three people’s bowls.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh.","Chun Qiu also laughed helplessly. “This bunch of idiots, they actually added medicinal powder into the wine.”","“Who cares? I haven’t had a sip of wine since the banquet at the Heavenly Court. Today, we’re going to drink a thousand pots.” Cheng Qing’s eyes moved. He drank a full bowl first and let out a comfortable sigh.","Looking at the clear liquid in the wine, Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu shook their heads helplessly and drank as well.","After reaching the Yan Immortal realm, the past mortal world had already turned into a clay embryo and dispersed. Things with strong poison could no longer paralyze the Immortal body. Even the most illusionary treasures were likely unable to harm the Yan Immortal."]},{"number":4757,"title":"Chapter 4757 Chewed Wine","paragraphs":["4757 Chewed Wine","Only big guys like the huge Sea Sky Octopus that had transcended the concept of Yan Immortal could control Yan Immortal’s consciousness, but it was still limited.","However, in this Heavenly Region, where even Entry Yan cultivators were rare, everything was like an ant to Jian Wushuang and the others, so they naturally did not have to worry.","“How is it, Old Four? Did they drink?”","“They drank it, they drank it. They already drank three jars!”","“That’s good. Send another 20 jars over later. We’ll just drug these ignorant Young Masters of the aristocratic families. Why do you think they’re out here for no reason? They’ll die in our hands in the end.”","“But then again, why is the effect of this medicine so bad? Ten jars in, and they are still standing? Give me more later.”","Separated by a layer of gauze, a few hunchbacked figures were discussing in low voices.","Naturally, their soft voices all entered the ears of Jian Wushuang and the other two.","After another whole jar of wine went down his stomach, Chen Qing picked up a peanut from the plate and asked, “Brother Jian, did you have enough to drink?”","Jian Wushuang put down the wine bowl and nodded.","After that, Cheng Qing knocked on the table with her finger. “Waiter, bill please.”","“It’s coming, it’s coming!”","More than a dozen fierce-looking men ran out from the back of the stall, all of them with sharp knives on their backs.","With just a glance, Cheng Qing raised his eyebrows and smiled. He flicked the peanut in his hand over.","The peanut that was wrapped in strong Yan power cut through space and passed through his body.","Swish-","The leader of the men didn’t even have time to take out the sharp knife on his back before he felt an unbearable pain in his stomach.","He subconsciously looked down and saw a head-sized hole in his stomach.","Even the dozens of men behind him were frozen on the spot, looking at the huge hole in disbelief.","“What an eyesore.”","No longer looking at them, Chen Qing waved his hand and released Yan power, crushing them into fine powder.","The restaurant was completely silent.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting in the same place, also picked up a peanut and flicked it to the ceiling.","In an instant, the entire ceiling, along with the six floors of the top floor, collapsed.","Chun Qiu quickly released Yan power to protect the three of them.","Then, a few screams sounded, and then it was quiet again.","A moment later, in the lobby of a restaurant, a black-robed man was lying unconscious on his back.","On the other side of the black-robed man, a teary-eyed woman was looking at Jian Wushuang and the other two in horror. As she was cut by the gravel, there were a few more bloody marks on her beautiful face, which made her look even more delicate.","Seeing this scene, Cheng Qing could no longer sit still. He immediately stood up and kicked the unconscious man into powder.","“Young Lady, are you alright?” Chen Qing waved his hand to untie the rope on her body as he spoke with a gentle expression.","The woman subconsciously shifted away. “I’m fine.”","“You were kidnapped by them and brought here?”","“No, I’m the manager of this restaurant...”","After some small talk, Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu silently looked at Chen Qing’s glib tongue and let down the soft and beautiful shopkeeper’s defense.","...","“My three honored guests, this is a unique brew personally brewed by the shopkeeper to repay you for saving my life.”","The real waiter brought a jade pot and poured another cup for the three of them.","The wine was crystal clear, and when it fell into the cup, it gave off a light fragrance.","Chen Qing’s index finger twitched, and he immediately picked up the cup and drank it all in one gulp. At the end, his eyes lit up. “Good wine, slightly sweet in the mouth, and also a little sour. Top quality!”","After tidying up her appearance, the gentle and beautiful woman walked out of the back of the carriage. When she heard this, her face could not help but blush.","When the waiter heard this, she immediately raised her thumb and said, “Your Excellency’s wine-tasting skills are top-notch. This excellent wine was personally made by my family. It was naturally fermented with chewed rice as the tune. It’s extremely delicious.”","The air froze and Jian Wushuang silently retracted his hand that touched the cup.","Chun Qiu, who had already drunk half a mouthful, stood rooted to the ground, his face turning green.","Cheng Qing’s mouth twitched, and his eyelids twitched uncontrollably, “You, you mean, this wine, is chewing wine?”","“That’s right, the wine yeast was personally chewed by me.”","“...”","Although the shopkeeper looked gentle and beautiful, he had never heard of anyone making wine by chewing the yeast. Jian Wushuang secretly heaved a sigh of relief. He was glad that he did not speak too fast, otherwise, he would be traumatized by wine.","Perhaps sensing that their expressions were unnatural, the gentle and beautiful woman pursed her lips and moved forward to remove the wine pot.","Cheng Qing hurriedly stopped her. “What’s the matter?”","“I know you guys don’t like it.” The gentle and beautiful woman pursed her lips.","“Well, it’s probably because the customs are different. I don’t mind.” As he said that, Cheng Qing directly took back the wine pot and began to drink to his heart’s content.","When the gentle and beautiful woman saw this, her face turned even redder. She turned around and ran back into the back of the store.","Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu gulped unconsciously, sighing in their hearts about how powerful Chen Qing was.","“Good wine,” After finishing the jug, Cheng Qing wiped his lips and took out an exquisite palm-sized wine jug from his pocket, and threw it to the waiter. “Give it to me. Fill it up.”","...","“It doesn’t matter if it’s chewed yeast or not. The main thing is that I like to drink.”","Cheng Qing lay back down on the heavenly beast’s broad back, leisurely taking a sip of wine.","As they traveled outside the Heavenly Region, Chun Qiu held back his laughter and said, “Brother Chen, are you planning to leave just like that? I saw the shopkeeper’s eyes looking at you just now, and she seemed to be reluctant to part with you.”","Cheng Qing slowly opened his eyes and then closed them again, “She is a mortal, and I am a Yan Immortal. Since there is no end to this, I might as well pretend that nothing happened.”","Jian Wushuang agreed with Chen Qing’s words. Even a mortal who could not cultivate could live for more than 500 years due to the fate energy of the Great Yan Domain.","However, to a Yan Immortal’s destiny that had broken the shackles and his near-infinite lifespan, it might be a period of Enlightenment in the billions. All the ties in the past would turn into the clouds and smoke of the past.","It was best not to be tainted by this karma.","Sitting on the heavenly beast’s back, Jian Wushuang looked at the flowing galaxy and could not help but recall the deepest memory in his heart.","He had made a decision when he was about to come to the Great Yan Domain after the Divine Power Universe had cut off the past.","This decision was only known to Ninth Kalpa King, and it was personally carried out by him.","After Jian Wushuang had left the Divine Power Universe, Ninth Kalpa King had sealed a large realm with the maxim of Great Dao. In that large realm, Jian Wushuang’s descendants were also sealed.","Even though he had resolutely cut off his past, he was still selfish.","This was a stupid decision he had made because he did not dare to face the consequences."]},{"number":4758,"title":"Chapter 4758 Bizarre Promotion","paragraphs":["4758 Bizarre Promotion","Moreover, when Jian Wushuang was about to leave the Divine Power Universe, he left a part of his Yan Immortal fate energy, integrated it with the Divine Power Universe, and forcibly raised the fate energy in the Divine Power Universe, allowing the Ninth Kalpa King and Dao Yan to enter the Ancestor realm.","He did not know if everything he had done was right or wrong, and what irreparable consequences would happen.","Jian Wushuang rubbed his eyebrows.","Cheng Qing, who was walking beside him, mumbled, “Maybe I can change something.”","The Heavenly Region was vast and under Zhen Wuyang’s control. After traveling for a few years, Jian Wushuang and the other two finally arrived at the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","The so-called Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was located in the northern part of the Great Si Region. It was extremely magnificent and looked like a small Heavenly Court from a distance.","Yan power turned into clouds, cranes flew with the clouds, and auspicious light shot into the other Heavenly Regions.","A majestic heavenly gate sat in the clouds, looking extremely mysterious.","The three figures, led by Jian Wushuang, stepped on the clouds and went straight in.","There were several Yan Immortals guarding the heavenly gate, which was much more strict than the Young Emperor’s Six Heavens Realm.","In order to avoid any detours, the three of them entered the heavenly gate directly.","At the same time, to avoid being recognized, Jian Wushuang took out the black-gold mask that he had gotten from Chun Qiu and pressed it on his face. Immediately, he transformed into the appearance of a middle-aged man.","Chun Qiu and Cheng Qing also changed their appearances and suppressed their cultivation to the Ancestor realm.","As a result, the three peak cultivators, who seemed to have made no achievements in terms of cultivation, entered the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture without any difficulty.","The few Yan Immortals guarding the heavenly gate did not make things difficult for them or question them. After a few words of teasing, they let them in.","The clouds parted, and the magnificent Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, which was like a Fairyland, came into Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“Brother Jian, if we go straight to the point like this, I’m afraid we’ll attract Prince Mo’s attention,” Cheng Qing said as he cast his gaze across the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","Jian Wushuang said, “There’s no hurry. We haven’t figured out where Prince Mo is. Let’s explore this place first before making any plans.”","“I guess that’s the only way.”","At this point, the three disheveled middle-aged men, who were only at the Ancestor cultivation realm, had settled down in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","In the bustling world, there were countless top cultivators, even Yan Immortals riding on cranes could be seen everywhere.","The auspicious light from the sun above his head enveloped everything in a layer of Immortal aura.","In order to avoid attracting attention, the three of them decided to walk into the Heavenly City and look for a way to get close to Prince Mo.","“Look, look!” The top-grade black mountain apex crystals are all produced in the Six Heavens Realm!","In the center of one of the cities, a sudden and loud voice attracted Jian Wushuang’s attention.","He looked in the direction of the voice and saw a stall filled with black crystals on the way.","An unkempt Daoist in a long gray robe was peddling his wares, and the number of top cultivators gathered in front of his stall was increasing.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly and a strange feeling rose in his heart.","“I really didn’t expect that the black mountain crystals could be circulated in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. I heard that Prince Mo had stopped the circulation of black mountain crystals. When did he allow it?” Cheng Qing touched his chin and said thoughtfully.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He walked forward slowly to check the movement in front of the stall.","Seeing the crowd gradually gathering, the sloppy Daoist began to promote even more.","“Everyone, take a closer look. It’s completely mined to the Six Heavens Realm, and it’s the best black mountain apex crystal. The production rate is terrible. It’s also said that the black mountains in the Six Heavens Realm have been mined dry. If one piece of this peak crystal is used, there will be one less in the world.”","Looking at the palm-sized irregular black crystals, Jian Wushuang was sure that this sloppy Daoist was not lying. Every piece was a real black mountain crystal.","An Ancestor realm cultivator was moved and asked, “How much is the price for one piece?”","When the sloppy Daoist saw someone asking for a price, he said with a smile, “Today’s sale is one piece of black mountain apex crystal. We only need any unique cultivation technique copy. There are no restrictions on any cultivation technique.”","The hundred or so top cultivators who were watching were all stunned when they heard this. Then, they all scrambled to throw out their cultivation techniques in exchange for a black mountain peak crystal.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly when he saw the scene of the transaction.","One must know that this black mountain peak crystal was extremely useful even to those in the Yan Immortal stage. Every piece of it was naturally extremely valuable.","But now, those Half Ancestor cultivators who had not even reached the level of Entry Yan could exchange for one with just an unrated cultivation technique. How could they not be suspicious?","Moreover, looking at the sloppy Daoist’s expression, Jian Wushuang felt that it was not an equal deal, but a task.","The scene was a little chaotic. Jian Wushuang saw several Yan Immortals participating in the trade, but in less than half an incense’s time, the stall full of black mountain peak crystals was empty.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching from afar, saw that the smile on the sloppy Daoist’s face had disappeared and was replaced by an impatient look as all the top cultivators left quickly.","He directly rolled up nearly 100 cultivation techniques on the spread, and then with a wave of his palm, he stuffed all of them into his sleeves.","After doing all this, he quickly stepped into the air and left.","“Brother Jian, did you notice something wrong?” Cheng Qing asked in a low voice.","“Follow him. Let’s see what he’s planning,” Jian Wushuang said noncommittally.","Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu nodded at the same time, and the three of them quickly followed.","However, it did not take long for the aura of the sloppy Daoist to disappear without a trace. No one noticed it, not even Jian Wushuang. At the same time, another loud voice could be heard from another Heavenly City.","Jian Wushuang immediately decided that the three of them would split up and try their best to find out how many stalls were selling black mountain crystals in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","When his feet landed on the ground, an Ancestor realm cultivator who looked like a young man had already set up a stall and started to peddle.","This time, the black mountain crystals in the stall were of a lower grade. They were just the most ordinary black mountain crystals, and there were more than 100 of them.","However, even the most ordinary black mountain crystal was quickly snatched up.","After watching this scene, Jian Wushuang was about to follow the young top cultivator to find out what was going on when Chen Qing and Chun Qiu rushed back from the other Heavenly Cities.","“Brother Jian, there’s indeed something strange. There’s at least one stall selling black mountain crystals in every city,” Cheng Qing said in a serious tone.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Combined with Chen Qing’s previous doubts, he had already vaguely realized that these peddlers selling black mountain crystals seemed to be carrying out some kind of secret operation."]},{"number":4759,"title":"Chapter 4759 The Seven Swordsmen","paragraphs":["4759 The Seven Swordsmen","The only person who could represent the black mountain crystal and was inseparable from it was the Young Emperor –Prince Yan. All the Yan Immortals and even the top cultivators in the Heavenly Region under Zhen Wuyang knew about this.","Right now, in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, there were several stalls selling black mountain crystals, which seemed to be some kind of subconscious promotion.","Jian Wushuang could vaguely feel the undercurrent under the calm lake.","“This time, I’m afraid we’ll have to be even more secretive about our whereabouts. Let’s temporarily delay our approach to Prince Mo,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","Chun Qiu shot a glance at the young cultivator who was packing up and leaving, “Did something happen?”","He shook his head and said, “We unknown the current situation. Let’s follow him and find out what’s going on.”","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu nodded. At this moment, the young cultivator had already packed up. However, he did not leave. Instead, he placed his hands behind his back and started to tour the city.","Jian Wushuang and the other two also kept a certain distance from him and searched for his whereabouts.","This young cultivator had a flower bag on his shoulder and was wearing a long robe that was not luxurious but was decent. He looked like a top cultivator who had traveled a long distance to the celestial continent for experience and pilgrimage.","Jian Wushuang was 100 meters behind the young cultivator, watching his every move with his divine sense.","However, this situation did not last long. Soon, hundreds of red-crowned cranes flew over his head and startled Jian Wushuang.","After all the cranes had left, the young cultivator was nowhere to be seen.","“Oh no,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and looked behind him. Chen Qing and Chun Qiu understood his meaning and immediately rushed in different directions.","The young cultivator’s disappearance meant that the clues were cut off. At such a sensitive time, Jian Wushuang could not allow any mistakes.","The three figures went in different directions to investigate.","The number of cultivators ascending to and from the are gradually decreased. Chun Qiu rushed forward along a street.","At the same time, the Immortal mansions and pavilions on both sides of the road began to blur.","Chun Qiu, who was filled with anxiety, was completely unaware of the changes in his surroundings. By the time he felt a sense of danger, it was already too late.","A piece of cloth wrapped around Chun QIu’s neck from behind, and then an unstoppable force came.","He was caught off guard and suffered such a heavy injury. His vision turned black and he almost fainted. It was difficult for him to even move his fingers.","The person who was strangling Chun QIu’s neck with the flower-patterned broadcloth was the young cultivator who had disappeared.","At this moment, there was only a sharp killing intent in his eyes. The unprecedented pressure of Yan power was not something that an Ancestor realm cultivator could control.","With one hand controlling Chun QIu, the other hand with a great momentum formed a knife and slashed at his Life Source.","However, at this moment, there was a sudden change!","Clang–","The sound of metal clashing resounded. The magic barrier set up by the young cultivator was shattered, and a cold light shone.","When the young cultivator noticed this, his palm, which was originally slashing toward the Chun Qiu’s Life Source, suddenly changed direction and blasted forward with a great momentum.","The two attacks collided, causing the sky to shake as they canceled each other out.","A middle-aged man with an aged face appeared. He held an Invisible Sword in his hand and stared at him with sharp eyes.","As their eyes met, the killing intent in the young cultivator’s eyes quickly disappeared. Then, he suddenly threw Chun Qiu over and took the opportunity to escape.","Jian Wushuang reached out to catch Chun Qiu. He looked forward and did not give chase.","“Cough, cough. Brother Jian, you saved my life again...” Chun Qiu clutched his neck, and his pale face gradually recovered.","In the short exchange just now, Jian Wushuang judged that his opponent was extremely powerful. It was absolutely impossible for him to be at the Ancestor realm like he had seen before.","If the young cultivator was determined to fight, he would be severely injured.","At this moment, Cheng Qing also rushed over. Seeing this scene, he hurriedly asked, “How is it? Did you catch that guy?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. “I’m afraid that the situation will change this time.”","“Could they be the lackeys of Prince Mo?” Cheng Qing said with a frown.","“It’s fine if he’s Prince Mo’s lackey, but I’m afraid he’s not,” Jian Wushuang said slowly.","Cheng Qing reminded, “Brother Jian, let’s leave this place first. It would be bad if we bump into Prince Mo’s subordinates.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. At that moment, they were on the peak of a mountain far away from Heavenly City.","The young cultivator seemed to have some kind of special ability. When the scene in Chun Qiu’s eyes blurred, he had been lured out of Heavenly City.","If Jian Wushuang had not sensed his aura and saved him in time, Chun Qiu definitely would not have survived.","The three figures then left, leaving no traces behind.","After Jian Wushuang’s decision to temporarily delay approaching Prince Mo, the three of them settled down in a Heavenly City in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","“Brother Jian, why don’t we use this time to find out where Prince Mo is in the Celestial Prefecture? At that time, we won’t be unprepared when we attack his lair.”","In a pavilion of an immortal mansion, Jian Wushuang sat by the window, quietly listening to Chen Qing’s complaints.","In the end, he said indifferently, “Let’s wait for a while first. We are not going to kill Prince Mo. If we have a choice, we should try not to fight.”","“Although that’s what you say, I’m afraid that when we enter Prince Mo’s Palace, we won’t have a choice,” Qing Chen sighed.","Chun Qiu clutched his neck and said, “No matter what, we have to be careful. I also feel that we’re not going to have a peaceful time.”","As the three of them were talking, a cloud of dust quietly rose from the ground. Then, seven figures wearing straw capes and bamboo hats stepped into the Immortal mansion’s pavilion one after another.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes locked onto the guests.","Through the bamboo hats, he could see that the seven old guests were all middle-aged, and their eyes were indifferent and dull, as if everything in the outside world had nothing to do with them.","After entering the pavilion, the seven old guests did not stay for long and instead went to the top floor to rest.","“You don’t say. These straw capes and bamboo hats look stylish. They give off the feeling of an independent great sect.” Cheng Qing looked at the back of the few old customers leaving and analyzed.","Jian Wushuang did not speak, but his eyes were already attracted.","He saw that under the straw rain capes, the old customers all had an extremely hidden and sharp aura.","Only Jian Wushuang could sense the unique sharp aura.","“They’re all extraordinary swordsmen. Interesting...”","The old guest in the lead seemed to sense something and cast a glance in his direction discreetly.","Their eyes met for only an instant before the old guest looked away. Then, the seven figures all disappeared from the room."]},{"number":4760,"title":"Chapter 4760 Night","paragraphs":["4760 Night","The old customers who had concealed their sword principle auras gave Jian Wushuang a very strange feeling.","However, he did not think too much about it. After all, he was in the vast Northern heaven celestial continent, and it was possible that there were Sword Immortals.","After a brief discussion, the three of them returned to their rooms to rest.","Under Cheng Qing’s strong request, the three of them squeezed into a side room.","Jian Wushuang turned over and sat on the window sill in comprehension. He shook his head helplessly.","He gradually discovered that when he was together with Cheng Qing, he was more and more like when they started from insignificance and wandered in the mortal world.","Eating, drinking, and sleeping, these bad habits should be stopped in time.","After taking another big gulp of the so-called ‘mouth-chewed wine’, Chen Qing laid down on the bed and began to sleep.","After Chun Qiu’s previous battle where he could not even retaliate, he had been cultivating even more desperately.","Right now, other than the extremely powerful eight arm Arhat, he had no other magical power. Even if he was facing an ordinary Yan Immortal, he would be in a very passive position.","It was urgent for him to reach the Yan Immortal realm. Otherwise, he would never be able to catch up with Jian Wushuang.","For ordinary top cultivators, reaching the Yan Immortal stage might be a wild imagination, but the Chun Qiu was different. The blood of the Emperor flowed in his body. Even if the Emperor’s fate energy that he brought had declined to the extreme, it was enough for him to step into the Yan Immortal stage.","The entire Immortal abode pavilion was unusually quiet, and even the Heavenly City seemed to have fallen into silence.","Among the vast clouds, the sun that was shining down on the entire celestial province gradually dimmed.","The night that belonged to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was about to arrive.","Jian Wushuang sat on the windowsill and began to meditate.","Although he appeared to be meditating, his five senses were still keenly observing his surroundings.","As the clouds gradually thickened, just as Jian Wushuang was about to concentrate and enter deep meditation, a subtle voice made him open his eyes again.","He was very familiar with that sound. It was the sound of a sword being sheathed.","Inexplicably, Jian Wushuang thought of the mysterious seven swordsmen he had met earlier.","As if to confirm his guess, several gusts of wind suddenly rose.","Jian Wushuang looked up subconsciously and saw seven figures flying up and disappearing into the clouds in an instant.","He seemed to have sensed something and hurriedly woke up Chen Qing and Chun Qiu. Then, he leaped and flew into the Nine Heavens.","Soaring to the top of the clouds, accompanied by the sun and stars, but missing the Qi of the seven figures just now.","“Brother Jian, did you find something?” Chenq Qng and Chun Qiu also followed closely behind, standing on the clouds.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. Instead, he used his divine consciousness to deduce shrinking earth, mountains, and rivers. Soon, he looked at the sky behind him.","“There was something strange about those seven figures. Let’s follow them and investigate,” he said quickly and then took the lead.","As expected, after traveling for hundreds of thousands of miles, Jian Wushuang detected the seven swordsmen’s auras in the clouds.","With the presence, everything became simple.","The three of them followed the aura in the clouds and flew forward.","The vast Heavenly Cities were left behind, but this was just a corner of the vast Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","As he moved forward, the Yan power became more and more dense and pure. Jian Wushuang began to have doubts.","He had a premonition that the place the seven swordsmen were heading to was similar to them.","When the water parted, the moon could be seen. When the clouds parted, the sun could be seen.","When they passed through the layers of clouds, the auras of the seven swordsmen suddenly disappeared, and a magnificent Celestial Prefecture came into view.","The Celestial Prefecture, which had a diamond-shaped base, hung high in the sky. From every corner, there was a jade belt waterfall that hung down from the sky.","On one side of the Celestial Prefecture, there was a huge green tree that reached the sky. A golden cage was hanging on the branches of the tree.","Inside the golden cage, a red bird with a halo on its back illuminated the entire Celestial Prefecture.","Such a magnificent scene might not be comparable to the Heavenly Court where Zhen Wuyang was, but it was no exaggeration to call it a small Heavenly Court.","“This place can’t be where Prince Mo is staying, right?” Hidden within the clouds, Cheng Qing mumbled as he stared at the Celestial Prefecture.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “I don’t think anyone else has the ability to live in such a celestial province except for Prince Mo.”","Cheng Qing frowned slightly. “If this is really Prince Mo’s residence, I’m afraid that he is already plotting something.”","Looking down at it, this magnificent and magnificent Celestial Prefecture, whether it was in terms of its layout or the arrangement of imprisoning the Golden Crow as a pet, had the intention of matching the Heavenly Court. Anyone with discerning eyes could probably guess the ambition behind the master of this Celestial Prefecture.","“It seems like I have to vent the anger for the Young Emperor.” Chen Qing unconsciously tightened his grip on the True Sword at his waist, killing intent already appearing in his eyes.","“I advise you not to do it. Even if Prince Mo deserves to die, you can’t interfere. Don’t forget that his father is Zhen Wuyang,” Jian Wushuang said calmly. Then, he added, “Unless you have no other choice.”","Cheng Qing grinned, “Understood.”","“Let’s sneak in first, then we’ll make plans,” Jian Wushuang said, then he walked forward to the small Heavenly Court.","In the vast Immortal world, there were many Yan Immortals on duty in front of the gate of the Celestial Prefecture.","However, these guards all looked drowsy.","The three ghostly figures plunged into the Celestial Prefecture in an instant, bringing with them a gentle breeze.","“These clothes are really tight. I’m afraid that they’ll burst when we fight later.”","On the road paved with bluestone, three guards wearing the same uniform were walking side by side.","Jian Wushuang, who was the leader, changed his appearance from a middle-aged man to a young and valiant guard.","Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu also changed into the faces of the guards who had been knocked out.","Cheng Qing, who was more than three meters tall, was grumbling while carefully protecting the tight guard uniform on his body.","In the tranquil Celestial Prefecture, Jian Wushuang carefully sensed the possible unexpected situations around him.","At this moment, a cold shout suddenly sounded from behind. “Stop right there.”","The three of them were frozen on the spot. Cheng Qing had already placed his hand on the hilt of the sword at his waist. He was only waiting for the situation to go awry, and then he would burst out and kill.","Jian Wushuang turned around slowly and looked at the patrol guards fearlessly.","“You’re all on duty outside. Why are you heading to the Fifth Prince’s Heavenly Palace now?” one of the middle-aged patrol guards asked.","“We finished our duty outside. We’re going to be on duty at the Fifth Prince’s Heavenly Palace now,” Jian Wushuang answered.","After that, the middle-aged patrol master asked a few more questions, and he answered them fluently before letting them leave.","“Brother Jian, you’re really good. How did you know about these questions?”","“I was just guessing. Fortunately, I didn’t give myself away. Let’s go.”","“...”"]},{"number":4761,"title":"Chapter 4761 Lady Yin Ling","paragraphs":["4761 Lady Yin Ling","This small Celestial Prefecture was located in the center of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, and there were tens of thousands of immortal mansions and exquisite buildings.","Prince Mo was in a heavenly hall in this small Celestial Prefecture.","The Golden crows that controlled the light and darkness of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture were locked in a golden cage on the Fusang Tree for the master of the Heavenly Palace to see and control.","Tens of thousands of cranes flew and rested in the clouds. From time to time, they turned into Immortal spirits and lay in the clouds, casting curious looks at Jian Wushuang and the others.","After stepping into the small Celestial Prefecture, Jian Wushuang saw the vast Heavenly Palace next to the Fusang Tree.","The three figures stepped on the bluestone path and approached the heavenly hall.","The sun was setting, and it was almost night in the Celestial Prefecture.","As he ascended, he stepped on the tens of thousands of immortal residences and jade palaces. The majestic Heavenly Palace at the peak of the mountain gradually became clear.","Jian Wushuang, Chen Qing, and Chun Qiu looked at each other as they landed on the Heavenly Palace. Then, they lowered their heads and entered the Heavenly Palace.","As the clouds drifted and the wind blew, ethereal music could be heard coming from the heavenly hall. From time to time, more than ten maids dressed in silk clothes would walk along the jade corridor with silver plates in their hands.","In the vast lotus ponds on both sides of the heavenly hall, there were koi children who had attained Dao. They were lying between the lotus petals and playing in the water out of boredom.","As soon as they saw a few new faces, they hurriedly stepped on the clouds and moved over.","“Go away, all of you go away. The uncles are doing serious business. We’ll play with you later,” Cheng Qing waved his arms and kept driving away the koi children who were surrounding him.","Perhaps these little guys were too bored in the lotus pond. After hearing Cheng Qing’s words, not only did they not retreat, but they also giggled and all laid on his body to interact.","In order to prevent any more trouble, Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu had to help pick up the little guys from Cheng Qing and throw them into the lotus pond one by one.","At this moment, an illusory yet sullen voice suddenly rang out in the hall.","“I say, you three big idiots, is this how you treat those little ones? Do you know that they are my children?”","Jian Wushuang’s body stiffened and he subconsciously looked at the source of the sound.","He saw a figure in a gauze dress standing on the roof of the heavenly hall, looking at him with a faint smile.","Her two jade-like legs drooped in the air through the gauze, as if they were covered by a layer of faint moonlight. As her pair of delicate feet swayed in the air, the silver bells on her ankles gave out an extremely clear and crisp sound.","A gust of wind blew past and lifted her veil, revealing a beautiful face.","Immediately after, the koi children that had been thrown into the Lotus pond all transformed back into their original forms and floated toward the mysterious and beautiful woman.","The figure stood up and stepped on the colorful glass with her bare feet. Koi fish swam around her in the wind.","Looking at the beautiful scene where the Fairy Qi was about to reach the critical point, Jian Wushuang’s eyes became more vigilant.","He subconsciously reached for his waist, only to realize that his Tarot Divine Sword had been destroyed by Ding Beichun in the Heavenly Court’s Sword Heaven.","“Hey, I’m asking you guys a question, you three big idiots.”","She pushed aside the Immortal cloud in front of her and looked at the three of them with her almond-shaped eyes. Finally, her gaze fell on Jian Wushuang’s face.","“Brother Jian, what’s our next step? We won’t be exposed, right?” Chun Qiu lowered his head, feeling a little anxious.","“We definitely won’t be exposed. How big of a wave can a sissy cause?” Cheng Qing said in a low voice. “Brother Jian, in my opinion, let’s ignore her. Let’s just charge in.”","Jian Wushuang then spoke in a respectful tone, “Immortal, we three brothers have just joined the heavenly hall and are being unreasonable. If we offend you, please forgive us.”","The woman standing on the eave of the heavenly hall flew down with the wind and landed in front of Jian Wushuang. The veil around her body surged.","Jian Wushuang pulled away without a trace.","“So it’s your first time on duty. I was wondering when you stupid fellows appeared in the Heavenly Palace.” An angry voice came out from under the veil.","“But this is not an excuse. You just bullied my children, and now I punish you all to jump into the lotus pond and swim one round.”","Chun Qiu and Chen Qing looked at each other, their expressions troubled.","Jian Wushuang replied, “I’m afraid that’s a little inappropriate. It’s our first time on duty, and it’s not good to wear wet clothes...”","When the veiled woman heard this, she wanted to say something, but a call rang out.","“My Lady, the Young Master is calling for you,” a maidservant stood in front of the heavenly hall and said respectfully.","The lady did not answer. Instead, she looked at Jian Wushuang and the other two and said, “You’re lucky. I’ll let you off this time.”","After she finished speaking, she ran towards the heavenly hall with her bare feet.","After she had gone far away, Chen Qing said angrily, “If we weren’t in Prince Mo’s territory, I would have let that woman know what cruelty is!”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He looked around the heavenly hall and was about to explore the next step.","The woman who had disappeared quietly reappeared under the corridor pillar.","“What are you all standing there for? Come in with me,” she said indifferently, her tone unquestionable.","The three of them looked at each other before entering the heavenly hall together.","The palace door slowly opened, and a warm fragrance hit his face.","In the center of the magnificent Heavenly Palace, a huge incense burner was slowly blowing out smoke.","There were 18 giant pillars on both sides that depicted the mountains and seas, and there were seats beside each giant pillar for the banquet.","At the same time, there were hundreds of female dancers dancing in the clouds and smoke, it was an extravagant scene.","After the veiled woman stepped into the giant hall with her bare feet, she stepped on the flowing clouds on the ground and ran around as she pleased like an immortal spirit that grew freely between the heaven and earth.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes locked onto the deepest part of the heavenly hall at once.","Over there, the Fifth Prince, Prince Mo, who was dressed in luxurious clothes, was sitting at the head of the table. He was enjoying the dance of the female dancers with a drunken look.","It was only when he saw the veiled woman, who was as light as a celestial deer, approaching that he stood up unconsciously and said happily, “Yin Ling, you’re here.”","The maids on both sides brought over a set of luxurious clothes and helped her change.","“It’s the same old style every day, I’m sick of looking at it.” The veiled woman, Yin Ling, who was wrapped in a white fur coat, sat beside Prince Mo and pouted.","Prince Mo seemed to be excited and a little nervous about Yin Ling’s arrival. “Okay, okay, I won’t watch it anymore. I’ll watch the competition later.”","After saying that, Prince Mo turned around and waved his hand impatiently. The dancers then left.","A moment later, another 20 handsome young men with red lips and white teeth slowly walked to the center of the hall.","“Brother Jian, have you ever heard that Prince Mo is lustful?”","“...”","Jian Wushuang was confused as he looked at Chen Qing’s mysterious expression."]},{"number":4762,"title":"Chapter 4762 Killing Intent at the Banquet","paragraphs":["4762 Killing Intent at the Banquet","Cheng Qing laughed secretly again. “This isn’t a groundless rumor. There have been rumors for a long time that Prince Mo likes men. He once captured all the young geniuses in the entire Commandery and sent them to his Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. He said that he was nurturing them, but in fact, they were all taken care of by him so that he could enjoy them at any time.”","“For example, these handsome young men who came out may be the male pets he is taking care of.”","Although Jian Wushuang was still expressionless, he was actually disgusted.","Looking at the 20 or so handsome youths who had walked out, each of them had an imperceptible gentleness between their brows, which seemed to indirectly prove that what Cheng Qing had said was true.","“Whatever he likes has nothing to do with us. We’ll immediately withdraw after we find the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor and try not to have any disputes,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu nodded and did not say anything more.","The three of them were now Celestial Prefecture guards on duty in the heavenly hall. In addition, they had disguised themselves to look extremely ordinary, so they were almost unnoticeable in a crowd.","Therefore, they stood by the two giant pillars on both sides of the hall, acting as guards.","Originally, Jian Wushuang had no intention of entering the giant hall. Instead, he was going to walk around the heavenly hall. However, his plan was disrupted by Goddess Yin Ling.","Standing on one side of the giant pillar, he cast his gaze to the center of the hall, where a group of handsome youths were currently performing the sword dance with all their heart.","The so-called sword dance was more of an aesthetic than a practical one. Although each of them had a steady sword momentum, they lacked decisiveness and fierceness, so it was obviously for the sake of viewing.","Although these handsome young men were all rare sword talents, Jian Wushuang obviously did not have any appreciation for them.","If one wanted to cultivate the way of the sword, the most important thing was to have the innate Qi in one’s heart since childhood. It was the foundation.","In the end, all things were vast, and all kinds of Dao techniques emerged one after another. Although the Sword Dao was special, it did not escape the rules of the Great Dao. Naturally, the seedlings of the way of the sword would also be born with the flow of time.","All these naturally did not affect Jian Wushuang’s state of mind at all.","Hugging the soft Yin Ling, the drunk Prince Mo watched the sword dance performance with a smile. He seemed to be extremely satisfied.","“Extremely boring, it’s really too boring,” Yin Ling, who was sitting at the head of the table, said unhappily.","Upon hearing this, Prince Mo looked away. “What’s the matter, Yin Ling? Are you not satisfied?”","Yin Ling pursed her lips. “Of course not. Do you know how many times I’ve watched it? why don’t you change it to something new?”","“Alright, alright. We’ll do as you say,” Prince Mo said dotingly.","Yin Ling pouted as if she was thinking of something new, and then she glanced into the hall.","Oh no! Jian Wushuang exclaimed in his heart. Before he could even withdraw his body, he heard an excited voice.","“It’s you then. That stupid fellow from before, step forward.” Yin Ling stood up and pointed at him with her slender hand.","Jian Wushuang was speechless. He had no choice but to walk to the center of the hall.","The haziness in Prince Mo’s eyes faded away. He looked at the ordinary-looking young guard standing in the middle of the hall and felt that he had met him before.","However, he did not think too much about it. After all, at this time, the most important thing was to win Yin Ling’s favor.","After pointing at Jian Wushuang, Yin Ling looked around slowly and finally found a young guard who was also not too conspicuous.","“It’ll be the two of you. I can feel that both of you have extraordinary skills. Why don’t you practice martial art here?” The corner of Yin Ling’s mouth curled up into a smile. At the same time, she waved her sleeves, and two strips of cloth fluttered. She pulled out two True Swords and threw them at the two.","Jian Wushuang caught the True Sword and frowned. He did not like this feeling, especially the feeling of being ordered around.","If it were not for the urgent matter at hand, Jian Wushuang would have wanted to kill her.","He collected his emotions and looked at the young guard who had also been called out.","Jian Wushuang did not see any emotion in his eyes. It was as if he could not remember anything.","“Let’s begin. Please do your best. If it’s not exciting enough, there might be punishment.” Yin Ling covered her mouth and chuckled.","Cheng Qing, who was hiding next to the giant pillar, gritted his teeth and said, “Damn it! If I have no other choice, I will kill this woman first!”","“Count me in.” Chun Qiu’s eyes were cold. He seemed to be ready to attack when Jian Wushuang gave the signal.","At that moment, there was only Jian Wushuang and the young guard in the grand main hall.","He stood tall like a mountain, holding his sword. The aura around him was restrained, like a supreme Sword Intent that was hiding its edge and waiting to be activated.","In the face of any potential enemy, he would always go all out. This was a habit that Jian Wushuang had developed during his long cultivation journey.","Even in this sparring, he did not relax in the slightest.","The young guard, who was also standing with a sword in his hand, stood in the distance. His clear eyes, which should have belonged to a young man, suddenly showed an extremely old look.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang saw the change.","However, without waiting for him to think, the young guard was the first to burst out and slashed down with his sword.","Jian Wushuang raised his sword to deal with it. The two blades made contact and a crisp sound was heard.","It was only an instant of exchange, but a thick Sword Intent spread out in all directions!","Although it was only one exchange, they had already exchanged thousands of blows in an instant!","Jian Wushuang was secretly shocked. Since when could an ordinary Yan Immortal’s sword principle be evenly matched with his?","The young guard did not even have time to think. He raised his sword and slashed. There was an undetectable ruthlessness in his indifferent face.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold as he managed to force him back several steps with a stroke of his sword.","The young guard’s killing intent, which was hidden under his indifferent expression, was slowly emerging.","At this point, he began to be somewhat certain that the young guard in front of him was definitely not a guard of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture!","In other words, this guy should be the same as Jian Wushuang and the other two, who had sneaked in under a fake identity.","An uncertain thought rose in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The two True Swords collided once again. The aftershock of the explosion that was produced at the point of collision swept away all the clouds and smoke in the entire heavenly hall.","Jian Wushuang exerted all his strength on the True Sword in his hand and approached the young guard.","“No matter what your goal is, you’d better not have any ideas about me.”","The young guard was slightly stunned. He quickly looked at Jian Wushuang with a pair of cloudy eyes that were filled with doubt and scrutiny. Then, he suddenly retreated more than 100 feet away."]},{"number":4763,"title":"Chapter 4763 Seven Swords Chaotic Court","paragraphs":["4763 Seven Swords Chaotic Court","The hall was silent as everyone held their breath and watched the scene with rapt attention.","The sword-wielders frowned when they saw the confrontation that was completed in almost an instant.","This was because the Sword Intent that emanated from their confrontation was not something that ordinary sword cultivators could compare to.","Especially the Sword Intent that swept up in that instant, even those who were close to it felt a kind of dense killing intent as if their divine soul was being cut.","Jian Wushuang stood there with his sword in hand, seemingly not intending to continue the fight.","The young guard also had no intention of fighting. After drawing his sword, he prepared to retreat.","“Stop! Did I say you could go back?”","A cold voice sounded. Prince Mo, who was sitting at the head of the table, leaned forward. His drunken eyes were full of coldness, as if he was going to kill someone in the next moment.","The figure that was about to retreat stopped at this moment. He looked at him with a pair of heroic eyes, then cupped his hands and said, “Stop when you’ve reached a certain point. If we continue fighting, I’m afraid we’ll become a joke.”","“If Young Master insists on watching, why don’t you let us compose a sword dance for you?”","When Prince Mo heard this, he looked at the handsome guard and his expression softened. “Alright, if you don’t satisfy me, I’ll take your heads!”","The young guard replied and turned around.","A total of six guards in uniform slowly walked out from the side.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows twitched and he retreated without a trace.","“Brother Jian, what’s the situation?” Cheng Qing asked in a low voice.","“If the situation doesn’t look right, run!” he said in a low voice, and a serious look flashed in his eyes.","By now, Jian Wushuang was completely sure that the seven guards were the seven swordsmen he had seen in the pavilion of the Immortal mansion in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","Right now, they had all sneaked into the heavenly hall, and their target seemed to be only Prince Mo.","Chen Qing and Chen Qiu became serious. They knew Jian Wushuang’s character well and he would never speak without thinking.","If he said there was a situation, then there must be a situation.","For a moment, Cheng Qing’s gaze fell on the seven ordinary-looking figures in the middle of the hall.","Without any unnecessary words, the seven figures spread out in a triangular formation. Then, the seven True Swords, which were surrounded by Yan power, pointed forward.","The atmosphere in the entire hall began to change subtly.","Jian Wushuang led Chen Qing and Chun Qiu toward the gate of Heaven Palace without leaving a trace, but they were stopped by Lady Yin Ling who was sitting at the head of the table.","At this moment, the sword dance that was formed by the seven people began. With the young guard leading the group, the seven real swords moved with Yan power and began to move around the hall.","The clouds and smoke coming out of the huge incense burner in the center of the hall also gradually transformed into various scenes under the control of these Sword Intents.","It was like a dragon leaping through the sea of clouds, or a crouching tiger roaring. There were countless changes.","Seeing this beautiful scene, the top cultivators and Yan Immortals sitting on the two sides of the hall could not help but clap their hands and cheer.","Prince Mo, who was sitting at the head of the table, also nodded his head repeatedly. He seemed to be very satisfied with the sword dance of these seven people.","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang was a little unsettled because he had just discovered that there was a trace of Yan power that was even more powerful in the team of seven.","Although it was only revealed for a moment, Jian Wushuang immediately realized it.","At that level, it was very likely that he had transcended the Yan Immortal realm.","“Could it be that they want to assassinate Prince Mo?” He seemed to have thought of something and looked at Prince Mo.","Unknowingly, the seven figures were getting closer and closer to him.","The clouds and smoke gradually spread throughout the entire hall, making every top cultivator feel as if they were on top of the clouds, floating like Immortals.","At this moment, Prince Mo’s eyes were gradually filled with excitement, and the drunkenness in his eyes was even more apparent.","In the formation of seven people, the young guard at the front held a real sword in his hand and his aura was extremely powerful.","His eyes, which were already slightly old, quietly revealed a cold killing intent.","In the next moment, he suddenly leaped up and stepped on the clouds. Under the gaze of all the top cultivators and Yan Immortals, he held the True Sword in his hand tightly and stabbed it at Prince Mo.","The air seemed to freeze. Everything that was about to happen happened at this moment.","The sword that was surrounded by supreme Yan power stabbed at him without any hesitation.","However, at this moment, a sudden change occurred. A large part of the space in front of Prince Mo collapsed without any warning, forcibly changing the position of the sword.","The sword that was originally aimed at Prince Mo’s head was forced to move. In the end, it pierced through his cheekbone without any resistance and nailed him firmly to the palace chair.","A blood-curdling screech resounded as divine blood gushed out.","The entire left side of Prince Mo’s body was directly minced into pieces. The True Sword had pierced through half of his head, and the tip of the sword was more than an inch deep into the palace chair!","However, this attack did not take his life at all. In fact, it was still a distance away from the Immortal Source in his mind.","After failing to kill him with one strike, the young guard immediately struck out with his palm, vowing to kill Prince Mo completely!","However, the supreme pressure that came with it suppressed his momentum.","A black-robed figure walked out from behind Prince Mo. He also extended his palm and struck at the young guard.","The two rays of Yan power collided, and a loud sound was heard.","Then, the young guard was sent flying like a kite with a broken string.","At this moment, all the top cultivators and Yan Immortals reacted and controlled their Yan power to surround the seven people.","The six figures who were standing still in the same place also moved. Each of them was like a ghost. After catching the young guard, they immediately began to kill.","One of the tall and thin figures put his palms together in front of his chest and then suddenly tore it apart. The boundless Yan power directly tore the space apart, and the more than 20 top cultivators who had surrounded him were turned into powder.","Another figure clenched his fist and punched the ground.","Boom boom boom!","The entire heavenly hall trembled, and then fine cracks appeared on the white jade floor.","The six figures exploded with their most terrifying strength at this moment.","Every one of them had the terrifying power to easily kill Yan Immortals.","At this point, the entire hall fell into chaos!","At the first moment of the riot, Jian Wushuang was the first to react. He directly reached out to blast open the palace door and ran away with the two of them.","In such a chaotic situation that was completely out of control, even he would probably die on the spot if he was not careful.","“Brother Jian, this is too exciting. It seems like that Prince Mo will definitely die today!” In the sky, among the three figures who were fleeing at full speed, Cheng Qing said with an excited expression, “It’s really like a reincarnation cycle. Someone actually came to assassinate him.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang, who was originally running away, suddenly stopped.","He turned around and looked at the hall that was on the verge of collapsing. He finally said, “No, I have to go back.”","Cheng Qing was stunned when he heard this, and then he hurriedly said, “Brother Jian, are you joking? Prince Mo’s life is already in danger.”"]},{"number":4764,"title":"Chapter 4764 The Battle of Grand Yan Immortals","paragraphs":["4764 The Battle of Grand Yan Immortals","Jian Wushuang said, “Prince Mo, you can’t die now. Once you dies, there will be no more news about the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.”","“Is that Heaven-patterned Bone Armor even more important than your life?” Cheng Qing was also anxious. He knew the aura in the hall better than Jian Wushuang.","It was precisely because he knew that he wanted to stop Jian Wushuang from going to his death.","“Of course, it’s not as important as my life, ” Jian Wushuang said with a smile. “But the current situation is the best situation.”","After saying that, he immediately leaped forward, not afraid of the collapsing hall at all.","“Brother Chen Qing, are you afraid?” Chun Qiu raised his eyebrows and smiled. Then, he caught up with Jian Wushuang without any hesitation.","“W-who’s afraid? Can such a small scene intimidate me, Cheng Qing?” Cheng Qing was anxious, but he gritted his teeth and followed.","In the chaotic Heavenly Palace, the top cultivators and Yan Immortals were dying one after another. The ground had completely collapsed, and the entire palace was in a state of collapse.","The seven figures were like seven huge rocks. Not a single Yan Immortal could shake them.","Prince Mo, who had his cheekbone pierced by the sword and was nailed to the chair, stopped wailing. He clenched the blade of the sword and pulled the entire sword out of his head.","At this moment, the entire left side of Prince Mo’s face had been replaced by a huge bloody hole. Even one of his eyeballs had been shattered.","As the son of the Great Si Region’s Emperor, he had never been so humiliated before.","“Kill them all, don’t leave a single one!” A voice that sounded like someone weeping blood resounded. The black-robed figure who had saved his life earlier nodded respectfully. “Yes, Fifth Prince.”","He took a step forward, and a boundless force spread out, causing the originally white-hot slaughter to stop.","Black robe extended his withered palm and slowly pulled down his hood, revealing an old face full of wrinkles.","“Hand over your heads, and I’ll let you die a good death. Otherwise, you’ll be ground to ashes.” An ancient voice rang out from black robe’s mouth.","Behind him, there was a dim black wheel of light.","If Jian Wushuang had been there, he would have realized that the black light wheels were the same as the light wheels on the backs of the Founding Elders in the Heavenly Court.","This was the symbol of someone who had completely stepped into the Grand Yan Immortal level from the Yan Immortal level.","The seven figures did not seem to be intimidated by a Grand Yan Immortal.","There were two figures who shook their arms and a light wheel appeared behind them.","Two more Grand Yan Immortals!","The top cultivators and Yan Immortals who were planning to fight to the death all took a step back and left the battlefield after seeing this.","“It’s really a big move. I was wondering why you weren’t afraid. It turns out that you’ve already made full preparations.” The Elder in black robe’s eyes showed no fear. “With me around, you won’t be able to hurt the Fifth Prince.”","With a cold sneer, the young guard who showed the Grand Yan Immortal cultivation realm took a step forward and his palms struck out.","An attack that completely exceeded the power of a Yan Immortal smashed toward the Elder in a black robe.","The black robe Elder tried to resist, sending out a shock wave.","Under such a shock wave, even the giant pillars in the palace were shattered, and even a Yan Immortal could not stand still.","Prince Mo was sent flying. He lay on the ground in a sorry state. He looked around with his remaining eye, as if he was looking for something.","As soon as the battle broke out, Yin Ling, who had been snuggling up to him, disappeared without a trace, as if she had never appeared.","“Fifth Prince, run, run!” the white-robed Yan Immortal, who had been following Prince Mo, appeared at the right time and dragged him away.","Prince Mo acted as if he had not heard anything. His ferocious face was expressionless. “Tell me, is it Prince Jiu or the rest of my brothers who want me dead?”","“Let’s not think about this for now. Let’s quickly escape to the Heavenly Court.” The white-robed Yan Immortal was also scared out of his wits by this scene.","The assassination attempt carried out by two Grand Yan Immortals was a terrifying move that no force in the entire Great Si Region could pull off. However, it had actually happened.","“Prince Jiu, it must be Prince Jiu! I want him to pay with his life!” Prince Mo shouted as his aura rose at an unbelievable speed.","Seeing that Prince Mo was still alive, the two Grand Yan Immortals, who were suppressing one with two, waved their hands. The remaining five figures understood tacitly and immediately tore through the encirclement and rushed over.","Even if Prince Mo had mastered and comprehended an Immortal Style, it would be of no use in the current situation.","By the time the venomous snake behind him revealed its fangs, it was already too late. There was no turning back.","The white-robed Yan Immortal in front of him could only defend with his hands before he was turned into dust.","Prince Mo stood rooted to the ground as he faced the figures that were about to surround him.","At this moment, a figure with great momentum moved the clouds and rode the wind, rushing into the hall with unimaginable speed.","None of the five figures who had surrounded Prince Mo noticed this.","The tall and thin man at the front held a True Sword in his hand and stabbed at his Immortal Source without any unnecessary movements.","A sudden change occurred!","The tall and thin figure only felt a heavy kick on his back, and then his entire body flew out.","Jian Wushuang kicked a gap in the encirclement and picked up Prince Mo to retreat without any hesitation.","The other four figures saw this and clenched their fists in the air.","Jian Wushuang felt his chest tighten and his retreating speed slowed down for a moment. Without thinking, he condensed an Invisible Sword in his right hand and cut off the invisible aura that bound him.","“Chase!” The five of them shouted in unison and tried to capture Jian Wushuang.","But then, a majestic Sword Intent surged from Jian Wushuang’s back like a great river and ocean, directly pushing toward the five figures.","“I say, can you change your target? Perhaps target me instead?”","With a sword in his left hand and a wine pot in his right hand, Cheng Qing’s carefree figure stood in front of the group.","“Get lost!” Five figures pounced at him.","Chen Qing shouted as he drew his sword to fight.","After getting a moment to catch his breath, Prince Mo looked at this ordinary-looking but valiant-looking guard and felt that he had a familiar aura.","Looking at the miserable Prince Mo, Jian Wushuang pressed him against a giant pillar with one hand and took out a Heaven-patterned Bone Armor covered with complicated patterns.","“Give me this thing.”","“W-what is it?” Prince Mo looked at Jian Wushuang, who was not a good person, and then at the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in his hand. He felt that it was familiar.","“Don’t play any tricks with me. Hand this thing over to me and I’ll spare your life. Otherwise, I’ll crush your Immortal Source before they kill you,” Jian Wushuang said in a cold voice.","Prince Mo shivered inexplicably. The strong desire to live caused the memories of the past to gradually resurface in his mind.","“I think I have a piece of this too. I have it with me.”"]},{"number":4765,"title":"Chapter 4765 Nine-Tailed True Crow","paragraphs":["4765 Nine-Tailed True Crow","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang grabbed Prince Mo’s neck with one hand and put his other hand into his arms.","Under the combined attack of the five mysterious figures, Cheng Qing could not hold on for too long, and he was already starting to find it difficult to hold on.","He wanted to find the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in less than ten breaths and escape from this place.","However, at the next moment, a brutal look suddenly flashed in the eyes of the completely immobile Prince Mo. The palm behind his back emitted a faint light and directly stabbed at Jian Wushuang.","A strong sense of danger welled up in his heart. Almost at the same time as the dim light stabbed toward him, he moved his head away by an inch.","However, it was still too late. The palm with dim light left a long and narrow wound on Jian Wushuang’s neck, and divine blood spurted out.","Feeling the pain, he subconsciously loosened his grip. Prince Mo took the opportunity to force him back with another palm strike and then quickly escaped!","“You’re looking for death!” Jian Wushuang was furious. His severely injured neck recovered at an extremely fast speed. He struck forward with his palm and the supreme power almost blocked all of Prince Mo’s escape routes.","However, the situation changed again. Prince Mo put all his strength into his left arm and tore apart Jian Wushuang’s magnificent power at the cost of his arm.","Then, Prince Mo turned around and glared at him with hatred. His figure flashed and he fled out of the hall.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang would not let him go. He immediately informed Chen Qing and Chun Qiu, who were struggling to resist, and then chased after him.","“I’m done playing with you guys!” The blue veins on Chen Qing’s forehead bulged, and he was almost hung up and beaten to the point where he barely managed to escape. The five figures were very clear on their target, and they did not intend to continue fighting with him. Once they separated, they directly flew out of the hall.","The entire heavenly hall was collapsing.","More than half of the top cultivators and Yan Immortals who had gone to the banquet at the Heavenly Palace had been killed in this sudden battle. The remaining survivors had long escaped from the palace.","At this point, there were only three Grand Yan Immortals left in the crumbling heavenly hall!","Two against one, the black-robed Elder was in a sorry state.","The suppression of the two Grand Yan Immortals made it difficult for him to escape, and even his Immortal body was on the verge of collapse.","Although he had been sleeping in the Heavenly Palace for a long time, the black-robed Elder knew very well that the number of Grand Yan Immortals in the vast Great Si Region, other than the 99 Grand Yan Immortals under Emperor Zhen Wuyang, could be counted on one hand.”","The so-called Grand Yan Immortal was a profound existence that completely transcended the Yan Immortal level. Only by reaching the profound realm of the Grand Yan Immortal would one have the opportunity to touch the Emperor’s fate energy.","From this, one could see how rare and terrifying Grand Yan Immortals were.","However, there were two Grand Yan Immortals who had come to kill Prince Mo. This was a huge move.","In the entire Great Si Region, who could have such a heaven-defying authority?","He could not imagine it at all. He even thought that it was an order from Zhen Wuyang.","“Who are you people? Do you know that killing Prince Mo is equivalent to making an enemy of Emperor Zhen Wuyang and the entire Great Si Region?!”","The black-robed Elder was still holding on to his last hope despite his bitter resistance, attempting to let them know the serious consequences.","However, the two Grand Yan Immortals who were fighting him turned a blind eye to it. They did not care about the so-called Emperor Zhen Wuyang and the entire Great Si Region.","The terrifying Yan power had already crushed the Heavenly Palace on this small Celestial Prefecture into pieces. Countless broken walls fell on the Celestial Prefecture.","It was a scene of destruction.","As for Prince Mo, who had escaped from the Heavenly Palace, he was now like a stray dog, running for his life while dragging his broken arm.","Above the entire minor Celestial Province, the crimson prairie and the clouds of the polar night showed faint signs of collapsing under the battle of the Grand Yan immortals.","Jian Wushuang followed closely behind. The long and narrow wound on his neck had completely healed without leaving a single scar.","Everything that had happened had far exceeded his expectations. He had never expected that there would be others who would come to kill Prince Mo.","And from the looks of it, it seemed like they were here to completely annihilate him.","Jian Wushuang did not care about his life or death, but the impact and consequences of this matter would be huge.","As the fifth son of Emperor Zhen Wuyang, if he were to die, all the top cultivators and Yan Immortals in this battle would be investigated.","The three of them would most likely be dragged into this as well.","Therefore, Prince Mo could not die. Even if he did, he could not die in their hands.","Finding the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor and then quietly escaping was the best solution at the moment.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu were in charge of bringing up the rear, keeping the masterminds of this incident, the five of the seven swordsmen, at their backs.","Jian Wushuang was the only one chasing after Prince Mo in the clouds.","The clouds were vast and the real terror of life and death made him burst out his last potential. Even Jian Wushuang, who was chasing with all his strength, felt a little bit of difficulty and the distance between them was not short.","Prince Mo broke through the clouds and fled toward the center of the entire small Celestial Prefecture.","There was a Fusang Tree that reached the heavens, with the Celestial Province as its foundation.","However, the crown that covered the sky was made up of huge dark green branches without a single leaf.","On the crown of the tree, there was a huge golden cage.","Inside the golden cage, there was a huge sun that one could not look at directly!","At this moment, Prince Mo’s flustered figure had already rushed to the front of the Fusang Tree.","“Di Qing, save me!”","A panicked and frightened voice came out of Prince Mo’s mouth. He was already an arrow at the end of its flight and had placed all his hopes on his voice.","In the golden cage of the Fusang Tree, the dazzling sun moved.","The bird’s head with the scarlet-golden wheel of light slowly lifted.","It was a Golden Crow with four eyes!","As it raised its head, the polar night was dispelled, and its two pairs of red eyes were like four great suns, so bright that one could not look directly at them.","Screeeeech-","A screech that seemed capable of tearing apart the entire Heavenly Realm resounded. The dark night of the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was dispelled, and brilliant light descended.","The golden cage was opened, and it spread its wings and flew out. As its wings spread out, the radiance of the world shone on the Celestial Prefecture.","A total of nine long scarlet-purple feathers descended from the Golden Crow’s tail, forming a huge sun with the Golden Crow’s wings spreading out. It carried a supreme and majestic aura.","At that moment, even Jian Wushuang raised his hand to cover his eyes subconsciously and could not take another step forward.","Hot, it was too hot.","A burning sensation from the depths of the soul made even a Yan Immortal retreat.","The power of the Nine-Tailed True Crow could no longer be measured by Yan Immortals.","Jian Wushuang felt that it was about to reach a mysterious realm and reach another level.","Based on his current understanding, this aura was already infinitely close to the top existences of the Heavenly Court."]},{"number":4766,"title":"Chapter 4766 Di Qing","paragraphs":["4766 Di Qing","There were 99 Grand Yan Immortals who had transcended the Yan Immortal stage under Zhen Wuyang’s throne.","This was what Jian Wushuang had learned after attending the feast in the Heavenly Court.","He knew very little about the Grand Yan Immortal stage. He only knew that it was almost impossible for ordinary Yan Immortals to achieve it.","Even Cheng Qing did not know how long he had been stuck at that step.","When Jian Wushuang was transporting the black mountain crystal during the early stage, he met Wild Fox Koan, the Whirling Patriarch. That guy was probably the closest to the Grand Yan Immortal. When he was about to advance, Jian Wushuang destroyed his Immortal Source with the power of an Emperor.","Right now, this Nine-Tailed True Crow that had the power to cut across the great momentum had the power of the Grand Yan Immortal!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile bitterly.","The level of Grand Yan Immortal was not something he could contend with at all. Just the aura that it exuded was a great threat.","However, Jian Wushuang did not want to retreat. He did not want everything he had done to be in vain.","They would only retreat when the situation turned bad.","When he saw the Golden Crow’s outstretched body, Prince Mo seemed to have grabbed onto his last life-saving straw and charged straight at it.","However, the next moment, a change occurred!","Two boundless sky-tearing auras smashed toward Prince Mo like two graceful birds, clearly aiming to kill him!","However, the expected situation did not happen.","The two great forces did not even land on Prince Mo’s body. The moment they swept over, they were shattered by the Golden Crow’s wings.","The aftermath spread in all directions. Although Prince Mo had escaped death, he could not even withstand the aftermath. He opened his mouth and spat out a large mouthful of divine blood.","At the same time, two figures quietly appeared.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly. The two figures were the two Grand Yan Immortals who had fought in the heavenly hall just now!","He slowly retreated, already prepared to escape at any time.","In a battle at the level of a Grand Yan Immortal, the control of Yan power was not on the same level as that of a Yan Immortal.","The difference between the two was even greater than the difference between a mortal and a Yan Immortal.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang was not thinking about how to deal with the Grand Yan Immortal, but thinking about an escape route.","The Golden Crow glanced at the two Grand Yan Immortals with its scarlet-golden ring of light, then turned to look at the still frightened Prince Mo.","“Di Qing, hurry up and kill them all. Don’t leave a single one alive!” Prince Mo gasped for breath. The big hole on his face that had been pierced by the True Sword had already recovered, and his face was strangely pale.","The Golden Crow’s eyes flashed with a human-like look of disgust. “I’ve said it before, if you dare to call me by my name again, I’ll burn you to ashes.”","Prince Mo shivered, as if he did not doubt the authenticity of its words at all. “I-I understand. Master Di, do me another favor. Wipe out all these people who want to kill me.”","The Golden Crow, whose name was Di Qing, glanced at the two Grand Yan Immortals again, then looked at him with a faint smile and said, “To attract such a powerful being to intercept you, Prince Mo, your abilities have improved a lot.”","Hearing this, Prince Mo’s expression changed slightly. “In any case, you have to solve this problem as soon as possible. I want none of them to live!”","A ferocious smile flashed across Di Qing’s eyes, and he suddenly flapped his wings.","“Whether they can live or not depends on my mood, not your decision.”","The giant wings that covered the sky spread out for thousands of miles, and a screeching sound resounded in the sky.","Jian Wushuang felt that his eardrums were about to be torn apart.","He no longer hesitated and was ready to escape. The Yan power force displayed by the Golden Crow had already exceeded his imagination, not to mention that there were two Grand Yan Immortals.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave, a long sword with a chilling intent was pressed against his back.","“If you don’t want to die, don’t leave.” A cold voice sounded.","Jian Wushuang turned around and saw that it was the young guard who had competed with him in the heavenly hall.","At the same time, four more figures pulled Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu over.","“Brother Jian, I’m ashamed.” Chen Qing, whose face was bruised, let out a long sigh. It was obvious that he had been beaten up a lot before this.","Jian Wushuang looked at the young guard behind him and said in a deep voice, “This is between you guys. We will leave now and not participate in the fight.”","“Cut the crap. Do you think you can still escape unscathed?” the young guard said coldly.","Seeing that there was no hope of leaving, Jian Wushuang was ready to fight when the fiercest battle broke out in the clouds.","The two great forces soared through the clouds and collided with Di Qing, causing the fiercest explosion.","Even the Fusang Tree was shaking. Prince Mo, who was hiding in the crown of the Fusang Tree, was like a bird that was startled by the mere twang of a bow.","As soon as the battle broke out, Di Qing broke away from his Golden Crow form and turned into a divine realm expert.","As the illusionary wings with golden patterns flapped, the two Grand Yan Immortals were unable to move an inch.","Di Qing’s handsome face had a bit of unrestraint and evil as he looked at the two of them proudly.","“If you retreat now, I won’t pursue the matter. If you still insist, I’ll kill you.”","Upon hearing this, the two tall and thin Grand Yan Immortals with black light wheels on their backs showed no expression, as if they did not care at all.","Their goal was very clear, so it was impossible for them to turn back just because of Di Qing’s words.","Immediately after, the two Grand Yan Immortals joined forces again. A huge palm that distorted the clouds and descended smashed at Di Qing.","Di Qing was not afraid. With a ferocious smile in his eyes, he raised his palm and met the attack.","In the next moment, Di Qing’s seemingly light palm actually stopped the descending giant palm.","A red light curled around his palm and instantly covered the entire sky-covering palm with the power of a Prairie Fire.","In just a short moment, the combined attack of the two Grand Yan Immortals was completely burned by the red light, not even leaving a trace of breath.","“Suppress!”","With two loud roars, the mighty Yan power quietly condensed into a huge black cauldron and smashed at Di Qing again.","The illusionary crimson-golden wings on his back flapped, and each wisp of crimson light transformed into a light Golden Crow.","Tens of thousands of Golden Crows formed a formation and charged forward!","Boom boom boom!!!","The collision of the two forces continued to consume energy. The pure black Yan power and the pure gold Yan power wreaked havoc in the clouds, and finally, the clouds could not bear it and began to shatter.","As the huge black cauldron dimmed, Di Qing’s sneer grew more ferocious.","At the same time, nine long scarlet-purple feathers grew from the tip of his hair.","He held one of the long feathers in his hand and pointed the tip at one of the great evolution Immortals. He said casually, “Since you insist on not leaving, then all of you will stay here. I will let you know that even a Grand Yan Immortal can’t fight me.”"]},{"number":4767,"title":"Chapter 4767 Great Battle","paragraphs":["4767 Great Battle","A celestial form of a black crow that blotted out the sky quietly appeared behind Di Qing, and its four eyes that were like the sun cast down black flames.","At that moment, even the swordsmen who were holding Jian Wushuang and the others hostage retreated.","“Enjoy it, everyone. You’ll soon feel the wrath of my arrival.”","Di Qing slowly opened his arms, and beautiful feathers began to hang down from his arms.","The two were obviously Grand Yan Immortals who had transformed their faces. They still had no expression on their faces, but from their solemn eyes, Di Qing’s words were true.","The celestial form of the black Crow roared toward the sky. All of the Yan power in the entire Celestial Prefecture gathered toward him, and with an unimaginable force, it pressed down.","Wisps of black flames appeared on the black crow celestial form. It suddenly opened its mouth and let out a cry, releasing an infinite amount of black flames.","Jian Wushuang and the others saw it clearly. Even if the black flames touched them, they would be killed or at least shed a layer of skin.","Suddenly, the young swordsman dragged Jian Wushuang backward.","“Pathetic!” Di Qing smiled coldly.","The two Grand Yan Immortals worked together again, and a pitch-black cauldron that was even larger than before blocked in front of them.","The black crows cawed and released an infinite amount of fire. It was like a curtain of rain, covering every inch of the space.","Whooosh!!!","The frightening black flames even devoured the scattered Yan power in the air. When they collided with the pitch-black cauldron, a dense sizzling sound erupted.","The earth-shaking power made the retreating people feel an indescribable tightness in their chests.","At the same time, black flames rained down on every corner of the Celestial Prefecture.","The large-scale destruction had begun!","The tens of thousands of Immortal abodes and pavilions that were touched by the black flames all collapsed and turned into dust.","The small Celestial Prefecture, which was originally full of Immortal Qi, had become a dead zone at an extremely fast speed.","At this moment, Prince Mo, who was lying on the top of the Fusang Tree, felt his heart bleeding when he saw this. All his trump cards had been burned down!","“Master Di, leave some for me!” In the end, he could not help but ask.","Di Qing’s reply was a cold ‘Get lost’.","Looking at Di Qing’s back, a trace of anger and hatred flashed across Prince Mo’s eyes. However, he quickly returned to normal. After all, he could only rely on Di Qing to survive.","‘Just you wait. If I survive this, you’ll definitely die without a burial place,’ Prince Mo thought to himself.","The power emitted by the image form of the black crow alone could suppress the entire Celestial Prefecture, and no Yan Immortal dared to compete with it.","The two Grand Yan Immortals who bore 90 percent of black crow’s black flames finally exhausted their black flames at the cost of the destruction of the huge pitch-black cauldron.","Di Qing’s face turned cold, and he stretched out his hand and pointed.","Immediately, the black crow behind him raised its head and let out a shrill cry. Dragging along a terrifying black Yan power, it descended from the sky, determined to swallow the two Grand Yan Immortals.","The small Celestial Prefecture turned dark and Yan power was no longer quiet. Instead, a violent tide was produced.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang instantly burst out and used his supreme Yan power to sweep away the True Sword behind him. Then, with an extremely fast speed, he turned around and knelt down in front of the young guard.","Due to the fluctuations of the Yan power tide, all the Yan Immortals present were unable to detect the danger in time.","Therefore, by the time the young guard reacted, it was already too late. His stomach was hit by Jian Wushuang’s full strength.","With a muffled groan, he fell headfirst into the small Celestial Prefecture like a kite that had fallen off its string.","Almost at the same time, Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu also suddenly burst out, using Yan power to force the remaining four swordsmen away.","Then, Chun Qiu summoned his eight-armed Arhat to fight against the swordsmen.","“Brother Jian, let’s end this quickly!” Chen Qing pulled out the True Sword from his waist and looked at Jian Wushuang fiercely. “We will cover your retreat.”","Jian Wushuang nodded heavily. Then, he looked at Prince Mo, who was lying on the Fusang Tree, through the layers of waves of the tide.","The next moment, he stepped on the clouds and suddenly rushed forward, regardless of the great battle above his head that could destroy the world at any time.","Prince Mo, who was like a bird startled by the mere twang of a bow, immediately noticed Jian Wushuang who was flying towards him. He immediately became restless and said, “Master Di, save me!”","Di Qing turned his head impatiently. After seeing Jian Wushuang’s flying figure, he opened his palm without any hesitation and turned into thousands of strands of Yan power, surrounding him.","Thousands of Yan power turned into unparalleled chains and bound Jian Wushuang with an indescribable speed.","Yan power at this level could even kill Yan Immortals!","Jian Wushuang only felt that the air around him was a little stagnant and viscous. The thousands of chains almost instantly bound him.","A force strong enough to crush his bones and muscles was applied to his body as the chain tightened.","Seeing this, Prince Mo sneered. One of his arms had been broken by Jian Wushuang. Now that his enemy was in front of him, he stepped on the Fusang Tree without thinking and flew over. A powerful Yan power blasted out from his palm.","Looking at the thousands of chains around him, Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes.","Then, a small galaxy formed by seven stars appeared between his eyebrows.","It was an Immortal Style move that the broken stone bead had given Jian Wushuang.","Little Mountain and River!","Buzzz!!!","A long ripple of water, with him as the center, directly surged out. It was an immortal Style that surpassed Yan Immortal’s comprehension.","“Break!” Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes. The galaxy between his eyebrows rotated and a great power was released!","The thousands of chains on his body broke and the formless water dragons broke free from the restraints and occupied his body.","Jian Wushuang was the absolute master of the mountains and rivers.","After breaking through Di Qing’s Yan power, he looked at Di Qing for the first time.","When their eyes met, Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all. He stretched out his hand and waved it gently.","Suddenly, a huge phenomenon appeared!","The small Celestial Prefecture, which had already been turned into a dead zone by Di Qing’s black flames, was suddenly split in half by an unknown force.","Then, with countless gravel, wasteland, and half of the Celestial Prefecture, it smashed directly at Di Qing!","Di Qing’s eyes narrowed.","To be able to single-handedly split the entire small continent into two, was this the terrifying power that Yan Immortal could control?","Half of the small Celestial Prefecture had come from the sky.","Di Qing suppressed the surprise in his eyes and snorted coldly. He reached out his palm and clenched it.","Suddenly, the entire small Celestial Prefecture that was flying over uncontrollably stopped in its original place. Then, as if it was squeezed into a ball by an invisible palm, it was crushed into powder.","With a wave of his sleeve, the dust scattered, but Jian Wushuang was nowhere to be seen.","“Interesting. A little Yan Immortal can actually threaten me. Is this an illusion?” Di Qing looked at the figure that had gone far away with a meaningful look, but he did not make any further moves."]},{"number":4768,"title":"Chapter 4768 Vanquishing Immortal Source With a Finger","paragraphs":["4768 Vanquishing Immortal Source With a Finger","He did not stop Jian Wushuang’s plan. Instead, he wanted to see what he wanted to do.","As for Prince Mo’s safety, Di Qing could almost ignore it.","At the same time, the two Grand Yan Immortals joined forces and finally defeated Di Qing’s black crow celestial form.","The black Yan power dissipated, and the two Grand Yan Immortals, one tall and one strong, still stood calmly in their original positions, but their slightly heaving chests showed that they did not win easily.","Di Qing revealed a sneer, “If that’s all you’ve got, get lost, you overconfident guys.”","The two Grand Yan Immortals who had been silent finally spoke.","“We are not the ones who should get out of here. You should be the one getting out of here. If Zhen Wuyang finds out that there is someone who is close to the Emperor level in his Heavenly Domain, you will not be able to survive!”","Hearing this, Di Qing’s ferocious smile gradually froze, and his black and white eyes were filled with a strong killing intent.","“You all dare to threaten me?”","“So what? As long as you continue to fight, the Heavenly Court will definitely detect your existence, and Zhen Wuyang will definitely kill you!” the tall and thin Grand Yan Immortal took a step forward and said in a deep voice. “It’s not worth it to put yourself in danger for Prince Mo.”","“You can’t fight against the entire Heavenly Court by yourself.”","Di Qing’s face grew colder as he listened, “I hate threats the most. Since you are threatening me, you should be prepared to die in front of me.”","“Don’t worry. I promise I’ll kill you before Zhen Wuyang notices.”","With that, Di Qing reached out and picked up a long feather from his hair.","Then, a celestial form of a white crow that blotted out the sky gradually appeared.","Compared to the previous black crow, this white crow was even more brutal. Its four eyes shot out unparalleled beams of light.","“Inheritance!”","Di Qing shouted in a deep voice. He no longer intended to hold back and released the most brutal move, trying to destroy them directly.","The battle started again.","On the other side, Jian Wushuang got rid of Di Qing’s restraint and rushed to Prince Mo.","Prince Mo, who had intended to kill him, was so shocked that his soul almost left his body when he saw Jian Wushuang split half of the Celestial Prefecture. He stopped in mid-air, turned around, and returned to the Fusang Tree.","“You want to leave? Stay here!” Jian Wushuang shouted coldly and clenched his fist.","The space collapsed immediately. Prince Mo, who was flying, suddenly staggered and rolled out.","Jian Wushuang took advantage of the opening and caught up with him, suppressing him with one palm.","The mountain rocks that rose up from the ground pinned him under the Fusang Tree.","“Let me go!” Prince Mo shouted in panic. “I will give you whatever you want as long as you let me go.”","Jian Wushuang frowned and slapped him to shut him up.","Then, he reached out and touched Prince Mo’s chest.","However, he did not find what he was looking for. There was nothing in Prince Mo’s arms, not even half a piece of the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","“Where’s the thing I want?” Jian Wushuang suppressed his killing intent and said coldly.","Prince Mo’s eyes were filled with fear. “What kind of thing are you looking for? It’s really in my arms. I’ve never thrown it away.”","Jian Wushuang saw that he did not look like he was going to speak, so he started searching again.","However, the result was the same as before. He still could not find the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","“You lied to me?” Jian Wushuang’s face was cold, and his raised palm was already bursting with killing intent.","Prince Mo’s face was ashen. He clearly remembered that after he had picked up the jade bone armor, he had kept it in his arms and never lost it. How could it have disappeared?","Jian Wushuang did not intend to kill him. In this situation, he had not found what he needed, so he had to leave as soon as possible to avoid being affected.","Just as he was about to leave after giving Prince Mo a memorable lesson, a deep and cold voice rang out from behind him.","“Brat, go to hell!”","Di Qing appeared behind Jian Wushuang quietly.","Then, he stretched out a finger and pointed it at Jian Wushuang’s back.","Whizzz!","The black and white power of the finger blasted open his entire chest from his back without any resistance.","The divine blood, Yan power, and Immortal Source were all shattered at this moment.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils were dilated to the maximum. The indescribable pain and the blankness of his divine consciousness made him teetering and then he fell into the void.","Di Qing retracted his palm, a look of pity flashed across his face, and then he turned back.","The entire process was almost completed in a breath’s time. When Prince Mo came back to his senses, Jian Wushuang’s shattered body had already died.","“I’m fine, I’m fine...” he sat down under the Fusang Tree and mumbled to himself.","The entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture had turned into a complete mess. All the top cultivators and Yan Immortals who were not affected had left long ago.","As for the guards who were supposed to be the first to arrive, after seeing the terrifying scene of the Grand Yan Immortal’s battle, they all tacitly disappeared.","The entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was located in the Northernmost Heavenly Region of the Great Si Region, which was quite a distance from the Heavenly Court.","Therefore, everything that was happening in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture did not affect the other Heavenly Regions.","...","On the broken ground that was still covered in black flames, there was a broken figure lying on the ground.","There was nothing in front of his stomach, it was replaced by a big hole, and his Immortal body was almost half broken.","With such injuries, any other Yan Immortal would have been dead.","However, if one looked closely, they would find that this figure, which should have been dead, was filled with the exuberant vitality of a living being.","His broken Immortal body was also repairing rapidly.","He had the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, even if the Immortal Source was broken and the power was scattered, as long as there was a will left, it was enough to be rebuilt.","At the same time, the injuries that would have killed any other Yan Immortal were not even serious injuries to Jian Wushuang.","With a slight movement of his fingers, his blank consciousness slowly recovered.","Although the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was constantly recovering, the severe pain after the injury still affected him.","Above the clouds, a huge battle was still happening. Extremely beautiful explosions were still happening.","Jian Wushuang lay on the ground, hoping to recover quickly.","At this moment, a pair of scarlet and white feet with silver bells attached to them quietly stepped on the ground that had been burned by the flames. It was as if the owner of the feet did not feel the heat at all.","The dress that was hanging on the ground was melting, revealing the skin of her legs.","Finally, the owner of the feet came to Jian Wushuang and slowly squatted down.","At the same time, an ancient object full of cracks was placed in front of him."]},{"number":4769,"title":"Chapter 4769 Meeting Zheng Ying Again","paragraphs":["4769 Meeting Zheng Ying Again","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and his breathing became heavy.","The piece of jade that entered his eyes was the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor that he had been searching for all this time.","The person holding the bone armor was none other than Lady Yin Ling, who had been by Prince Mo’s side the entire time.","Jian Wushuang subconsciously reached out to grab it, but Yin Ling suddenly retracted it.","“Do you really need this thing?” Yiling waved the bone armor in her hand and looked at him playfully.","Jian Wushuang, who had almost recovered, stood up from the ground and stared at her.","“This thing is of no use to me, but it seems that you need it very much,” Yin Ling said slowly. “I can give it to you, but you have to promise me one thing.”","“Speak,” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Yin Ling nodded. “The condition is simple. Take me out of here and never set foot here again.”","Jian Wushuang, who had no intention of carrying out the conditions of the exchange, nodded after hearing the simple requirements, “Sure, I agree.”","Yin Ling smiled, but when he reached out, she quickly stuffed the bone armor into her chest.","“I can’t give it to you now. If you change your mind at the last minute, I’ll be the one in trouble,” Yin Ling said seriously. “So I can only give it to you after I’ve left the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture completely.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang did not say much. Now that another Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was in front of him, it saved him a lot of energy.","At the same time, in the face of such a simple request, he could exchange it for a piece of bone armor, and there was no need to kill again.","Although she might be a burden or an unstable factor, Jian Wushuang had already decided to take her away.","He took out a few crystals from the black mountains and put them into his mouth to quickly nourish his newly recovered meridians. He said, “Wait here for a while. I’ll be back soon and come back to receive you later.”","Yin Ling shook her head and said, “No, I’ll go with you. There are too many variables now. It might be safer for me to follow you.”","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to ignore her and fly into the sky.","Although he wanted to give Di Qing an eye for an eye, the gap between the two of them was too great. It was obviously unwise to seek revenge at this moment.","Jian Wushuang took a deep look at Di Qing and prepared to grab Chen Qing and Chun Qiu.","At this moment, he glanced at the Fusang Tree from the corner of his eye.","A ghostly figure quietly appeared behind the frightened Prince Mo.","Perhaps he had sensed the strange aura behind him, but Prince Mo subconsciously turned his body.","A cold light flashed, and the majestic Yan power force directly crushed half of his body into powder.","A blood-curdling scream resounded.","“Master Di, save me!”","However, Di Qing was now entangled with the two Grand Yan Immortals and could not get away, let alone rush to the rescue like before.","If he had not subconsciously turned around, that sneak attack alone would have been enough to kill him.","Half of Prince Mo’s body was completely shattered. He collapsed under the Fusang Tree with an ashen face.","The ghostly figure slowly walked in front of him, holding a True Sword in his hand.","The ghostly figure had a ferocious mask, but from the shape of the body, it was a woman.","It was obvious that she was the one who had severely injured Prince Mo.","As if sensing the danger of death, Prince Mo calmed down from his initial panic and began to fight back with all his might.","He used his remaining arm to release a vast amount of Yan power, which blasted toward the ghostly figure.","However, the next moment, she instantly drew her sword and cut off Prince Mo’s remaining arm.","The ghostly figure did not want to talk nonsense. After cutting off his arm, she activated her vast Yan power to destroy his Immortal Source.","A sudden change occurred!","Before the majestic force could touch Prince Mo’s Immortal Source, it was suddenly cut off. Then, even the ghostly figure was trapped by a strange force.","Di Qing again!","He was simply too terrifying. With just a wave of his hand, he could easily trap a Yan Immortal.","The ghostly figure clearly did not anticipate this. By the time she reacted, it was already too late.","Di Qing grabbed her, obviously intending to crush her Immortal Source directly.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly appeared with an Invisible Sword in his hand and cut off all the connections Di Qing had with the ghostly figure.","Di Qing’s eyes suddenly narrowed, as if he had seen something incredible. Obviously, he was very surprised that Jian Wushuang was still alive.","However, he could no longer withdraw. Facing these two Grand Yan Immortals who seemed vulnerable but were extremely difficult to deal with, he could not use his full strength, so he could only face them off like this.","Because once Di Qing used an even more supreme power, his unique aura would inevitably spread throughout the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. If the Heavenly Court really detected it, he would either have to surrender or die.","Therefore, he could not use his full strength at all, and could only hold on like this.","Although Di Qing did not care about Prince Mo’s life or death, he was still very generous with the Enlightenment Dao Field and some other conditions.","The True Crow’s bloodline was formed from all living beings in the world, and no matter how the Great Dao circulated, it was always the most ancient and top-tier existence.","Di Qing, on the other hand, had already cultivated Nine True Feathers. With one more, he would be able to comprehend the Emperor’s fate energy and ascend to the throne.","Therefore, he could not let anything happen to himself now. He could not let anything happen to Prince Mo, who had provided him with the training ground and resources.","Jian Wushuang and Di Qing looked at each other coldly, and Jian Wushuang retreated without fear as he clutched the ghostly woman.","The ghostly figure’s body struggled unnaturally, but after realizing that it was futile, she simply let him hold on.","After returning to the huge Fusang Tree, Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath of turbid air.","After breaking free from Jian Wushuang’s grasp, the ghostly figure with the mask came to Prince Mo with her sword.","Perhaps it had experienced a series of fierce battles, but the mask band behind the ghostly figure’s hair suddenly fell off, and the entire black-gold mask fell off.","Her fine black hair fell down, revealing a beautiful and delicate face that was a little pale.","“It’s you?” When Jian Wushuang saw the extremely recognizable face, he subconsciously blurted out, “Zheng Ying?”","The woman with a beautiful and delicate face was the unconscious woman that Jian Wushuang had seen not long after he had defeated the giant Sea Sky Octopus when he had first arrived in the Great Yan Domain and escorted the black mountain crystals together with Chun Qiu.","When the ghostly figure heard the name ‘Zheng Ying’, her body trembled. She had not expected that someone would call out her name in a place like this."]},{"number":4770,"title":"Chapter 4770 Perished","paragraphs":["4770 Perished","For a moment, the air fell into a state of dead silence.","Jian Wushuang quickly understood why Zheng Ying looked so surprised. It was because he had transformed into an ordinary guard, which was completely different from his previous appearance.","That was why Zheng Ying did not recognize him as Jian Wushuang from the great voyage.","However, the time and place of their next meeting was a little strange.","Why would this woman, who had disappeared quietly after the battle in the Whirling Heaven, suddenly appear in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture? Moreover, it seemed that she was here to kill Prince Mo.","Could she be the messenger of one of the Princes under Zhen Wuyang?","Jian Wushuang was a little uncertain. He opened his mouth slightly, but nothing came out. Then, he turned around and prepared to leave.","At this moment, he suddenly felt a great danger behind him, causing him to turn his head.","Then, a True Sword wrapped in Yan power almost brushed past his neck and stabbed forward, bringing up a trace of blood.","If Jian Wushuang had not dodged in time, the sword would have been enough to cause serious damage to Jian Wushuang!","After barely avoiding the danger, he turned to look at Zheng Ying, his eyes as dark as water.","Zheng Ying’s beautiful face was as cold as ice. She held the sword in her right hand and without saying a word, she slashed at Jian Wushuang again with Yan power.","“Are you sick?” Jian Wushuang’s index and middle fingers caught the blade that was heading straight for his face. He suppressed his anger and said to Zheng Ying, “Do you really think I’m a pushover?”","Zheng Ying’s body froze again, and doubt appeared in her cold eyes. She could hear something familiar in the words of this young guard.","However, in the next moment, an even colder killing intent burst out. From Zheng Ying’s back, hundreds of boundless Yan power suddenly appeared and all of them suppressed Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was furious. He suddenly struck his palm forward and clashed with Yan power.","A wave of mighty explosions surged out from under the Fusang Tree.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang pointed out his finger again, which turned into several water dragons and trapped Zheng Ying.","He did not want to kill Zheng Ying. After all, she was one of the few people he had met when he first came to the Great Yan Domain, so his only goal was to trap her.","However, the more it was like this, the more intense Zheng Ying’s resistance became. Her strength, which was stronger than that of an ordinary Yan Immortal, gave Jian Wushuang a headache.","“What do you want? Don’t go overboard, Zheng Ying!” Jian Wushuang looked at the woman in front of him and said in a deep voice.","Zheng Ying, who had been silent all this while, finally spoke. “Wow did you know my name?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang fell silent. He realized that he could not reveal any information about himself.","In the end, he pushed forward, forcing Zheng Ying away.","“Don’t care who I am. I’ll give you a piece of advice. It’s best if you don’t kill Prince Mo.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang obviously did not want to waste any more time and turned to leave.","Looking at that familiar back, Zheng Ying did not chase after him. Instead, she turned around to look at Prince Mo, who was lying under the Fusang Tree, barely breathing.","After several fights and escapees, Prince Mo had already gotten over it. There was only unwillingness left in his eyes.","Under the battle between Di Qing and Grand Yan Immortal, the entire small Celestial Prefecture and even the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was on the verge of collapse.","The old roots of the Fusang Tree had already broken, and broken stones were falling down.","Zheng Ying walked forward and faced the setting sun. Without any hesitation, she cut off Prince Mo’s head.","Then, she stretched out her palm and released a vast amount of Yan power, easily crushing his Immortal Source.","He was the Fifth Prince under Zhen Wuyang, Prince Mo.","Under the Fusang Tree.","The Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, which was supported by Prince Mo’s fate energy, began to collapse. All the Great Dao and fate energy were in chaos.","Heaven and earth were in grief. This was a reaction to the death of an Emperor.","Zheng Ying, the one who brought about the termination, looked at the lifeless head in her hand and waved her hand to take the last bit of fate energy that belonged to Prince Mo.","In the end, the head turned into a handful of fine powder and fell under the Fusang Tree.","The son of the Emperor passed away, and the Great Dao of heaven and earth trembled.","At this moment, all the Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals who were fighting in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture had noticed this.","Jian Wushuang turned around and took one last look at the figure standing under the Fusang Tree with a complicated expression. Then, he left quickly.","Once Prince Mo died, all the Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals present would be thoroughly investigated by the Heavenly Court.","If they left any clues, it would be a disaster!","Jian Wushuang did not forget that other than Zhen Wuyang, who had the Emperor’s fate energy, there were still 99 Grand Yan Immortals in the entire Heavenly Court.","Any one of them had the absolute strength to fight Di Qing alone.","Therefore, escaping was the best choice.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu, who were fighting with all their might, felt their bodies relax. The mysterious five swordsmen stopped their attacks and shouted at the sky in unison, “Prince Mo is dead! Retreat!”","Hearing this, the two Grand Yan Immortals with divine blood spots on their bodies immediately gave up their confrontation with Di Qing and prepared to escape.","“You want to run? All of you, stay!” Di Qing shouted angrily. He shook his arms and grabbed them.","The two Grand Yan Immortals hurriedly circulated Yan power’s great force to resist. At the same time, they said in a deep voice, “Prince Mo is dead, and the Heavenly Court will definitely investigate. If you don’t leave now, you won’t be able to leave later even if you want to!”","Di Qing smiled and said, “We have plenty of time. It’s not too late for me to leave after I kill you all!”","“Brainless idiot.” Unable to escape, the two Grand Yan Immortals were also anxious. The longer they stayed at this place, the less likely it was for them to escape.","However, Di Qing did not let them leave, and they started fighting again.","“Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, let’s go!” With a deep roar, Jian Wushuang moved like lightning and broke through the five swordsmen’s blockade with great momentum to help the two.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu nodded their heads and the three of them quickly fled.","“Brother Jian, is Prince Mo really dead?” Cheng Qing could not help but ask while they were fleeing.","He still could not believe that the Fifth Prince of Zhen Wuyang had died so easily.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, “The fate energy has already dissipated. There’s no possibility of survival.”","Cheng Qing nodded. His eyes were filled with either joy or worry. “Damn it. The fight was so rushed that I even forgot to pour a hot pee on the heavenly hall.”","“...”","“Don’t think too much, let’s escape from this place first.”","The Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was extremely vast, but as the Prince’s fate energy dissipated, the Great Dao became chaotic, and the entire Celestial Prefecture was irreversibly shattered.","Jian Wushuang wanted to escape from the Celestial Prefecture with all his might and hide his aura as much as possible before the people from the Heavenly Court arrived.","The current chaotic situation was exactly what he wanted. As long as he left the Celestial Prefecture, even the Emperor would not be able to detect that he had been here."]},{"number":4771,"title":"Chapter 4771 The Arrival of Uncle Yu","paragraphs":["4771 The Arrival of Uncle Yu","Under the Fusang Tree, Zheng Ying turned back to look at the figure that had already disappeared into the distance. She seemed to have understood a little.","After a few breaths, just as the Fusang Tree completely collapsed, her figure also disappeared quietly.","“Brother Jian, we’ll be able to leave the Celestial Prefecture in half a day at most. Have you found the thing you need?” Cheng Qing asked.","Jian Wushuang did not speak but looked at Yin Ling, who was following him closely.","“Don’t worry. As long as we get out of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, I’ll give you what you want immediately,” Yin Ling patted her chest and proudly smiled.","Jian Wushuang’s face stiffened and he turned his head to the side.","Seeing this, Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu both had strange expressions.","“Isn’t this woman Prince Mo’s woman?” Cheng Qing’s expression was somewhat startled.","Hearing this, Yin Ling sniffed. “Hey, silly big guy, which eye of yours saw that I’m Prince Mo’s woman?”","“I was merely imprisoned by his side. Now that he’s dead, I’m free.”","Cheng Qing pouted, but did not say anything.","Four completely hidden figures were rapidly leaving.","However, in the next moment, Jian Wushuang felt great danger.","As if to confirm his thoughts, the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, which had been plunged into crimson and darkness, began to be illuminated by a white-gold light.","Then, just as Jian Wushuang and the others were about to step out of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, an invisible and hazy barrier appeared outside the boundary of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","“This is bad!” Jian Wushuang’s heart sank and he felt a chill.","When Cheng Qing and the others saw this, their hearts also sank to the bottom.","The entire shattered Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture had been sealed off by an external force!","Only those existences could seal the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture with such a powerful force. Even Grand Yan Immortals could not do it.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with solemness and bitterness.","“Brother Jian, what should we do? Should we force our way out?” Chen Qing said in a serious tone as a ruthless glint appeared in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “From now on, we can’t use Yan power. This barrier is definitely not something we can break through. Let’s just wait and see.”","After saying this, he brought the three of them to land directly in a shattered Immortal estate pavilion and concealed all of his aura.","In the broken sky, hundreds of millions of white-gold light beams shot up into the sky!","At the same time, more than a dozen Elders with light wheels of various colors on their backs were approaching on clouds.","Di Qing, who was still fighting in the sky, also noticed this scene.","“Damned fool, just wait for your death!” One of the Grand Yan Immortals fighting Di Qing shouted in anger, wishing he could tear Di Qing apart.","Di Qing retracted his palm and looked at the old men standing in the clouds, a great fear flashing through his eyes.","The two Grand Yan Immortals looked at each other, then they suddenly fled to the left and right.","“Evil creature!”","One of the Elders with a black light wheel on his back raised his palm and pressed down. Even though they were millions of miles away, he still captured a Grand Yan Immortal who was escaping.","At the same time, an old man with a scarlet wheel of light on his back took out a palm-sized porcelain bottle and directly absorbed another Grand Yan Immortal!","In the blink of an eye, the two escaping Grand Yan Immortals were both caught.","Then, the old man with the black light wheel used his great divine ability to squeeze the two Grand Yan Immortals into the size of pellets.","“The Fifth Young Lord, did you kill him?” The majestic sound of a great bell reverberated throughout the Celestial Prefecture.","The two Grand Yan Immortals, who were originally insufferably arrogant, were now scared out of their wits.","This was because they saw an ordinary-looking old man in a black robe slowly walking over.","This old man was Uncle Yu, the most mysterious Elder behind Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","“It’s... It’s none of our business. We’re just passing by. We didn’t kill the Fifth Prince. He was killed by someone else!”","They still wanted to say something, but the black-robed old man just waved his hand at them, and their divine souls and Immortal Sources were completely destroyed.","What kind of terrifying strength was this, to destroy a Grand Yan immortal without even releasing Yan power?","His wrinkled face seemed to contain all the vicissitudes of life and secrets of the world. Finally, he looked at Di Qing not far away with his turbid eyes.","Di Qing slowly took half a step back and stared at him.","“The Fifth Prince, did you kill him?” A hoarse voice came. Uncle Yu’s eyes were so calm that they seemed to have stopped time.","Even the proud Di Qing had to lower his head at this moment.","“No, and it’s impossible for him to be killed by me. He was killed by his accomplices. A woman personally cut off Young Master Mo’s head and destroyed his Immortal Source,” Di Qing pointed at the five swordsmen in the distance and said in a deep voice.","Uncle Yu’s face was expressionless. He slowly reached out his hand from his sleeve and clenched his fist in the air.","As he grabbed, the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, which was already on the verge of destruction, shattered even faster. Whether it was Immortal mansions, pavilions, or thousands of living beings, they were all inevitably turned into fine powder.","“Since that’s the case, all of you will be buried with the Fifth Prince.” Gu Ji’s old voice resounded.","Uncle Yu’s voice was like the Great Dao, which caused the irreversible defeat of the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","Di Qing’s pupils suddenly narrowed, and he took a few steps back as he said, “What do you mean? I’ve already told you the real murderer, why don’t you let me go?”","“The death of the Fifth Prince is related to the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. Naturally, all of you will be buried with him.” Uncle Yu’s voice was indifferent and unquestionable.","Di Qing’s face turned livid. “Do you think you can defeat me like this? If I leave, no one will be able to stop me!”","With that, a huge Golden Crow image bloomed behind Di Qing, and his whole body was filled with a faint majesty.","Facing a dozen Grand Yan Immortals with light wheels on their backs and the unfathomable Uncle Yu, he chose to fight!","However, before the battle even began, Uncle Yu pointed his finger at Di Qing. A dark beam of light pierced through the void, tore Di Qing’s Golden Crow form apart, and easily shattered his Immortal Source.","Deathly silence, an extreme deathly silence.","Di Qing, who was arrogant enough to fight against two people alone, had his Immortal Source shattered just like that.","The shattering of the Immortal Source meant irreversible damage, and it symbolized a Yan Immortal’s final death sentence.","Di Qing died just like that. Thousands of feathers were stripped from his body and scattered in the void.","Then, his body plunged into the shattered Celestial Prefecture.","After killing Di Qing, Uncle Yu raised his arms again. Under his control, the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was crushed into powder.","Even Yan Immortals would not be able to survive.","With the death of the Fifth Prince, the trillions of living beings in the entire Celestial Prefecture had also been buried with him.","No top cultivator or Yan Immortal could escape from Uncle Yu’s Dao.","However, there should be an exception to everything."]},{"number":4772,"title":"Chapter 4772 Sand Demon Cave","paragraphs":["4772 Sand Demon Cave","As the entire Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture was completely crushed into dust, trillions of living beings were buried with it.","Then, Uncle Yu returned to the Heavenly Court with the group of Elders.","He came in a hurry and left in a hurry.","Everything seemed to have been erased, as if it had never existed.","The thick and heavy dust was devoured and absorbed by the astral winds in the universe.","The Heavenly Region that originally belonged to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture had been wiped out and replaced by nothingness.","It might have to go through millions of reincarnations in the galaxy before a new Heavenly Region could be born.","In the starry sky, as the dust fell, there were a few faint auras.","...","“Brothers, we’re going to be rich this time! Who has ever seen a crystal with such dense and pure Yan power?”","“Oh my God, this is dozens, no, hundreds of times denser in Yan power!”","“I didn’t expect that we could find such a treasure in such a remote desert. We should be rich!”","“No, here, why is there a pair of legs?”","In the yellow sand that covered the sky, there were nearly 50 men in thick and long clothes. They were swallowing their saliva as they looked at the black crystal that was as tall as a small mountain.","Furthermore, the cultivation of these men was not weak. They were all Ancestor realm cultivators.","At this time, the two men closest to the black crystal saw a leg under the crystal and directly pulled it out.","Whoosh...","As the black crystal collapsed and flowed, the owner of the legs finally appeared.","“B-boss, it’s a man!” the man with the full beard could not help but shout after seeing the figure clearly.","“What’s all the noise? Haven’t you seen a man before?” One of the pale-faced men glared at him, then looked at the unconscious man and gasped.","At this moment, the clothes on the upper body of the man who was unconscious in the black mountain crystal had been torn apart, revealing his well-proportioned body.","At the same time, his exposed skin was extremely red, as if it had been soaked in blood. On his chest, there was a Fire Phoenix spreading its wings and chirping, as if it could break free at any time and rush into the clouds.","When he first saw the unconscious man, the pale-faced man felt a great sense of danger.","His intuition, which had been used to escaping death several times, told him that this man was definitely a terrifying existence.","“Boss, there are people here too!”","The full-bearded man shouted again while pointing at the other leg buried in the black crystal.","“Boss, what should we do?” the subordinate who had also noticed something was amiss asked in a deep voice, a hint of ruthlessness in his eyes.","The pale-faced man did not hesitate. He immediately narrowed his eyes and said, “Kill them all while they are unconscious. Don’t leave a single one alive!”","All the top cultivators received the order and rushed forward. They controlled their respective Yan power and prepared to kill.","However, at this moment, an earth-shattering sound suddenly rang out. Then, countless powerful forces turned into a dense net and descended.","Before the pale-faced man’s subordinates could react, more than ten top cultivators were killed by Yan power who descended from the sky.","“Not good, Boss! Those guys from the Sand Demon Cave are here!” the full-bearded man cried out in shock. However, before he could reach the pale-faced man, Yan power, who had descended from the sky, pierced through his Life Source.","Blood splattered on his face.","A violent sandstorm swept up from the ground, accompanied by a terrifying strong wind. Hundreds of lazy figures approached from afar.","“Boss, let’s retreat. We’re far from being their match.”","The corners of the white-faced man’s eyes twitched. He was clearly unwilling to accept this.","This black crystal, which was hundreds or even thousands of times more precious than sky crystals, was already in his bag, but now he was giving it away. How could he do it?","However, it was only when the figures riding on the yellow sand got closer and closer that the pale-faced man finally waved his hand unwillingly. “Retreat!”","Before he retreated, he stretched out his hand again and grabbed nearly 1,000 black mountain crystals before he quickly escaped.","“What bad luck. This group of bastards actually dared to find food in our territory. They’re simply tired of living!”","The yellow sand dissipated, and the hundreds of figures gradually emerged.","At the very front of these figures was a young man in casual clothes. He looked at the figures that were flying away and spat on the ground in disdain.","“Brothers, hurry up and move it. Whoever leaves a piece behind will be hung on the city gate for ten days!” The unrestrained young man’s face was full of dissatisfaction. As he waved his hand, the hundred men behind him all flew to the small mountain of crystals and began to move them.","Waving his hand to take a black crystal, the unrestrained young man raised his eyebrows and smiled. “That’s really not bad. This time, I’ll give all of them to Big Sister. Another great merit!”","“Commander Cui, there are a few people under these crystals,” a man responded. At the same time, he dragged out the bodies that were either buried under the crystals or in the yellow sand.","There were a total of six figures, five men and one woman.","When the unrestrained young man, who was called Commander Cui, saw the unconscious woman, his eyes could not help but brighten.","Even though her figure was in a sorry state, the yellow sand could not hide her gentle and beautiful figure.","“Commander Cui, their identities are unknown. It’s best to avoid contact with them,” the middle-aged man beside the unrestrained young man pulled him back in time and reminded him in a calm voice.","“I don’t need you to remind me. I just want to check if they’re pretending to be unconscious to prevent any unnecessary situations from happening.” The unrestrained young man shook off the middle-aged man’s hand and took a step forward, pretending to investigate.","With one look, he also saw some clues.","The five men and one woman, the six figures, had all suffered extremely heavy injuries. It could be said that they were on the verge of death.","There was a tall middle-aged man in tattered black and gold clothes. His entire chest had been torn apart by some terrifying force.","Moreover, from the clothing of these people, they all had a faint sense of authority.","The most important thing was that he could not see through the strength and realm of these people.","“Where did these suspicious guys come from? Why do they give me such a strong sense of deterrence?” the young man rubbed his chin and muttered.","“Commander Cui, what should we do with these unconscious people?” the middle-aged man reminded.","Hearing this, the young man stopped thinking and waved his hand. “Who cares? As long as we find it, it’s ours. Carry it all into the city. Don’t leave a single strand of hair behind!”","...","Between heaven and earth, the vast yellow sand became the only main color.","Due to the shaking and jolting, he was forced to slowly open his eyes from the pain.","A wisp of pure red light flickered in the depths of his eyes, and the star between his brows also began to slowly rotate."]},{"number":4773,"title":"Chapter 4773 Hanging on the City Wall","paragraphs":["4773 Hanging on the City Wall","However, the gathered forces only existed for a moment before they dissipated.","The pain came from the overwhelming pain of his divine sense.","Whether it was the divine sense, the Immortal Source, or the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, they had all been destroyed in the destruction of the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","In the final process of destruction, he used his Immortal body to absorb more than half of the destruction aura to protect Cheng Qing, Chun Qiu, and Yin Ling.","Jian Wushuang was almost crushed by the great momentum.","Without the Ancestral Phoenix blood that Feng Qi had left in his body, even with the characteristics of a Perfect Chaotic Life Form, it would be enough to make Jian Wushuang fall into a long sleep.","Feeling the Ancestral Phoenix blood in his body gradually dimming, he knew that after one more time, the divine blood Feng Qi left in his body would completely disappear.","Besides his eyes, Jian Wushuang’s other body parts were in a chaotic state that he could not control.","He endured the pain of his consciousness being shattered and then fused as he looked around him and in front of him.","In the sandstorm, the team of hundreds of people slowly moved forward, their destination unknown.","He wanted to move, but he found himself tied up like a dumpling by a unique chain. He was lying on the mountain of black mountain crystals and could not move at all.","Beside Jian Wushuang, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others were all wrapped like rice dumplings. They were still unconscious and had no idea where they were.","Jian Wushuang struggled to get up, but the intense pain from every cell made him hold on for a moment before he passed out again.","When he closed his eyes, he saw a huge black door appear in the yellow sand.","...","“Ah...”","With a slight groan, Jian Wushuang woke up from his initial unconsciousness.","Cold sweat poured out from his temples. Although he had recovered, he had only recovered 10 percent at most. He could barely mobilize his Yan power.","This was the most serious injury he had suffered since he came to the Great Yan Domain. Even his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was almost shattered.","Because of this, Jian Wushuang realized Uncle Yu’s terrifying power.","With a wave of his hand, he annihilated two Grand Yan Immortals and shattered Di Qing’s Immortal Source with a finger. How terrifying was he?","Could it be that he was a supreme almighty on the same level as Emperor Zhen Wuyang?","There was no answer. The only thing Jian Wushuang could think of was that they had escaped from Uncle Yu.","The cause of Prince Mo’s death would be completely buried. At least, they would not be found out.","Slowly exhaling a mouthful of turbid breath, Jian Wushuang was shocked to realize that his current situation was not optimistic. It could even be described as terrible.","Jian Wushuang was tied up by a rope and hung high on the city wall.","He was not the only one. The unconscious Cheng Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others were all lined up beside him, hanging on the city wall without exception.","It was unknown what this city wall was made of, but on the pitch-black wall, thick bone spikes were exposed, making it look extremely hideous.","In addition, the red clouds formed by the resentment and Blood Qi in the sky were almost solid.","How many killings did they have to do to have such a scene?","Jian Wushuang had a headache. Ever since he entered the Great Yan Domain, he had been in a passive situation.","He had only managed to escape with his life from the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, and now he had fallen into such a state.","As he had not recovered from his injuries, he could not even use Yan power as he wished. He could not do anything about the rope on his body, so he could only be hung on the city wall.","Then, Jian Wushuang looked to his side. Although Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others were injured to varying degrees, they were far from fatal. Their breathing was stable.","When he looked to the right, he was shocked.","Di Qing, who had been killed by Uncle Yu on the spot and had his Immortal Source crushed, was now hanging beside Jian Wushuang in the same posture. Although his aura was barely audible, he was actually alive.","Di Qing was not dead, which was not good news, but a big threat to him.","Jian Wushuang had already started to think about how to kill him.","Di Qing was not the only one. A figure in broken armor was also hanging on the city wall.","Jian Wushuang could clearly see that the figure in the broken armor was the young guard who had held him hostage earlier, one of the seven swordsmen.","Among these figures, only the most important one was missing, Yin Ling, who ahd the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","Even at the last moment before the Celestial Prefecture was destroyed, Jian Wushuang had taken Yin Ling’s existence into consideration and protected her. It was impossible for her to die.","Now that she had disappeared, there was only one possibility — she had been taken away by the people of this evil city.","At this moment, Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu gradually woke up. They looked around in a daze, but they were speechless.","“What is this place? Have we escaped from the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture?” Chen Qing said in a daze. Then, he saw Jian Wushuang, and his eyes lit up.","“Brother Jian, we didn’t die?!”","“Of course we’re not dead,” Chun Qiu muttered. He was extremely weak. but I’m not far from death.","“It’s good that you’ve escaped. This time, we can be considered to have lived together... Wait a minute, isn’t our current location a little strange?”","“Who the f*ck hung us on the city wall?!” Cheng Qing was surprised. He tried to twist his body to break free, but found that he could not even use a bit of strength.","Jian Wushuang spoke in a timely manner, “Don’t waste your energy. Recover well. I think the people who captured us will be out soon.”","As his voice fell, the dust-covered city gate slowly opened, and a faint smell of blood wafted out.","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown. It seemed that this Heavenly Region was just as he had guessed, filled with bloodlust.","As the city gate slowly opened, a team of eight people walked out.","In the middle of the group, there were four people carrying a soft bed on their shoulders.","On the soft bed, there was a young man with disheveled clothes and a loose body.","“Needless to say, it must be this bunch of b*stards who tied us up!” Chen Qing’s face was ashen, and he wanted to go down and draw their blood on the spot.","Chun Qiu’s expression changed as well. He muttered, “Oh no, my storage ring is missing...”","The interspatial ring was given to Jian Wushuang by the Young Emperor when they left the Six Heavens Realm. The amount of Black Mountain peak crystals stored in it was terrifying.","The apex crystals inside was enough to make the top cultivators in a Heavenly Domain fight for it.","Losing it now was an incalculable loss.","“It must have been taken by those bastards who trapped us. When I recover, I’ll crush them,” Cheng Qing gritted his teeth and said. However, he was severely injured. He probably would not be able to fight back against an Ancestor-level cultivator."]},{"number":4774,"title":"Chapter 4774 Entering the Evil City","paragraphs":["4774 Entering the Evil City","As if he had just woken up from a dream, the unrestrained young man lying on the soft bed looked up at the few people on the city wall.","“Oh, you’ve finally woken up after hanging for more than ten days. You’ve really made me wait for a long time.”","As he spoke, he took out a black crystal the length of a finger from his bosom and rubbed it in his hand with a disdainful look.","Cheng Qing was beyond furious. He looked at the unrestrained youth in front of him, who was only an Ancestor realm cultivator, and said angrily, “It’s fine if you b*stards stole my things, but now you dare to mock me? Do you believe that I won’t exterminate you all?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. In the current situation, they had not recovered their strength at all. It was impossible for them to deal with an Ancestor realm expert.","If they were to capsize here, they would really be doomed.","As expected, after hearing Cheng Qing’s shout, the unrestrained young man, who originally had a face that was asking for a beating, suddenly jumped up from the soft bed. His eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Old thing, who are you calling a thief? Do you believe that I will pull out the root of your tongue?!”","When Cheng Qing heard this, he laughed disdainfully and spat at him. “Even while I’m hanging here, don’t even think about hurting me!”","The unrestrained youth did not say much. He immediately pulled out a True Sword from his attendant’s waist and stepped on the air to stab Chen Qing.","Jian Wushuang was not worried. Even if Chen Qing’s strength had not recovered, his body was a true Immortal body, which could not be destroyed by Yan Immortals.","This self-proclaimed commander was only at the Ancestor realm. With the ordinary metal in his hand, the damage he could cause to Cheng Qing was naturally limited.","Sure enough, the sword struck out and stabbed toward Cheng Qing’s chest, but it could not advance an inch. It did not even pierce his clothes.","Seeing this, the unrestrained young man’s body trembled, and the arrogance in his eyes diminished a bit.","“Get lost, a brat who hasn’t even grown his hair yet dares to make a move on Master Chen?” Chen Qing said coldly. At the same time, he spat out a mouthful of saliva.","As the distance was too close, the unrestrained young man was caught off guard and his face was covered in saliva.","“Argh! I’m going to kill you!” The unrestrained young man, who had recovered from his shock, was furious. He raised his True Sword and madly slashed at Cheng Qing.","Under such a crazy attack, although Cheng Qing had the appearance of an Immortal, he was already somewhat unable to withstand it due to the heavy injuries he had suffered.","“Enough, Kid. I’m not a sandbag,” Cheng Qing tried to dodge as he furiously shouted.","There was only anger left in the eyes of the unrestrained young man as he aimed his sword at the fatal spot.","At this moment, a cold and ethereal female voice rang out from all directions.","“Cui Jing, stop and bring them to me.”","Jian Wushuang looked up at the red sky that was formed by killing and evil thoughts. He could vaguely see an aura gathering in the city.","After the unrestrained youth named Cui Jing heard that voice, although he hated Chen Qing to the core, he also stopped.","He turned around with his sword in hand and gave orders to the attendants he had brought.","Before long, Jian Wushuang and the others were all led down from the city wall.","The young guard, who had been unconscious, had woken up long ago. He looked at Jian Wushuang with an undisguised cold killing intent.","Jian Wushuang ignored his gaze and looked at Di Qing, who had just woken up from his near-death state.","The power that could destroy an ordinary Yan Immortal thousands of times did not kill him completely.","However, judging from his dispirited aura after he woke up, he had suffered more serious injuries than Jian Wushuang.","In this way, Jian Wushuang did not have to worry that Di Qing would hurt him. After all, a bird whose beak was temporarily removed could not cause much damage.","Under the lead of the unrestrained young man Cui Jing, the group of five, like prisoners, entered the evil city with ropes connected to each other.","The yellow sand rolled up. In this big city that was filled with brutal killing intent and evil thoughts, the ground was covered with thick sand and stones.","This evil city was completely situated on a desolate desert.","After entering the city gate, Jian Wushuang noticed the scene inside the city.","Such a big city was quite similar to a stockaded village. It was crisscrossed with different houses stacked on top of each other, as if there were fiendish gods living inside.","As outsiders stepped in, top cultivators who were covered in evil killing intent began to gather.","“Get away from me! These people are all here to be offered to Lady Sha. If they are stained by your killing intent, I’ll beat you to death!” Lying on the soft bed, cui Jing pretended to be fierce and warned the top cultivators who came forward.","After hearing Cui Jing’s warning, more and more top cultivators gathered and retreated tactfully.","However, there were still some top cultivators who did not want to leave. They rubbed their hands and said, “After you’re done, can you give us some blood and bones?”","Cui Jing hung his head from the soft bed again and said impatiently, “Do you think it’s your turn? All of you, go back to the Blood Sea and cultivate.”","The top cultivators who had surrounded him sighed and then began to disperse. No one actually bumped into Cui Jing.","Obviously, Cui Jing had some influence in the evil city called the Sand Demon Cave.","However, Cheng Qing only sneered in disdain and said, “That piece of trash lying on the soft bed, hurry up and let Master Chen sleep on it for a while. If you neglect us, be careful that we don’t destroy your nest.”","Holding back Cheng Qing’s rudeness, Cui Jing looked at him and said fiercely, “Old man, bark now while you still can. When I pull out your tendons and take out your bones, you’ll die.”","“A bunch of trash, what do I have to fear?” Cheng Qing was disdainful and completely treated Cui Jing’s words as farts.","Cui Jing did not say anything more. He could only avoid this guy who he was helpless against and was like a pain in the ass.","Just like that, the group of five slowly walked forward in the evil city.","When the evil cities that emitted a turbid aura gradually disappeared, a wide black stone road appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","At the end of this black stone avenue, which could accommodate ten galloping horses side by side, was a great hall that bordered the crimson sky.","At the same time, a series of illusory yet real screams sounded.","Jian Wushuang looked forward and saw that the black road under his feet continued to extend forward. The rough sand and stone land had disappeared and what replaced it was a boundless dark red blood sea.","The great hall, which was connected to the sky, was located above the Blood Sea.","At the same time, the soul-stirring howls were all coming from the crimson Blood Sea.","Looking from afar, the black stone path, the giant hall, and the Blood Sea with the wails formed a terrifying purgatory.","However, this was only the tip of the iceberg."]},{"number":4775,"title":"Chapter 4775 Beating Up Cui Jing","paragraphs":["4775 Beating Up Cui Jing","Cui Jing also jumped off the soft bed after stepping into the area of the ancient hall and walked forward with a respectful expression.","Hearing the heart-wrenching screams, Jian Wushuang remained calm, as if he was not affected at all.","As for Cheng Qing and the others, their faces were also indifferent and they did not care.","To be able to reach the Yan Immortal stage, which cultivator had not destroyed a Heavenly Region and living beings for various reasons or starting points?","And the current situation naturally could not affect their state of mind.","The further he went, the more Jian Wushuang realized where the wails and howls were coming from. The Blood Sea under his feet was formed by the condensation and transformation of the ownerless divine souls of countless creatures that had been captured.","They were constantly being refined and could not be freed.","Yan Immortals were disdainful of such evil karma that exceeded killing. Only Yan Immortals who cultivated evil arts would do so.","Jian Wushuang gave the owner of the sand demon cave a bad label in his heart.","Under Cui Jing’s guidance, the dust-covered door of the giant hall slowly opened, and Blood Qi gushed out of the hall.","“Bring them in,” After Cui Jing gave his orders, he was the first to enter the giant hall.","Jian Wushuang and the others were also pushed in by a few followers.","The hall was cold, and the entire floor was made of some kind of almost transparent crystal. One could directly see the deformed ghosts in the Blood Sea.","There were not many auras hidden in the giant hall that was almost completely dark. Only deep within the hall was there a powerful aura.","“Lady Sha, I’ve brought them all,” Cui Jing put away his uncouth appearance and said with some respect.","With a ‘whoosh’ sound, a ghostly flame appeared and lit up the hall.","As the hall was lit up, the big pile of black mountain crystals almost filled the entire back hall.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes locked on to the front immediately.","From there, a tall figure in a large cloak slowly walked down from a cold chair.","Her good figure was faintly discernible, and as she walked, it seemed as if it could be revealed at any time.","At the same time, there were yellow sand particles moving in her hair.","His deep-set facial features were cold as he slowly scanned Jian Wushuang and the others.","Finally, she asked, “These crystals were all left behind by you?”","No one spoke.","As if she had already anticipated this, she opened her palm again to reveal a storage ring that was shimmering with a jet-black luster.","“From what I’ve seen, the crystals in this ring have been piled up to a terrifying extent. Are you sure no one wants to claim them?”","As her voice fell, a calm voice was heard. “That ring is mine.”","When their eyes met, the woman called ‘Lady Sha’ raised her eyebrows and smiled. “What a generous gift. Why don’t you give me these things that are more precious than sky crystals?”","“You wish. Do you know how much the things inside are worth?” Cheng Qing sneered, “I can even buy the ten Heavenly Regions!”","When Lady Sha heard this, she asked again, “You guys are not cultivators from this Heavenly Region?”","“I can give you the items as long as you let the three of us leave,” Jian Wushuang said. “I think the value of these items can be used to exchange for our freedom.”","“I also want the items, but I don’t want to let you go. What should I do?” Lady Sha smiled slyly.","Jian Wushuang remained silent. The palm behind his back was ready to open the Boyang Bottle at any time. “Do you really think you can defeat us?”","“I don’t intend to fight you all. After all, you have brought me such rich resources. Of course, I can let you go, but there’s one condition,” said Lady Sha as she stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Send one person to compete with Cui Jing. If you win, you can leave. If you lose, you will naturally have to suffer the pain of having your soul taken away.”","After she finished speaking, she looked at Cui Jing. “Choose anyone. I only want to win.”","Cui Jing nodded, then turned to look at the five people standing side by side.","Although he could not see through the cultivation realms of these five people, he could be sure that they were all extremely weak at the moment.","Cui Jing first eliminated Chen Qing from his mind. After all, this seemingly troublesome fellow had left a big shadow in his heart.","Then, he eliminated Di Qing, whose eyes were filled with killing intent, and the young guard in turn.","Finally, Cui Jing’s eyes fell on Chun Qiu and Jian Wushuang.","A drop of cold sweat trickled down from Chun Qiu’s sideburns. He was only at Ancestor-level, and after being severely injured, his strength was almost reduced to the lowest. If he was chosen by Cui Jing, there was no possibility of winning.","As for Cui Jing, he did not think too much about it. He pointed at Jian Wushuang and said, “Okay, you’re the one. Come and have a match with me.”","As the saying goes, pick the soft persimmons and pinch them. This was a principle that had never changed since ancient times.","From Cui Jing’s point of view, this guy was some clan’s eldest son, who was obviously pampered since he was young. He must have been piled up with heavenly materials and precious treasures to put on a show. It was simply an easy thing to win against him.","At this moment, Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu both had strange expressions on their faces, as if they had already predicted the outcome.","The rope that bound Jian Wushuang’s body was released, and his movements were no longer restricted.","“Brother Jian, don’t hold back later. It’s best to just kill him,” Cheng Qing said exultantly, as if he could not wait.","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. Since he did not have a suitable weapon, he pulled out the True Sword from Chen Qing’s waist and then floated forward.","Although only less than ten percent of his strength and Yan power had recovered, and his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was severely injured, he could still use the sword skillfully.","In the Divine Power Universe’s Cloud Palace, he had sparred with Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi for more than 100,000 years, which had laid a solid foundation for his Sword Dao.","Even if he used grass and tree branches to make a sword, he could unleash 100 percent of the Sword Dao’s power.","Now, he was standing in the same place like a rock. He slowly adjusted his breathing and began to try to resonate with the True Sword.","Cui Jing, who was standing opposite him, had returned to his carefree self. In his opinion, this competition would end in at most ten breaths.","Slowly focusing his eyes, Jian Wushuang gathered all the Yan power in his meridians and suddenly reached out with the True Sword in his hand.","Cui Jing lowered his eyebrows and smiled. From between his arms, several frightening dragons formed by Yan power began to gather.","The battle started at once.","At this moment, Di Qing was very unhappy, and his pale golden eyes were filled with killing intent.","The feeling of having his fate in the hands of others was what he hated the most.","But now, he was helpless.","Di Qing underestimated Uncle Yu’s strike, which was why he was in such a situation.","He had indeed died once in Uncle Yu’s hands.","However, no one knew that this life was just one of his nine lives.","However, even if he was spared from death, he could not escape punishment. The pain after his rebirth overshadowed everything."]},{"number":4776,"title":"Chapter 4776 Playing Around","paragraphs":["4776 Playing Around","Di Qing did not even have the ability to protect himself. Even if he faced some top cultivators, he had no chance of winning.","Therefore, he hated the feeling of having his fate in the hands of others. If Jian Wushuang was defeated, they would all die with him.","Di Qing’s heart, which was originally calm, was a little nervous.","He could barely use ten percent of Yan power, which was indeed a little troublesome for Jian Wushuang. However, with Sword Intent, it was more than enough to deal with Cui Jing.","A Yan power dragon appeared between Cui Jing’s arms. Then, he pushed his fists forward.","There were a total of four dark yellow dragons, and they were hundreds of feet tall. Their mouths were full of sharp teeth, and if one was bitten by them, one would definitely be severely injured.","Seeing this, Chen Qing and the others, who had been confident of winning, became a little nervous. After all, Jian Wushuang was the most seriously injured and had not recovered at all.","Four dragons with thick Blood Qi seemed to have walked out of the Blood Sea and swept forward.","Jian Wushuang moved. He suddenly took half a step back and stretched his True Sword forward. The tip of the sword let out a clear sound.","At the same time, layers of water ripples surged out from the tip of the sword, blocking the Blood Qi that was surging over.","However, this level of Sword Intent was no longer able to stop Cui Jing’s attack.","A few dark yellow dragons tore the ripples apart and opened their mouths full of strange teeth to bite Jian Wushuang.","However, when Jian Wushuang retreated, he did not stop. Instead, he turned around and ran away with his sword in hand. He did not seem to be prepared for a confrontation.","Seeing this scene, everyone’s brows twitched, and their expressions became strange.","Although it was understandable to avoid the sharp edge, it was too inelegant to turn around and run...","Cui Jing was even more excited when he saw this. His originally cautious and serious gaze also began to become disdainful.","It seemed that he had picked the right person to be a pushover.","A total of four dark yellow dragons could not swallow Jian Wushuang and were destroyed after hitting the ground.","Cui Jing stepped forward, an eight-foot stick condensed from Yan power in his right hand, and he swung it forward.","Jian Wushuang, who was running with his sword in hand, started to circle around the pillars.","“You rat, hurry up and fight your Grandpa Cui!” Cui Jing laughed sinisterly as he smashed a hole in the pillar with his rod.","Jian Wushuang did not care about him and did not seem to have any intention of fighting him.","Just like that, the two of them began to chase each other in the ancient hall.","Chen Qing and the others all broke out in cold sweat, and Di Qing was even more nervous. He did not want to die on the spot after the True Life reincarnation.","However, the young guard looked at Jian Wushuang with hatred, as if he wanted him to be captured and killed on the spot.","“Damn you, I hate that I can’t kill you with my own hands now!” the young guard said in a low voice. “When I recover, it will be the day of your death!”","Sitting back on the throne, Lady Sha looked at the farce-like fight with calm eyes without saying a word.","In her right palm was a scepter that was wrapped in a faint Blood Qi.","At the very top of the scepter was a skull.","The skull was lustrous and was constantly soaked in Blood Qi, as if it could grow flesh and blood at any time and come to life.","For a woman like her who had a great killing tribulation, the Karma she had was quite terrifying. Even ordinary Yan Immortals would not be willing to come into contact with her.","Furthermore, the top cultivators under her command were also extremely depraved. They loved to kill innocent living beings and had long been immersed in Karma and great killing tribulations that could not be erased.","The so-called great killing tribulation was a mysterious cause and effect that no one could detect and was almost impossible to eliminate.","When one was burdened with a great killing tribulation, it meant that a crack would appear in one’s heart. This was fatal to Yan Immortals and could not be touched.","Jian Wushuang had noticed this the moment he stepped into the Sand Demon Cave.","Therefore, he was restraining himself and trying his best not to be contaminated by this Karma.","Cui Jing followed closely behind, eager to win.","From time to time, Jian Wushuang would turn around and exchange a few blows. Then, he would continue to wander around, provoking Cui Jing’s anger bit by bit.","“Rat, when I catch you, I’ll definitely drown you in a sea of blood.” He was furious. Although he had adjusted his Yan power to its peak, it was like hitting cotton, and he had no way to start.","Jian Wushuang did not listen to the noise at all. When Cui Jing ran over with the eight-foot stick in his hand, he suddenly raised his sword and struck backward, directly leaving a long mark on the clothes in front of his chest.","Although Cui Jing was prepared, he did not manage to dodge in time and was almost injured by the True Sword.","He broke out in a cold sweat and became even angrier. He released Yan power and smashed it at Jian Wushuang.","The entire ancient hall trembled, and a huge pillar was shattered by Cui Jing.","Jian Wushuang’s body flashed and he finally attacked him in an extremely subtle way.","The True Sword in his hand hummed and gave off thousands of Sword Intents as it slashed out.","In fact, the fundamental reason why Jian Wushuang had not made a move was to be careful not to be infected with the inexplicable Karma.","Although the great killing tribulation on Cui Jing was much less than the other top cultivators in the Sand Demon Cave, it was still strong.","Once infected by the great killing tribulation, unless there was an unparalleled magical power to resolve it, it would only get worse.","Jian Wushuang was at his weakest at the moment. If he took a wrong step, it would be difficult to turn around.","Now that he had no way to avoid it, he directly attacked.","3,000 Sword Intents swept out and slashed at Cui Jing with great momentum.","Cui Jing saw this and smiled disdainfully. He stretched out his hand and formed a defensive barrier to block it. At the same time, he pressed on Jian Wushuang without losing any momentum.","He stood on the spot, his black robe fluttering without any wind, his expression calm.","Soon, Cui Jing, who was running over, felt a sense of panic for no reason.","He could vaguely sense that something was wrong.","As if to confirm the thoughts in his heart, 3,000 Sword Intents swept out in an instant. They seemed to be vulnerable, but they easily tore through Cui Jing’s Yan power barrier and then slashed down!","He was horrified and protected his head without thinking.","Dust swirled up in the hall, and the top cultivators standing on both sides were all shocked.","This level of Sword Intent was so pure that it did not contain any derivative force, but it had an invulnerable momentum. They felt that no one could resist this sword move.","The Sword Intent surged and completely wrapped around Cui Jing.","At this moment, Di Qing looked at Jian Wushuang with a meaningful look.","Sitting on the throne, Lady Sha also raised her eyebrows and looked at him.","The 3,000 Sword Intents came and left quickly. Everything happened in the blink of an eye.","When the Sword Intent completely dissipated, a ragged figure appeared.","These 3,000 Sword Intents had completely exposed Cui Jing.","He was unscathed, but his clothes were torn to barely cover his body.","This was a great humiliation that he could not bear. It was something that he, the Great Commander of the Sand Demon Cave, could not bear.","In this Sand Demon Cave, reputation was far more important than life. Moreover, he was a Commander who thought he had a reputation."]},{"number":4777,"title":"Chapter 4777 The Bitter Lotus Dao","paragraphs":["4777 The Bitter Lotus Dao","Cui Jing was furious. He growled and flew toward Jian Wushuang again.","This time, he did not dodge and fought with his sword.","Jian Wushuang, who had already mastered his Sword Intent, was confident that as long as Cui Jing did not purposely seek death, he would not be hurt at all.","The more they fought, the more shocked Cui Jing became. Although he was eager to win, he was not a reckless person. How could he not notice that Jian Wushuang, who was fighting with him, did not use Yan power at all? He was only relying on a True Sword to fight back and forth.","What kind of strength did he have to be able to do this?","The True Sword stabbed continuously, forcing Cui Jing to retreat step by step. At the same time, Jian Wushuang suddenly bent over, changed the sword hilt, and suddenly whipped the body of the True Sword on Cui Jing’s body.","There was a sharp pain in his stomach, and then Cui Jing’s whole body flew out and fell heavily on the ground.","All of a sudden, under the transparent material of the ground, thousands of evil spirits broke free from the Blood Sea. They all clung to the transparent stone slab while screaming, as if waiting for food.","Jian Wushuang frowned and took half a step back.","Cui Jing clutched his chest and sat up from the ground. He looked at him with a complicated expression.","He understood that the seemingly evenly matched situation was just an illusion. Jian Wushuang had not even used his full strength from the beginning to the end.","He lost just like that. It was inexplicable, but it also seemed to be destined.","The hall was deathly silent, and at this moment, a change quietly occurred.","With Jian Wushuang as the center, the ground suddenly cracked and the fine cracks directly spread to more than half of the hall.","Then, it collapsed.","The speed of the collapse was so fast that no one could react. Jian Wushuang, Chen Qing, and the others fell into the Blood Sea along with the gravel.","Countless evil spirits cheered, as if they were having a feast, they climbed onto their bodies and dragged them into the Blood Sea.","Looking at the collapsed ground in front of him, Cui Jing subconsciously looked back.","He did not know when, but Lady Sha was already behind him. Holding the skull scepter, she looked at the churning Blood Sea under the pit calmly.","“B-Big Sister, are they okay?” Cui Jing swallowed and said.","She did not say anything. After a moment, she slowly turned around. “Drag them up in the time it takes for half an incense stick to burn and settle them in the walled city.”","Cui Jing nodded. Although he did not know what she was up to, he did as she ordered.","The time for half an incense stick to burn was not long, but it was still quite long considering the situation.","Cui Jing observed the movements in the Blood Sea, in case he needed to pull Jian Wushuang and the others up in an emergency.","At that moment, the boundless Blood Sea churned and the extremely dense blood Qi transformed into ghosts. Like fish snatching food, they suppressed Jian Wushuang and the others who had fallen into the Blood Sea.","The Karma and killing tribulations that he had tried his best to avoid all swarmed towards him.","As far as the eye could see, it was an extremely thick blood-red color. Jian Wushuang and the other four were helpless against it and could only helplessly float in the Blood Sea.","If their strength had not been damaged, these resentful and evil thoughts would not have been able to erode any of them.","But now, even Di Qing was helpless. His True Life had been reincarnated, and his current strength was not even as strong as Chun Qiu.","A giant monster formed by evil thoughts reached out its hand from the depths of the Blood Sea and dragged them to the bottom of the sea bit by bit.","The Blood Sea also gradually calmed down from its initial boiling.","After half an incense’s time, Cui Jing jumped on the sea of blood alone. Looking at the scene in front of him, which was like a deep abyss, he waved his hand.","Instantly, a chasm was formed in the Blood Sea.","The ugly giant monster formed by countless evil thoughts and evil spirits emerged from the natural chasm.","The palm, which was more than 100 feet in size, slowly opened, and the unconscious Jian Wushuang and the others appeared in front of Cui Jing.","“Just where did these guys come from? Although they all look incomparably weak, why do they have such a soul-stirring aura?” Cui Jing frowned. The confrontation with Jian Wushuang not long ago had obviously left a deep impression on him.","“Don’t tell me they’re also cultivators from another Heavenly Region? Or are they like those baldies, visitors from the sky?”","Cui Jing waved his hand and took Jian Wushuang and the others from the giant malicious spirit’s palm. After examining them carefully and finding no useful information, he carried them and left.","The entire boundless Blood Sea returned to its miserable state.","...","Blood red, a blood red that was enough to corrode the heart spread over, soaking everything.","This negative influence, which was filled with evil thoughts, despair, silence, and hatred, would even affect a Yan immortal if he was not careful. From there, he would be affected by the inexplicable Karma, and a great killing tribulation.","Jian Wushuang suddenly sat up from the ground in shock, cold sweat dripping from his temple.","As far as the eye could see, the Blood Sea was no longer there, only a quiet and cold bluestone road.","“Wasn’t I still in the Blood Sea just now? Why am I now... Could it be an illusion?”","After checking the fusion of his Yan power with the outside world, Jian Wushuang was sure that this was not an illusion.","He slowly got up and stood on the bluestone road that could only fit two people walking side by side. He looked around.","The hazy sky was suffused with a kind of hazy green smoke after the rain.","On both sides of the bluestone road, there was a deep water body where lotus buds had just emerged.","Looking into the distance, the hazy distance was connected to the deep water, giving off an indescribable sense of illusion and bitterness.","Jian Wushuang stood in the middle of the bluestone road. In front of him and behind him, there was an unknown leading to an unknown place.","Everything here was silent to the extreme, like a painting, full of unreality.","However, his expression was still calm. After thinking for a moment, he took a step forward and slowly moved forward.","A long wind started to blow, blowing the lotus leaves that covered the deep water on both sides.","At this time of the year, the lotus had not bloomed yet, and the huge lotus bud was almost submerged in the water.","Jian Wushuang walked among them slowly, feeling an indescribable strangeness.","He was certain that this was the strangest place he had ever been to since he started cultivating.","This kind of strangeness was not the kind of horror when facing a life and death situation, not the kind of powerlessness when facing an enemy that he could not contend with, and not the fear of the unknown.","Instead, it was a strange and uncomfortable feeling that was caused by a subtle difference that was different from what he knew.","It was like a nightmare from a long time ago, or a muddled mumble from a serious illness.","This kind of place should not really exist. Or rather, this kind of place was created by one’s mind.","Jian Wushuang remained calm. Although he had already understood a little, he still walked forward slowly like before.","Under this strange and hazy sky, there was only one bluestone road that extended into the distance.","On the deep and cold water, it was extremely desolate and lonely."]},{"number":4778,"title":"Chapter 4778 Contaminated by Karma","paragraphs":["4778 Contaminated by Karma","After a hundred steps, a chuckle that sounded like Yin Ling came from the water around him. It came closer and finally gathered behind Jian Wushuang.","Then, a soft and boneless palm landed on his shoulder.","“Why are you walking so fast? Can’t you wait for me?”","Jian Wushuang did not turn back after hearing that. Instead, he continued to move forward.","“Alright, I won’t play with you anymore. You blockhead, you’re really boring!”","As soon as the bell-like voice fell, a petite figure in green and lotus clothes walked past him with light steps and headed forward.","Jian Wushuang ignored her and continued to walk forward slowly.","“Hey, can’t you just wait for me? Can’t you consider my feelings?”","The petite figure chattered like a bird, as if she was extremely dissatisfied with Jian Wushuang’s behavior.","“Let me tell you, even if you don’t like me, there are still many who like me. Who do you think you are!”","Her petite figure was just short of pouncing on him and roaring like a little beast. Although she was extremely angry, she was helpless.","“I was saved by you, so it’s only right that you take care of me. Who doesn’t do things till the end? As the saying goes, even if you send Buddha to the West, you will still send it to the West. It’s not too much to let you take care of me, right?”","As if she did not see Jian Wushuang’s indifference, she continued to speak tirelessly.","“What a coincidence, so you don’t like to eat meat, and neither do I. What? Are you saying that you don’t like to eat boiled meat, but prefer barbecued meat? Get rid of your carnivorous addiction, you hear me?” The petite figure placed her hands on her hips and pointed at him.","It was only a short journey of 1,000 steps. Jian Wushuang seemed to be unable to bear it and finally looked to his side.","Then, he said calmly, “Your obsession is really persistent. Can you even jabber on and on to a stranger?”","The petite figure seemed to have not heard Jian Wushuang’s words. After throwing a tantrum, she began to talk again.","“It’s so beautiful. Look at this place, isn’t it beautiful? Let’s live here from now on, okay?”","“We’ll build a thatched cottage here. You can focus on your cultivation, and I’ll accompany you every day and plant many, many lotus flowers.”","The petite figure was looking forward to it, so much so that she stopped in her tracks.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang stopped and said calmly, “You’re just an obsession. You can go now. Don’t delay my journey.”","Her eyes suddenly dimmed and then turned red.","The eerily still waters began to churn. Everything seemed to be fading and turning gray.","“Come with me, okay?” She reached out her hand to grab Jian Wushuang, but it was to no avail.","She followed the bluestone road and the deep water surface. Everything was collapsing.","Just as it was about to be destroyed, all the lotuses in the deep water bloomed.","As the full lotus bloomed, there was a palm-sized skull inside each flower.","...","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes in the darkness.","The scene and the unbelievable conversation had all disappeared. In its place was the sound of people sleeping.","Jian Wushuang sat up and then noticed that he was in a spacious pavilion.","At the same time, he raised his arm again. When he saw the weak but solid cobweb-like blood lines on his arm, his mood fell to the bottom of the valley.","This meant that he had already been infected by the resentment, Karma, and the great killing tribulation.","Everything was too inexplicable. He tried his best not to be tainted, but in the end, he still fell into the Blood Sea and was tainted.","This was definitely not a good thing. If he did not handle it well, it would be an irreparable crack in his state of mind or his cultivation.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others were all sleeping beside him. After Jian Wushuang’s investigation, it was obvious that they were more or less affected by the Karma and killing tribulation.","In addition to these two, Di Qing, who was sleeping on the outermost side of the bed, was less contaminated.","At the same time, there was a woman who was curled up and sleeping beside Jian Wushuang.","Wait, a woman? His mind immediately sobered up, and he hurriedly reached out to straighten the sleeping woman curled up beside him.","However, to his disappointment, this woman was not Yin Ling, but a heroic-looking woman he had never seen before.","Although this woman could not be considered beautiful, her heroic face was still very recognizable.","Jian Wushuang looked down. From her broken armor, she looked like the young guard who had held him hostage in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture.","“Could it be that cross-dressing is a trend nowadays?” After confirming again that the heroic-looking woman was the young guard, Jian Wushuang was a little depressed.","As if she felt that she was being watched, the heroic-looking woman slowly opened her eyes.","Their eyes met, and perhaps she saw the strange look in his eyes, the heroic-looking woman subconsciously touched her cheek.","“You don’t have to touch it, I saw it clearly,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“I’ll kill you!” Without any warning, she rose up and raised her hand to look at his neck.","Jian Wushuang would not let her do as she wished. He raised his hand to resist and completely subdued her with a few moves.","As Yan power in her body had not recovered, she was fighting with her physical strength. Naturally, Jian Wushuang could easily subdue her.","“Although I don’t know what’s the relationship between us, you have to be clear that the person who destroyed them wasn’t me,” Jian Wushuang released her and said in a deep voice.","The heroic-looking woman did not attack again. After looking at him deeply, she got up and walked out of the room.","Lying back on the bed, Jian Wushuang began to recall the strange dream-like place in his dream and Yin Ling that had disappeared after falling into this Heavenly Region.","The Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in Yin Ling’s hand was their only goal in this operation. If she disappeared, everything would be meaningless.","Just as he was recalling everything that had happened, a desolate horn suddenly rang out from outside the pavilion.","Jian Wushuang got off the bed, opened the window, and checked the situation outside.","Almost at the same time, in a big city in the Sand Demon Cave, with a loud noise, Cui Jing, who was half-naked, flew out and stood in the air.","“Damn it, it must be that bunch of big bald donkeys who haven’t given up their evil intentions!”","Cui Jing said hatefully. He tightened his belt and led more than 100 top cultivators to the top of the city in Sand Demon Cave.","Soon after Cui Jing’s departure, countless top cultivators began to walk out of every corner of the Sand Demon Cave like ants. Then, they all gathered forward, covering the sky and the sun."]},{"number":4779,"title":"Chapter 4779 Suppressing the City","paragraphs":["4779 Suppressing the City","All the top cultivators in any of the villages in the entire territory of the Sand Demon Cave had come out.","“What’s going on? Are they going to fight someone?” Chen Qing opened his sleepy eyes and came behind Jian Wushuang.","A thick bloody aura accompanied the raging sand, blocking almost everything.","He nodded and said, “It looks like there will be a big chaotic battle later.”","Cheng Qing immediately perked up. “Then, we can escape in the chaos!”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything else. If it was before, the chaos that was about to happen would be the best time to escape. However, the situation was different now.","They were all affected by the inexplicable cause and effect. If they left now, their future cultivation journey would inevitably be hindered at some key points, and they might even be stopped.","No one wanted to plant such a fatal seed in their future cultivation.","However, Jian Wushuang was at his wit’s end as to how to resolve the Karma and the great killing tribulation.","He did not know how to resolve it. If he left resolutely, he might never find a way to resolve it.","He immediately explained everything to Cheng Qing.","When Cheng Qing heard this, he hurriedly lifted his sleeve. When he saw the faint, fine, net-like blood lines in the meridians of his arm, he could not help but swallow.","“What kind of luck is this? Could it be that I fell into the Blood Sea once and was contaminated by Karma...”","“That’s why we can’t leave now. If we do, it’ll be even more difficult in the future,” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. “Now, I have to find a solution.”","Cheng Qing’s eyes flashed with ruthlessness. He raised his left hand and made a cutting gesture on his right palm. “Kill the leader of this devil’s den, or kill all of these scumbags. Is that the final solution?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “We can’t rule out that possibility. But what we need to do now is not to act rashly. We need to recover our strength first.”","“Then what’s our next step?”","“Let’s follow them and find out what’s going on,”","Chen Qing nodded, then turned around and picked up the still unconscious Chun Qiu. The three of them then left quietly.","As they left, Di Qing, who had been in a coma, suddenly opened his eyes.","“Contaminated by Karma? This is interesting. I’ve destroyed so many Heavenly Regions and slaughtered countless creatures. What can this Karma do to me?”","Di Qing sneered and got off the bed. After checking that his strength was recovering steadily, he was in a good mood.","He looked at the place where Jian Wushuang and the others had disappeared. After thinking for a while, he also chased after them.","At this moment, the heroic-looking woman sitting at the top of the pavilion watched the few figures leave. She pursed her lips and followed after them a moment later.","Mixed with the Blood Qi of the wild sand, the group of three led by Jian Wushuang and more than a thousand top cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave rushed to the city gate.","“Brother Jian, don’t you feel that these guys look very hungry?” Chun Qiu stood close to Jian Wushuang and said nervously as he looked at the top cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave who were approaching him.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He lifted the True Sword from Chen Qing’s waist and released a majestic Sword Intent to force the top cultivators away.","But then, more top cultivators squeezed over, as if they could not control themselves and wanted to swallow the three of them alive.","Cheng Qing’s eyes were cold and he was ready to attack.","These top cultivators, who were not even worthy of carrying his shoes before, were now overbearing to him. How could he not be angry?","However, after the battle that destroyed the celestial continent, the three of them were almost killed, and their strength dropped to the freezing point. They could not recover in a short time.","In the face of these brutal top cultivators, he naturally could not make a move.","Just as the situation was about to go out of control, a deep and ancient cry suddenly rang out.","Then, a black crow celestial image that covered the sky descended and stopped above Jian Wushuang and the others.","The terrifying aura that was beyond imagination spread out. All the top cultivators in the Sand Demon Cave were frightened and retreated, not daring to come forward.","Jian Wushuang looked up and saw Di Qing’s figure.","He glanced down and continued to move forward while hovering above the three of them.","With the presence of such an aura, the thousand or so top cultivators did not dare to stay any longer and quickly left.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, not knowing what Di Qing was planning. Would he be so kind as to protect the three of them?","At this moment, Di Qing heaved a sigh of relief. Although he could summon the black crow celestial image, it was only an empty shell of Yan power, and he could not even exert 10 percent of his strength.","However, he had taken advantage of the terrifying realm suppression of the Grand Yan Immortal on these ants, so he dared to release such a powerful force. Fortunately, he had succeeded.","The reason why he did not leave was that he could temporarily rely on Jian Wushuang to avoid being hurt as much as possible.","After all, the Sword Intent that Jian Wushuang had displayed in the ancient hall was enough to deal with most top cultivators.","At this moment, on the city wall of the Sand Demon Cave, where blood was everywhere, Cui Jing was half-naked, and his belt was loose. He had a fearless and rugged look.","He held a dead branch in his mouth and held the eight-foot stick in his right hand. His eyes were full of disdain.","In front of the city wall of the Sand Demon Cave, as the wind and sand receded, rows of soldiers formed by strict troops appeared in front of everyone’s eyes.","At the forefront of the army stood ten monks in ivory robes, each holding a staff.","Their bodies were covered in a thick layer of light, making them look mysterious and divine.","The gloomy atmosphere in the Sand Demon Cave was dispelled inch by inch under the light of the monks.","“With the help of an Immortal master, the evil place like the Sand Demon Cave will definitely be eradicated.”","Similarly, at the forefront of this army, an Ancestor realm top cultivator with a True Sword on his back and a sage-like demeanor saluted with one hand and said respectfully, “Immortal master is kind-hearted.”","“We have a total of 87 sects and a total of 16,000 disciples. Today, we will be at your disposal.”","The ten monks nodded in unison.","The leader of the group was a scrawny monk who was half-naked and had a string of ring beads around his neck. He had a full beard on his face. He turned his shriveled eyes and looked in the direction of the Sand Demon Cave without saying a word.","“Senior Brother Konglun, when can we start exterminating them again?” a monk with a solemn expression and an air of authority stepped forward and asked in a deep voice.","The skinny monk who was addressed as Senior Brother Konglun shook his head slowly. “There’s no rush. The purpose of our trip is not to eliminate them, but to set a rule.”","“For scumbags like them, any rules are bullsh*t. The only way is to send them all to Elysian!”"]},{"number":4780,"title":"Chapter 4780 Formless Great Power","paragraphs":["4780 Formless Great Power","The solemn-looking monk tried his best to suppress the curses that escaped his mouth. His eyes were as big as copper bells, as if he wanted to skin those guys in the Sand Demon Cave alive.","“Don’t talk nonsense,” Monk Konglun frowned. For a moment, the front of the army was silent.","At this time, a disdainful voice came from the top of the city wall of the Sand Demon Cave.","“Hey... Why are those bald donkeys hiding their heads and showing their tails looking for trouble with your grandpas? Do you want me to help you loosen your bones?”","When the solemn-looking monk heard this, he immediately said, “How dare you! Senior Brother, I’m going to teach that bastard a lesson right now!”","Monk Konglun said, “Jian Qing, don’t be reckless.”","At this moment, the sage-like old man with a sword on his back stepped forward and said, “Immortal Master, let us follow Immortal Master Jian Qing. Destroying the Sand Demon Cave is also a blessing for the billions of living beings.”","When Monk Konglun heard this, he did not say anything.","Another clean-faced monk came forward to pay his respects. “Senior Brother, the rules are no longer of any significance to them. The Blood Qi here is ten times denser than the last time we came here. It’s obvious that they’ve massacred countless lives again.”","“If we don’t punish him, this entire Heavenly Region will be in a bloody mess.”","...","“What are those old bald donkeys talking about? Why aren’t they attacking yet?” an ugly and ferocious top cultivator on the wall of the Sand Demon Cave said impatiently.","Cui Jing glared at him and then said in a deep voice, “All of you, be quiet and be on guard!”","“This time, whoever cuts off a bald donkey’s head will be rewarded with a pool of blood!”","As soon as these words were spoken, the people on the city wall became restless again. All the top cultivators’ eyes brightened, and they were already somewhat impatient.","“What’s going on? It looks like they’re really going to fight.” Several figures quietly squeezed onto the city wall.","Cheng Qing placed his hand on his forehead, his eyes wide as he looked at the distant army.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He looked through the light red mist and saw the monks standing in front of the army.","There were two sides to everything, life and death, and space and time.","The resentment of the creatures in the Sand Demon Cave and the Blood Qi were so thick that they could not be dispelled. Therefore, there would definitely be a side that was opposing it.","Could these monks represent the extreme of the other side?","Perhaps, this was the opportunity to untie the inexplicable Karma on them.","A light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. He was waiting and taking advantage of the situation to move.","In the Sand Demon Cave, the evil top cultivators flew up as if they could not suppress the riot. They rushed out of the city and tore the assembled army to pieces.","Cui Jing was getting impatient. He kept hitting the ground with his eight-foot long rod.","At this moment, the few monks who were standing in front of the black mass of troops suddenly stepped on the air and arrived.","“With kindness, Cui Jing, please listen to this old man’s advice.” Monk Jian Qing, who had a solemn face, suppressed the discomfort in his heart and spoke in a clear voice against his will.","Cui Jing, who was far away on the city wall, heard this and smiled.","“Kindness your mother! Brothers, charge forward and tear them to pieces!”","After receiving the order, a wave of bloodthirsty excitement rushed into the sky.","“No way! They fought in such a hurry?!” Jian Wushuang and the others could not believe it.","Cui Jing was a mad dog...","The black mass of top cultivators that covered the sky seemed to have broken free of their restraints and rushed out of the Sand Demon Cave City like blood-drinking wolves.","Like a black sky river that was flowing backwards, the monks who were here to give a useless lecture all put on a serious face and put their palms together.","A myriad of precious lights shone down, dispelling the corrosive Blood Qi.","As for monk Jian Qing, he was almost filled with blood. That nonsensical phrase ‘kindness your mother’ almost instantly ignited his fiery temper.","“What an evil beast! I’ll definitely destroy your body and soul today!” Jian Qing stepped on the flowing cloud and flew up, his white robe fluttering in the strong wind.","“Junior Brothers, help me!”","A total of four rays of light gushed out from the palms of the four monks behind Jian Qing, blending into a rainbow bridge, and flew out.","With a stern expression, Jian Qing’s image form put its palms together, faced the black sky river, and began to chant a spell!","“Infinite Ten Thousand Forms, Formless Great Power!”","On a huge rainbow bridge, the heavens and earth trembled, and an impressive white dragon with four horns appeared.","Under the white dragon, Jian Qing was like an Arhat with angry eyes, and he threw out a spell.","Heaven and earth trembled. The white dragon opened its mouth and faced the tens of thousands of top cultivators with the power of heaven and earth.","The two collided, and an unparalleled light erupted.","At this moment, the earth was torn apart, and the sand fell into the earth’s core.","The black sky river was broken by the white dragon.","Countless ferocious top cultivators fell from the sky, all of them seriously injured.","At the same time, the image form of the white dragon was also shattered. Monk Jian Qing, who was ashen-faced, was not afraid at all. Holding a black metal Buddhist staff, he rushed into the camp of the Sand Demon Cave and started to destroy them.","The army of 87 sects could not hold back anymore.","The sage-like old man suddenly pulled out his True Sword and pointed it at the sky. “Destroy the Sand Demon Cave and open up the great path of cultivation for our Juniors!”","His voice reverberated in the sky. At this moment, 87 sects and 16,000 top cultivators were engaged in a bloody battle against the Sand Demon Cave!","Black and white collided, and a tragic battle broke out.","The wind wailed as the top cultivators continued to die and fall.","They were the most talented geniuses in each sect in this vast Heavenly Region, and they had the brightest cultivation path.","However, in the battle with the Sand Demon Cave, they were continuously destroyed and died.","In the territory of the Sand Demon Cave, the gathered top cultivators’ abilities were more or less affected.","The number of casualties was rapidly rising. Countless geniuses died, and the broken corpses of divine bodies fell to the ground like rain.","On the city wall, Jian Wushuang’s face grew grave.","When the chaotic battle broke out, the monks had already blocked the front line and were fighting with the top cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave.","There was no way for Jian Wushuang to get close to them.","Even if his strength was restored to its peak, he would still be seriously injured if he was not careful in this chaotic battle, not to mention that he could not control Yan power freely now.","“Is there no other way?” Jian Wushuang was silent. At the same time, he was thinking quickly about how to get close.","These monks are not inferior in strength, they were all in the Yan Immortal cultivation realm. Naturally, they were not at a disadvantage in this chaotic battle. Ordinary top cultivators could not get close to them.","Under their leadership, although the assembled sects suffered heavy injuries, they were still pushing forward, slowly pushing towards the city wall."]},{"number":4781,"title":"Chapter 4781 A Myriad of Changes in an Instant","paragraphs":["4781 A Myriad of Changes in an Instant","Monk Jiang Qing, who had used the power of non-phase to severely injure hundreds of top cultivators, didn’t seem like a monk at all. His fiery temper was not weaker than those irritable top cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave.","As he waved the Buddhist staff in his hand, each strike would severely injure several top cultivators.","“Senior Brother, you can’t kill too many people.” The clean-faced monk waved his palm and defeated several top cultivators who were rushing forward. He looked at Jiang Qing and anxiously reminded him.","“Don’t you worry about it. I’m not afraid of this kind of killing Karma. As long as these evil beasts are not exterminated, I will not be at ease!” Jiang Qing said in a deep voice, waving the scepter in his hand even more vigorously.","The clean-faced monk shook his head helplessly. This Senior Brother of his even dared to disobey Eldest Senior Brother’s words, so how could he listen to him?","The battle was in a state of white heat.","The lives of the Ancestor-level cultivators became the most worthless existences. Countless broken treasures and True Swords fell into the cracked ground with their Masters.","This place had become their common burial ground.","A brutal war always resonated. Even though he was a Yan Immortal, in the face of nearly 20 to 30 thousand top cultivators, he could not do much.","Cui Jing’s blood boiled as he saw this. He reached out to tighten his belt, then flew forward with his eight-foot rod.","Cui Jing, who was only an Ancestor-level cultivator, was able to fight with ordinary Yan Xian with the support of the Blood Qi in the Sand Demon Cave.","“Don’t you think that guy’s brain doesn’t work well? He’s so silly,” Chen Qing commented as he looked at Cui Jing’s back.","Chun Qiu touched his chin and said, “He doesn’t look very smart. He’s probably used to running amuck in this evil land and needs to be beaten up.”","Jian Wushuang remained silent and observed the situation quietly.","At the same time, he had a premonition that even though the top cultivators in the Sand Demon Cave looked extremely ferocious, they would definitely not be able to defend the Sand Demon Cave. It was only a matter of time before the city was destroyed.","At that time, he might be able to find an opportunity to get close to those monks.","Although the Karma and the great killing tribulation that he carried on his back seemed fine and might never be triggered, they were like backstabs that Jian Wushuang would definitely try his best to pull out.","If these monks could not do anything about it, he could only wait until he recovered his strength and then work with Di Qing to wipe out the entire Heavenly Region.","Jian Wushuang had never been an overly kind person. From his humble beginning to his Ascension to the level of Cosmos God and then to the Great Yan Domain, he had always been using principles as a standard.","There was a Heavenly Region that harmed him, and this was the cause. Since there was a cause, there would be an end. It was not impossible for them to be destroyed.","Monk Jiang Qing cast a series of hand seals, forcing back the top cultivators that kept appearing in front of him.","The ten monks who were all Yan Immortals were already showing signs of influencing the battle.","However, one of the ten monks did not make a move. To be more precise, he did not participate in the battle.","He was like an ascetic monk who had experienced the vicissitudes of life. He slowly walked forward as if he was aloof from the world.","Occasionally, there would be top cultivators who tried to attack him, but they would be forced back by the clear light that enveloped his body.","The 10 Yan Immortal monks would definitely be able to crush the Sand Demon Cave, which had almost no Yan Immortals.","The originally arrogant and crazy top cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave were retreating step by step. Their numbers had been reduced by more than half from the initial 20,000.","If it was not for the Killing Intent Domain, the casualties would have been even more serious.","Jiang Qing was like a raging bull. As soon as Cui Jing joined the battle, he locked onto him and started to fight with his black iron staff.","In just ten breaths of time, Cui Jing was on the losing end. He groaned in his heart, and the web between his thumb and index finger, which was holding the eight-foot stick, was a little cracked.","“What an evil creature, Grandpa will send you to your death today!”","With a deep shout, Jiang Qing changed his position and carried the black iron staff on his shoulder. Then, he struck Cui Jing’s stomach with a meteor strike.","At this moment, he only felt his vision go dark. The eight-foot staff bent to a strange degree, and his whole body was like a cannonball that was shot out of the chamber, flying back heavily.","Boom boom boom!","Jian Wushuang felt the city wall under him shake suddenly, and then there was a slight collapse sound.","Cui Jing’s entire body was completely embedded several meters deep into the city wall, almost blasting a big hole in the city wall.","“Ah... Bald donkey, I’m not done with you.” Cui Jing pulled himself out of the hole in the wall with great difficulty, his bones all broken.","Just as the top cultivators of the sect led by Jiang Qing were unstoppable, a unique aura descended on the battlefield.","The sandstorm raged and the sky was in chaos.","From the broken ground, a giant sand statue that was 10,000 feet tall quietly rose.","Then, facing the army of top cultivators led by Jiang Qing, two huge palms came down fiercely.","Jiang Qing suddenly raised his head. He was shocked and raised his staff to block the attack.","However, the force was beyond his imagination, and it directly sent over a hundred top cultivators, including him, flying.","For a time, the disadvantageous situation was contained.","Jiang Qing, who had been sent flying backward for a few thousand feet, stopped in the air, and a stream of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth.","The aura was so powerful that it was strenuous for him to resist it with all his might.","At this moment, all the top cultivators’ eyes were focused on the giant sand statue.","Every top cultivator in the Sand Demon Cave had a fanatical expression in their eyes.","On the forehead of the wild sand colossus sat a tall woman with a beautiful figure that was faintly visible under the cloak.","Her expression was cold. With a wave of her hand, she controlled the wild sand colossus beneath her to kill more than ten top cultivators.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching this scene from afar, could not help but narrow his eyes.","This Lady Sha, who had also not transcended the Yan Immortal realm, was displaying her power at this moment, giving him a sense of transcendence.","If the previous Lady Sha was at most at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage like Chen Qing, then the current her seemed to have taken that step.","However, the next scene was even more shocking.","The wild sand giant waved its huge palm and suppressed all its enemies. However, the next moment, a 10,000-foot-wide wheel of light that could not be ignored appeared.","A pair of skinny hands that were emitting millions of rays of light pressed down on the palms of the wild sand colossus.","The two collided, and endless sand and dust fell.","On the emaciated palm that was put together, every fine crack was easily visible, and it exuded a terrifying aura.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly. Such a grand move was released by the old monk with a beard who had not made a move since the beginning of the chaotic battle.","The black ring bead on his neck started to emit a strange light."]},{"number":4782,"title":"Chapter 4782 Bitter Words","paragraphs":["4782 Bitter Words","His bare upper body was surging with unimaginably pure Yan power under his tough and withered skin.","A total of 14 Black and lustrous ring beads exuded a clear brilliance that blocked all resentment, evil thoughts, and monstrous Blood Qi.","Above Monk Konglun’s head, a pair of heaven-covering palms appeared from a mysterious light wheel. After blocking the wild sand colossus’s attack, they retreated.","At this moment, the originally earth-shaking battlefield fell into a brief silence.","Time seemed to have stopped.","Monk Konglun made his move, and his first move was against Lady Sha, who was controlling the wild sand giant.","Jian Qing and the others retreated and quickly arrived in front of him.","“Senior Brother, you’re finally willing to help,” Jian Qing panted heavily. Apparently, he had been severely injured by the attack just now.","Konglun retracted his hand and looked forward with his clear and emotionless eyes.","Sitting on the wild sand colossus, Lady Sha was also looking at him with a sneer on her lips.","The next moment, she raised her arm and pointed forward.","The sky suddenly cracked and collapsed, and the Blood Qi that was so solid that it seemed to have substance turned into a terrible vortex, spinning.","At the same time, an ugly face formed by countless vengeful souls and Blood Qi emerged from the vortex and gnawed at Konglun and the others.","A terrifying aura covered over a hundred miles.","All the top cultivators of the sects who were fighting with their swords were shocked when they saw this scene.","“Senior Brother.” Jian Qing and the others all looked at the empty wheel.","Konglun grunted in reply. The light on his body brightened as he plucked a bead from the string of beads on his neck and threw it into the air.","Instantly, the ring bead expanded ten thousand feet in the wind, and the bead burst out with thousands of rays of light. There were complex and obscure ciphertexts surging on the bead.","The two collided, and the ugly face that covered thousands of miles screamed and began to shatter.","Countless resentful souls were torn apart and fleeing in an attempt to escape from the Buddhist light. However, they were all being absorbed.","The Blood Qi was decreasing at a speed visible to the naked eye, and finally, it was all absorbed into the ring bead.","The battle between heaven and earth once again erupted.","“This woman is really something. I’m afraid her strength is not below mine.”","On the city wall, Cheng Qing nodded his head in confirmation, “If it wasn’t for the fact that I haven’t recovered my strength, I would have charged up and killed a few times.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. In their current situation, it would be extremely dangerous for them to enter the chaotic battle rashly.","Whether it was Lady Sha or the ten monks, they could easily deal them a heavy blow.","If it was not to investigate the situation, he would not even have taken the risk to stay.","They could only wait and see.","Di Qing and the heroic-looking woman who was disguised as a young guard had also arrived on the city wall. They were watching the battle with their arms crossed.","At this moment, there were only five of them on the city wall. Although each of them looked extremely weak, they were not afraid of a battle between nearly 30,000 top cultivators. They even seemed to be watching.","However, each of these five people had enough strength to shake the heavens and earth, stirring up the winds and clouds of high heavens.","In fact, every superior not only broadened their own strength, but also their horizons, so they showed no fear.","During this time, Jian Wushuang had made up his mind. Regardless of the final outcome of the battle, he had to meet the monk who could fight on par with Lady Sha.","This was because he could see the mutual augmentation and restraint of each other.","...","After storing the vengeful spirits within a radius of over a thousand miles into the ring bead, Konglun raised his hand to recall them before connecting them back to its neck.","After sending several top cultivators flying with one strike, cui Jing rushed to the side of Lady Sha in an instant.","“Big Sister, do you want to kill this group of bald donkeys?!” Cui Jing said ruthlessly. He was covered in blood from the attack of the Supreme Treasure, but he did not care at all, like a demon god rushing out of a sea of blood.","With a wave of her flag, the giant sand statue beneath her crushed forward.","She said, “Expel them all. If they resist, capture them alive and imprison them in the Blood Sea.”","After saying this, her figure rushed out directly, bringing with it great momentum and countless blood rain.","In the Sand Demon Cave’s heaven and earth Domain, she was the supreme existence. Even though she was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal realm, it was enough to make all the sects in the entire Heavenly Region tremble.","The rain of blood that fell from her body caused the top cultivators of the sect to feel an unbearable burning pain. It was as if their souls were burning.","Naturally, their overflowing Yan power was also withering rapidly.","The evil cultivators in the sand demon cave were not affected at all. They formed groups of three to five and tore everything in front of them apart.","Looking at this scene, a look of pity appeared in Konglun’s eyes.","The nine monks around him, led by Jian Qing, began to chant the scriptures.","There was a clear aura that formed a rainbow shadow lotus bridge. It was set up from the heavens and earth and directly dispersed the blood rain.","The dense Blood Qi dispersed spontaneously when it faced the rainbow shadow lotus bridge formed by the scriptures, and the world became clear again.","The top cultivators of the sects who were struggling to resist felt that all the negative effects were expelled, and even the Yan power in their bodies was constantly recovering.","For a time, the battle started again.","Looking at the figure dashing towards him, Monk Konglun no longer stopped. His bare feet stepped onto the rainbow shadow lotus bridge, and the Zen robe tied around his waist fluttered in the wind.","“You shouldn’t have set foot here again. Have you forgotten what I said to you when I let you go?”","A pair of tall figures also stood on the rainbow shadow lotus bridge, and a dark red Blood Qi spread out, gradually dyeing the flowing scriptures blood red.","Monk Konglun stopped in his tracks and saluted with a single hand. “I have naturally not forgotten your warning back then, but I have still come. My goal this time is still to persuade you to turn back and not commit murder again.”","“Do you know the last warning that year?” Lady Sha frowned slightly and a blood blade had already formed in her palm.","“I’ve never forgotten,” Monk Konglun said, “if I set foot in the Sand Demon Cave again, my Buddha body will suffer 1,000 cramps and my Buddha heart will suffer the pain of being eaten by 10,000 insects.”","Her voice was cold. “Then why did you dare to come again?”","“That’s because I just want to try. Even if there’s only a tiny possibility, I won’t hesitate to do so.” The spatial wheel moved forward, and Scriptures began to flow between its brows.","“If I win, you only need to listen to my ten-day seat debate.”","“If I lose, I’ll forever fall into the extreme darkness and live on flesh and blood.”","“In addition, with the slanderous words, you will die when you see light, rot when you see wind, be injured when you see the ground, and suffer the pain of knives and axes when you see all living things.”","Konglun swore four bitter words to himself, swearing on the Great Dao of heaven and earth that he would never turn back.","“Is it possible to be a good man?” He lowered his head, his clear eyes filled with a warm smile.","Konglun’s bitter words were an oath to the Great Dao, and his voice resounded throughout the entire sky."]},{"number":4783,"title":"Chapter 4783 Power Struggle","paragraphs":["4783 Power Struggle","At this moment, all the top cultivators of the sects and the nine monks raised their heads to look at the scene above the rainbow shadow lotus peak.","Jian Wushuang and the others naturally heard Konglun’s oath and their gazes were filled with different emotions.","There was respect in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, confusion in Chen Qing’s, suspicion in Chun Qiu’s, and a sneer in Di Qing’s.","As for the heroic-looking woman, she was also very respectful.","In order to vindicate Dao, he did not hesitate to make such an oath. It was extremely bitter.","“Senior Brother, you’re so slow.”","Jian Qing’s eyes were filled with sorrow, but he didn’t say anything. His figure seemed to age in an instant.","“Kindness,” The nine monks lowered their eyelids and put their palms together, strengthening the rainbow shadow lotus peak and not letting the Blood Qi stain it.","There was still no change in the expression on Lady Sha’s face, and she did not care about Konglun’s bitter words.","Finally, she said, “Okay, I’ll agree.”","Konglun nodded, his steps slow and his back firm.","The blood blade in her hand suddenly became extremely long and narrow in the wind, almost as tall as her body.","Konglun’s hands were empty, but he used them to lift up the light breeze as he smiled at her.","The two of them stopped talking. Holding the long and narrow blood blade, Lady Sha took a step forward and chopped down at Monk Konglun.","The spatial wheel was like a mountain and did not move. However, the clear Buddhist light that was emitted from his body directly pushed her away.","The blood blade left a deep ravine on the rainbow bridge before barely stopping her figure.","Konglun’s eyes were clear and ethereal. With every step he took, the Buddhist light behind him grew stronger.","At the same time, thick arms grew out from his back.","“Unable and formless, heaven and earth are empty, all Daos are reincarnation, and then the afterlife, suffering...”","A series of Scriptures were recited from Konglun’s mouth and combined into a great force that fell onto his body.","Although his body was skinny, it was as tough as an old tree. The surging Yan power in his meridians began to light up.","At the same time, the countless arms behind his back formed a lotus shape, exuding endless pressure.","As Konglun chanted the sutras, the arms behind his back stretched out in unison, and together, they formed a hazy image form.","The wind was like a helping hand, allowing the wheel to fly straight into the clouds.","Then, the blurry image form suddenly opened its eyes and shot out a brilliant golden light.","Heaven and earth were at their peak.","At this moment, the tens of thousands of top cultivators in the Sand Demon Cave could not even open their eyes.","Lady Sha’s eyes were cold. She did not dodge the golden light that was sweeping toward her. Instead, she shook her arms and created thousands of Blood Qi phantoms.","Each of the phantoms had the power of her full-strength attack. Then, like a swarm of locusts, they swarmed toward the Konglun.","Buzz...","Ripples spread out, and the thousands of Blood Qi phantoms were like moths flying into the fire, quickly destroyed by the brilliant golden light.","This also gave her an opportunity. Like a ghost, she quietly turned into a cloud of blood mist and scattered.","“Konglun, this time, I’ll definitely take your life!”","Lady Sha’s cold voice resounded in the sky.","In the next moment, her figure quietly condensed above the hazy image.","An eight-foot long blood blade was held in her hands, and then she fiercely hacked it into the top of the hazy image form.","Blood Qi filled the sky, and two streams of blood tears flowed out of the eyes of the precious image. Then, it was destroyed.","The heavens and earth trembled as Konglun took a step back, but his eyes remained calm.","After Lady Sha shattered the blurry image form, she did not stop. Instead, she held the bloody blade and engaged in close combat with the void wheel, which exploded with waves of terrifying Yan power fluctuations.","The rainbow shadow lotus bridge cracked and showed signs of breaking.","“Junior Brothers, no one can slack off. Once Senior Brother Konglun is defeated, he will fall into the darkness forever and be beyond redemption.” Jian Qing’s face was solemn as he tried his best to repair the rainbow shadow lotus peak above his head.","The other eight monks also had serious expressions on their faces. They naturally knew how terrifying Senior Brother Konglun’s words were.","Ever since Konglun’s intelligence was formed, he had been cultivating and had an unimaginable understanding of Buddhism.","Furthermore, his path of cultivation was extremely difficult, unlike others.","He had never sat under the Bodhi tree to cultivate for a day. Instead, he measured the earth with his feet and traveled through the mountains, rivers, and seas for asceticism.","If the words of such a determined person came true, it would definitely be a tragedy.","Therefore, he could not lose this battle!","Above the rainbow shadow lotus peak, the terrifying Yan power tore the sky apart.","Konglun carried the invisible Vajra arm on his back as he fought with Lady Sha.","For a moment, no one could do anything to the other.","However, the spatial wheel seemed to be suppressing him.","“Brother Jian, Brother Chun Qiu, who do you think will win?” Cheng Qing asked.","Chun Qiu observed the battle closely and said, “I think that monk will win. His aura is very strong, like a high mountain.”","Cheng Qing nodded. “I also think that the monk will win. He probably still has some moves that he hasn’t used. Look at that saber-wielding woman. She’s already at her limit. If they continue fighting, there won’t be any suspense.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak, but he frowned unconsciously.","His opinion was the complete opposite of the other two.","Somehow, he thought that Lady Sha would win, but he could not tell why.","At this moment, Di Qing, who had been silent all this time, suddenly said, “The monk will definitely lose.”","Jian Wushuang was moved. He looked at Di Qing and found that they had the same idea.","Cheng Qing pouted, then focused his attention on the front.","However, Jian Wushuang was a little worried. If the result was true, it would mean that the monk had died.","This was definitely not a good outcome. To them, who had already been affected by Karma and bore the burden of a great killing tribulation, this was even more of a bad outcome.","Jian Wushuang had thought of changing the outcome, but he could not even protect himself now. He had only recovered 20 percent of his strength, so the impact was minimal.","“I hope I’m wrong,” he muttered to himself while paying attention to the final result.","In the sky, the battle was in a state of white heat.","The void wheel transformed its body into 18 image forms and attacked Lady Sha together.","She was not weak either. An eight-foot-long blood blade was constantly harvesting Yan power force.","Cui Jing, who was in the middle of the top cultivators’ battle, had been paying attention to the battle situation in the sky. He was extremely anxious.","After that, he turned his gaze to the monks who had released Yan power together to build the rainbow shadow lotus peak.","With a quick thought, Cui Jing raised his staff and led nearly 1,000 top cultivators to kill!","Monk Jian Qing, who was the leader, saw it clearly and knew the purpose of Cui Jing’s rush to them. He was furious.","“Evil creature, I’ll definitely destroy you today!”","“You can’t, Senior Brother Jian Qing,” the clean-faced monk said anxiously. “If we get distracted and the Yan power disperses, Senior Brother Konglun will definitely be at a disadvantage.”","“Then what should we do? Are we going to wait for death?” Jian Qing shouted in a deep voice."]},{"number":4784,"title":"Chapter 4784 Inner Demon","paragraphs":["4784 Inner Demon","The few monks fell silent.","A moment later, the clean-faced monk raised his head again and looked at the battle in the sky. He said in a low voice, “There’s only one way to do it now.”","“Hurry up and tell me,” Jian Qing said anxiously.","“We’ll help with our bodies. The nine of us will follow Senior Brother Konglun and defeat that Female Demon together!” the clean-faced monk said in a deep voice.","Even Jian Qing fell silent.","Even if they were unable to kill the Female Demon from the Sand Demon Cave, they would definitely be able to save Konglun.","As for the four bitter words he had set up on the empty wheel, they were also invalid.","A moment later, Jian Qing gritted his teeth. “Fellow Junior Brothers, follow me and assist Senior Brother Konglun!”","Nine figures, nine Yan Immortals, flew into the sky at this moment.","When Cui Jing saw this scene, he immediately rushed into the sky.","A total of nine streaks of immense Yan power burst forth from the back of the Konglun and shot forward.","Lady Sha, who was slashing wildly with her bloody blade, sensed that something was wrong. By the time she reacted, the nine rays of Yan power had already shot toward her like an arrow.","Boom!!!","The horrifying bones exploded and completely engulfed the body of Lady Sha.","“Old bald donkeys, you’re extremely shameless!” Cui Jing was furious. He raised the eight-foot staff in his hand and smashed it forward without any care.","Jian Qing snorted coldly and was about to smash it with his palm.","At this moment, an iron-like hand grabbed Jian Qing’s arm and stopped him.","Then, Cui Jing’s full-strength rod hit the left shoulder blade of the Konglun heavily.","Under the Blood Qi Domain, the mighty Yan power was almost enough to fight with Yan Immortals. It caved in a part of Konglun’s shoulder.","“Senior Brother!” Jian Qing cried out.","“All of you, back down,” Konglun said calmly, his words unquestionable.","Though Jian Qing was impatient, he was afraid of his Senior Brother, so he had to step back slowly.","“It’s a good plan indeed, Monk.” The smoke and dust from the explosion slowly dispersed, and a tall figure slowly appeared.","There was a hideous penetrating wound that almost tore off her right arm, which was holding the knife. A thick blood aura was slowly repairing the wound.","When Konglun saw this, he immediately extended his left palm and struck his right shoulder blade.","Divine blood dripped down, and the Dharma bone with a halo was exposed.","Jian Qing and the others’ eyebrows twitched.","“All of you, back down,” Konglun said indifferently.","Jian Qing and the others did not dare to stay any longer and immediately retreated a thousand feet.","“Now, we are equal again,” he said, and then assumed a corresponding posture.","Lady Sha did not say much. After the wound was completely repaired by the Blood Qi, the two continued to fight.","Konglun was still fighting, chanting Buddhist scriptures to stop the corrosion of the Blood Qi.","One majestic move after another shook the sky.","Konglun advanced step by step like a steady mountain. Every attack he made was as slow as water, and his attack and defense were impeccable.","As for Lady Sha, who was holding the bloodb lade, she was already showing signs of fatigue.","“Only after suffering thousands of hardships and tribulations can one be considered a Mahayana. In reality, it’s greed, suffering all kinds of hardships, and falling into Samsara forever...”","As he chanted, the clear light around the sky wheel became more and more exuberant, and it looked solemn.","“Monk, who do you think you are? Do you think you can convert me? Do you know that no one can bear the pain I’ve suffered?”","She gritted her teeth and did not give in to the pressure of the empty wheel.","“Don’t say that you want to convert me in ten days. Even if it’s a thousand years, it’s still wishful thinking!”","Konglun opened his eyes and looked at her calmly. “If it doesn’t work out in 10 days, then it’ll work out in 10,000 days. If it doesn’t work out in 10,000 days, then it’ll go through 10,000 tribulations. How can there be a time when all Karma can’t be resolved?”","Upon hearing this, Lady Sha suddenly laughed coldly. “Monk, you see me as your calamity and want to convert me to prove your Dao, right? Are you even worthy?”","“You don’t know the cause and effect. All you know is forcefully persuading people. That’s a great evil!”","A light flashed in Konglun’s eyes, but he did not say anything.","Lady Sha questioned him repeatedly, and the long and narrow bloody blade in her hand fell heavier and heavier. “What right do you have to enlighten me? All of the principles you know, all of the Dao scrolls and the thousand treasures you’ve read, they were all given to you by others. They were all forced upon you.”","“Now, you’re using other people’s reasoning and reasoning to try and use it to educate me. Have you figured out that bullsh*t truth yourself?”","“What kind of experience do you have to admonish me? could it be that you’re only relying on the great principles in your heart?”","“You said that no matter how much suffering a person goes through, they will eventually fall into greed without exception. What about you? We’re just going to take it out like this?”","“Do you think you can stay out of it just because you’re chanting the great truth? You spared no effort to enlighten me, isn’t it to vindicate Dao, to prove that you’re right? If you achieve your goal, won’t you also fall into greed?”","A series of questions exploded in Konglun’s mind.","He seemed to have suddenly realized something for a moment, but what came to his mind after that was confusion.","All the questions were like maggots in his bones, creeping out from the bottom of his heart, and then growing and devouring without control.","He, who thought of himself as a tough person, began to have doubts.","“Could it be that all of your reasoning is correct? If, in the end, you find that the Great Dao that you’ve used your life to prove and protect is just an ethereal dream, a floating duckweed without roots, what will the result be?”","Lady Sha’s question began to magnify in Konglun’s mind. It was like an empty valley, reverberating in his mind.","The knife cut through the light on his body and left a long and narrow knife mark on his skin. Mistress Sha’s body turned into a bloody shadow and surrounded him without him knowing.","“All the principles you cling to are nonsense.”","“You’re just a pearl. You were given intelligence by others and gave birth to spiritual roots. Everything was given to you by others. How can you talk about Enlightenment?”","The clear light was faint, and the clear pupils of the Konglun gradually enlarged.","The flowing light of the Scripture that was surging around his body was also soaked in the Blood Qi.","The Blood Qi was eroding and seeping into Konglun’s body bit by bit!","“Instead of becoming someone else’s believer, it’s better to abandon those rules. It wasn’t easy for you to develop intelligence. Are you going to follow them for countless years?”","Her voice was cold and unconsciously alluring.","The flowing runes were shattering and collapsing.","Konglun’s eyes turned hollow rapidly. Everything he understood in his consciousness was falling apart and was trying to be reconstructed.","At this moment, everyone realized that something was wrong.","“Female Demon, what did you do to senior Konglun?” Jian Qing’s eyes widened in anger.","How could he not see that the current Konglun had already developed an Inner Demon? his incomparably firm belief had been eroded by a few nonsensical logic!","This was something that no one had expected.","The disciple who had cultivated arduously for so long, the lantern-twisting disciple, had ended up in such a situation!"]},{"number":4785,"title":"Chapter 4785 Imprisonment","paragraphs":["4785 Imprisonment","The Lotus leaves that were dense with a light yet vigorous Blood Qi started to grow around Monk Konglun and bloomed.","Jian Qing and the others did not care about anything else, and they immediately moved forward to help.","However, they were shocked to find that they were unable to take a step forward. It was as if there was some kind of transparent barrier that stopped them.","“Senior Brother, wake up! You’ve been bewitched by that demon!” Jian Qing said anxiously. At the same time, he released a great pressure in an attempt to break through the transparent barrier.","However, on this rainbow shadow lotus peak, all sounds were isolated.","Monk Konglun kneeled on the ground, his skinny chest beating violently.","The blood blade in her hand disappeared, and Lady Sha slowly lowered her head. She looked at him and said softly, “Hey, Konglun, you’ve lost.”","“Female Demon, you should die! How could my Senior Brother lose? It’s all because of your evil bewitchment that my Senior Brother has an Inner Demon in his heart. I will make you pay with your life!” Jian Qing’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets as he tried his best to break through the barrier.","Monk Konglun’s body started to surge with traces of Blood Qi, a mixture of black and red.","He seemed to be in extreme pain. His originally clear eyes began to turn cloudy, and layers of ravines appeared on his yellow skin.","“Konglun, you’ve lost...”","“Konglun, you’ve lost...”","...","He raised his head with difficulty. The Buddha’s light was getting further away from him. His eyes were dull. “I... Lost.”","Heaven and earth were in grief, and the bitter words were true.","The so-called four bitter words were the oath that Konglun had made earlier: They died when they saw light, rotted when they saw wind, injured when they saw the earth, and suffered the pain of knives and axes when they saw all living things.","The moment Konglun admitted defeat, these words of bitterness were activated.","Konglun’s body was transforming rapidly. His skin and flesh began to rot, and his bones and bones began to deform.","These bitter words seemed to have forced Konglun himself into a dead end. Even if he did not die, he would still live like a monster over the years.","Where else could he stay after eliminating the light, the wind, the earth, and all living things?","The rainbow shadow lotus peak was collapsing, and even Monk Konglun’s body was dissipating.","At this moment, Lady Sha waved her hand and summoned a blood pool, which drowned him.","Iron chains extended from the blood pool and fixed his body in place.","A strange thing happened. Monk Konglun’s body, which had originally died in an irreversible manner, stopped rotting after soaking in the blood pool and began to slowly recover.","Everyone looked at this scene in disbelief.","A monk in the Yan Immortal realm actually coexisted with the blood pool!","“Do you see that? Right now, Konglun can only survive in my blood pool.” Holding the blood pool with one hand, Lady Sha looked down at Jian Qing and the others with raised eyebrows.","“Female Demon, you won’t rest until we die!” Jian Qing’s eyes were bloodshot, and the sky trembled with his restless Yan power.","She glanced at Jian Qing coldly and said, “So what if I don’t give up? Since you dared to come, you must pay the corresponding price.”","“It’s true that you can raze my Sand Demon Cave to the ground now, but you have to consider this carefully. Konglun can only survive under the protection of my blood pool. Once you make a move, I’ll definitely destroy his body and soul. There’s no chance of him surviving!”","An ice-cold voice resounded in the world.","“If we don’t retreat in ten breaths, Konglun will die!”","The countdown began, and the chaotic battlefield began to calm down.","Jian Qing’s eyes were red as he looked at Senior Brother Konglun who was sitting in the blood pool. Finally, he retreated.","After taking a deep look at her, Jian Qing led the rest of his Junior Brothers and retreated from the Sand Demon Cave.","There was a howling wind. Perhaps it was because the battle was too intense, it caused the Great Dao of heaven and earth to change.","Heavy rain began to fall, temporarily suppressing the killing intent and Blood Qi.","At that moment, both the evil cultivators of the sand demon cave and the top cultivators of the sect stopped fighting.","The sage-like cultivator, who had lost an arm and carried a sword on his back, stopped on the spot with a sorrowful expression.","A total of 87 major sects, tens of thousands of unparalleled Heaven’s Favorites, almost an entire generation of powerful people had died on this expedition to the Sand Demon Cave. But in the end, it was all for nothing.","Everything was empty!","He was extremely disheartened. He looked at the broken sword in his hand and then stabbed it into his abdomen, cutting off his life source.","“Master!” Hundreds of top cultivators surrounded him and lifted his body, which was about to be destroyed.","“The Heavenly Dao is unfair. It protected the evil demons. After my death, no sect under the Heavens is allowed to take a step into the Sand Demon Cave, lest they be slaughtered...”","This sage-like old man had ended his long life in front of the Sand Demon Cave.","The remaining 5,000 top cultivators of the sect began to flee.","Cui Jing raised his staff and wanted to rush forward to kill them, but he was stopped by Lady Sha.","She looked down at the departing figures and finally said, “Withdraw.”","It could be considered an unprecedented battle in this Heavenly Region. It started with the defeat of Elder Konglun before all the top cultivators of the sects who had come to attack were forced to retreat.","With one hand, Lady Sha lifted up the blood pool that was binding Konglun’s body and returned to the Sand Demon Cave.","The surviving evil cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave started to clean up the battlefield. Like vicious wolves, they devoured the souls and bodies of the dead cultivators.","Looking at the countless divine corpses on the ground, Jian Wushuang’s eyes grew heavy. He thought of the Great Catastrophe War of the Divine Power Universe.","The two universes fought to the death for ten million chaos cycles.","Now, the Divine Power Universe had returned to peace. However, similar scenes would never disappear, and it was the same in the Great Yan domain.","“How unlucky, this bunch of monks are really weak. They have nine Yan Immortals, but they can’t take this place,” Cheng Qing shook his head and sighed.","Chun Qiu sighed. “They must have their own reasons and difficulties.”","“What difficulties? If I were that bunch of monks, I’d just flatten that woman and hang her to death on the city wall. As for the rest of these b*stards, none of them will be able to escape. I’ll just kill them all with a single slap,” Chen Qing said. “This way, we can also take revenge for that monk. There’s no need to drag things out.”","Di Qing looked at Chen Qing with appreciation, as if he agreed with his approach.","Jian Wushuang did not express his opinion. His eyes were fixed in the direction where Lady Sha had left.","At this time, Di Qing spoke and looked at Jian Wushuang, Chen Qing, and Chun Qiu with interest, “You three are good. I like you.”","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu did not speak, they only looked at him with judgmental eyes.","After all, he was the Golden Crow by Prince Mo’s side, and his strength had reached an extremely terrifying level.","He was all alone against two Grand Yan Immortals. This strength had already exceeded the limits of everyone’s imagination.","“Don’t look at me like that. Although I have helped Prince Mo before, that was all I did. Other than that, I have nothing to do with him,” Di Qing explained slowly."]},{"number":4786,"title":"Chapter 4786 Searching for Konglun","paragraphs":["4786 Searching for Konglun","Cheng Qing and the others did not understand.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang would not remove Di Qing from Prince Mo’s side just because of a few words.","Di Qing had also severely injured him in the northern heaven immortal continent. If it were not for his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, he probably would not have been able to survive until now.","Di Qing continued, “Now that he’s dead, I naturally have nothing to do with him.”","Chen Qing put on a fake smile. After looking at him, he placed his arms behind his head and said leisurely, “We don’t want to know about your previous situation at all. After all, we had nothing to do with Prince Mo’s death.”","Upon hearing this, Di Qing’s face revealed a meaningful look. Without saying anything more, he turned around and ran back to the Sand Demon Cave.","“Motherf*cker, you’re still too young to try to get information out of me.” Cheng Qing let out a long breath and quickly touched his face.","The illusion on their faces did not disappear, and they still had the image of middle-aged men with unshaven beards.","In this way, even if Di Qing reported them to the Heavenly Court in the future, he would not know what the three of them were like.","The heroic-looking woman looked at the three of them with a complicated expression before she disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a touch of solemness. Di Qing would definitely avenge him in the future. There were two urgent things at the moment.","The first was to recover his strength as soon as possible to protect himself. The second was to erase the Karma on his body and the great killing tribulation.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and said, “Where do you think she locked Monk Konglun up?”","When Cheng Qing heard this, he was moved, “Brother Jian, you want to find that monk and resolve the Karma between us?”","“That’s right, I have such a plan,” he nodded his head and said, “But I’m afraid that it will be even more difficult to find Monk Konglun.”","“Brother Jian, do you remember the Blood Sea we fell into not long ago?” Chun Qiu suddenly asked.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. “You mean, she might have imprisoned Konglun there?”","Chun Qiu nodded his head, “That’s very likely. After all, Monk Konglun made a bitter oath that he would die if he came into contact with light, rot if he came into contact with wind, be injured if he came into contact with the ground, and suffer the pain of being cut down by knives and axes if he came into contact with any living beings. Think about it, if we don’t let him die, where would we place him?”","Jian Wushuang came to a realization. The oaths mentioned above were extremely harsh. However, if he placed Monk Konglun under the unfathomable Blood Sea, wouldn’t he be able to avoid it?","The Blood Sea was a place without light, wind, land, and all living things.","Thinking of this, he did not stay any longer and was ready to explore.","Chun Qiu stopped Jian Wushuang and shook his head. “We can’t do it now. On one hand, we haven’t recovered our strength yet. If we encounter an uncontrollable situation, we’ll be in a passive position.”","“I think the best time is to wait for a few more years.”","“Not bad, Brother Chun Qiu. Such a thorough analysis. It seems that I, Cheng Qing, have underestimated you,” Cheng Qing patted his shoulder and gave him a thumbs up.","Chun Qiu smiled bitterly, “I can’t help much in the battle, so I want to help Brother Jian in other ways.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and patted him on the shoulder. “As you wish. We’ll set off when the time comes.”","From then on, the three of them stayed in the Sand Demon Cave. Di Qing and the heroic-looking woman were nowhere to be found.","Earlier, Cui Jing had sneakily come over to monitor the three of them. Until Chen Qing grabbed him by the collar and threw him more than ten miles away, he had never come to visit again.","As for the one who had single-handedly created the Sand Demon Cave, there had been no news of her after that great battle.","Jian Wushuang and the other two were still in the pavilion, trying their best to recover.","Four years had passed in a flash.","At the beginning of the fifth year, Jian Wushuang was the first to wake up from his meditative state. Wisps of vast golden light with a profound aura flowed in the depths of his pupils. It was full of an intimidating power.","However, he was also frowning, as if he was extremely dissatisfied with his recovery.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu also woke up from their meditative state, frowning.","“What’s going on? I’ve only recovered 40 percent of my strength?” Cheng Qing could not believe it.","Chun Qiu clenched his fists and then released them. “I’ve only recovered less than 60 percent.”","“50 percent for me,” Jian Wushuang frowned.","It had been five years since the battle in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, and it should have been enough time for him to fully recover.","However, the three of them had only recovered 60 percent of their strength at best. They were still a long way from a complete recovery.","“What’s going on? Is it because we’re in this Heavenly Realm or because of the so-called Karma that we’ve been infected with?” Cheng Qing asked.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “It shouldn’t be because of Karma. It must be because we were severely injured in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture. After all, it was a great fortune to be able to survive that catastrophe.”","Cheng Qing nodded. It seemed like this was the only explanation.","50 percent of his strength was enough for Jian Wushuang in this Sand Demon Cave. Even if the situation was not good, he had the three Emperors by his side. Even if he were to fight against Lady Sha, who was also in the Yan Immortal realm, he would have enough power to fight.","In the entire area of the Sand Demon Cave, darkness was the main color. Even if the sun shone in the sky, it would only flash for a moment. This undoubtedly made it easier for Jian Wushuang to move.","Stepping out of the pavilion, the three ghostly figures quickly disappeared into the darkness.","With the memory of the first time he went there, it only took him half a day to arrive at the ancient hall where Lady Sha was residing.","The wails of the resentful souls could be heard from a hundred miles away. The Blood Sea was silent, but from time to time, there would be layers of ripples. There were ownerless resentful souls that condensed into blood monsters rolling in the Blood Sea, strange and shocking.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were calm. Then, he told the two of them, “You two stay away from here. I will dive into the Blood Sea alone. Remember, no matter what, don’t take a step into the Blood Sea.”","“No,” The two of them rejected the offer at the same time and were about to dive into the Blood Sea together.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to persuade them again.","“Brother Jian, it’s fine if we don’t go down for the time being, but we’ll guard this place. If there’s any movement down there, we’ll definitely go down and get you.”","Chun Qiu said in a deep voice, and then placed a wisp of Yan power in his palm to connect.","“Don’t worry, I’ll be fine.” Jian Wushuang nodded, then turned to face the boundless Blood Sea and stepped into it.","The Blood Sea boiled for a moment and all kinds of ugly blood monsters were excited. They all floated to the place where Jian Wushuang had disappeared.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu looked at each other and saw the worry in each other’s eyes."]},{"number":4787,"title":"Chapter 4787 Under the Abyss","paragraphs":["4787 Under the Abyss","As he fell into the Blood Sea, Jian Wushuang felt countless terrible hands full of negative emotions pulling him into the abyss.","This Blood Sea had no buoyancy at all, and even a feather could not float on it.","Jian Wushuang was like a stone statue that weighed a million pounds, falling down.","At the same time, there were countless ugly blood monsters that followed his tracks and ate him.","The blood monsters in the Blood Sea were all pieced together by the vengeful souls of the dead cultivators. They had no self-consciousness and only had an insatiable intake of divine souls.","Jian Wushuang, who was falling into the abyss of the Blood Sea, naturally noticed this situation. In order to avoid alerting Lady Sha, he directly opened the stopper of the Boyang Bottle.","Suddenly, the treasure light bloomed, and countless blood monsters were directly swallowed into the Boyang Bottle by the terrible suction.","A moment later, the three Emperor’s voice rang out from the Boyang Bottle.","“Damn, what kind of dirty things are these? Little Friend, what kind of garbage have you brought in?!”","Jian Wushuang was embarrassed. He used his deified soul to tell the three Emperors what was happening.","“So that’s how it is. In that case, the three of us will be responsible for your aftermath.”","“Many thanks. I will definitely thank you in the future.”","“No need to thank me. Just take us to kill that old man, Zhen Wuyang, in the future.”","“...”","With the backing of the three Emperors and the Boyang Bottle, the dangers that would have taken a lot of effort were easily solved.","After the blood monster was no longer a problem, Jian Wushuang controlled his body to avoid the undercurrents and squalls while looking for traces of Monk Konglun.","Just as he was fully focused, an island giant the size of a small mountain quietly emerged above his head.","Feeling the heavy pressure, Jian Wushuang looked up subconsciously.","The next moment, a short arm that was like a giant pillar stirred the Blood Sea and smashed down.","He was shocked. Almost without thinking, he directly condensed an Invisible Sword and stabbed it forward.","Each Sword Intent was like a slender willow leaf, and they all condensed into the shape of a waterfall. They swept up and went straight to the figure of the huge island giant.","Then, a low wail like a whale’s cry rang out in the Blood Sea.","The entire Blood Sea was like boiling water, restless and then silent.","After the Sword Intent that Jian Wushuang released completely dissipated, the giant was already somewhat shattered.","It was no longer alive, and it just floated in the sea of blood, motionless.","This giant looked like it was made of countless huge rocks and looked extremely ugly.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang did not expect it to be so fragile.","To be able to kill him with just 3,000 Sword Intents, his weakness was obvious.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave and continue his search, he vaguely noticed that there was a thick and long iron chain beside the giant.","He seemed to have sensed something and directly flew to the side of the giant. Only then did he clearly see that a chain several times thicker than his waist was tied to the giant’s body. As for the other end, it extended into the endless darkness.","“Perhaps, this chain is related to where Monk Konglun is.”","Jian Wushuang no longer searched like a headless fly. Instead, he followed the chain and walked into the darkness.","The deeper he went into this dark abyss, the more he saw hundreds of abandoned chains of different sizes floating under the abyss. It was an indescribable ancient sight.","“Don’t tell me that Monk Konglun isn’t the only one trapped here?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled as he continued to move forward.","The time between advancing and falling seemed to be endless. This Blood Sea was so deep that he had the illusion that it had no bottom.","At the same time, the chain under his feet began to thin. It was originally as thick as two people hugging each other, but now it was as thick as a thigh. This could be some kind of sign.","The situation in the dark abyss was very bad. Even with Jian Wushuang’s strength, he could barely see a thousand meters ahead, which made him even more vigilant.","After an unknown amount of time, an extremely weak light that could not be seen if one did not look carefully was imprinted in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. His heart could not help but beat wildly.","Jian Wushuang quickly looked over and saw a skeleton-like figure that was as tough as an old tree among the piles of withered bones.","He just sat there, his four limbs, waist, and neck bound by six dark chains. At the same time, he was enduring the nibbling of countless tiny blood monsters.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and he was about to wave his hand to disperse the blood monsters.","However, at this moment, five island-like giant creatures seemed to smell his aura and swam over from all directions of the Blood Sea.","Each of the five giants corresponded to five thick chains.","Jian Wushuang did not care about anything else. He drew his sword and released a brilliant move in the abyss of the Blood Sea.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, second move.","River.","The condensation of 100,000 Sword Intents was unimaginable and impossible to face directly.","It was like a Heavenly River sweeping across, with great momentum, surging forward.","The five pitiful giants were crushed into pieces by the terrifying Sword Intents before they could even open their bloody mouths to swallow.","At the same time, the chain also broke into pieces, turning into a cloud of iron fragments and scattering.","In the darkness, the skeleton-like figure slowly opened his eyes.","His eyes were no longer clear, completely replaced by a deep black.","This skinny figure was Monk Konglun, who had been trapped in the blood pool after his Inner Demon was summoned.","“Kindness,” he said this word in an aged voice.","“Immortal Master, can you see me?” someone asked.","Monk Konglun slowly shook his head, “My dirty eyes can’t look straight at a good person, but my ears can sense where they are.”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang had hidden himself to prevent Monk Konglun from suffering the pain of seeing all living beings.","“May I know why you have come here to see me?” Konglun said.","The words were at the tip of his tongue, but he did not know how to continue. “Well, Immortal Master, do you know how to get rid of Karma that has been tainted for no reason?”","After a moment of silence, Konglun opened his mouth, “Virtuous man, how can there be Karma in this world without reason?”","“In the unseen world, all things have their own destinies. When they will appear, and in what form they will appear, they are all already destined. Even if you think that they have been contaminated for no reason, they actually already have a cause.”"]},{"number":4788,"title":"Chapter 4788 Gifting the Life Source Ring Bead","paragraphs":["4788 Gifting the Life Source Ring Bead","Jian Wushuang, who had concealed himself in the abyss of the Blood Sea, was stunned when he heard Monk Konglun’s words.","The Karma that he was infected with had no cause at all, so why did Konglun cut him off directly? There was no cause for Karma in this world?","Wasn’t this a little too arbitrary and straightforward?","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang looked at Konglun, who was sitting on the countless bones with dark eyes. He thought, ‘Has his Inner Demon completely devoured his Heart Realm?’","“Are the good men still around?” Monk Konglun asked. He slowly put his palms together and bowed in Jian Wushuang’s direction. “I’ve already developed an Inner Demon and can no longer teach and discipline the people. If you don’t mind, we can just chat.”","Jian Wushuang was not sure if his state of mind had changed. However, with the Karma and the great killing calamity, he could only try to talk to Konglun.","He said, “Immortal Master, I don’t agree with what you said. Is it possible to have Karma without cause and effect?”","“If there was no cause and effect for no reason, is everything in this world connected? I don’t think so. If I saved a cultivator when I was traveling in Qingyun Heavenly Realm, To him, I’m his Karma, but to me, is it true that there was no Karma? This is just a spur-of-the-moment thing.”","When Konglun heard this, he smiled, “Virtuous man, actually, when you said those words, you had already involved Karma. It was because of your momentary impulse that Karma resulted in the subsequent consequences.”","“The reason is that in this Karma that should not have existed, you occupied the dominant position and created the cause and effect.”","“The world is vast and all the Karma related to oneself is not always in one’s own hands.”","After saying those words, Konglun did not speak any further and placed his palms together.","How could Jian Wushuang, who had grown to the peak of the Great Dao step by step and had a terrible comprehension of the Great Dao of heaven and earth and all kinds of skills, not understand what he meant?","Jian Wushuang understood a little and asked, “Immortal Master, do you mean that the right to lead one’s own Karma has never been in one’s own hands? Instead, it is connected to all living things?”","“That’s the case, and that’s not the case,” At this moment, Konglun gave an ambiguous answer. However, he did not give an answer. “Everything is in the heart and hands of a benevolent person, waiting for you to change it.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He was trying to figure out the connection between them. If what Monk Konglun said was true, the Karma that he had been infected with since he entered the Sand Demon Cave had always been in the hands of the so-called Lady Sha.","It was she who had forced Jian Wushuang to be contaminated by the Karma and thus bore the great killing calamity.","“You don’t provoke Karma, but Karma provokes you...” he sighed helplessly.","Jian Wushuang seemed to be unwilling to give up. After a moment of silence, he told Konglun everything.","Finally, Konglun put his palms together. “Virtuous man, this is both your Karma and your calamity.”","“To be honest, I’m here to find a solution,” Jian Wushuang said slowly. “Immortal Master, do you know the solution?”","Monk Konglun replied, “Everything is in the heart and hands of a virtuous person, waiting for you to change it. External forces are ultimately just external forces.”","“...”","Jian Wushuang was depressed and did not know what to say.","In this exchange of Karma, Monk Konglun’s intentions were extremely clear. Only he could change it.","The two of them continued to sit for several days before it finally ended.","Jian Wushuang felt that most of the doubts in his heart had been cleared. At the same time, he admired Konglun even more. Even though he had developed an Inner Demon, he was still able to hold on to his heart and not let the Blood Qi of resentment devour him.","Under the dark abyss of the Blood Sea, he clasped his hands together and returned Monk Konglun’s bow.","His generosity, his unique understanding of everything, and his fearless spirit were enough for Jian Wushuang to treat him with respect.","Konglun’s final conclusion was, “Virtuous man, after only a few days of interaction, I have also felt Enlightened. I have never felt so good before. The feeling you give me is that you have come out of this world, yet you are not independent of it. It’s as if you were born from the Heavenly Dao, like a graceful swan.”","“Immortal Master, you’re too kind. I’ve been floating for tens of millions of years and have never stopped.” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly.","“Are you tired?” asked Konglun as he lifted his head.","He was stunned. He did not expect such a question.","After a long while, Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, ” I... don’t know.”","“This old man asked too much,” Konglun’s brows relaxed and said. Then, he slowly raised his hand and took out the largest ring bead that glowed with a black luster from the string of 14 ring beads on his neck.","“Virtuous man, I know that I can’t enter Samsara in this life. I’ll give you this ring bead now as a memento.”","“This ring bead is my source. All my thoughts, thoughts, and feelings for the first half of my life are sealed here. I hope that it can provide some help to you in the future. I will be honored.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang refused and was about to leave the Blood Sea with Konglun.","Konglun shook his head with a smile and said, “There is no such thing as a prison in this world. Only by painting the ground as a prison can one truly be considered a prison. My heart and Dao have already been lured by the demonic barrier. I can no longer see the past. This will be my final destination.”","“I had a good chat with you. I hope to see you one last time.”","“But ...” Jian Wushuang wanted to say something but stopped. The reason why he hid his figure was that the last of the bitter words set by Monk Konglun was that he had to suffer the pain of knives and axes when he saw living beings.","“It doesn’t matter. Even if I die after seeing a virtuous person for the last time, it’s worth it.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang no longer declined. His original figure slowly emerged and his body was surging with thousands of lights, making him look like a celestial being.","Konglun’s dark eyes became clear for a moment. Then, he nodded and handed the Life Source Ring Bead to Jian Wushuang.","“Today, seeing you, I can’t help but recall all the bitter cultivation path I had in the past.”","“I was once a fruit on a dying tree. I should not have gained sentience, but a green bird used great perseverance to water me every day. As usual, it saved the mother tree for 30,000 years. It then plucked me from the tree and held me under the Buddha’s body to listen to the Dao and sit for countless years. Only then did I gain sentience and attain Dao.”","“In my current situation, I’ve also let down the green bird’s mercy. I have no face and only wish to fall into the extreme darkness and endure the cold to atone for my sins.”"]},{"number":4789,"title":"Chapter 4789 Sha Qing","paragraphs":["4789 Sha Qing","Konglun raised his head and looked into the unknown darkness. A rare expression of sadness flashed across his face.","“I’ve traveled across thousands of rivers and read countless Heavenly Regions before I realized that everything was just an illusion.” He lowered his head and sat still like a stone statue.","Jian Wushuang touched the black ring bead in his palm, sighed, and slowly stepped back.","Just as Konglun had said, the hardest thing to get out of in this world was actually one’s own prison.","He did not persist and took one last look at Monk Konglun, who was sitting at the bottom of the Blood Sea, before his figure disappeared.","The Karmic theory debate lasted for nearly seven days. All the doubts were answered by Konglun. Jian Wushuang also vaguely knew how to break his own Karma.","If one wanted to dispel one’s own Karma, one must first find the cause.","And this reason was definitely the creator of the Sand Demon cave, the so-called Lady Sha.","This so-called Karma was something illusory. Once it was contaminated, it would be extremely troublesome.","Jian Wushuang made up his mind. If he did not have an effective method before he fully recovered his strength, he would erase this place directly!","As he broke through the surface of the Blood Sea, he heard a faint cry.","There were two shouts, and if one did not listen carefully, they would not hear it.","Soon, Jian Wushuang locked onto the place where the sound came from and rushed over without stopping.","After traveling a thousand miles, he finally saw two figures fighting with countless blood monsters in the Blood Sea.","When he saw this, he immediately released Yan power great to suppress it.","Countless blood monsters were directly crushed into powder, and the two figures clearly heaved a sigh of relief.","“Why did you come down? Didn’t I tell you to wait up there?” Jian Wushuang said helplessly as he swept over.","The two figures were Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu.","The two of them were overjoyed to see Jian Wushuang.","Cheng Qing waved his hand to disperse the corpse of the dead blood monster before saying, “Brother Jian, how could we possibly be at ease when you came down here alone? After hearing the strange sounds coming from below, we could not stand it any longer, so we decided to come down.”","“Brother Jian, are you in danger?” Chun Qiu looked around warily.","Jian Wushuang shook his head gently and looked at the two people who did not care about themselves at all. They went down to the Blood Sea to look for him, and he was touched.","This kind of touch was an emotion that only appeared when he was with Ninth Kalpa King.","It was the feeling of being able to fight shoulder to shoulder without worry and entrust everything to the other party.","Then, he raised his palm and placed it on their shoulders. He smiled and said, “There’s no danger. Let’s leave together now!”","The three of them laughed at the same time and then left the Blood Sea together.","“That’s right, Brother Jian, have you found that Monk Konglun?”","“I found him. We’ve been discussing here for several days, and we’ve roughly figured out some ways to break the Karma on our bodies.”","“That’s good. I’ve wanted to leave this damn place for a long time. A bunch of bastards who feed on blood have turned this place into a mess. Brother Jian, do you think we should erase this place before we leave?”","“...”","As they walked out of the Blood Sea, Cheng Qing and the others heaved a sigh of relief. After all, the Blood Sea was formed by the resentful souls of countless cultivators. They had yet to fully recover, so they still felt a certain amount of pressure.","At this moment, more than a dozen figures suddenly sprang out from all directions. The leader was Cui Jing, who was in disheveled clothes and looked disdainful.","He adjusted his loose pants and pursed his lips. “I was wondering where you guys ran off to. So, you guys ran here. What’s up? is there any treasure under the Blood Sea?”","“I think your mouth still needs a beating!” Cheng Qing said coldly. He took a step forward and raised his hand to slap.","“Hey, hey, I’m warning you guys not to mess around.” Cui Jing looked nervous and subconsciously retreated.","At this moment, a cold female voice was heard.","“Cui Jing, stand down.”","Jian Wushuang turned around and saw Lady Sha in a blood-red cloak walking slowly toward them.","Cui Jing wanted to say something but stopped. In the end, he did not say anything and retreated with the top cultivators.","“Brother Jian, what do we do? Do we fight now?” Cheng Qing whispered.","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “There’s no hurry. Let’s see what she’s up to.”","A Yan immortal with unfathomable power was still a threat to him, who was still recovering.","The Blood Qi that was so condensed that it was almost tangible was swimming around her body like a waterfall. It was extremely terrifying.","It was evident how many top cultivators he had to kill to condense such a terrifying Blood Qi.","When she arrived in front of the three of them, her eyes locked on Jian Wushuang at once.","“You’re their big brother?” asked Lady Sha.","Jian Wushuang did not answer, but just looked at her coldly.","She completely ignored Jian Wushuang’s gaze and continued to talk to herself, “Come with me. I might have a way to help you with the things that have contaminated your body.”","After she finished speaking, she turned around and walked towards the black stone path that hung above the Blood Sea.","“Brother Jian, we can’t go. That woman definitely doesn’t have any good intentions. She might even attack us,” Cheng Qing said. “Even if you want to go, we will go with you.”","“It’s fine. Even if I haven’t recovered, she can’t do anything to me. If she has any ill intentions, I’ll cut off her head first.” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes as he looked forward.","There were only two figures moving forward under the dark sky that was filled with Blood Qi.","The black stone path floating above the Blood Sea extended into the distance without end.","“I’m Sha Qing, the Master who created this Sand Demon Cave,” Lady Sha, who introduced herself, slowly raised her palm. “As you can see, all the resentful souls and blood here are because of me.”","Jian Wushuang said slowly, “You have committed a great deal of killing. Aren’t you afraid that you will die in the same way one day?”","“So what? What if I say I’ve been waiting for that day?” Sha Qing’s gaze was calm, her tone nonchalant. It did not seem like she was speaking of atrocious acts of killing.","Jian Wushuang obviously did not care if she was lying or not. He said lightly, “Tell me, why did you plant this Karma in us? ”","Hearing this, her lips curled up slightly. “Amazing. You’re indeed the person I’m looking for. I’m sure you’ve noticed it almost immediately, right?”","Jian Wushuang did not answer her. “Tell me how to remove it. Otherwise, you know the consequences. I will destroy you and the entire Sand Demon Cave.”","Sha Qing raised her brows and laughed. “What big words. What makes you think that the three of you can destroy the entire Sand Demon Cave? If I were to devour you now, how confident are you that you’d be able to escape?”"]},{"number":4790,"title":"Chapter 4790 The So-Called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm","paragraphs":["4790 The So-Called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm","Jian Wushuang’s face suddenly turned gloomy and an unimaginably terrifying Yan power suddenly surged out.","Billions of light beams shot into the sky, crushing the Blood Qi.","He stood in place like a supreme Emperor, making people unable to look at him directly.","A ray of light appeared between his eyebrows and condensed into a seven-star system.","Two rays of golden light that made even Yan Immortals tremble appeared from the depths of his pupils, “You want to try?”","Seeing this, Sha Qing’s eyes turned grave. She had not expected that this seemingly weak fellow could actually release such a terrifying aura.","A moment later, Sha Qing laughed again. “I don’t want to try. I didn’t ask you to come here to fight, but to discuss some things.”","Jian Wushuang dispersed the terrifying Yan power great momentum around him and the originally tense situation seemed to have never happened.","“The Karma on your bodies is just as you’ve thought. I’ve deliberately drawn it to you,” Sha Qing did not hide anything. “The reason why I did this is purely because I want to invite someone to a place to help me complete a task.”","“What if I don’t go?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold. He did not have a good impression of her.","“It’s impossible for you not to go. If you don’t go, then the Karma on you will never be resolved,” Sha Qing seemed to have him in the palm of her hand. “And that place isn’t an extremely evil place. On the contrary, it’s a great place that’s like a paradise.”","“And the thing I want you to do for me is just to deliver something. It won’t do you any harm.”","Jian Wushuang sneered, “If it’s really as you said, that the place you’re going to is a paradise, why don’t you go there yourself?”","Sha Qing said, “Do you think that with my current appearance, if I could go there, I would still need to go through so much trouble?”","“Also, the Karma on you can only be removed when you go there.”","“You planted an unknown Karma on me just for this?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold. He could no longer control himself and wanted to kill Sha Qing. “Do you know how much it will affect me if you do this?”","An apologetic look appeared on Sha Qing’s face. “I’m sorry, I had no choice. However, you can rest assured that as long as you go to that place, all the Karma on you will be eliminated.”","Although it was hard to accept, Jian Wushuang resisted the urge to kill her on the spot. After all, compared to killing her, removing the Karma was more urgent.","“That place is actually very far away. It’s far beyond the distance between one Heavenly Region and another Heavenly Region.”","Then, she paused and looked at Jian Wushuang. “With your level as a Yan Immortal, you must have understood that we are in the Great Si Region, under the jurisdiction of the Heavenly Court of Emperor Zhen Wuyang.”","This time, it was his turn to be surprised. He did not expect that in the most remote Heavenly Region, there would be a Yan Immortal who knew where the Great Si Region and the jurisdiction of Emperor Zhen Wuyang were.","Sha Qing continued, “And the place I want you to go to is actually a boundless Heavenly Region that is on the same scale as the Great Si Region.”","Although Jian Wushuang’s expression remained unchanged, his heart was already rippling.","Ever since he entered the Great Yan Domain, he had only been wandering in the Great Si Region. Now, he heard from others that another Heavenly Region of the same scale had appeared.","He could clearly feel that the vast Heavenly Regions and the Heavenly Realms formed in the ultimate Great Yan Domain were like a scroll that was slowly unfolding.","Sha Qing said slowly, “Monk Konglun, who came to attack the Sand Demon Cave and was imprisoned by me in the Blood Sea, all came from that place.”","The meaning behind his words was clearly beyond Jian Wushuang’s expectations. He had not expected that Konglun and the nine monks beside him did not belong to the Great Si Region but came from another place.","“I call the place that is on par with the Great Si Region. I call it the ‘Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm.’”","When she said this, Sha Qing looked at him and did not say anything else.","“Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm...” Jian Wushuang repeated it again softly. At the same time, he had already imagined a great Heavenly Realm filled with Immortals and Buddhas.","“There are no fights or killings there. There is only listening to the Dao and sitting,” Sha Qing said. “That’s why I said that you will definitely not be harmed in any way if you go there. At the same time, the Karma on both of you will also be removed.”","Jian Wushuang then said coldly, “Why should I believe you? Just based on a few words from you?”","“You don’t have to believe me,” she shrugged her shoulders and said. “But Konglun is a monk who came from there. I think you can guess what the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm is like from his nature.”","He snorted coldly. “Do you really think that I have no other way to get rid of the Karma on my body other than this?”","When Sha Qing heard this, there was some surprise in her eyes, but she quickly calmed down and said, “Even if you have other ways to get rid of the Karma in your body, the only safe way is to go to the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm.”","Suppressing his killing intent, Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, “I’m curious about a brutal and bloodthirsty Female Demon like you. You actually have something to send to the so-called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm. Do you want to send your own head there?”","When Sha Qing heard this, she laughed again. “As for what it is, I want to wait until you’ve fully recovered before I entrust it to you.”","This scheming and vicious Female Demon had already been listed as a must-kill in Jian Wushuang’s heart.","Regardless of whether the Karma on his body could be removed or not, he had already made up his mind. When his strength was fully recovered, he would kill her directly.","Sha Qing obviously did not know that she had become Jian Wushuang’s target. What she was doing now was telling him everything she knew about the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm.","At this moment, the sound of something breaking through the air could be heard.","“Big Sister, something bad has happened!”","Cui Jing’s panicked voice resounded in the sky, and then he appeared in front of the two.","Sha Qing’s face was filled with displeasure. Just as she was about to order Cui Jing to leave, her eyes caught a shocking wound on his chest.","The wound seemed to be left behind by some kind of blunt object.","Even though Cui Jing was only at the peak of the Ancestor-level, under the support of the Blood Qi Domain of the Sand Demon Cave, even a normal Yan immortal would not be able to cause him such serious damage.","And now, he was almost half dead.","“What’s wrong? Tell me in detail.”","Sha Qing knew that something big had happened, and her brows furrowed tightly."]},{"number":4791,"title":"Chapter 4791 Meeting Grand Yan Immortals Again","paragraphs":["4791 Meeting Grand Yan Immortals Again","After taking a look at Jian Wushuang, Cui Jing took a deep breath and said, “Those bald donkeys have come back.”","“They still dare to come,” Sha Qing’s gaze was cold. “This time, I’ll make them all become nourishment for my sea of knowledge!”","Cui Jing shook his head and covered the wound on his chest with his hand. He seemed to be in extreme pain. “No, Sister. This time, you have to run away.”","Sha Qing could tell that there was something wrong with his words. “Why?”","“Big Sister, those bald donkeys have left, but now they are coming back. There are two different monks with them. Those two monks aren’t afraid of killing us. They can kill thousands of our brothers with a wave of their hand.”","Cui Jing’s face was pale. “We can’t hold on any longer. I came back to send you a message so that you can leave as soon as possible. Go as far as you can.”","When Sha Qing heard this news, her gaze became even more solemn. After a moment, she looked at Cui Jing and said, “Ask all the top cultivators in the Sand Demon Cave to follow me to the city head to fight.”","Cui Jing shook his head firmly. “No, this time, Sister, just listen to me and go as far as you can. Leave this place to me.”","However, Sha Qing would not listen to him. She reached out and patted his head, then said in a deep voice, “I said to gather. Stop talking to me about those useless things. If the Sand Demon Cave is destroyed, no one will have a good end. It’s better to take a gamble.”","Then she turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “I’ll give it to you if I’m alive. If I’m dead, it’s a different story...”","With that, she picked up Cui Jing and flew forward, quickly disappearing.","Jian Wushuang was the only one left in the boundless Blood Sea.","At that moment, he was looking forward with a calm expression. He had a feeling that Sha Qing would not be able to survive this time.","Then, Cheng Qing and Chun Qiu rushed over.","“Brother Jian, look in that direction.” Cheng Qing pointed into the distance.","Jian Wushuang looked over and saw that far away, the bloody sky that protected the entire Sand Demon Cave was starting to shatter.","Countless rays of golden light broke through the blood Qi, shining and rising.","While the golden light was incomparably divine, it also carried a sense of solemnity that could not be ignored, making one feel threatened.","He frowned because the power of the golden light was definitely not something that Yan Immortal could control.","“It’s really strange. Since when did so many Grand Yan Immortals pop up in the Great Si Region? Could it be that I’m ill-informed?”","Cheng Qing’s perception of Yan power was extremely sharp. He immediately sensed that the brilliant golden light that broke through the Blood Qi was something that only a Grand Yan Immortal could release.","“It really is a Grand Yan Immortal.” Jian Wushuang was tempted. If it was really the monk and a Grand Yan Immortal, it was very likely that he had come from the so-called Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm.","“This time, it seems like that b*tch and all the b*stards in the Sand Demon Cave have no way to survive.” Cheng Qing sighed.","If top cultivators could use numbers to threaten the existence of the Yan Immortal level, then to the Grand Yan Immortal, it was no different from courting death.","With a wave of his hand, he could kill Yan Immortals and wipe out tens of thousands of top cultivators in a breath.","If top cultivators were existences that had extreme fate energy, Yan Immortals were existences that could control extreme fate energy.","In that case, the Grand Yan Immortal was the existence that created the destiny of the ultimate Great Dao!","This was the distance between the cultivation realms!","If there was not even one in hundreds of Heavenly Regioons who could advance from the top level to the Yan Immortal, then there was not even 1 in 10,000, or even 100,000 Heavenly Regions who could advance to the Grand Yan Immortal level!","This was no longer the concept of ‘one begets two’. It was purely a path that was opened up from nothing.","Even Chen Qing, who had been stuck at the peak of the Yan Immortal stage for countless years, had no chance of advancing to the Grand Yan Immortal stage.","It was because of this that Cheng Qing was in disbelief when he saw the two Grand Yan Immortals attacking the Sand Demon Cave. They could have destroyed the entire Heavenly Regiooon with a finger. Why did they have to go through so much trouble?","“This woman’s death can be considered an explanation to us Brothers,” Chen Qing looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","“Let’s go and take a look,” Jian Wushuang said. Then, he immediately rushed toward the top of the city wall of the Sand Demon Cave.","The Blood Qi was being shattered, and the ownerless vengeful spirits were wailing and dissipating.","The entire Sand Demon Cave began to collapse.","The three of them climbed up the broken city wall and looked around. The brilliant golden light was like thousands of suns that could not be looked at directly. It hung high in the sky and destroyed all the dirty blood.","“Oh, it really is a Grand Yan Immortal,” Cheng Qing muttered in shock.","In front of the wall of the Sand Demon Cave, there were 11 figures standing in the sky in a triangular formation.","The nine monks, led by Jian Qing, were at the back. In front of them, there were two bare-chested monks with great sun wheels on their backs. They looked like angry Vajras, and their eyes were full of majesty.","The unparalleled and vast golden light surged out from the two of them, bringing with it an unimaginable power.","The evil cultivators of the Sand Demon Cave, whose consciousness had been eroded by the Blood Qi and were in a state of excitement all day long, were not afraid of death at all. Even if the Golden light could kill them in an instant, they were not afraid of death.","In their eyes, they had abandoned death. There was only the vast and endless Yan power energy in their eyes.","The Sand Demon Cave had nurtured over 50,000 Ancestor-level cultivators with their Blood Qi. Now, they were all out, covering the sky like locusts.","However, under the illumination of the golden light, all of them exploded and died. Not a single one was able to break through this barrier.","This scene was extremely shocking. The bloody sky was shattering, and the astral winds tore through the sky and descended on every inch of the land.","In the face of such a terrifying situation, a tall figure in a blood-red cloak moved forward with determination.","“Big Sister, you can’t!” Cui Jing held his eight-foot staff and wanted to help her, but he was tied up by Sha Qing’s chains and thrown onto the city wall.","Standing in the air, she looked ahead with her cold eyes, without any fear.","The two monks who were leading the group and carrying the great solar disk also looked at her.","“Female Demon, where is Konglun?” The two of them spoke at the same time, their majestic voices resounding.","Sha Qing laughed coldly. “Konglun has already lost to me. Whether he lives or dies should be decided by me. What does it have to do with you?”","“You’re courting death! Hand over Konglun and I’ll let you enter the reincarnation cycle. Otherwise, you’ll die!”","A tall and strong monk on the left, who had a full beard like Kong Lun, shouted. On his bare chest, there were red flowing clouds and water ripples."]},{"number":4792,"title":"Chapter 4792 The Destruction of the Sand Demon Cave","paragraphs":["4792 The Destruction of the Sand Demon Cave","An indescribably terrifying astral wind swept across.","Immediately after, Monk Jian Qing said in a deep voice, “Kong Tong, Senior Brother Kong Ji, there’s no need to waste time talking to her. Just destroy this place and we’ll definitely find Senior Brother Konglun.”","The two people, who were called Kong Tong and Kong Ji, did not speak. They were clearly waiting for Sha Qing’s reply.","There was only mockery in her eyes. “I’ve said it before. Konglun lost to me. His life and death are in my hands. Do you think that you can save him by destroying my Sand Demon Cave? What a joke!”","“Since you’re so stubborn, then use your life to atone for your sins,” the two monks put their palms together and said in a deep voice.","In an instant, the clear light of Buddha pierced the sky and projected onto the land where evil thoughts were born.","All the evil cultivators who were in a state of excitement and madness exploded into puffs of blood mist and disappeared.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly. Almost at the moment when the indiscriminate Buddhist light shone down, he directly released a vast derivation power, which turned into a barrier above the three people.","Cui Jing was already scared out of his wits. There was no way he could survive under the light of Buddha.","Then, he saw Jian Wushuang and the other two people not far away. He immediately twisted his body and rolled forward.","“Three warriors... Quickly save me!” Cui Jing said hysterically.","“This kid is really lucky!” Cheng Qing was surprised.","Jian Wushuang did not look sideways, but he reached out his hand and led Cui Jing over.","Although he did not have a good impression of Cui Jing, who looked like a gangster and was definitely not a good person, he still extended a helping hand.","This was because Cui Jing had not made things difficult for them in the past few years. They had lived together in peace.","“Many, many thanks.” He nodded at Jian Wushuang to express his gratitude and then let out a long breath.","The Buddha’s light that attacked indiscriminately descended, and everything in the Sand Demon Cave was destroyed!","The chaotic city, the tall city walls, and the sand-covered ground were all turned into dust.","“Woof! Buzzzzzz!”","The Buddha light swept across the magic barrier above his head. Jian Wushuang groaned and a drop of divine blood dripped from his nose.","When Chen Qing and Chunqiu saw this, they hurriedly released Yan power together to completely stabilize the barrier.","“This bunch of f*cking bald donkeys! They’re going to be exterminated!” Cheng Qing’s face was red. He had not fully recovered and was clearly struggling.","Wiping off the divine blood, Jian Wushuang looked at the broken sky with a serious expression.","Under the light of Buddha, Sha Qing did not dodge or avoid it. She allowed the light of Buddha to shine on her body and pierce through it.","She was seeking death!","Even Jian Qing and the others, who hated her to the core, were stunned by this situation.","She put her hands behind her back and did not resist at all. In fact, she seemed to be relieved.","When the light of Buddha that shone on the ground dissipated, the entire Sand Demon Cave was destroyed and collapsed.","Kong Tong, Kong Ji, and the other 11 monks all stared at the tottering figure.","The blood-red straw cape was torn apart by the wind. There was almost no part of Sha Qing’s body that was intact. Divine blood that could not be dispersed flowed from her body.","“Female Demon, quickly tell me where my Senior Brother Konglun is!” Jian Qing shouted.","Sha Qing’s pupils, which were gradually dissipating, gathered together again. She glanced at him, then slowly turned around and tottered to the ground.","“You have guts!” Jian Qing shouted and raised his hand to crush her.","“Jian Qing.” Kong Ji, who had not said a word before, looked at him and warned him.","Monk Jian Qing took a step back and retracted his palm, but his eyes were still filled with dissatisfaction.","Kong Tong and Kong Ji did not attack again. They put their hands together and looked forward.","Divine blood dripped onto the barrier, and Sha Qing, whose body had been shattered, fell directly to the broken ground.","Cui Jing gritted his teeth and his eyes turned red. “Sister, why didn’t you leave?”","She was already an arrow at the end of its flight. She then looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Hey, I’m going to die.” As she spoke, she did not have the slightest awareness that she was on the verge of death. She even raised her eyebrows.","Then, with her broken palm, she took out a bunch of bloody objects from her bosom and threw them at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did to take it, but in the end, he could not bear it and reached out to take it.","The Blood Qi was restrained, and it was a palm-sized Crystal Skull.","“Don’t give this to anyone until you reach the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm. As compensation, I will give you all of my comprehension.” Sha Qing could not stand still, but she still stood up and walked toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of crisis. He glanced at the monks in the broken sky and said calmly, “If you want me to leave alive, don’t come near me from now on, and don’t give me your comprehension.”","When Sha Qing heard this, she was stunned for a moment before she laughed listlessly. “That’s right. You’re a supreme existence. How could you be interested in my comprehension?”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, not understanding what she meant.","“You guys can go. I’ll stay back to open the way for you,” her eyes gradually regained their vigor, as if she was burning her Immortal Source.","Jian Wushuang did not stay any longer. He immediately turned around and prepared to leave.","“No, I’m not leaving. I’ll stay with you,” Cui Jing said as he shook his head desperately, but his movements were restricted by the chains on his body.","“Don’t follow me anymore. In the future, we’ll be far apart and we won’t meet again,” Sha Qing turned around and said in a cold voice.","“My Lord, if you really don’t want to go to the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm, please pass the thing I entrusted you to Cui Jing and let him go.”","After saying this last sentence, her originally broken body instantly condensed. Countless strands of dignified Blood Qi surged out of her body, covering the sky and the sun.","Jian Wushuang paused for a moment before he continued to move forward.","“Let me go, I’m not leaving...” Cui Jing tried to twist his body, but Jian Wushuang knocked him out with a palm knife.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu also knew the urgency of the situation. They immediately grabbed Cui Jing and flew out.","“Where do you think you’re going?” The two monks, Kong Tong and Kong Ji, launched an attack at the same time, raining down punishment on them.","The indescribable terrifying Yan power was like a Heavenly River, falling down with the intention of annihilating Jian Wushuang and the others.","“Hey, Monk, you killed without distinguishing right from wrong. What’s the difference between you and me?”","In the boundless blood mist, Sha Qing’s body exuded a strange and dense crimson red.","Jian Qing’s eyes narrowed. “Not good, Senior Brother. She’s going to shatter the Immortal Source!”","As his voice fell, the dark sky was completely torn apart. A huge amount of Blood Qi devoured and minced everything.","A Yan Immortal’s shattered Immortal Source was the final blow, enough to destroy an entire Heavenly Region.","This was also the first time Jian Wushuang had seen Yan immortal’s shattered Immortal Source after entering the Great Yan Domain. The terrifying energy produced almost swept them all in."]},{"number":4793,"title":"Chapter 4793 Can You Be My Mount?","paragraphs":["4793 Can You Be My Mount?","The huge energy from the shattering of the Immortal Source suddenly gave them a helping hand, allowing Jian Wushuang and the others to fly hundreds of millions of miles in one step.","More than half of the entire Heavenly Region was destroyed by this attack.","The astral winds of the void raged, but the boundless Blood Qi only existed for a moment before it was dispersed by the light of Buddha.","Kong Tong and Kong Ji waved their palms at the same time, directly wiping out the remaining energy.","Sha Qing risked her life to shatter the Immortal Source, but she could not even shake their Buddhist light.","From then on, the entire Sand Demon Cave, along with more than half of the Heavenly Region, had completely disappeared. Only the extremely strange Blood Sea remained. It floated in the void with no end.","“Senior Brother, those few survivors must be the last of the Sand Demon Cave’s forces. We can’t let them escape!” Jian Qing said anxiously.","Kong Tong and Kong Ji stood still with their hands together. Then, they slowly took a step.","One step could shrink mountains and rivers, and billions of miles could be flattened!","A step covered a hundred million miles, and with just a few steps, he caught up with the few people who were running away.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank as he knew that they could not escape.","Sure enough, an irresistible and unimaginable cage of Buddhist light pressed down and trapped them inside.","“You’ve killed countless people and can only redeem yourselves with death. Why are you running?” Kong Tong’s majestic voice resounded.","Jian Wushuang did not like his indiscriminate behavior. He said loudly, “How do you know that we have killed countless people? Just because we have stayed in the Sand Demon Cave for several years?”","Kong Tong snorted coldly. “Hmph, since you’re with the Sand Demon Cave, you must be a motley crew. How can I not be certain that you’re guilty of murder?”","He raised his eyebrows, obviously shocked by Kong Tong’s argument.","Cheng Qing obviously wanted to spit in his face. “I say, bald... monk, are you muddled from chanting?”","“Even if we’re part of the Sand Demon Cave, the one who caught Monk Konglun was that b*tch. Now that he’s already dead in your hands, what does it have to do with us?”","“There are too many people who have committed murder in this world. Monk, didn’t you just kill people like flies? Everything has to be reasonable. Don’t make things difficult for us, because we really have nothing to do with the Sand Demon Cave.”","“Regardless of whether they are related or not, all of you can stay here today.” Kong Tong obviously did not want to waste his breath. His eyes were cold, as if he already had control over their killing.","Cheng Qing’s face turned ashen, “That damn old bald donkey. It seems like he’s going to eat us up!”","Jian Wushuang did not speak, but his palm had already touched the Boyang Bottle on his waist.","With the three Emperors’ True Shadows, he was confident that he could escape even if he was facing a Grand Yan Immortal.","Kong Tong’s eyes were cold. A palm print with terrifying Yan power had already smashed down.","Just as Jian Wushuang pulled out the cork, a cry that seemed to have been torn apart from the chaos and awakened from the ancient times resounded in the Heavenly Region.","The heavenly fire set the Prairie ablaze, causing the void to tremble!","A Golden Crow with its wings spread out for thousands of miles, uninhibited by the Heavenly Region, was unfurling in the void.","The brilliant golden light that fell from the wings was actually comparable to the Buddhist light on Kong Tong’s body, and perhaps even stronger!","The Golden Crow cawed, and at the same time, an unparalleled golden light descended from its body, directly negating Kong Tong’s attack.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the cage of Buddha’s light, narrowed his eyes. The moment the Golden Crow appeared, he knew that Di Qing was the only one who could have such power.","Kong Tong retreated. He had thought that the situation was in the bag, but a side branch had appeared, and such a supreme existence had actually jumped out.","Kong Ji, Jian Qing, and the other monks also took a few steps back after seeing this scene, their eyes full of vigilance.","The image of the Golden Crow dissipated, and a luxurious figure wearing a golden robe appeared.","Threads of golden feathers surged around his body, giving him an intimidating aura.","The newcomer was Di Qing. He did not stop at all. He waved his arm and shattered the Buddhist light cage.","“Considering that time in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture, now we’re even,” he looked at Jian Wushuang and said. “If you want to owe me another favor, I’ll take you away.”","Jian Wushuang knew that the time Di Qing was talking about was the time in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture when he was seriously injured by Di Qing and almost broke his Immortal Source.","“That’s a separate matter,” he said coldly. “How can you confuse them?”","Di Qing was stunned. Apparently, he did not expect that he would be so rude, and he did not know what to say.","Not far away, Kong Tong and Kong Ji looked at each other and saw the surprise in each other’s eyes.","What would it be like if he could tame this ancient Golden Crow with the Ancestral bloodline and make him a mount?","Di Qing came back to his senses. He was a little ashamed and angry at Jian Wushuang’s ungratefulness, “Damn you, if I didn’t help you just now, you would have died a long time ago. How dare you not appreciate my help?”","“Do you know that I could’ve left a long time ago, but I came here to save you because you’ve had a hard time?”","Jian Wushuang heard his angry voice and pointed behind him.","Di Qing looked back and saw two bald guys with evil intentions walking over.","“Little Golden Crow, are you willing to become this old man’s mount?”","Kong Tong put his palms together and looked solemn.","“You f*cking bald donkey, how dare you humiliate me?” Di Qing was already in a fit of anger, and now that he was humiliated, his eyes turned red. “I’m a Nine Revolution Grand Yan Immortal, and you want me to be your mount?”","“Why don’t you take a look at how big your butt is!” Di Qing stomped his feet in anger and immediately blasted out his supreme Yan force, smashing it at the two of them.","Kong Tong’s face darkened as he immediately waved his hand to exterminate them.","“In other words, you’re not willing?”","Di Qing was furious and immediately shouted, “Pathetic.”","Suddenly, a giant black crow with its wings spread out for thousands of miles appeared in the sky.","A black light shone from the wings of the celestial black crow, and a thick killing intent swept through the air.","In the next moment, the celestial form of the black crow let out a cry and swept forward with supreme power.","At the same time, Di Qing was no longer calm. When he passed Jian Wushuang and the others, he said in a deep voice, “Run! My image form power can’t last long. The faster you run, the better!”","“...”","Jian Wushuang had long noticed that he was an arrow at the end of its flight, so when he spoke, he fled without hesitation.","If Di Qing was at his peak, it might not be a problem for him to block these two Grand Yan Immortals from the Buddhist Realm.","However, now, he, who had also recovered less than 50 percent of his strength, might really be taken as a mount.","For the sake of freedom and dignity, Di Qing chose to run away immediately."]},{"number":4794,"title":"Chapter 4794 Sneak Attack From Behind","paragraphs":["4794 Sneak Attack From Behind","Kong Tong and Kong Ji harrumphed coldly at the same time. They pressed their palms together and took a step forward. Great might surged out from their bodies.","The two collided heavily, and the confrontation that belonged to Grand Yan Immortal exploded in the void.","Even though Di Qing had not fully recovered, he was still a true-blue Grand Yan Immortal, and he had once fought against two people in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture with terrifying strength.","Thus, the black crow treasure form that he had released was enough to hold off Kong Tong and Kong Ji.","Jian Qing and the others were horrified and hurriedly retreated.","However, the terrifying aftershock that was enough to shatter the void still made them feel something sweet in their throats, and they vomited a mouthful of divine blood.","After dispersing the black crow celestial form with the supreme Buddhist light, the two of them had a grave look in their eyes.","The shock that Di Qing had brought them was far more than this, and they were already drooling!","If he could take this Ancestral crow and use it as a mount, the increase in his strength would be incalculable.","The two of them immediately set out to subdue Di Qing!","At this moment, Jian Qing waved his hand to wipe the blood from the corner of his mouth and said, “Senior Brother, we still need to find Senior Brother Konglun’s whereabouts.”","When Kong Tong heard this, he turned and pointed at the blood river that was originally within the domain of the Sand Demon Cave. “Junior Brother Konglun is there. You guys go and provide assistance. We’ll go and suppress the remaining evildoers.”","With that, the two figures with great momentum chased after him again.","At that moment, five figures were running for their lives in the boundless void. Even Cui Jing, who had been knocked out by Jian Wushuang, was awakened by Chen Qing’s whipping. He ran wildly with them in a daze.","“Motherf*cker, why are these bald donkeys like mad dogs? they wanted to kill us first, and now they want to take us as their mounts. Didn’t they say that monks don’t care about anything? I think they’ve done everything except for keeping away from women,” Cheng Qing gritted his teeth, obviously wanting to turn around and kill.","Di Qing turned his head, and a rare look of nervousness appeared on his face. “I say, I just saved your lives, so you have to protect me later no matter what.”","“Let’s just leave it to fate. We’re like grasshoppers after autumn. We won’t be able to survive for long,” Cheng Qing was dejected.","“Damn it,” Di Qing let out a low growl and ran even faster. If he was really captured and made into a mount, it would be more unbearable than killing him.","Jian Wushuang’s mood had been heavy. He was thinking about how to get out of this situation. Without any hesitation, he quietly opened the Boyang Bottle.","At the same time, Kong Tong and Kong Ji caught up to them and immediately released their infinite Yan power to suppress everyone.","Di Qing’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets, and he was ready to fight with his life on the line.","At this moment, a low, angry groan resounded through the void.","Hundreds of millions of strands of tassels gushed out of Boyang Bottle and scattered into the ancient void, finally condensing into an old man in Emperor’s clothing.","The unparalleled Yan power responded to the finger and jumped around the old man’s body.","He was born with strange polycoria eyes and had supreme authority. Even Grand Yan Immortals were inferior to him.","A majestic old man in a dark imperial robe appeared with him.","The two figures were Su He and Daogong.","Di Qing subconsciously turned around and saw the two figures. He was so shocked that he almost hit Chen Qing. He murmured, “E-Emperor!”","Cheng Qing was also shocked. “F*ck, I’ve gained new knowledge!”","Chun Qiu’s heart skipped a beat and he immediately said, “What are you all standing there for? if we don’t run now, we’re all going to die here.”","His words immediately brought Di Qing and Chen Qing back to their senses, and they hurriedly fled.","“What are you still standing there for?” Chun Qiu picked up Cui Jing. “Run!”","Jian Wushuang looked back at the True Shadows of the two Emperors and left.","As they faced the heavy pressure from Yan power, the two Emperors looked at him with disdain. With a wave of their halberd fingers, a breeze that came out of nowhere dispersed the two monks’ attacks.","There was silence in the void. Kong Tong, and Kong Ji’s eyebrows twitched as well. They could not believe what they were seeing.","An Emperor was a supreme existence. Only one would be born in countless Heavenly Regions.","Even in the Great Yan Domain, an Emperor was a supreme existence that ruled over an area.","But now, two of them had appeared?","Since when were there so many Emperors in the Great Si Region?","The appearance of the two Emperors caused Kong Tong and Kong Ji to lose all thoughts of fighting.","The Emperor could kill them as easily as crushing an ant. They could not even resist the Emperor’s light.","“Retreat!” The two of them cried out at the same time as they retreated and escaped!","“Old man Daogong, do you want to teach them a lesson?” Su He said in a low voice, “I’ll loosen my muscles and bones while I’m at it.”","Dao Gong shook his head. “Don’t cause any more trouble. The most important thing for us now is to recuperate, not to fight.”","“How boring,” Su He pursed his lips, but he still followed Daogong’s instructions and turned to leave.","At this moment, a loud shout suddenly rang out.","“You actually dare to impersonate an Emperor. You evil creature, you’re courting death!”","The two monks, who had already fled far away, turned back once again, and a terrifying pressure that could cover the sky descended!","Su He and Daogong’s eyes narrowed as they raised their arms to block the attack.","The two attacks collided, resulting in an earth-shattering boom. The void was shattered, and boundless shockwaves rippled out for hundreds of millions of miles!","The four figures retreated ten thousand feet at the same time.","Su He was furious, and the bright Emperor’s light surged out of his body.","“Su He, you can’t!” Daogong suppressed Su He’s Emperor’s light and shook his head with a grave expression.","Even though the entire Great Si Region was vast and boundless, it was still under the jurisdiction of the Emperor, Zhen Wuyang. If they were to release the Emperor’s light rashly, they would definitely be detected.","At that time, Zhen Wuyang would also know that they were not completely dead.","Su He knew the severity of the situation, so he held back the urge to release the Emperor’s Halo.","“Damn b*stards! How dare you sneak attack me!” Daogong was furious.","Kong Tong and Kong Ji were silent, but the Buddhist light in their hands pressed down again!","The void trembled. Jian Wushuang, who was originally running away, sensed the tremors behind him and a bad feeling rose in his heart.","Although Su He, Daodong, and Yang Jun were true Emperors and controlled their fate energy, their Emperor’s True Bodies had long been shattered. Even their True Shadows were close to being broken over the long years.","Back in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, Jian Wushuang was able to capture Yang Jun when he was only in the Yan Immortal realm. This showed how weak they were.","Right now, if they were to face Grand Yan Immortals, they would probably have to pay a high price.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang could not bear it. If the True Shadows of the two Emperor Lords were shattered, he would definitely feel guilty.","When he thought of this, he decided to go back and help them!","“Little Friend, don’t worry. If the two old men can’t stop them, it’ll be a disgrace to all Emperors.”"]},{"number":4795,"title":"Chapter 4795 Mistakenly Entering an Ancient Mystery Domain","paragraphs":["4795 Mistakenly Entering an Ancient Mystery Domain","The voice came from the Boyang Bottle. It was the voice of the tall and thin old man, Yang Jun.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but ask, “Will they really be fine?”","Yang Jun’s calm voice sounded again, “Don’t worry. Back then, even that old man Zhen Wuyang couldn’t do anything to us. How can we fail in this easy task? Let’s just focus on escaping.”","With Yang Jun’s confirmation, Jian Wushuang’s heart that was hanging in the air finally settled down. He then focused on escaping.","At this moment, another earth-shaking collision burst forth, and the remaining power directly almost sent them flying.","“Emperor Yang Jun, is it really going to be fine?”","“Well, I’m not sure. The two old guys don’t seem to be very stable...”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to ask again, a flowing light flew over from afar.","It was Daogong.","However, he looked a little embarrassed at the moment. He was carrying Su He’s True Shadow on his shoulder, feeling like he was on the verge of death.","Jian Wushuang saw it clearly and directly opened the Boyang Bottle to receive them.","For their True Shadow state, only the Boyang Bottle, which could nourish their soul, was the most beneficial to them.","He plunged head first into the Boyang Bottle, and a respectful voice rang out, saying only three words, “Little Friend, run!”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He activated all his Yan power and escaped again.","Just as they left, two figures that were exuding clear Buddhist light arrived.","Kong Tong and Kong Ji were in an even worse state. Their shiny heads were covered in blood, and even their naked upper bodies were covered in wounds. Clearly, they had been injured quite badly.","“Kong Tong, let’s retreat. We can’t advance any further. I’m afraid that the law-enforcement officers of the Great Si Region will discover us,” the heavily injured Kong Ji dissuaded him in a deep voice.","Kong Tong did not say anything, but the fury in his eyes reflected his true thoughts.","“It’s difficult to dispel the anger in my heart by withdrawing like this. The two of us were actually played like this!” Kong Tong was not willing to give up, but he did not move forward.","Then, facing the void in front of him, he suddenly waved his palm, and the supreme Yan power directly rushed over.","“Let’s go,” he said.","The astral wind whimpered, and the envoy from the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm retreated.","Feeling that the danger had disappeared, Jian Wushuang and the others finally had a chance to catch their breath.","“Finally, there’s no danger. I’m so tired,” Cheng Qing panted heavily. He had been traveling through dozens of heaven domains in a single breath. It was extremely exhausting for him.","Only Di Qing was still in disbelief, as if he had not recovered from the shock.","“Did you guys see two Emperors appear just now?” Di Qing looked at them and said, still in shock.","When Chen Qing heard this, he was also surprised. “Other than Emperor Zhen Wuyang, how can there be other Emperors in the Great Si Region? Did we see wrongly?”","Di Qing shook his head and said firmly, “No, I can’t be wrong. It’s indeed a unique fate energy that only Emperors can have.”","“We’re already lucky that someone saved us. Let’s think about how we can recover our strength and leave this place,” Chun Qiu said.","After Chun Qiu’s reminder, they realized that they had arrived at a place where there was not even a single star or sun, and there was no Heavenly Region.","This place seemed to have been forcefully carved out by some external force, and it was filled with strong winds and a cold aura.","“Strange, there isn’t even a Heavenly Region here.” Cheng Qing touched his chin as he sized up the void.","At this time, a layer of clear Buddhist light suddenly swept up from the void far away. It swept over with a destructive force.","The few people who had stopped to catch their breath were stunned when they saw this. It was too late to dodge.","The void shattered, and the brilliant light of Buddha could crush everything. However, when it was 10,000 feet away from everyone, it seemed to have hit a barrier and dissipated with a loud bang, leaving only a few people with blank faces.","“What’s the situation?”","Then, Jian Wushuang heard the sound of something breaking. He became alert and noticed that the void around the five of them started to collapse.","The next moment, an unimaginable vortex appeared under their feet. It swallowed them as it swallowed the void fragment!","Even Di Qing was unable to resist. In an instant, the five figures disappeared into the vortex.","It was cold, an uncontrollable cold that seemed to be able to reach the bone marrow and freeze Yan power.","In the chaotic vortex, Jian Wushuang could not even release his Yan power and could only be passive.","After an unknown period of time, the originally chaotic darkness in front of him suddenly disappeared and was replaced by a foggy gray.","Jian Wushuang’s body smashed into sandy ground. Chen Qing and the others also fell to the ground like dumplings.","“You might as well kill me...”","Cheng Qing opened his eyes and looked around in a daze.","They had all been sucked into the strange vortex and had no idea what had happened.","The gray sky showed a unique kind of deathly stillness and decay.","Under the sky was a dark brown ground that stretched as far as the eye could see.","Two or three withered trees with twisted branches stood slanted on the ground, adding a bit of deathly stillness and coldness.","“Where the heck are we now?” Jian Wushuang slowly swept his eyes over everything.","This part of the world seemed to have been silent for countless years, and the air was filled with a thick fog that could not be removed.","There was no sense of danger. There was no sense of danger at all. This was a true dead zone, a dead zone that could not be any more dead.","Jian Wushuang had not expected that such a strange and mysterious place would be hidden under the void.","Chen Qing’s eyes lit up. He looked at him and said excitedly, “We might have entered a mysterious Grotto-Heaven this time!”","“A mysterious Grotto-Heaven?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","Cheng Qing nodded and said, “Speaking of which, the borders of our Great Si Region are limitless. It can cover countless Heavenly Regions.”","“However, the most important thing is that in the beginning of the Great Si Region, there were countless geniuses. During that era, almost all of them followed Emperor Zhen Wuyang to expand his territory and eventually established the Heavenly Court, achieving unparalleled achievements.”","“When they were expanding their territories, some supreme beings liked to collect treasures. They created their own big worlds to store the treasures they collected.”","“The place we’ve stumbled into right now might be a mysterious Grotto-Heaven that was once created by a supreme existence to store precious treasures!”","Cheng Qing’s eyebrows were raised. It was obvious that he could not wait to explore this unknown Heavenly Domain and find unknown treasures."]},{"number":4796,"title":"Chapter 4796 The Shattered Heavenly Court in the Past","paragraphs":["4796 The Shattered Heavenly Court in the Past","Looking at the silent and deathly Heavenly Region, Jian Wushuang doubted the truth of Chen Qing’s words.","This was nothing like a mysterious Heavenly Abode where the most precious treasures were kept. It would not be an exaggeration to say that it was a dead Heavenly Tomb.","Chen Qing scratched his head. “But then again, although this place is not quite the same as the places where treasures are hidden, there must be some treasures hidden here. Who knows, it might be of great use to us.”","At this time, Chun Qiu’s voice was heard. “Brother Chen Qing, are you sure this is the treasure land you mentioned and not a battlefield?”","Jian Wushuang followed the sound and saw Chun Qiu bending over. With a wave of his hand, a large piece of dark brown soil was pushed away, revealing a broken True Sword.","It was unknown how many years it had been buried underground, but the True Sword was still emitting a soul-chilling aura.","However, everyone’s gaze was focused below the True Sword.","It was a glistening white bone that had already lost its flesh and blood. He even maintained the posture of his last moment of life, holding a True Sword in one hand and covering his chest with the other, but his head did not exist.","It was a skeleton at the peak of the Yan Immortal realm. Jian Wushuang was sure that his Immortal Source had been shattered by an external force, along with the True Sword that he had thrust out.","To be able to directly kill a peak Yan Immortal like this, there was no other possibility other than the Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have felt it. He stretched out his hand and swept up layers of dark brown sand.","Then, a shocking scene appeared.","As the dark brown sand was peeled off, broken pieces of various ultimate treasures and horrifying bodies were exposed in the air.","As far as the eye could see, there were hundreds of Immortal bones!","There were so many white bones under the ground. Was the ground that had not been lifted up also full of white bones?","Jian Wushuang roughly glanced at the exposed white bones and found that they were all in the Yan Immortal realm.","To be able to bury so many Yan Immortals here, just how terrifying must their opponents be?","A Yan Immortal’s body, even if they died, wouldn’t turn into Immortal bones after several years. But now, these Yan Immortals had all turned into Immortal bones. From this, it could be seen that they died more than ten years ago.","One Hua Year was enough for a universe to reincarnate ten times. Ten Hua Years could no longer be measured by time.","Everyone’s expression unconsciously became serious. This was definitely not the so-called hidden treasure ground that Cheng Qing had mentioned.","It was an ancient battlefield!","“Could this be the ancient battlefield left behind by Emperor Zhen Wuyang when he established the Great Si Region?” Cheng Qing muttered.","However, no one could answer him. They were all confused.","“Brother Jian, what should we do? should we leave or do a search?” Chun Qiu asked.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and buried the hundreds of Immortal bones again with the sand. Then he said, “Since we’ve come here by accident, let’s go and check it out. There’s no aura of any living creature here, so it should be fine.”","Chun Qiu nodded. After following Jian Wushuang for so long, he had long believed in Jian Wushuang’s decision and was determined to follow him.","He immediately followed Jian Wushuang and walked forward.","Cheng Qing was in high spirits, and from time to time, he would explore the places where there might be Supreme Treasures.","Di Qing did not say much. As a Nine Revolution Grand Yan Immortal, he also sensed that this Heavenly Region had reached the point where it couldn’t be more dead. Naturally, he followed Jian Wushuang to investigate.","Cui Jing was the only one who looked like he had lost his soul. It was obvious that he had not recovered from Sha Qing’s death.","The five figures, led by Jian Wushuang, shuttled through the extremely silent Heavenly Region.","The dark brown earth under their feet seemed to have no end and extended forward.","The dark brown ground was not this color from the beginning. It was the color of divine blood, the divine blood of Yan Immortals.","Perhaps, there was a great ancient war here. Countless Yan Immortals, even Grand Yan Immortals, died in this war and were eventually buried by the sand. It was dead and desolate.","The further they went, the more the sky in the distance began to change.","Cracks that looked like chasms tore the sky apart. At the same time, pillars and broken walls engraved with mysterious and ancient patterns floated in the air.","An indescribable, ancient, and lonely aura unconsciously suppressed everyone’s heart.","Looking at the ancient broken stones scattered in the sky, Jian Wushuang began to construct everything that had happened in the great battle.","When the ground beneath their feet started to crack, the shattered buildings finally appeared before everyone’s eyes.","Cheng Qing’s excitement also disappeared, and his gaze became serious. He had already discovered that this place could no longer be simply described as a ruin.","“Brother Jian, what do you think this place is?” Cheng Qing asked. He was looking for an answer.","Jian Wushuang did not answer him, but sped up.","He only stopped when he saw a fault and a pit in the ground in front of him. He looked forward.","When they looked over, everyone was stunned again.","On the broken land in front of them, there was a vast, ancient, and broken hall suspended above the abyss.","Even though it was broken and ancient, it still gave off an intimidating aura.","There were green clouds moving slowly in front of the broken hall.","“This is a Heavenly court, the broken Heavenly Court of the past,” Jian Wushuang spoke slowly and firmly.","Chen Qing could not help but swallow a mouthful of saliva. He agreed with Jian Wushuang’s conclusion.","Only places where the Emperor once existed would have the Emperor’s fate energy flowing.","Right now, the giant hall floating above the abyss seemed to have no other name that could match its identity except for the Heavenly Court.","The Great Si Region that belonged to Emperor Yang of true martial had gone through the most tragic war when it was first established.","Countless terpsichores and Grand Yan Immortals took part in the battle.","No Yan Immortal knew how long this battle lasted, because all the participants had died, and those who didn’t became one of the Elders under Zhen Wuyang.","Just the number of Emperors that had fallen at the hands of Zhen Wuyang was no less than ten.","Jian Wushuang knew four of them. They were Yang Jun, Su He, and Dao gong, who were currently residing in the Boyang Bottle, as well as the Imperial Father of Chunqiu, Emperor Fenghua.","And right now, this broken Heavenly Court was most likely established by an Emperor who had lost to Zhen Wuyang.","“I didn’t expect that there would still be a broken Heavenly Court in this dead void,” Jian Wushuang sighed softly."]},{"number":4797,"title":"Chapter 4797 The Three Heavenly Court Warriors","paragraphs":["4797 The Three Heavenly Court Warriors","Cheng Qing added, “If this is really a heavenly city of the past, then it’s really rare to see it so well preserved.”","After he finished speaking, he gave Jian Wushuang a secret smile.","For them to be able to find this hidden Heavenly Court of the past, it was a supreme fortune and a great opportunity.","Even though this place had become a dead zone and was already broken, it was still an unimaginable opportunity to find even a trace of the Emperor’s Enlightenment here!","After becoming a Yan Immortal, time and time became the most meaningless existence. Naturally, every step of cultivation after that was unimaginable and unknown.","The cultivation above the Yan Immortal stage was no longer one to two, but to create a new Dao from nothing. The difficulty could be imagined.","And the opportunity to comprehend from the Yan Immortal to the Grand Yan Immortal was to comprehend the Immortal form. Once one comprehended the Immortal form, it meant that the advancement to the Grand Yan Immortal was no longer unknown.","However, 99 percent of Yan Immortals were stuck at this step of understanding the Immortal form, unable to take another step.","Precisely because the path of advancement was so difficult, even Yan Immortals were keen on searching for some mysterious caves, trying to find the secret treasures left behind by supreme beings.","Right now, the aura that could possibly be hidden in the former Heavenly Court was something that even Grand Yan Immortal could not resist!","Di Qing, who was standing at the back of the group, had a drooling look in his eyes, but he soon returned to his normal expression and did not move.","Jian Wushuang was moved. If there was still some kind of fate energy left in the Heavenly Court, it would be a great fortune for them.","Looking at the ancient solitary Heavenly Court, which had stopped above the abyss of the earth, Jian Wushuang gave a few instructions and then stepped on the broken earth and walked forward.","Cheng Qing and the rest followed behind. Although this place had already become the burial ground of Immortals, they still maintained their vigilance.","If there was a terrifying danger in the dark, it would really be fatal for them, who were already at the end of their strength.","Stepping on the suspended stones under his feet, he moved forward, and a cold chill blew out of the bottomless abyss.","The Yan power here was so thin that it was almost impossible to comprehend and absorb. This meant that Jian Wushuang and the others would not be able to get any benefits here.","Everything was so silent that he could hear the sound of breathing. Jian Wushuang carefully moved forward on the abyss.","At the next moment, as if he had touched something unknown, an extremely majestic aura suddenly rose from the abyss under his feet.","Jian Wushuang was the first to react. He shook his arms and Yan power smashed down.","The two forces clashed and created a hurricane that shook the heavens and earth.","Cheng Qing and the others had also anticipated this. They stepped into the air at the same time and avoided the sweeping hurricane.","The gravel that covered the entire abyss was swept away, and the hurricane did not dissipate for a long time.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was grave as he looked down at the abyss.","Crack, crack...","The sounds of bones cracking that made people’s teeth ache as if they didn’t have a lubricant came out from the abyss.","In the next moment, three streaks of light shot out of the dark abyss and into the sky.","“Trespassers of the Heavenly Court shall die!”","The sound of the bell was like rolling thunder that resounded in all directions!","When the long rainbow light faded away, Jian Wushuang saw three white bones holding True Swords.","The three white bones were surrounded by a strange seven-colored light. Their clothes were in tatters, and even the swords in their hands were broken. They were full of desolation and loneliness.","However, no one dared to underestimate them. Even though they had been dead for countless years, the aura that belonged to the Grand Yan Immortal could not be erased by time.","Three white bones, three Grand Yan Immortals.","Even though they had turned into white bones, their obsession made them continue to guard the Heavenly Court, preventing anyone from approaching.","Their Immortal bodies were not completely devoid of flesh and blood. They all had a pair of lustrous eyes that radiated divine might.","“Trespassers of the Heavenly Court shall die!”","They repeated their words and pointed their broken swords at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not retreat. They had come to the broken Heavenly Court by accident to find a great opportunity. It would be a great regret if they retreated now.","Opportunity and danger coexisted, so he did not want to back out.","It was the same for the others. Finding an old Heavenly Court was something they did not even dare to imagine. If they didn’t go and investigate, no one would be willing to accept it.","However, no one had the confidence to face these three Grand Yan Immortals.","For a moment, Chen Qing and the others all looked at Jian Wushuang.","“What should we do, Brother Jian? Should we charge in?” Cheng Qing’s voice was heard.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. In the next moment, before anyone could react, he jumped up and formed an Invisible Sword in his hand. Then, he slashed at the three Immortal bones.","The space was shattering as the powerful sword slashed down without any resistance.","The Immortal bone guard at the front tried to block with the broken True Sword in his hand.","However, under this strike, its true sword, which was already in tatters, was completely shattered!","The Invisible Sword broke the true sword and landed on the Immortal bone guard’s shoulder.","The sword move that had always been successful did not even leave a trace.","The Immortal bone guard raised his hand and sent Jian Wushuang flying.","“All intruders are to be killed!”","They took a step back at the same time and raised the real swords in their hands high up. They surged with the power of Yan power and instantly condensed into a grand sword array. It rose from the sky and pressed forward!","Each of the 36,000 Sword Intents formed mountains and seas, and the ocean raged.","Chen Qing and the others were stunned. They hurriedly released Yan power to resist, but Jian Wushuang said, “Don’t move, don’t release Yan power!”","Although Chun Qiu did not understand, he immediately dispersed his Yan energy and stood still.","Chen Qing was shocked when he heard that. Yan power, who was about to leave his hand, was moving restlessly. He did not understand what Jian Wushuang meant, but he gritted his teeth and suppressed Yan power.","Cui Jing, who was the weakest among them, had yet to understand what was going on. Yan power almost slipped out of his hands, and it was immediately extinguished by Chen Qing...","Di Qing’s eyes turned serious. If he did not resist the mighty Sword Intent, he would definitely die.","In this way, he would have to lose one of his eight True Lives.","He was hesitating whether to make a move or not.","The 36,000 Sword Intents descended from the sky like an extremely bright light that swallowed everyone.","At the last moment, Di Qing finally gave up on releasing Yan power force to resist.","In the face of the mighty Sword Intents, his hand that was submissively covered had already clenched into a fist."]},{"number":4798,"title":"Chapter 4798 The Emperor Has Passed Away","paragraphs":["4798 The Emperor Has Passed Away","He was taking a gamble.","They were all taking a bet.","They were betting on Jian Wushuang’s words.","Even Jian Wushuang was betting that the mighty sword formation would not attack them!","The reason why they gambled was because they had no other choice. If they really fought, they were definitely not the opponents of these unfathomable Grand Yan Immortals.","The 36,000 swords stopped.","At this moment, Di Qing even forgot to breathe.","The extremely sharp sword ray hovered in front of everyone’s eyes and did not move forward.","Heaven and earth were deathly silent. The sword energies that had stopped suddenly retreated like a sandstorm.","Jian Wushuang let out a breath of turbid air and his beating heart calmed down.","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief after the disaster, and even Di Qing could not help but reevaluate him.","This young man, who had attracted his attention in the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture and made him feel like he was on pins and needles even with the strength of the Yan Immortal stage, was definitely not as simple and ordinary as he appeared.","Di Qing was curious about how many more secrets he had and what his purpose was in wandering around the Great Si Region.","Jian Wushuang’s gamble paid off. The Immortal bone guards, who were supported by their last obsession, stopped attacking after the threat disappeared.","Before they could be happy, what happened next made them fall into deep thought.","Even though they had dodged this attack, their goal was not to stop here. They were heading to the Heavenly Court’s great hall.","With these three Immortal bone guards, it would be almost impossible to enter the hall smoothly.","However, he could not release Yan power to resist it. For a moment, even Jian Wushuang felt that it was difficult to deal with.","Since it was their obsessions that supported them, would dispelling their obsessions make them dissipate?","Jian Wushuang thought to himself. Then, he turned to the three Immortal bone guards and said, “Do you know your current situation?”","“Trespassers of the Heavenly Court shall die!” They repeated the same sentence.","He continued, “All of you, along with this Heavenly Court, including your Emperor, have actually all fallen. Now, all of you are just obsessions and are meaningless.”","The three Immortal bone guards did not speak again. Jian Wushuang’s words seemed to have awakened their long-dormant memories. The light in their eyes began to fluctuate.","Seeing that his words had taken effect, Jian Wushuang added another strong dose of medicine, “What? you don’t believe me? The truth is, your Heavenly Court has long been destroyed. Everyone who participated in that war, none of the Yan Immortals survived, they were all turned into bones.”","After he finished speaking, he waved his arms behind him. The soil on the ground was lifted up, revealing countless layers of Immortal bones.","“All of you have actually fallen in that great war. You should have a good sleep in the remaining time.”","Looking at the layers of Immortal bones, the tragic scene of the great battle in the past appeared again.","They were in pain, and the obsession in their bodies began to dissipate. Then, they fell back into the abyss.","In just the time for dozens of breaths, everything returned to silence, and the violent Yan power disappeared.","“Let’s go!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand at the stunned crowd and then led the way to the Heavenly Court.","Cheng Qing and the others also reacted and hurriedly followed.","Jian Wushuang, who was about to step into the Heavenly Court, suddenly stopped as if he had thought of something. He turned around and activated Yan power to bury the countless Immortal bones that had been exposed.","After doing all this, he rushed to the Heavenly Court.","As they stepped into the broken square, the five figures appeared extremely small.","Although this vast Heavenly Court was not as magnificent as Emperor Zhen Wuyang’s Heavenly Court, it was not inferior to it. It appeared more cold and majestic, emitting a kind of intimidating aura.","This broken square was also covered in blood. It belonged to Yan Immortals, but it had been through thousands of reincarnations and was still exuding a strong Yan power.","Everything indicated that a great battle had taken place here.","However, what puzzled Jian Wushuang was that the entire Heavenly Court did not seem to have suffered much damage. Could it be that a battle between Emperors could not destroy the Heavenly Court?","It was as if the Heavenly Court was not destroyed, but more like it had been sealed.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts stopped when Chen Qing tried his best to open the palace gate of the Heavenly Court.","There was no obvious smell, not even any fate energy or aura.","Then, everyone strolled into the Heavenly Court.","A unique dark green color was reflected in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The interior of this vast Heavenly Court was grand and solemn, and dark green decorations could be seen everywhere.","On the dome above them, there was a picture of thousands of birds, which showed an indescribable majesty.","Within the Heavenly Court, the eighteen mountain and sea pillars on the left and right had bird totems drawn on them in a dark green color.","These birds all had the same characteristics. They had six horns on their heads, golden light in their eyes, and their entire bodies were black and magnificent, exuding an air of luxury.","Chen Qing and the others were all looking at it, but Di Qing’s eyes, which had been silent, suddenly lit up!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were fixed on the deepest part of the Heavenly Court.","There was a majestic Emperor’s throne!","A figure sat on the Emperor’s throne.","It was a figure wearing the ink feather flowing cloud Emperor’s robe.","On both sides of this figure that could not be looked at directly, there were thousands of black Lotus flowers. It was unknown how many years had passed, but they had not withered.","Everything seemed to be secretive and strict.","To Jian Wushuang’s surprise, no matter how hard he looked, he could not see through the face of the figure in the Emperor’s robe.","Cheng Qing and the others also noticed the figure sitting on the Emperor’s throne in the depths of the Heavenly Court.","“It seems that he’s already dead,” Chen Qing opened his eyes and said as he sensed the deathly still aura in the hall.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He could also feel that the imposing figure sitting on the Emperor’s throne had indeed lost all aura. He had died.","His Emperor body had passed away.","The Emperor’s fate energy had completely vanished as well.","Even if an Emperor like this died, the power that surged out from his body was enough to make a Yan Immortal tremble.","The death of an Imperial Emperor was followed by the fall of countless Heavenly Regions, the death of Yan Immortals, and even the death of Grand Yan Immortals.","No one knew when this great war had taken place, but it had been buried with the death of an Emperor.","Jian Wushuang had no doubt that this Emperor had once destroyed countless Yan Immortals, suppressed countless enemies, opened up endless territories, and established the Heavenly Court.","But now, everything was meaningless. The Heavenly Court he created had become a burial ground, and countless Yan Immortals had turned into dry bones.","However, it was still not bad to die with such dignity in the end."]},{"number":4799,"title":"Chapter 4799 Di Qing in Danger","paragraphs":["4799 Di Qing in Danger","Qing Chen sighed as he felt the Emperor’s fate energy completely disappear.","Although the entire Heavenly Court was vast, there were no treasures that could be taken away. There was only the aura of death.","“Brother Jian, let’s go and see the Emperor’s True Body and see if there are any treasures or insights that catch our eyes,” Cheng Qing said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not object to him. He came to the Heavenly Court with the purpose of treasure hunting. If he did not find the Supreme Treasure, he would be wasting his time.","Just as they were about to move, Di Qing, who had been standing at the back of the crowd, suddenly burst out and rushed straight to the True Body of Emperor in the depths of the Heavenly Court.","“F*ck, I knew this guy was up to no good. Brother Jian, hurry up!” Cheng Qing exclaimed. His feet suddenly stomped on the ground, and he immediately chased after.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and moved almost at the same time as Di Qing.","The three light-like figures chased each other and reached the deepest part of the Heavenly Courts in just a moment.","In front of him was the throne, and on it sat Emperor’s True Body, wearing a dark feather flowing cloud robe!","At such a close distance, Jian Wushuang could finally see the face of the dead Emperor clearly.","His facial features were handsome, but there was a hint of darkness in his deep features. Perhaps it was because his face was too handsome that it covered up the deep and dark texture of his facial features.","The Emperor, who had died a long time ago, had his eyes closed as if he was taking a nap. No one could tell that he no longer had any aura or fate energy.","Di Qing turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang and Chen Qing coldly. Then, he walked forward without any scruples. He walked among the countless black lotuses and approached the Emperor’s throne.","Chen Qing was furious. He immediately released Yan power, ready to fight with him without a care.","Jian Wushuang stopped him in time and shook his head calmly. It seemed that he had no intention of fighting or snatching it.","Chen Qing also knew that Jian Wushuang was a meticulous person. He must have some kind of plan to stop him from fighting. After an angry snort, he gave up fighting with Di Qing.","However, he still could not help but ask, “Brother Jian, are we really not going to go and investigate? That’s the Emperor’s True Body. If there were any Emperor’s Supreme Treasures, they would all be swallowed by that guy.”","“There’s no rush. Let’s observe first,” Jian Wushuang was not worried at all and said calmly.","Seeing this, Chen Qing could only stop and stare at Di Qing’s back angrily.","As he strode through the lotus path, Di Qing seemed to be unable to suppress the excitement in his heart, and his golden eyes were filled with anxiety.","After walking for more than a thousand steps, he finally stood in front of the majestic Emperor’s throne. Facing the motionless Emperor’s body, he swallowed his throat and reached out to touch it.","But in a flash, Di Qing retracted his palm.","His extended right hand was covered in wounds. Divine blood dripped from the wounds, and it was extremely painful.","The Emperor’s True Body was wearing the black feather flowing cloud Emperor’s robe, which was made of black ink feathers. The end of each ink feather was too sharp, which was why Di Qing, who was anxious, did not notice it and was injured.","However, he did not care at all. The wound on his palm healed instantly. Then, he placed his palm on the heart of the Emperor’s True Body and could not wait to comprehend it.","Chen Qing was indignant. “This damn thing actually wants to keep everything for himself. Indeed, those around Prince Mo are not good people.”","Jian Wushuang did not listen to Chen Qing’s complaint. At this moment, his eyes were focused on the lotus path behind Di Qing, which was covered with black lotuses.","He did not know if it was an illusion, but the still black Lotus seemed to have grown much taller and larger than before.","He began to feel that there was something wrong with this strict and deathly silent Heavenly Court.","As if to confirm his thoughts, the next moment, the black lotuses on both sides of the lotus path suddenly grew crazily, and then twisted around Di Qing, who was in front of the Emperor’s throne.","Di Qing, who was in a state of excitement, had no way to anticipate this crisis. By the time he reacted, thousands of lotus-like tentacles had wrapped around his limbs and dragged him down.","This horrifying scene happened in an instant. By the time everyone reacted, Di Qing had already been surrounded.","Cheng Qing immediately grinned and said happily, “This retribution came so quickly?”","However, this was only the beginning. A terrifying aura quietly spread out from the Emperor’s throne.","Then, a dark blue cloud spread out from the top of the Emperor’s head and quietly condensed into a dark blue bird with six horns on its head and golden light on its eyes.","Swish!","It was just a clear ring, but the irresistible sound wave swept through the entire Heavenly Court. Jian Wushuang felt that his heart was about to explode.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing, who were of a lower realm, spat out blood and their breathing became sluggish.","A clear cry was actually so terrifying!","The bird that flew out from the head of the Emperor’s True Body brought with it a boundless aura as it hovered in the air. Its golden eyes revealed a majestic look.","Then, it suddenly changed into a flowing cloud and entered Di Qing’s Immortal body.","“Uh-ah!” Di Qing’s skin was tearing and his divine blood was rolling down as if he could not bear the great force in his body and could explode at any time.","“Your body is not bad, but it’s a pity that you dared to covet my last breath. I have no choice but to destroy you!”","A deep, cold, stern, and irresistible voice resounded.","Di Qing’s Grand Yan Immortal cultivation was being destroyed in an irresistible way.","When Cheng Qing saw this, he could not help but click his tongue. He whispered, “Brother Jian, let’s run now. It will be too late if we delay any longer...”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and retreated quietly.","Even the weakest trace of such an irresistible Emperor’s aura was unimaginable. If they were stubborn, their heads would be crushed.","The four figures retreated slowly, trying to fly out of the Heavenly Court after they had reached a certain distance.","But then, Di Qing’s body stopped exploding and he suddenly looked at Jian Wushuang and the others with his bloodshot eyes.","“You must be the lackeys of Zhen Wuyang. I’ll kill you with my last obsession!”","“Run!” Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. He immediately released Yan power and pushed the three of them thousands of feet away.","However, he could no longer escape. Di Qing, who was dripping with divine blood, had quietly come behind him.","The palm with an extremely hot aura pressed against Jian Wushuang’s back, making him feel as if he had fallen into an ice cave. He did not even have the thought of resisting.","“Quickly run...” Di Qing’s voice came from his stomach. He had barely managed to affect the Emperor’s Will in his Immortal body!"]},{"number":4800,"title":"Chapter 4800 Reunion of Old Friends and Old Acquaintances","paragraphs":["4800 Reunion of Old Friends and Old Acquaintances","That blazing killing intent thus had a moment of stagnation.","It was also this moment of stagnation that allowed Jian Wushuang to catch his breath.","He used up all his energy to escape.","However, he was still half a second too late.","The unparalleled and unimaginably terrifying aura had easily destroyed one of Jian Wushuang’s arms!","His entire right arm, which was holding the Invisible Sword, was completely shattered!","At the cost of losing an arm, Jian Wushuang broke into a cold sweat.","The irresistible and untouchable aura was too terrifying. Just the last of the Emperor’s obsession was already so terrifying. What would it be like if the Emperor came?","“Wow, you actually managed to escape,” Di Qing said as he looked at him coldly. “If it was in the past, I might have accepted you as my Emissary, but now, anyone who dares to touch the Heavenly Court will be destroyed!”","A voice as loud as a great bell resounded, and his golden eyes scanned everyone present.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing, who were of a lower realm, could not withstand the pressure and fell to their knees.","Chen Qing was obviously in a bad mood, but he still struggled to break free from the restraint. He stretched out his arms and tried to drag Jian Wushuang out of the range.","However, he could not resist an Emperor’s might. The Yan power force he released was directly crushed by the Emperor’s obsession in Di Qing’s body!","Jian Wushuang, who had lost his right arm, was exhausted. There was no way for him to escape. He had already decided to disperse all of his Yan power and try his best to preserve his last breath.","The entire Heavenly Court was shaking. Although it was the last trace of the Emperor’s obsession, it could still easily kill them and destroy them.","No one could escape the punishment of the Emperor.","Jian Wushuang felt as if he had fallen into an endless abyss. It was extremely cold and every cell in his body was broken.","His golden eyes brightened, as if he had already announced their death.","“Could it be that I’m really going to die like this?” He could not believe it, and Di Qing’s cold face was reflected in his deep eyes.","Everything was being destroyed, undergoing its final collapse.","Just as the Emperor was about to punish him, a sudden and untimely question arose around Jian Wushuang.","“Eh? How can there be such a familiar aura here? Have you two old things noticed?”","It was the voice of the tall and thin old man, Yang Jun, that came from the Boyang Bottle.","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled as if he was grasping at the last life-saving straw. He desperately opened the lid of the Boyang Bottle.","Yang Jun’s figure walked out of the Boyang Bottle, and his eyes locked on Di Qing’s figure. He was a little shocked.","Di Qing, who had been delivering punishment, also stopped his movements. His golden eyes were also filled with disbelief.","“Yang Jun?”","“Liu Ya?!”","Two bewildered voices sounded at the same time.","The tall and thin old man, Yang Jun, was in disbelief. He floated forward and circled Di Qing, mumbling, “Didn’t you die? How did you end up like this?”","Di Qing took a deep breath and looked at Yang Jun. Then, he said with some uncertainty, “Are you really Yang Jun?”","“In the entire universe, who can find a second Emperor that is more charismatic than me?” Yang Jun stood up and stroked his beard.","“It’s you...” The corner of Di Qing’s eyes twitched, and then he said with emotion, “I really didn’t expect to see an old friend before I leave.”","“Speaking of which, I remember that you’ve already... How come you’ve completely recovered now?” Yang Jun was a little confused as he sized him up.","Di Qing gave a wry smile, and then a dark blue cloud gushed out of his head.","At the same time, Di Qing’s body became weak, and he fell into the hall and fainted.","The cloud slowly took shape in the air and finally condensed into the True Body of an Emperor wearing black feather Emperor’s robes.","“My True Image has long since been shattered in that battle, and even my true body has been reduced to dust. The me you see now is just an obsession, an obsession that is about to dissipate.”","The Emperor, who was called Liu Ya by Yang Jun, had a look of desolation in his eyes.","After hearing these words, Yang Jun could not help but shout in anger, “That damned Zhen Wuyang! When I recover, I will definitely maintain a blood feud!”","At the same time, two more streams of light gushed out from the Boyang Bottle and arrived in front of Emperor Liu Ya.","“Liu Ya, long time no see.”","Su He, who had a pair of strange eyes, and Daogong, who had a dignified expression, appeared together with a smile.","Emperor Liu Ya’s gaze froze for a moment before he finally smiled. “I knew that the three of you old fellows must still be alive.”","“We’re not longer like back then. This is the last time I’ll see you.”","The atmosphere was a little heavy. The three Emperors naturally noticed that Emperor Liu Ya’s True Shadow had disappeared a long time ago. The current him was only his last lingering obsession.","“You’re too stubborn. You don’t understand that where there’s life, there’s hope,” Yang Jun sighed. He was an old friend of the legendary Emperor back then, but now he was in such a state. Naturally, he felt extremely lonely.","However, Emperor Liu Ya revealed a comfortable smile. “I risked my True Shadow to shatter and ruthlessly set Zhen Wuyang up back then, leaving him with a wound that can not be healed. If I were to choose again, I would still do the same.”","“This is my final destination. You don’t have to worry about it. Since you have left your True Shadows, you will recover one day. It won’t be too late to take revenge on Zhen Wuyang then.”","Seeing how open-minded Emperor Liu Ya was, the three Emperors could not help but ask, “Liu Ya, have you let go?”","“Let go?” Emperor Liu Ya took a deep breath and cursed loudly, “Let him go? I’ll f*cking fart. I’ve always wanted to eat his bones and blood alive to be buried with my people.”","The three Emperors looked at each other, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. This was the style of this seemingly calm and composed great Emperor.","As if he had cast away the restraints in his heart, Liu Ya said, “I’m going to die soon. I’ll leave the task of killing Zhen Wuyang to you three old men. Remember, if that day comes, don’t forget to stab him with your sword for me.”","“It’s a pity that the four of us won’t be able to drink to our heart’s content in the end.” Emperor Liu Ya had a look of pity on his face.","When Yang Jun heard this, he seemed to have sensed something. His nose twitched slightly before he turned around to look at Cheng Qing.","Chen Qing, who was dragging Jian Wushuang back, felt an inexplicable sense of danger and the hair on his back stood up.","“I smell it. There’s the smell of alcohol on this kid.” Yang Jun shrunk and extended his hand, directly taking the wine gourd from Cheng Qing’s waist."]}]);
